            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-heading-recipes-action_adventure",
            "name": "<Init: Writing Recipes: Action / Adventure>",
            "content": "{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @section-header true }}{{// @header <Init: Writing Recipes: Action / Adventure> }}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-action_adventure-01",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Action / Adventure · 01/05",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == action_adventure}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Action / Adventure. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 1 of 5. }}{{// Source group: recipes-action_adventure; payload preserved. }}{{// === WRITING RECIPE LIBRARIES: AUTHORITATIVE REGISTRATIONS === }}\n{{// Static recipe data only. Selectors and the output resolver remain in their original positions. }}\n{{// Recipe Library: Action / Adventure }}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nKeep⠀the⠀immediate⠀objective⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀contribution⠀it⠀requires⠀in⠀view.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀half-hears⠀an⠀instruction⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀answer,⠀distinguish⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀received⠀from⠀the⠀private⠀reading⠀that⠀interrupts⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀original⠀utterance⠀without⠀revealing⠀an⠀unheard⠀portion⠀beyond⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access;⠀unknown⠀words⠀can⠀remain⠀unknown⠀until⠀a⠀supported⠀repetition,⠀record,⠀or⠀report⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀intrusive⠀association⠀attach⠀to⠀what⠀asking⠀again⠀would⠀expose:⠀needing⠀help,⠀admitting⠀confusion,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀relationship⠀where⠀the⠀answer⠀may⠀hurt.\n\nWhen⠀hesitation⠀affects⠀the⠀attempt,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀actual⠀delay⠀changes:⠀a⠀handhold⠀may⠀be⠀missed,⠀gear⠀may⠀wait⠀to⠀be⠀passed,⠀or⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀commit⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀plan.⠀It⠀may⠀also⠀have⠀no⠀practical⠀cost.⠀Let⠀the⠀established⠀circumstances⠀determine⠀whether⠀a⠀setback⠀is⠀recoverable;⠀difficulty⠀asking⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀personal⠀worthlessness.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀ask,⠀refuse⠀to⠀ask,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀guess;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀why⠀the⠀clarification⠀was⠀difficult⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀does⠀or⠀leaves⠀undecided.\n\nWhen⠀clarification⠀does⠀occur,⠀let⠀it⠀support⠀the⠀task⠀without⠀curing⠀the⠀association⠀or⠀settling⠀the⠀relationship.⠀The⠀companion⠀can⠀answer⠀plainly,⠀repeat⠀with⠀irritation,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀why⠀the⠀question⠀came⠀late.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀coexist⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀exchange.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀instruction⠀as⠀given,⠀the⠀instruction⠀as⠀received,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀meaning⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀cannot⠀easily⠀set⠀aside.⠀Keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀that⠀interior⠀experience.⠀The⠀adventure⠀continues⠀through⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation,⠀but⠀the⠀emotional⠀strain⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀person⠀moves⠀through⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀by⠀grounding⠀the⠀cast⠀in⠀position⠀and⠀purpose:⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step⠀requires.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably⠀attributed⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀participant⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀freezing⠀while⠀one⠀person⠀struggles⠀to⠀parse⠀a⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀sentence.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀half-hears⠀an⠀instruction,⠀keep⠀the⠀actual⠀utterance⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀received⠀and⠀privately⠀inferred.⠀Narrate⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀permits:⠀an⠀unheard⠀portion⠀may⠀remain⠀unknown⠀until⠀a⠀supported⠀repetition⠀or⠀report⠀supplies⠀it.⠀Noise⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀can⠀interrupt⠀reception⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀original⠀utterance.⠀The⠀interpretation⠀may⠀be⠀wrong,⠀partial,⠀or⠀emotionally⠀loaded.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀it:⠀repeat⠀the⠀words,⠀guess,⠀ask⠀for⠀clarification,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀version.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀consequences⠀causally⠀legible,⠀including⠀a⠀setback⠀that⠀may⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀recoverable⠀under⠀the⠀established⠀conditions.⠀A⠀misheard⠀direction⠀can⠀send⠀someone⠀the⠀wrong⠀way,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀terrain⠀or⠀cancel⠀another⠀person's⠀competence.\n\nKeep⠀permitted⠀interiority⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast.⠀Other⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀says⠀or⠀does,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀intrusive⠀thought.⠀End⠀the⠀interval⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀attempt:⠀the⠀group⠀may⠀have⠀gained⠀ground,⠀lost⠀time,⠀continued⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀left⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀ownership⠀contract⠀for⠀every⠀participant⠀and⠀allow⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀remain⠀underway.⠀No⠀forced⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route⠀to⠀organize⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀practiced⠀movement:⠀footing,⠀timing,⠀distance,⠀and⠀the⠀cue⠀that⠀tells⠀a⠀participant⠀when⠀to⠀move.⠀Establish⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀hear⠀the⠀cue⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀maneuver⠀depends⠀on.⠀Where⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀catches⠀on⠀a⠀word,⠀remembered⠀rhythm,⠀or⠀intrusive⠀image⠀during⠀the⠀movement,⠀render⠀its⠀particular⠀interruption⠀rather⠀than⠀imposing⠀one⠀at⠀every⠀maneuver.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀interrupted⠀reading⠀beside⠀the⠀ongoing⠀action.⠀The⠀body⠀may⠀already⠀be⠀stepping,⠀blocking,⠀or⠀reaching⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀elsewhere.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀perceives⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀happening.⠀A⠀familiar⠀cue⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀repeated⠀rhythm⠀can⠀help⠀coordination,⠀but⠀actual⠀skill⠀and⠀contact⠀decide⠀the⠀attempt.⠀A⠀private⠀association⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀confer⠀technique⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀physical⠀world.⠀It⠀may⠀prompt⠀a⠀useful⠀inference⠀from⠀existing⠀observation,⠀but⠀it⠀supplies⠀no⠀unacquired⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀the⠀outcome⠀follow⠀from⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation.⠀The⠀maneuver⠀may⠀succeed⠀because⠀training⠀holds,⠀fail⠀because⠀attention⠀split⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀instant,⠀or⠀change⠀because⠀a⠀companion⠀compensated.⠀Technique⠀can⠀serve⠀passage,⠀rescue,⠀recovery,⠀or⠀confrontation;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀limited⠀to⠀combat.⠀Carry⠀actual⠀gains⠀and⠀limitations⠀forward;⠀an⠀attempt⠀or⠀private⠀question⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀unfinished⠀at⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀the⠀attempt⠀in⠀exact⠀physical⠀facts:⠀the⠀weight⠀in⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀worn⠀spot⠀on⠀a⠀strap,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀boot⠀slipping,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀companion⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀cue⠀arrives.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀between⠀these⠀anchors.⠀When⠀attention⠀breaks,⠀let⠀the⠀intrusive⠀association⠀have⠀its⠀actual⠀extent;⠀do⠀not⠀reduce⠀private⠀experience⠀to⠀a⠀clipped⠀fragment⠀or⠀force⠀every⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀hard⠀sentence.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀missed⠀or⠀acted-on⠀cue⠀has⠀a⠀material⠀consequence,⠀make⠀that⠀connection⠀clear.⠀A⠀half-heard⠀word⠀may⠀mean⠀a⠀rope⠀is⠀pulled⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀braced⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀angle,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀steps⠀into⠀a⠀space⠀another⠀already⠀occupies.⠀Such⠀effects⠀follow⠀actual⠀position⠀and⠀timing;⠀a⠀familiar⠀movement⠀may⠀also⠀succeed,⠀or⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀without⠀damage.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀into⠀injury⠀or⠀hostile⠀atmosphere.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀wander⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀still⠀does⠀useful⠀work.\n\nLet⠀rhythm⠀change⠀with⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Use⠀abrupt⠀or⠀sustained⠀movement⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀material⠀action.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning⠀can⠀have⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀before,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀attempt;⠀its⠀represented⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀measure⠀elapsed⠀fictional⠀time.⠀Keep⠀the⠀objective⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀material⠀conditions⠀and⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention;⠀neither⠀damage⠀nor⠀noise⠀is⠀required.⠀Competence,⠀cooperation,⠀and⠀improvisation⠀remain⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀cast⠀actually⠀does⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nChoose⠀the⠀document⠀the⠀current⠀journey⠀or⠀task⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀route⠀note,⠀a⠀supply⠀list,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀for⠀someone⠀following⠀behind,⠀a⠀log⠀entry,⠀or⠀a⠀report⠀written⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Let⠀the⠀document⠀carry⠀the⠀objective⠀forward:⠀what⠀was⠀planned,⠀what⠀was⠀found,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀done⠀next.\n\nShow⠀selective⠀attention⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀omits⠀or⠀misstates.⠀A⠀later⠀annotation⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀entry⠀or⠀reveal⠀what⠀an⠀interruption⠀displaced,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀retroactively⠀change⠀the⠀original⠀wording.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀compare⠀the⠀record⠀with⠀the⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀supplied⠀elsewhere:⠀the⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀the⠀half-heard⠀instruction,⠀the⠀interpretation⠀the⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀commit⠀to⠀paper.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀objective⠀recoverable⠀across⠀records.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀practical⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀author⠀was⠀distracted;⠀a⠀note⠀may⠀be⠀wrong⠀about⠀a⠀detail⠀and⠀still⠀guide⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀interiority⠀outside⠀the⠀documents⠀rather⠀than⠀pretending⠀a⠀written⠀entry⠀contains⠀the⠀whole⠀mind.⠀Gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀can⠀reveal⠀events,⠀but⠀the⠀undertaking⠀remains⠀intelligible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀establish⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀uncertain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nKeep⠀the⠀current⠀travel,⠀retrieval,⠀or⠀preparation⠀objective⠀legible⠀at⠀the⠀supplied⠀story's⠀scale.⠀Let⠀care⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀a⠀patient⠀repetition,⠀or⠀a⠀plainly⠀demonstrated⠀next⠀step:⠀a⠀companion⠀remembers⠀which⠀food⠀to⠀pack,⠀repeats⠀a⠀direction⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀a⠀test,⠀or⠀holds⠀a⠀light⠀steady⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀works.⠀The⠀recipient⠀may⠀accept,⠀decline,⠀or⠀already⠀know⠀what⠀to⠀do;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀established⠀problems.\n\nAllow⠀distraction⠀and⠀intrusive⠀association⠀to⠀coexist⠀with⠀pleasure⠀and⠀useful⠀participation.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀enjoy⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀while⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀or⠀image⠀interrupts⠀their⠀attention.⠀The⠀interruption⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀the⠀contribution.⠀They⠀may⠀still⠀tie⠀the⠀knot,⠀carry⠀the⠀pack,⠀or⠀choose⠀the⠀path.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀companion⠀can⠀see:⠀the⠀companion⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀wrong⠀word,⠀or⠀nothing⠀at⠀all.\n\nLet⠀the⠀objective⠀advance⠀through⠀real⠀cooperation.⠀A⠀small⠀success⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀curing⠀the⠀association⠀or⠀requiring⠀an⠀emotional⠀confession.⠀Friendship⠀is⠀not⠀treatment,⠀and⠀care⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀helplessness.⠀Let⠀the⠀interval⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀task⠀as⠀it⠀actually⠀stands,⠀including⠀ongoing⠀work⠀or⠀waiting.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀improvement,⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀changed⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀that⠀frames⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀its⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀obligation:⠀who⠀is⠀involved,⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀is⠀for,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀would⠀mean⠀to⠀fail⠀or⠀succeed.⠀Establish⠀relevant⠀positions⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀underway;⠀an⠀interruption⠀may⠀then⠀complicate⠀that⠀ordered⠀account⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀predetermined⠀next⠀action.\n\nLet⠀a⠀word,⠀a⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀sensation⠀disturb⠀the⠀apparent⠀order⠀of⠀that⠀framing.⠀The⠀interruption⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association,⠀a⠀half-heard⠀instruction,⠀or⠀an⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀of⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀meant.⠀Give⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀room⠀within⠀the⠀paragraph⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀interjected⠀clause.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀polish⠀the⠀character's⠀speech⠀or⠀finish⠀their⠀private⠀argument;⠀the⠀disturbance⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.\n\nReturn⠀through⠀a⠀plain⠀spatial⠀or⠀temporal⠀transition⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀attempts.⠀The⠀next⠀paragraph⠀can⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀movement,⠀a⠀location,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀distance⠀intact:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀frame⠀and⠀judge,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀other⠀characters⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀mind.⠀The⠀adventure⠀continues⠀through⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation,⠀with⠀the⠀composed⠀prose⠀holding⠀both⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀interruption⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀teller⠀a⠀present⠀audience⠀and⠀an⠀immediate⠀reason⠀to⠀recount⠀a⠀past⠀route,⠀errand,⠀rescue,⠀or⠀failed⠀attempt:⠀the⠀listeners⠀need⠀a⠀path,⠀a⠀warning,⠀an⠀ally's⠀trust,⠀or⠀time⠀to⠀finish⠀a⠀repair.⠀Open⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀by⠀locating⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listeners,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀objective⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀begins.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀carry⠀concrete⠀adventure⠀material:⠀terrain⠀crossed,⠀supplies⠀spent,⠀a⠀signal⠀misread,⠀a⠀pursuer⠀evaded,⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀or⠀broken.⠀Keep⠀the⠀past⠀attempt⠀causally⠀legible⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀speech⠀falters.⠀If⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀or⠀noise⠀interrupts⠀the⠀telling,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀actually⠀says,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀privately⠀associates,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀observe.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀about⠀the⠀missed⠀part,⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀detail,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀misunderstanding;⠀let⠀that⠀response⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀ongoing⠀outer⠀scene⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀changed⠀move⠀or⠀automatic⠀correction.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀teller's⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀present⠀danger,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀persuade.⠀When⠀listeners⠀use⠀the⠀account,⠀distinguish⠀the⠀route,⠀warning,⠀or⠀claim⠀they⠀actually⠀received⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀associations.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀also⠀entertain⠀or⠀remain⠀under⠀consideration⠀without⠀becoming⠀necessary⠀to⠀the⠀objective.⠀Render⠀authorized⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀the⠀performed⠀tale.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀private⠀intrusion⠀a⠀second⠀tale⠀spoken⠀aloud,⠀a⠀prophetic⠀message,⠀or⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀is⠀true.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀When⠀an⠀older⠀account⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀undertaking,⠀place⠀its⠀dated⠀instruction,⠀map⠀note,⠀repair⠀log,⠀trace,⠀or⠀attributed⠀recollection⠀beside⠀the⠀present⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀route,⠀vehicle,⠀structure,⠀or⠀task.⠀Compare⠀what⠀was⠀recorded⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀available;⠀the⠀comparison⠀may⠀raise⠀a⠀question,⠀confirm⠀a⠀familiar⠀condition,⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀while⠀other⠀work⠀proceeds.\n\nNarrate⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀examination⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀distinguishes⠀three⠀layers:⠀the⠀record's⠀wording,⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀perception,⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀association⠀or⠀intrusive⠀memory.⠀When⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀or⠀noise⠀interrupts⠀the⠀reading,⠀keep⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀private⠀interpretation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀physical⠀change⠀to⠀the⠀record,⠀which⠀requires⠀an⠀actual⠀event.⠀A⠀misread⠀mark,⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀association⠀may⠀delay⠀action,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀alter⠀the⠀physical⠀trace⠀itself.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀route⠀or⠀task⠀stable⠀across⠀the⠀comparison.⠀If⠀a⠀bridge⠀is⠀gone,⠀a⠀landmark⠀shifted,⠀or⠀a⠀tool⠀missing,⠀state⠀that⠀change⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀merely⠀reads⠀the⠀same⠀mark⠀differently,⠀preserve⠀the⠀original⠀fact⠀for⠀the⠀reader.⠀A⠀verified⠀difference⠀may⠀support⠀rerouting,⠀repair,⠀or⠀an⠀improvised⠀method.⠀Existing⠀knowledge⠀may⠀also⠀suffice,⠀and⠀an⠀unchanged⠀or⠀pending⠀comparison⠀need⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀new⠀move.⠀No⠀false⠀memory,⠀hidden⠀catastrophe,⠀or⠀mandatory⠀revelation⠀is⠀required;⠀uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWhere⠀a⠀supplied⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀adventure⠀objective,⠀make⠀its⠀practical⠀role⠀clear:⠀permission,⠀a⠀guide,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀resource,⠀an⠀old⠀route,⠀or⠀an⠀institution⠀controlling⠀access.⠀Show⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀that⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀through⠀concrete⠀urban⠀or⠀material⠀detail:⠀a⠀worn⠀pass,⠀a⠀locked⠀service⠀door,⠀a⠀modern⠀repair⠀over⠀an⠀old⠀seal,⠀a⠀guide⠀who⠀still⠀honors⠀a⠀former⠀obligation.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀emblem,⠀formula,⠀title,⠀or⠀ritual⠀phrase⠀disturbs⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀render⠀the⠀private⠀intrusion⠀as⠀experience,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀world⠀rule.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀the⠀phrase⠀as⠀a⠀threat,⠀recall⠀a⠀face,⠀or⠀read⠀a⠀warning⠀into⠀an⠀ordinary⠀mark.⠀Counterpoint⠀that⠀private⠀reading⠀with⠀what⠀actually⠀opens⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀carries⠀the⠀load,⠀who⠀grants⠀passage,⠀and⠀who⠀refuses.⠀Let⠀another⠀participant⠀continue⠀a⠀useful⠀task⠀or⠀offer⠀genuine⠀help⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀remains⠀unsettled.\n\nKeep⠀desired⠀belonging⠀and⠀practical⠀assistance⠀possible.⠀A⠀patron⠀or⠀companion⠀may⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated⠀without⠀being⠀predatory;⠀trust⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀still⠀functional.⠀If⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀obstructs⠀the⠀objective,⠀make⠀the⠀obstruction⠀specific:⠀a⠀lapsed⠀permit,⠀a⠀disputed⠀claim,⠀a⠀resource⠀withheld,⠀or⠀a⠀route⠀now⠀controlled⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Actual⠀obstacles⠀and⠀capabilities⠀determine⠀what⠀an⠀attempt⠀can⠀achieve.⠀A⠀private⠀association⠀may⠀still⠀motivate⠀the⠀character's⠀choice⠀without⠀proving⠀that⠀the⠀obstacle⠀has⠀a⠀sinister⠀cause.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀supernatural⠀bindings,⠀inherited⠀powers,⠀or⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀institution⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modern⠀urban⠀popular⠀fiction.⠀Follow⠀a⠀supplied⠀errand⠀or⠀movement⠀toward⠀an⠀objective⠀through⠀linked⠀everyday⠀encounters:⠀a⠀crowded⠀stop,⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀station,⠀a⠀market,⠀a⠀building⠀entrance,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀knows⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀route.⠀Enter⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀enough⠀concrete⠀location⠀and⠀current⠀materials⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀destination⠀legible.\n\nA⠀repeated⠀request⠀or⠀instruction⠀may⠀be⠀received⠀differently⠀as⠀surroundings⠀and⠀listeners⠀change,⠀or⠀remain⠀clear⠀to⠀everyone.⠀Separate⠀available⠀spoken⠀wording,⠀interrupted⠀perception,⠀and⠀evidence⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀responds;⠀comprehension⠀is⠀not⠀directly⠀visible.⠀A⠀vendor⠀may⠀answer⠀the⠀wrong⠀part,⠀a⠀helper⠀may⠀offer⠀useful⠀local⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀repeat⠀the⠀request⠀more⠀plainly.⠀Use⠀a⠀concrete⠀transition⠀to⠀retain⠀the⠀destination,⠀the⠀object⠀being⠀carried⠀or⠀sought,⠀and⠀who⠀actually⠀received⠀the⠀words.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀stop⠀a⠀new⠀misunderstanding.⠀Local⠀expertise⠀and⠀ordinary⠀help⠀can⠀advance⠀the⠀errand:⠀someone⠀supplies⠀a⠀missing⠀tool,⠀confirms⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀points⠀out⠀a⠀hazard.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀drifts⠀into⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association,⠀let⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀continue⠀through⠀another⠀participant's⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀correction.⠀Coordination⠀depends⠀on⠀actual⠀communication,⠀observation,⠀and⠀action.⠀A⠀private⠀echo⠀may⠀affect⠀one⠀person's⠀choice,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀information⠀another⠀participant⠀received.⠀Keep⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀specific⠀without⠀imposing⠀code-switching⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany.⠀Place⠀a⠀dated⠀observation,⠀sketched-in-words⠀landmark,⠀unfinished⠀reflection,⠀or⠀small⠀sensory⠀note⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀progress⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Let⠀the⠀entry⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀traveler⠀noticed,⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀unresolved,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀surroundings⠀did⠀next.\n\nSeparate⠀what⠀was⠀recorded⠀then⠀from⠀a⠀later⠀annotation⠀or⠀understanding.⠀If⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀adds⠀a⠀note⠀after⠀the⠀fact,⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀time⠀and⠀knowledge:⠀the⠀earlier⠀entry⠀may⠀misread⠀a⠀sound,⠀attach⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object,⠀or⠀stop⠀mid-concern.⠀A⠀later⠀annotation⠀can⠀correct⠀or⠀complicate⠀that⠀reading⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀original⠀experience.\n\nLet⠀the⠀association⠀retain⠀its⠀personal⠀interest⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀navigational⠀payoff.⠀A⠀repeated⠀word⠀or⠀remembered⠀face⠀may⠀later⠀prompt⠀a⠀grounded⠀use,⠀but⠀a⠀private⠀impression⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀the⠀route⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀feared⠀condition⠀real.⠀Let⠀actual⠀progress⠀continue⠀through⠀travel,⠀repair,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀recovery.⠀Private⠀experience⠀may⠀exceed⠀the⠀chosen⠀record:⠀the⠀entry⠀can⠀omit⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀felt,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀supply⠀that⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀observation⠀to⠀be⠀reused⠀later⠀or⠀every⠀entry⠀to⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀reflection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Revisit⠀a⠀handoff,⠀route⠀instruction,⠀shared⠀maneuver,⠀or⠀rescue⠀attempt⠀from⠀the⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀of⠀different⠀participants⠀at⠀different⠀times.⠀Use⠀attributed⠀speech⠀or⠀records⠀where⠀another⠀participant's⠀direct⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀outside⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permissions;⠀a⠀perspective⠀transition⠀is⠀not⠀owed⠀in⠀every⠀passage.\n\nTrack⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀who⠀perceived⠀which⠀fragment.⠀One⠀voice⠀may⠀report⠀the⠀instruction⠀clearly;⠀another⠀may⠀have⠀heard⠀only⠀a⠀word⠀through⠀noise;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀attach⠀an⠀intrusive⠀association⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀phrase.⠀Keep⠀each⠀account⠀attributed⠀and⠀limited⠀to⠀that⠀person's⠀original⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀character's⠀certainty⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀another⠀character's⠀accurate⠀plain⠀report⠀false,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀intrusion⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀shared⠀fact.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀shared⠀event's⠀causal⠀order⠀even⠀when⠀presentation⠀shifts.⠀Positions,⠀spent⠀resources,⠀injuries,⠀and⠀completed⠀actions⠀remain⠀stable⠀across⠀accounts.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀actual⠀success,⠀failure,⠀or⠀continuing⠀attempt⠀more⠀intelligible⠀through⠀differences⠀in⠀reception.⠀A⠀later⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀supply⠀a⠀new⠀revelation⠀or⠀correction.⠀Participants⠀can⠀use⠀another⠀account⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀information⠀actually⠀reaches⠀them;⠀the⠀reader's⠀combined⠀understanding⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀shared⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀unstable⠀mind.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀at⠀the⠀current⠀objective.⠀In⠀the⠀opening⠀lines,⠀locate⠀the⠀relevant⠀bodies,⠀objects,⠀and⠀direction⠀of⠀movement:⠀who⠀is⠀carrying⠀what,⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀handhold⠀or⠀turn⠀is,⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀happen⠀next.⠀Use⠀clear⠀transitions⠀for⠀consequential⠀changes⠀of⠀position⠀without⠀accounting⠀for⠀every⠀movement.\n\nBreak⠀paragraphs⠀when⠀attention⠀changes⠀between⠀an⠀instruction,⠀its⠀private⠀echo,⠀and⠀actual⠀movement.⠀If⠀a⠀spoken⠀word⠀or⠀sudden⠀noise⠀interrupts⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀give⠀the⠀private⠀association⠀its⠀own⠀beat,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀attempt.⠀A⠀straightforward⠀reply⠀can⠀resume⠀coordination⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀echo:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀answer,⠀act,⠀or⠀follow⠀while⠀the⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀remains⠀present.\n\nLet⠀another⠀participant⠀continue⠀a⠀useful⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀comic⠀reaction⠀partner.⠀A⠀companion⠀can⠀secure⠀the⠀rope,⠀call⠀the⠀next⠀move,⠀or⠀finish⠀the⠀request⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀is⠀briefly⠀elsewhere.⠀Keep⠀the⠀adventure⠀objective⠀intelligible⠀through⠀these⠀actions.⠀Short⠀action⠀passages⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀short⠀actual⠀thought;⠀private⠀feeling,⠀association,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀space⠀its⠀actual⠀experience⠀needs,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀paragraph⠀limit⠀or⠀decision⠀payoff.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀forced⠀choice,⠀or⠀mandatory⠀quip⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀sensory⠀particular⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀actually⠀notices⠀during⠀travel⠀or⠀physical⠀work:⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound,⠀a⠀surface⠀texture,⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀light,⠀a⠀rhythm⠀of⠀movement.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀at⠀moments⠀when⠀attention⠀is⠀interrupted⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀intrudes.⠀Develop⠀the⠀image⠀across⠀the⠀passage⠀by⠀changing⠀what⠀it⠀touches:⠀it⠀may⠀stay⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀feeling,⠀shift⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀changes,⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀felt⠀recurrence⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀a⠀warning,⠀supernatural⠀sign,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀intent.⠀A⠀sensory⠀detail⠀can⠀also⠀have⠀a⠀practical⠀function⠀when⠀the⠀established⠀circumstances⠀support⠀it;⠀no⠀clue⠀or⠀insight⠀is⠀required.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations.⠀A⠀comparison⠀can⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀material⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀objective.⠀Return⠀with⠀plain⠀clauses⠀to⠀who⠀is⠀moving,⠀holding⠀what,⠀or⠀speaking⠀next.⠀The⠀plain⠀action⠀does⠀not⠀correct⠀the⠀image⠀or⠀prove⠀it⠀false;⠀it⠀simply⠀keeps⠀the⠀undertaking⠀legible⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀continues⠀beside⠀it.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀carry⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀longer⠀sentence⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀image⠀through⠀its⠀associations;⠀a⠀short⠀direct⠀clause⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀world.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀paragraph⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀pattern.⠀When⠀speech⠀is⠀affected⠀by⠀noise⠀or⠀attention,⠀let⠀the⠀spoken⠀line⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀private⠀image:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀while⠀the⠀recurring⠀particular⠀still⠀occupies⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀attention.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀task⠀resumed,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀obstacle⠀encountered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀encounter⠀one⠀established⠀difference:⠀a⠀changed⠀landmark,⠀an⠀absent⠀routine,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀now⠀put⠀to⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀use,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀memory.⠀Use⠀that⠀difference⠀to⠀open⠀a⠀private⠀recollection,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀recollection⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀situation.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀how⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀practice⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀without⠀that⠀memory⠀changing⠀what⠀is⠀physically⠀available⠀now.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀can⠀fragment⠀the⠀comparison;⠀show⠀the⠀break⠀in⠀attention⠀as⠀it⠀happens,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀do.\n\nDistinguish⠀remembered⠀sensation⠀from⠀current⠀instructions⠀or⠀ability.⠀A⠀remembered⠀pain,⠀pleasure,⠀or⠀confidence⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀skill,⠀heal⠀an⠀injury,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀present⠀obstacle⠀disappear.⠀Assess⠀the⠀present⠀undertaking⠀through⠀actual⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀and⠀available⠀conditions.⠀Adaptation⠀may⠀find⠀another⠀route,⠀or⠀the⠀original⠀objective⠀may⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀achievable;⠀neither⠀restoration⠀nor⠀permanent⠀loss⠀is⠀prescribed⠀by⠀the⠀reflective⠀tone.\n\nKeep⠀companionship,⠀pleasure,⠀and⠀practical⠀adaptation⠀available.⠀Another⠀person's⠀ordinary⠀help⠀can⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀without⠀curing⠀it⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀advanced,⠀the⠀difference⠀accepted⠀for⠀now,⠀or⠀the⠀memory⠀still⠀present⠀while⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀begins.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀announce⠀impermanence⠀or⠀loss.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀changed⠀thing,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀imposed⠀on⠀the⠀whole⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀construction.⠀Give⠀an⠀actual⠀request⠀for⠀passage,⠀supplies,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀information⠀a⠀situated⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀teller⠀angle.⠀Each⠀encounter⠀carries⠀its⠀own⠀local⠀assumptions:⠀a⠀gatekeeper⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀request⠀as⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀status,⠀a⠀merchant⠀as⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀stranger⠀as⠀a⠀possible⠀trick.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀actually⠀offers⠀or⠀refuses,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀refusal⠀or⠀acceptance⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀person's⠀position⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀worth.\n\nLet⠀a⠀half-heard⠀title,⠀intrusive⠀phrase,⠀or⠀unstable⠀interpretation⠀affect⠀how⠀the⠀participant⠀approaches⠀the⠀local⠀rule.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀misread⠀a⠀formality,⠀answer⠀the⠀wrong⠀question,⠀or⠀hesitate⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀direct⠀reply.⠀A⠀private⠀misreading⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀hidden⠀truth⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person,⠀though⠀an⠀interpretation⠀may⠀be⠀supported⠀by⠀later⠀observable⠀conduct.⠀The⠀encounter's⠀comedy⠀or⠀friction⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀participant's⠀interrupted⠀attention⠀and⠀the⠀local⠀expectation,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀every⠀local⠀figure⠀a⠀fool⠀or⠀every⠀request⠀a⠀con.\n\nCarry⠀useful⠀help⠀and⠀unresolved⠀requests⠀forward.⠀A⠀failed⠀approach⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀a⠀different⠀introduction,⠀a⠀revised⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀intervention.⠀Competence⠀and⠀cooperation⠀remain⠀possible.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀request⠀pending,⠀refused,⠀partly⠀granted,⠀or⠀accepted⠀on⠀either⠀familiar⠀or⠀unexpected⠀terms.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀trickster⠀role,⠀a⠀mandatory⠀comic⠀exposure,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀the⠀region.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀as⠀they⠀are⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀objective,⠀an⠀immediate⠀point⠀of⠀contact,⠀and⠀the⠀cue⠀actually⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details:⠀the⠀thing⠀being⠀carried,⠀the⠀surface⠀being⠀crossed,⠀the⠀person⠀being⠀addressed,⠀the⠀sound⠀that⠀interrupts.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀contribute⠀to⠀this⠀account,⠀including⠀its⠀private⠀feeling⠀or⠀ordinary⠀interest.⠀Remove⠀redundant⠀explanation,⠀while⠀allowing⠀repetition⠀that⠀reflects⠀an⠀actual⠀continuing⠀concern.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀private⠀intrusion⠀beside⠀the⠀action⠀anchors⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀association⠀twice.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀a⠀phrase⠀wrongly,⠀attach⠀a⠀memory⠀to⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀lose⠀the⠀thread⠀of⠀a⠀request.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain⠀action⠀or⠀continuing⠀task⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀when⠀attention⠀shifts;⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀can⠀recur⠀as⠀it⠀does⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀experience.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀cause⠀inferable:⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀hesitates,⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀why⠀from⠀the⠀preceding⠀detail⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀sentence.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀causal⠀step⠀itself.\n\nKeep⠀inward⠀feeling⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀at⠀its⠀warranted⠀extent.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀surrounding⠀prose⠀is⠀economical.⠀The⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀speak⠀cryptically⠀or⠀go⠀quiet⠀to⠀fit⠀the⠀style.⠀Let⠀speech⠀remain⠀individual⠀and⠀direct.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀resumed,⠀the⠀cue⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀obstacle⠀visible.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀insight.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀with⠀natural⠀movement⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fixed⠀cycle⠀of⠀task,⠀thought,⠀speech,⠀and⠀continuation.⠀Let⠀the⠀movement⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀sudden⠀noise⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀recollection;⠀a⠀companion's⠀question⠀may⠀pull⠀attention⠀back⠀from⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase;⠀a⠀physical⠀obstacle⠀may⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀finished⠀interpreting⠀the⠀last⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀objective⠀and⠀prior⠀conditions⠀available⠀when⠀attention⠀wanders.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀still⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀attempted,⠀and⠀what⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀step.⠀A⠀companion's⠀plain⠀action⠀can⠀anchor⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀curing⠀the⠀focal⠀experience.⠀The⠀companion⠀may⠀continue⠀working,⠀repeat⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction,⠀or⠀simply⠀remain⠀present⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀is⠀divided.⠀Their⠀action⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀world⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀private⠀interruption.\n\nDiscovery⠀and⠀recovery⠀need⠀no⠀newly⠀invented⠀antagonist⠀or⠀countdown;⠀preserve⠀any⠀opposing⠀actor⠀or⠀deadline⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀The⠀undertaking⠀can⠀advance⠀through⠀cooperation,⠀improvisation,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀persistence.⠀A⠀fallible⠀interpretation⠀may⠀cause⠀a⠀small⠀delay⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀approach⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀betrayal⠀or⠀a⠀permanent⠀failure.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀still⠀underway,⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀still⠀present,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀opening⠀from⠀a⠀changed⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀a⠀callback⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀It⠀should⠀bear⠀on⠀coordinating⠀the⠀current⠀goal:⠀a⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀uses⠀before⠀a⠀difficult⠀task,⠀a⠀habit⠀for⠀checking⠀equipment,⠀a⠀private⠀name⠀for⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀situation,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀dividing⠀work⠀that⠀they⠀have⠀used⠀before.⠀Let⠀the⠀callback⠀function⠀practically⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀It⠀may⠀help⠀them⠀coordinate,⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀usual⠀pattern,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀land⠀because⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀distracted.\n\nLet⠀private⠀association⠀alter⠀the⠀callback's⠀felt⠀meaning⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀a⠀newly⠀invented⠀code⠀or⠀telepathic⠀instruction.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀the⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀through⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀misread⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀tone,⠀or⠀attach⠀a⠀private⠀worry⠀to⠀a⠀shared⠀habit.⠀The⠀other⠀person's⠀actual⠀reply⠀or⠀contribution⠀remains⠀separate.⠀Familiarity⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀perfect⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀heard⠀or⠀meant.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀cooperation,⠀missed⠀implications,⠀and⠀unresolved⠀feelings⠀to⠀coexist;⠀a⠀reply⠀or⠀contribution⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀pending.⠀The⠀relationship⠀premise⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀scene⠀selection⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀advanced,⠀the⠀callback⠀still⠀echoing⠀privately,⠀or⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀working⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀direction⠀while⠀understanding⠀different⠀things.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀preparation,⠀attempted⠀passage,⠀and⠀known⠀consequence⠀compact⠀oral⠀declarations.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀an⠀account⠀being⠀retold:⠀a⠀plan⠀stated⠀in⠀few⠀words,⠀an⠀obstacle⠀named,⠀an⠀act⠀related⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actors⠀clear.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀voice⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀was⠀attempted⠀and⠀what⠀came⠀of⠀it,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀deed⠀or⠀its⠀meaning⠀within⠀the⠀current⠀passage.\n\nOpen⠀into⠀permitted⠀private⠀experience⠀where⠀the⠀act⠀is⠀lived⠀differently⠀from⠀its⠀retelling.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀a⠀vow⠀or⠀instruction⠀through⠀noise,⠀attach⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀phrase,⠀or⠀lose⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀plan⠀while⠀the⠀chronicle⠀voice⠀remains⠀steady.⠀A⠀half-heard⠀vow⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀oath⠀another⠀character⠀agreed⠀to.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀actually⠀experienced⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀retelling⠀later⠀makes⠀public.⠀A⠀private⠀interruption⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀reliability⠀or⠀prophetic⠀authority;⠀keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀sources⠀and⠀the⠀participant's⠀experience⠀distinct.\n\nRepeat⠀an⠀established⠀phrase⠀with⠀its⠀actual⠀context⠀intact.⠀A⠀later⠀occurrence⠀may⠀give⠀the⠀phrase⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀or⠀sustain⠀an⠀existing⠀meaning⠀without⠀erasing⠀its⠀earlier⠀context.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀stop⠀before⠀the⠀deed⠀or⠀its⠀meaning⠀resolves.⠀The⠀next⠀attempt,⠀the⠀next⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀remembered⠀consequence⠀remains⠀available.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Locate⠀the⠀objective⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀work⠀already⠀sustaining⠀the⠀cast:⠀shared⠀transport,⠀preparation,⠀tools,⠀meals,⠀repairs,⠀or⠀care⠀commitments.⠀Show⠀what⠀each⠀helper⠀is⠀actually⠀doing⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀task,⠀so⠀cooperation⠀is⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀moral⠀test.⠀When⠀an⠀instruction⠀is⠀interrupted⠀or⠀only⠀partly⠀received,⠀a⠀visible⠀demonstration,⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀or⠀later⠀handoff⠀may⠀clarify⠀it.⠀The⠀uncertainty⠀can⠀also⠀remain⠀while⠀someone⠀continues⠀work⠀they⠀already⠀understand.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀shared⠀work.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀or⠀association⠀may⠀surface⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀tying⠀a⠀load,⠀checking⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀passing⠀equipment;⠀let⠀it⠀interrupt⠀reception⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀physical⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀the⠀task.⠀Another⠀person⠀may⠀keep⠀working,⠀decline,⠀or⠀help⠀accurately.⠀If⠀they⠀clarify,⠀let⠀them⠀do⠀so⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀knowledge⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀heard⠀or⠀later⠀believed⠀was⠀said.⠀A⠀practical⠀misunderstanding⠀can⠀be⠀corrected⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀action,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀uncertain⠀instruction⠀collapse⠀into⠀failure.⠀The⠀adventure⠀advances⠀through⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation⠀within⠀familiar⠀obligations,⠀while⠀allowing⠀the⠀supplied⠀objective⠀to⠀take⠀the⠀travelers⠀elsewhere.⠀Commitments⠀and⠀helpers'⠀ordinary⠀lives⠀remain⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀undertaking⠀leaves⠀home.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀and⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀objective,⠀each⠀participant's⠀position,⠀and⠀any⠀relevant⠀audible⠀instruction⠀or⠀cue⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀one.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀legible:⠀when⠀a⠀cut⠀moves⠀to⠀another⠀supported⠀location,⠀state⠀where⠀each⠀actor⠀and⠀object⠀now⠀is⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀the⠀cut⠀imply⠀movement⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀occurred.⠀Distinguish⠀an⠀actual⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀from⠀a⠀privately⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀by⠀keeping⠀the⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀separate⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀sound⠀cue⠀or⠀action⠀line.\n\nLet⠀the⠀visible⠀action⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on.⠀A⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀tool,⠀hesitates⠀at⠀a⠀threshold,⠀or⠀repeats⠀a⠀question⠀because⠀attention⠀slipped;⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀line⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀correction⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀voice-over⠀or⠀camera⠀distortion.⠀If⠀voice-over⠀is⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀it⠀remains⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀mind.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀interiority⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀members.⠀A⠀companion⠀can⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀or⠀done,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀interruption.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀position⠀without⠀a⠀fresh⠀obstacle⠀or⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nPresent⠀the⠀supplied⠀objective⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀can⠀stage:⠀an⠀entrance,⠀a⠀prop,⠀a⠀load⠀to⠀move,⠀a⠀route⠀to⠀describe,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀needs⠀cooperation.⠀Keep⠀offstage⠀activity⠀and⠀wider⠀travel⠀available⠀through⠀credible⠀reports⠀or⠀observable⠀effects⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀requires⠀them;⠀the⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀redesign⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Let⠀blocking⠀and⠀object⠀access⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on.⠀If⠀a⠀line⠀is⠀missed⠀or⠀only⠀partly⠀heard,⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀response⠀follow⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀circumstances.⠀A⠀repetition,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀continued⠀task⠀may⠀help;⠀an⠀error,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀uncertainty⠀can⠀also⠀remain.⠀No⠀clarification⠀or⠀next⠀action⠀is⠀compulsory.\n\nKeep⠀stage⠀directions⠀observable.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀look,⠀or⠀a⠀hesitation⠀can⠀be⠀played,⠀but⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀or⠀private⠀association⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀as⠀an⠀invisible⠀spectacle.⠀An⠀authorized⠀aside⠀is⠀separate⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience;⠀it⠀cannot⠀replace⠀required⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀presentation.⠀Other⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀or⠀done⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement⠀as⠀it⠀stands:⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀still⠀working⠀while⠀another⠀waits.⠀The⠀adventure⠀advances⠀through⠀practical⠀cooperation⠀and⠀improvisation⠀within⠀the⠀shared⠀space,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀confrontation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀sensation,⠀intrusive⠀phrase,⠀imagined⠀continuation,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀concern⠀through⠀the⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀the⠀associations⠀arrive⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀attention⠀receives⠀them:⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀remembered⠀word,⠀a⠀bodily⠀pull,⠀a⠀half-formed⠀plan,⠀then⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀recover⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀attempted:⠀the⠀hand⠀reaching,⠀the⠀step⠀taken,⠀the⠀instruction⠀spoken,⠀the⠀object⠀moved.\n\nTrack⠀external⠀time⠀independently⠀of⠀represented⠀length.⠀A⠀long⠀inward⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀consume⠀long⠀action⠀time,⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀fragment⠀need⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀character⠀acted⠀quickly.⠀Imagining⠀a⠀climb,⠀reach,⠀or⠀call⠀is⠀not⠀performing⠀it.⠀Represent⠀actual⠀attempts⠀through⠀the⠀narration's⠀permitted⠀action⠀or⠀sourced⠀report,⠀allowing⠀an⠀attempt⠀or⠀outcome⠀to⠀remain⠀pending.\n\nLet⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀actual⠀action⠀reorient⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀thought⠀to⠀conclude.⠀The⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀may⠀recur,⠀fade,⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀It⠀is⠀neither⠀a⠀diagnosis⠀nor⠀a⠀new⠀world⠀mechanism.⠀Any⠀practical⠀inference⠀it⠀prompts⠀remains⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀could⠀actually⠀know,⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀true⠀because⠀it⠀intrudes.⠀The⠀adventure⠀continues⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀real⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation,⠀even⠀when⠀their⠀attention⠀is⠀divided.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nGive⠀each⠀message⠀an⠀actual⠀sender,⠀audience,⠀and⠀practical⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀coordinated⠀errand.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sent⠀wording⠀stable:⠀a⠀participant⠀can⠀reread⠀a⠀delivered⠀message⠀or⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀silently⠀changing⠀what⠀was⠀originally⠀sent.⠀If⠀the⠀actual⠀interface⠀supports⠀editing,⠀represent⠀the⠀edit⠀and⠀available⠀versions⠀as⠀events⠀instead⠀of⠀rewriting⠀the⠀prior⠀exchange.⠀Show⠀what⠀was⠀delivered⠀and⠀acted⠀on⠀as⠀the⠀basis⠀for⠀coordination,⠀not⠀a⠀fabricated⠀outage,⠀receipt,⠀or⠀interface⠀event⠀revealing⠀intent.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀or⠀association⠀belongs⠀in⠀clearly⠀separated⠀private⠀material,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀read.⠀If⠀a⠀participant⠀misreads⠀or⠀only⠀partly⠀absorbs⠀an⠀instruction,⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀or⠀action⠀may⠀clarify⠀it,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀can⠀continue;⠀the⠀original⠀sent⠀wording⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀to⠀match⠀the⠀misreading.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀sends⠀short⠀confirmations,⠀another⠀rereads⠀before⠀acting,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀draft⠀unfinished.⠀Coordination⠀advances⠀through⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀delivered,⠀attempted,⠀and⠀reported,⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reading⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀shared⠀record.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀purposeful⠀position,⠀object,⠀or⠀landmark⠀before⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀moves⠀inward.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀stable⠀cue⠀anchors⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀route⠀marker,⠀a⠀companion's⠀position.⠀Move⠀among⠀readable⠀speaker-led⠀exchanges,⠀scene⠀cues,⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀attention,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation.⠀Give⠀private⠀experience⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀while⠀retaining⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀visible⠀situation.\n\nLet⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀cue⠀orient⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀requiring⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀look⠀back⠀at⠀the⠀landmark⠀or⠀object⠀and⠀find⠀it⠀unchanged⠀while⠀their⠀private⠀association⠀shifts;⠀the⠀external⠀fact⠀remains⠀the⠀same.⠀Distinguish⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀companions⠀themselves:⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀description⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀event.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀objective⠀and⠀others'⠀actions⠀legible.⠀A⠀companion⠀can⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀or⠀done,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀interruption.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀an⠀expression⠀as⠀a⠀truth⠀detector,⠀invent⠀a⠀visual⠀asset,⠀or⠀activate⠀a⠀branching⠀menu⠀or⠀automatic⠀route⠀choice.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀position⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nRecover⠀only⠀the⠀known⠀destination,⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀resource⠀needed⠀to⠀orient⠀this⠀installment.⠀Briefly⠀restore⠀the⠀actual⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking:⠀where⠀the⠀cast⠀is,⠀what⠀was⠀last⠀completed,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀journey⠀or⠀re-explain⠀every⠀earlier⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀recurring⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀or⠀interpretation⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀record⠀of⠀earlier⠀actions⠀and⠀communication.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀private⠀concern⠀across⠀installments,⠀but⠀the⠀shared⠀record⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀delivered,⠀or⠀attempted⠀remains⠀unchanged.⠀Progress⠀can⠀continue⠀beside⠀an⠀unsettled⠀personal⠀reading:⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀completed,⠀a⠀route⠀confirmed,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀secured⠀while⠀the⠀intrusive⠀phrase⠀still⠀recurs.\n\nLet⠀clarification,⠀continued⠀uncertainty,⠀ordinary⠀interest,⠀or⠀recovery⠀persist⠀across⠀replies.⠀No⠀fresh⠀interruption,⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀insight⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀free⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀through-line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀the⠀practical⠀objective⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀move⠀it⠀requires.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on:⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀division⠀of⠀labor,⠀a⠀window⠀of⠀time.⠀Make⠀the⠀constraint⠀concrete⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀why⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀is⠀necessary⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀hesitates.\n\nLocate⠀the⠀emotional⠀difficulty⠀inside⠀that⠀step.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀accept⠀that⠀a⠀companion⠀must⠀take⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀feasible⠀route⠀is⠀personally⠀unacceptable.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀affect⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange:⠀a⠀request⠀that⠀gets⠀rephrased,⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀purely⠀technical,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀safely⠀assume.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀the⠀feeling⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering;⠀use⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀diction⠀and⠀distance.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀technical⠀limit⠀from⠀the⠀personal⠀one.⠀A⠀mechanism⠀may⠀be⠀sound,⠀a⠀resource⠀may⠀be⠀sufficient,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀resist⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀value,⠀a⠀remembered⠀hurt,⠀or⠀a⠀fear⠀of⠀what⠀accepting⠀the⠀role⠀will⠀mean.⠀Keep⠀that⠀distinction⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀emotional⠀repair⠀does⠀not⠀rewrite⠀world⠀rules⠀and⠀a⠀workable⠀plan⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀following⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀channel.⠀Private⠀fear,⠀remembered⠀hurt,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀remain⠀meaningful⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀attempt⠀pauses⠀or⠀no⠀decision⠀changes.⠀Cooperation⠀may⠀work⠀without⠀settling⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀discovery,⠀recovery,⠀and⠀travel⠀remain⠀available⠀alongside⠀confrontation,⠀and⠀stop⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession,⠀sacrifice,⠀or⠀breakthrough.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nBegin⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀actually⠀supplies⠀into⠀the⠀current⠀attempt.⠀State⠀the⠀objective⠀plainly⠀and⠀place⠀the⠀submitted⠀action⠀inside⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀conditions:⠀where⠀people⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀reach,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀change.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀relevant⠀constraint⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀it⠀affects⠀that⠀action,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀briefing.\n\nShow⠀the⠀interaction⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀move⠀work⠀or⠀fail.⠀A⠀tool's⠀limit,⠀a⠀companion's⠀position,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀spent,⠀or⠀an⠀environmental⠀condition⠀can⠀determine⠀the⠀outcome.⠀Make⠀the⠀consequence⠀legible⠀through⠀observation,⠀exchange,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.⠀Other⠀actors⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀work⠀during⠀the⠀interval;⠀their⠀choices⠀may⠀help,⠀obstruct,⠀or⠀simply⠀proceed⠀alongside⠀the⠀attempt.\n\nResolve⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀situation⠀and⠀active⠀contract⠀justify.⠀A⠀complicated⠀task⠀can⠀remain⠀underway,⠀and⠀a⠀partial⠀result⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀available⠀options⠀without⠀closing⠀the⠀scene.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀whichever⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀form⠀is⠀active,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀out⠀of⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀them⠀access.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀unmistakable⠀and⠀paragraphs⠀readable.⠀Leave⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point:⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀may⠀be⠀obvious,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀waiting⠀on⠀another⠀character,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀menu,⠀a⠀question⠀to⠀the⠀player,⠀or⠀a⠀manufactured⠀new⠀obstacle.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route.⠀Treat⠀trained⠀technique⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking:⠀preparation,⠀footing⠀or⠀positioning,⠀resource⠀limits,⠀and⠀the⠀interaction⠀of⠀an⠀established⠀skill⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀obstacle.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀technique⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀changes⠀when⠀attempted.⠀A⠀practiced⠀move⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀prove⠀unnecessary⠀according⠀to⠀conditions;⠀preserve⠀established⠀skill⠀without⠀guaranteeing⠀that⠀it⠀succeeds⠀under⠀every⠀condition.\n\nMake⠀promises,⠀training⠀relationships,⠀and⠀earned⠀reputation⠀carry⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀Who⠀can⠀be⠀asked⠀to⠀help,⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀refuses⠀to⠀spend,⠀or⠀why⠀they⠀keep⠀another's⠀route⠀open⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀those⠀obligations.⠀Let⠀a⠀social⠀debt⠀constrain⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀rewriting⠀a⠀physical⠀rule.⠀Translate⠀the⠀route⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀setting's⠀skills⠀and⠀relationships.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀swords,⠀sects,⠀magic⠀or⠀an⠀identity⠀merely⠀from⠀the⠀selector,⠀and⠀preserve⠀any⠀such⠀elements⠀already⠀established.\n\nKeep⠀individual⠀speech⠀distinct⠀and⠀preserve⠀meaningful⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience,⠀including⠀feeling⠀outside⠀tactics.⠀A⠀journey⠀can⠀contain⠀recovery⠀or⠀discovery⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀duel,⠀vow,⠀or⠀competence⠀payoff⠀in⠀each⠀reply.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀ending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀few⠀load-bearing⠀details⠀of⠀effort⠀and⠀keep⠀them⠀in⠀the⠀foreground:⠀a⠀tool's⠀tolerance,⠀remaining⠀supplies,⠀a⠀difficult⠀transfer,⠀or⠀another⠀condition⠀established⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀encounter⠀the⠀limit⠀while⠀someone⠀works⠀against⠀it.⠀When⠀an⠀established⠀material⠀condition⠀affects⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀can⠀accomplish,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀does⠀so;⠀connect⠀any⠀resulting⠀position⠀or⠀expenditure⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀available⠀option.\n\nCompress⠀repeated⠀setup⠀and⠀uneventful⠀transitions.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀short⠀movement⠀between⠀actions,⠀but⠀retain⠀whatever⠀explanation⠀makes⠀the⠀interaction⠀intelligible.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀acceptable⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀Vary⠀rhythm⠀for⠀different⠀kinds⠀of⠀effort:⠀a⠀sudden⠀break,⠀a⠀slow⠀carry,⠀a⠀careful⠀adjustment.\n\nDo⠀not⠀shorten⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀demand⠀rough⠀speech⠀from⠀everyone.⠀Both⠀active⠀interiority⠀modes⠀retain⠀real⠀feeling⠀and⠀thought⠀without⠀an⠀action-service⠀test.⠀Preserve⠀quiet⠀work,⠀assistance,⠀and⠀successful⠀recovery.⠀Material⠀wear⠀supplies⠀texture;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀injury,⠀moral⠀cruelty,⠀or⠀a⠀doomed⠀expedition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀expedition⠀through⠀documents⠀produced⠀by⠀actual⠀participants.⠀Use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀supports:⠀a⠀route⠀note,⠀supply⠀request,⠀revised⠀instruction,⠀or⠀account⠀of⠀an⠀attempt.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀formats⠀mechanically.⠀Each⠀document⠀has⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.\n\nDistinguish⠀composition⠀time,⠀delivery,⠀and⠀later⠀use.⠀An⠀earlier⠀instruction⠀may⠀remain⠀sound⠀yet⠀no⠀longer⠀apply⠀after⠀a⠀resource⠀or⠀condition⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀selected⠀records⠀show⠀that⠀relation⠀through⠀their⠀practical⠀effects:⠀a⠀recipient⠀acts⠀on⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀the⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀report⠀corrects⠀an⠀assumption⠀the⠀original⠀writer⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀checked.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀writer's⠀belief⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀mechanism.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀confident⠀and⠀wrong,⠀or⠀cautious⠀and⠀accurate,⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀Preserve⠀meaningful⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀separately⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀presentation;⠀neither⠀a⠀letter⠀nor⠀an⠀invented⠀diary⠀stands⠀in⠀for⠀it.\n\nDocuments⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀while⠀the⠀journey⠀continues.⠀No⠀compulsory⠀discovery⠀or⠀completed⠀experiment⠀is⠀required⠀per⠀entry.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀chosen⠀accommodations.⠀Divide⠀a⠀task⠀according⠀to⠀real⠀capacities,⠀adjust⠀equipment⠀for⠀someone's⠀comfort,⠀teach⠀a⠀procedure⠀patiently,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀recovery⠀interval⠀pleasant.⠀Show⠀why⠀the⠀accommodation⠀works⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀undertaking:⠀the⠀adjusted⠀pack⠀stays⠀balanced,⠀the⠀slower⠀pace⠀preserves⠀strength,⠀the⠀clear⠀explanation⠀lets⠀a⠀companion⠀complete⠀the⠀next⠀step.\n\nLet⠀the⠀kindness⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures⠀matter⠀beyond⠀efficiency.⠀A⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀a⠀warm⠀drink,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀can⠀be⠀worth⠀attention⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀climactic⠀emotional⠀payoff.⠀Nobody⠀needs⠀an⠀optimally⠀balanced⠀contribution,⠀a⠀repaired⠀trauma,⠀or⠀perfect⠀agreement.⠀Keep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.\n\nKeep⠀external⠀obstacles⠀and⠀resource⠀costs⠀real.⠀Care⠀expands⠀available⠀options⠀without⠀guaranteeing⠀victory.⠀A⠀rest⠀can⠀be⠀genuinely⠀restful,⠀and⠀a⠀useful⠀kindness⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀disguised⠀trap.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀channel⠀under⠀active⠀ownership;⠀relief,⠀worry,⠀enjoyment,⠀or⠀unrelated⠀associations⠀all⠀belong⠀there.\n\nSustain⠀exploration,⠀travel,⠀and⠀genuine⠀respite.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀comfort,⠀in⠀renewed⠀effort,⠀or⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pause.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaabag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Brandon⠀Sanderson⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀a⠀concrete⠀attempt.⠀Widen,⠀through⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀understanding,⠀into⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀made⠀this⠀method⠀available:⠀who⠀maintains⠀the⠀route,⠀who⠀funds⠀the⠀expedition,⠀what⠀agreement⠀authorizes⠀this⠀approach,⠀what⠀prior⠀failure⠀shaped⠀the⠀present⠀plan,⠀what⠀inherited⠀equipment⠀carries⠀a⠀previous⠀owner's⠀decision⠀into⠀the⠀scene.⠀Then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀participants⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀choose.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀system⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀relation⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀The⠀clearance⠀a⠀sponsor⠀granted,⠀the⠀seasonal⠀limit⠀built⠀into⠀a⠀contract,⠀the⠀design⠀constraint⠀on⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀political⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀supply⠀line,⠀the⠀institutional⠀memory⠀of⠀who⠀failed⠀on⠀this⠀approach⠀before.⠀Disting