.⠀Keep⠀the⠀current⠀activity⠀and⠀available⠀choices⠀orientable⠀as⠀reflection⠀moves⠀through⠀this⠀material.⠀Work⠀may⠀continue,⠀wait,⠀or⠀be⠀deliberately⠀paused⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene;⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀nonspoken⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀consume⠀time⠀or⠀freeze⠀independently⠀ongoing⠀events.⠀The⠀examination⠀gives⠀the⠀undertaking⠀remembered⠀context⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀fresh⠀practical⠀act.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀recognizable⠀claim⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀sequence.⠀The⠀particular⠀may⠀support⠀it,⠀narrow⠀it,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀reflection⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀corrected⠀conclusion⠀or⠀a⠀plan.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀finish⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀still⠀uncertain⠀what⠀the⠀shared⠀account⠀means.⠀Keep⠀the⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀anchored⠀in⠀human⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀journey⠀into⠀a⠀lecture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaahaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀spatial⠀logic⠀of⠀travel,⠀pursuit,⠀repair,⠀or⠀recovery⠀legible:⠀what⠀is⠀visible,⠀what⠀is⠀heard,⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀what,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀depends⠀on.\n\nLet⠀an⠀established⠀object,⠀spoken⠀phrase,⠀or⠀sound⠀connect⠀present⠀work⠀with⠀remembered⠀context.⠀The⠀connection⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀supported⠀transition,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀that⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀named,⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀contribution⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀action.⠀Use⠀retrospective⠀material⠀when⠀the⠀permitted⠀sequence⠀benefits⠀from⠀its⠀lived⠀feeling⠀or⠀context,⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀emotional⠀beat⠀trigger⠀a⠀flashback.⠀If⠀a⠀retrospective⠀sequence⠀appears,⠀keep⠀its⠀viewpoint⠀and⠀time⠀clear,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀undertaking⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀particular⠀still⠀available.\n\nTreat⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀voice-over,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀information⠀another⠀character⠀hears.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀family⠀saying⠀while⠀crossing⠀a⠀river⠀without⠀speaking⠀it⠀aloud;⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀know⠀the⠀recollection⠀while⠀the⠀companion⠀observes⠀the⠀crossing⠀without⠀necessarily⠀knowing⠀that⠀private⠀memory,⠀retaining⠀whatever⠀other⠀knowledge⠀the⠀story⠀established.⠀Let⠀recurring⠀language⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀through⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanatory⠀narration⠀after⠀every⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaahax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀playable⠀movement:⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀reach,⠀carried⠀objects,⠀and⠀practical⠀dialogue.⠀Let⠀the⠀group's⠀work⠀remain⠀visible⠀in⠀how⠀people⠀pass⠀a⠀tool,⠀hold⠀a⠀rope,⠀clear⠀a⠀space,⠀or⠀wait⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀gone⠀ahead.⠀Use⠀pauses⠀and⠀blocking⠀to⠀show⠀hesitation,⠀care,⠀or⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀object⠀into⠀a⠀symbol.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀saying⠀bring⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀into⠀how⠀a⠀person⠀handles⠀present⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀phrase⠀their⠀parent⠀used⠀while⠀securing⠀a⠀load,⠀or⠀handle⠀a⠀repaired⠀container⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀former⠀companion⠀taught⠀them.⠀The⠀public⠀speech⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀association⠀remain⠀distinct:⠀another⠀character⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀phrase⠀without⠀knowing⠀its⠀source,⠀or⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀care⠀behind⠀the⠀handling.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀private⠀association⠀to⠀be⠀spoken⠀aloud⠀or⠀performed⠀as⠀an⠀aside.\n\nOffstage⠀activity⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀justified⠀reports⠀or⠀effects:⠀a⠀shout⠀from⠀outside,⠀a⠀returning⠀character's⠀account,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀an⠀engine⠀failing.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀No⠀compulsory⠀reenactment,⠀prop⠀inventory,⠀or⠀transformed⠀final⠀arrangement⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀form.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀underway⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀arrangement⠀only⠀partially⠀understood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaahay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nStructure⠀the⠀telling⠀through⠀an⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀movement⠀among⠀bodily⠀attention,⠀intrusive⠀phrase,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀returning⠀concern⠀during⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀those⠀associations:⠀a⠀rope's⠀friction⠀may⠀bring⠀back⠀a⠀voice,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀private⠀memory,⠀a⠀repeated⠀family⠀saying⠀may⠀surface⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀checks⠀a⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀orientable⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀sentence⠀turns⠀inward.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀whether⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀still⠀walking,⠀holding⠀a⠀line,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀searching.\n\nTreat⠀shared⠀language⠀as⠀remembered⠀sound⠀when⠀it⠀arrives⠀in⠀thought.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀currently⠀says⠀or⠀knows.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀parent⠀may⠀accompany⠀the⠀present⠀work⠀without⠀being⠀spoken;⠀a⠀rumor⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀public⠀voice⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀confirm.⠀Distinguish⠀present⠀action,⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀and⠀imagined⠀possibility.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀imagine⠀a⠀reunion,⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀exist,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀keep⠀that⠀imagining⠀from⠀being⠀mistaken⠀for⠀an⠀event.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀reasoning⠀appear⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀passage⠀into⠀a⠀numbered⠀tactical⠀explanation.⠀Thought⠀can⠀matter⠀without⠀producing⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀work⠀while⠀the⠀remembered⠀voice⠀remains⠀unresolved,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀close⠀by⠀resolving⠀the⠀association⠀or⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀attributed⠀messages⠀to⠀coordinate⠀the⠀actual⠀undertaking:⠀travel⠀times,⠀supplies,⠀routes,⠀arrivals,⠀repairs,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀questions⠀that⠀arise⠀between⠀people⠀working⠀toward⠀a⠀shared⠀objective.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀each⠀sender's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀while⠀working.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀resurfaced⠀message⠀carry⠀shared⠀history⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀coordination.⠀Mark⠀its⠀composition⠀and⠀circulation⠀separately⠀from⠀current⠀receipt,⠀understanding,⠀and⠀action.⠀A⠀message⠀sent⠀years⠀ago⠀may⠀be⠀forwarded⠀now;⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀by⠀a⠀parent⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀child's⠀text⠀without⠀explanation;⠀a⠀sender⠀may⠀quote⠀a⠀public⠀account⠀while⠀privately⠀remembering⠀a⠀different⠀version.⠀The⠀transcript⠀shows⠀what⠀was⠀transmitted,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀sender⠀thought⠀while⠀composing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀live⠀recollection⠀and⠀other⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀in⠀their⠀active⠀channel.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀No⠀clarification,⠀notification,⠀proof⠀of⠀comprehension,⠀or⠀changed⠀plan⠀is⠀owed⠀each⠀interval.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀request⠀still⠀pending,⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀underway,⠀or⠀a⠀sender⠀simply⠀returning⠀to⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀current⠀location⠀and⠀undertaking⠀through⠀concise⠀scene⠀cues,⠀then⠀give⠀attributed⠀speech⠀and⠀permitted⠀focal⠀narration⠀room⠀to⠀connect⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀with⠀remembered⠀occasions.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀moment:⠀a⠀doorway⠀remembered⠀from⠀childhood,⠀a⠀tool⠀held⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀way,⠀a⠀public⠀sign⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀something⠀else.⠀Let⠀the⠀cue⠀support⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀without⠀functioning⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀and⠀current⠀movement⠀readable.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀objective⠀advances⠀or⠀meets⠀resistance.⠀A⠀repeated⠀visual⠀or⠀verbal⠀cue⠀can⠀orient⠀a⠀return⠀without⠀signaling⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth⠀or⠀emotional⠀change.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀familiar⠀detail⠀and⠀continue⠀working;⠀another⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expressions⠀always⠀reveal⠀what⠀they⠀remember.\n\nPreserve⠀