ption,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀response.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀announce⠀that⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀will⠀later⠀become⠀significant.⠀Establish⠀the⠀action⠀as⠀itself⠀first:⠀the⠀character⠀packs⠀the⠀bag⠀because⠀the⠀bag⠀needs⠀packing,⠀the⠀companion⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀how⠀they⠀speak,⠀the⠀group⠀shares⠀a⠀meal⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀hungry.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀acquire⠀weight⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀course⠀of⠀events,⠀or⠀let⠀it⠀remain⠀simply⠀familiar.\n\nLocate⠀a⠀character's⠀changed⠀understanding⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀occurs;⠀any⠀narrator's⠀retrospective⠀framing⠀must⠀remain⠀distinct⠀and⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀authority.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think,⠀I⠀used⠀to⠀hate⠀that⠀phrase,⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀think⠀about⠀it⠀at⠀all.⠀Keep⠀other⠀people's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀reactions⠀independent.⠀One⠀character's⠀private⠀association⠀with⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀shares⠀it,⠀notices⠀it,⠀or⠀would⠀respond⠀to⠀it⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀spoken.⠀Direct⠀affection⠀and⠀simple⠀coordination⠀can⠀appear⠀without⠀concealed⠀opposites.⠀Do⠀not⠀presume⠀a⠀hidden⠀demand⠀in⠀a⠀genuine⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀or⠀a⠀concealed⠀wound⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀joke;⠀such⠀an⠀interpretation⠀needs⠀actual⠀support.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀material⠀effects.⠀Keep⠀supplies,⠀weather,⠀routes,⠀and⠀repairs⠀consistent⠀with⠀actual⠀conditions;⠀they⠀may⠀present⠀a⠀real⠀limitation⠀or⠀remain⠀reliable.⠀The⠀emotional⠀continuity⠀of⠀shared⠀life⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀physical⠀work.⠀Preserve⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reflect⠀at⠀length⠀while⠀walking,⠀or⠀may⠀think⠀only⠀in⠀brief⠀practical⠀fragments;⠀either⠀is⠀valid⠀if⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀character.\n\nTravel,⠀discovery,⠀and⠀recovery⠀need⠀neither⠀an⠀antagonist⠀nor⠀a⠀tragic⠀or⠀miraculous⠀emotional⠀climax.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀or⠀role⠀boundary⠀with⠀work⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀state,⠀including⠀ongoing⠀preparation,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀or⠀an⠀unchanged⠀task.⠀The⠀ordinary⠀habit⠀remains⠀available⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀without⠀being⠀resolved⠀into⠀a⠀symbol.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀any⠀established⠀history⠀to⠀select⠀a⠀current⠀request,⠀handoff,⠀preference⠀or⠀small⠀shared⠀act.⠀Where⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀exists,⠀make⠀its⠀recurrence⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀people⠀actually⠀do:⠀a⠀pack⠀check,⠀a⠀word⠀used⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀preference⠀remembered⠀and⠀honored.⠀New⠀acquaintances⠀can⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀contribution⠀without⠀an⠀invented⠀past⠀callback⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀habit⠀forming⠀immediately.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀keep⠀the⠀act⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀bond.\n\nShow⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀does⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀may⠀privately⠀associate⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀under⠀the⠀permitted⠀access.⠀The⠀meanings⠀can⠀agree,⠀differ,⠀remain⠀plain,⠀or⠀stay⠀unspoken⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀misunderstanding.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀routine⠀comforting⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀finds⠀it⠀merely⠀practical;⠀one⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀recurrence⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀does⠀not.⠀A⠀boundary⠀and⠀accurate⠀help⠀can⠀both⠀work:⠀care⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀entitlement,⠀telepathy,⠀or⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀demand⠀a⠀particular⠀response.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀action-adventure⠀plan⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀material.⠀Let⠀the⠀repeated⠀act⠀occur⠀within⠀the⠀actual⠀undertaking,⠀whether⠀it⠀supports⠀coordination,⠀offers⠀comfort,⠀or⠀simply⠀accompanies⠀ongoing⠀work;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀gain.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on,⠀what⠀each⠀attempt⠀changes,⠀and⠀how⠀cooperation⠀or⠀improvisation⠀affects⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity.⠀The⠀relationship⠀history⠀informs⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀work⠀together;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀work⠀itself.\n\nPreserve⠀genuine⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀routine⠀means,⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀think⠀about⠀it⠀at⠀all.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀sacrifice,⠀repaired⠀relationship,⠀or⠀synchronized⠀recognition.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀the⠀bond⠀unchanged⠀or⠀slightly⠀shifted,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity⠀still⠀ahead.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀undertaking⠀as⠀an⠀oral⠀chronicle:⠀a⠀retelling⠀with⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurring⠀wording⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀account.⠀Use⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀public⠀shape⠀to⠀remember⠀ordinary⠀contributions⠀alongside⠀the⠀larger⠀deeds.⠀A⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀watched⠀pack,⠀a⠀practical⠀kindness,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀enter⠀the⠀account⠀because⠀it⠀occurred,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀secretly⠀guaranteed⠀a⠀later⠀triumph.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀remembers⠀what⠀people⠀did;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀promote⠀every⠀act⠀into⠀legend.\n\nKeep⠀earlier⠀participant⠀knowledge⠀and⠀private⠀motives⠀separate⠀from⠀later⠀remembrance.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀knew⠀while⠀doing⠀the⠀act⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀chronicle⠀later⠀says⠀the⠀act⠀meant.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀a⠀companion's⠀care⠀sustained⠀the⠀party,⠀but⠀the⠀companion⠀may⠀have⠀acted⠀from⠀simple⠀habit,⠀irritation,⠀or⠀practical⠀necessity.⠀Do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive⠀to⠀fit⠀the⠀later⠀meaning.⠀Render⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀for⠀the⠀mind⠀and⠀time⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes,⠀distinguishing⠀remembered⠀experience,⠀the⠀teller's⠀current⠀reflection,⠀and⠀the⠀public⠀account.\n\nLet⠀names⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀sustain⠀continuity⠀without⠀heroic⠀promotion⠀or⠀forced⠀reinterpretation.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀for⠀continuity⠀or⠀for⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀when⠀events⠀support⠀it;⠀recurrence⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀its⠀meaning⠀each⠀time.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀dialogue:⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀tradition⠀and⠀modest⠀scale.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀across⠀replies⠀without⠀a⠀predetermined⠀farewell⠀or⠀sacrifice.⠀End⠀the⠀interval⠀when⠀the⠀chronicle⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀deed⠀concluded,⠀a⠀journey⠀resumed,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀retelling.⠀The⠀ordinary⠀contribution⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀without⠀being⠀declared⠀the⠀hidden⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀to⠀write⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀arrangements⠀that⠀keep⠀it⠀possible:⠀who⠀packs⠀the⠀food,⠀checks⠀the⠀route,⠀minds⠀the⠀vehicle,⠀watches⠀the⠀child,⠀covers⠀the⠀shift,⠀or⠀keeps⠀a⠀bed⠀ready.⠀Make⠀relevant⠀dependencies⠀available⠀through⠀ordinary⠀work⠀when⠀they⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀maintenance⠀problem,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀handoff⠀each⠀time.⠀A⠀helper's⠀remembered⠀preference⠀or⠀repeated⠀contribution⠀can⠀carry⠀attachment⠀without⠀making⠀that⠀person⠀endlessly⠀available⠀or⠀turning⠀care⠀into⠀proof⠀of⠀devotion.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀active⠀around⠀the⠀journey.⠀People⠀have⠀jobs,⠀households,⠀appointments,⠀and⠀loyalties⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀because⠀the⠀protagonist⠀is⠀traveling.⠀Cooperation⠀may⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀warm,⠀neutral,⠀reluctant,⠀or⠀impossible;⠀refusal⠀can⠀be⠀reasonable.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀is⠀elsewhere,⠀preserve⠀their⠀access⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀observe,⠀hear,⠀or⠀receive⠀in⠀messages⠀rather⠀than⠀granting⠀knowledge⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀private⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀or⠀object⠀return⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀later⠀use.⠀It⠀may⠀acquire⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀a⠀difficult⠀event,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀simply⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀daily⠀life.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀absence⠀ominous,⠀every⠀helper⠀secretly⠀burdened,⠀or⠀every⠀reunion⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Render⠀actual⠀authorized⠀feeling,⠀attention,⠀and⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀even⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀decision⠀or⠀productivity⠀gain.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀work⠀still⠀pending,⠀a⠀practical⠀result⠀achieved,⠀or⠀someone⠀returning⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀obligation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀to⠀keep⠀each⠀stage⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking⠀legible.⠀When⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀give⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀that⠀orients⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Establish⠀a⠀small⠀shared⠀act⠀or⠀object⠀through⠀visible⠀use:⠀someone⠀checks⠀a⠀strap,⠀passes⠀a⠀water⠀bottle,⠀repeats⠀a⠀route⠀instruction,⠀or⠀leaves⠀a⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀place.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀act⠀or⠀object⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀scene's⠀activity,⠀perception⠀or⠀authorized⠀association⠀makes⠀it⠀relevant;⠀a⠀new⠀use⠀or⠀visible⠀consequence⠀is⠀not⠀required.\n\nDo⠀not⠀create⠀offscreen⠀history⠀or⠀a⠀cutaway⠀solely⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀callback⠀poignant.⠀A⠀recurring⠀object⠀may⠀remain⠀ordinary,⠀be⠀used⠀differently,⠀or⠀be⠀noticed⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀its⠀earlier⠀meaning.⠀An⠀expression,⠀musical⠀cue,⠀or⠀slow⠀shot⠀cannot⠀certify⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀or⠀intends.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀presentation⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material,⠀never⠀replaced⠀by⠀voice-over⠀or⠀made⠀audible⠀to⠀other⠀characters.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀stay⠀individual⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀joke,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀say⠀nothing⠀while⠀the⠀work⠀continues.⠀Preparation,⠀discovery,⠀and⠀recovery⠀can⠀advance⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀farewell⠀image,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀completed⠀result.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀action⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀undertaking⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀staged:⠀who⠀enters⠀with⠀a⠀pack,⠀where⠀a⠀key⠀is⠀kept,⠀which⠀chair⠀someone⠀takes,⠀how⠀a⠀rope⠀is⠀handed⠀over,⠀what⠀remains⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀after⠀an⠀exit.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀handoff,⠀ordinary⠀line,⠀or⠀familiar⠀arrangement⠀recur⠀where⠀the⠀established⠀history⠀supports⠀it.⠀Different⠀characters⠀may⠀notice⠀or⠀ignore⠀its⠀significance;⠀the⠀recurrence⠀itself⠀does⠀not⠀announce⠀a⠀private⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀blocking⠀causally⠀clear.⠀A⠀character⠀reaches⠀the⠀door⠀because⠀they⠀crossed⠀the⠀room,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀dramatic⠀pause.⠀Do⠀not⠀choreograph⠀tears,⠀meaningful⠀glances,⠀or⠀concealment⠀as⠀substitutes⠀for⠀action.⠀Offstage⠀contributions⠀can⠀enter⠀through⠀credible⠀reports⠀or⠀other⠀observable⠀effects,⠀including⠀sounds⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀delivered⠀package,⠀a⠀repaired⠀item,⠀a⠀message⠀brought⠀in⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀there.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀separately⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀permissions.⠀An⠀authorized⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀that⠀interiority.⠀A⠀task⠀or⠀request⠀can⠀remain⠀pending,⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀success⠀need⠀not⠀culminate⠀in⠀confession,⠀reunion,⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀speech.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀someone⠀leaving⠀for⠀another⠀obligation⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀order⠀of⠀its⠀associations.⠀A⠀present⠀sensation⠀or⠀heard⠀phrase⠀may⠀lead⠀into⠀a⠀remembered⠀ordinary⠀occasion,⠀a⠀private⠀feeling,⠀an⠀imagined⠀alternative,⠀or⠀an⠀unrelated⠀pleasure⠀before⠀attention⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀work⠀at⠀hand.⠀Let⠀recurrence⠀sustain⠀the⠀same⠀concern⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀significance⠀each⠀time.\n\nDistinguish⠀recalled⠀speech⠀from⠀current⠀speech,⠀imagined⠀events⠀from⠀acts,⠀and⠀later⠀interpretation⠀from⠀earlier⠀motives.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀journey,⠀use⠀concrete⠀returns—the⠀road,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀pack,⠀the⠀next⠀instruction,⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀waiting—so⠀the⠀external⠀undertaking⠀remains⠀recoverable.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀miss⠀a⠀cue,⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀act⠀before⠀finishing⠀a⠀thought.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀and⠀respect⠀other⠀minds'⠀privacy.⠀Prose⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀spend⠀fictional⠀time;⠀a⠀long⠀association⠀can⠀occur⠀in⠀a⠀brief⠀pause.⠀No⠀revelation,⠀tactical⠀insight,⠀hidden⠀memory,⠀or⠀compulsory⠀grief⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀returning⠀to⠀work.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀mid-thought,⠀mid-task,⠀or⠀simply⠀noticing⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀familiar⠀greeting,⠀check-in,⠀or⠀recurring⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀practical,⠀affectionate,⠀neutral,⠀or⠀differently⠀meaningful⠀to⠀each⠀recipient.⠀Preserve⠀original⠀sent⠀wording.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀has⠀access,⠀show⠀any⠀actual⠀response;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀reading⠀or⠀subsequent⠀action⠀remain⠀unknown⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀an⠀acknowledgment⠀or⠀activity⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nDistinguish⠀receipt⠀from⠀reading,⠀reading⠀from⠀comprehension,⠀and⠀intention⠀from⠀performed⠀work.⠀A⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀understood;⠀a⠀request⠀that⠀is⠀read⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀completed.⠀A⠀composed⠀draft,⠀including⠀supported⠀dictation,⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀imagined⠀wording⠀and⠀from⠀transmission⠀that⠀actually⠀occurs.⠀Show⠀the⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀of⠀each⠀person⠀through⠀their⠀word⠀choice,⠀timing,⠀use⠀of⠀edits⠀or⠀attachments,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀transmit.⠀Keep⠀genuine⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀channel;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀sent⠀with⠀the⠀message⠀and⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀receive⠀it.\n\nDelays⠀and⠀brief⠀answers⠀do⠀not⠀prove⠀neglect⠀or⠀concealment.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀may⠀acquire⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀remain⠀casual,⠀or⠀simply⠀continue⠀as⠀ordinary⠀coordination.⠀Confirmation⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request⠀can⠀close⠀the⠀interval⠀without⠀missed⠀final⠀messages,⠀interception,⠀or⠀emotional⠀payoff.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀work⠀still⠀underway⠀or⠀with⠀one⠀person⠀returning⠀to⠀an⠀offline⠀obligation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaamba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation.⠀Use⠀background⠀detail⠀that⠀orients⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀or⠀its⠀lived⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀practical⠀payoff:⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀workbench,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀vehicle,⠀the⠀contents⠀of⠀a⠀shelf,⠀the⠀light⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀room.⠀Establish⠀a⠀routine⠀or⠀object⠀without⠀marking⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀future⠀emotional⠀device.\n\nA⠀later⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀routine⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀change⠀its⠀significance⠀or⠀merely⠀preserve⠀familiarity.⠀Keep⠀observed⠀expressions⠀distinct⠀from⠀inferred⠀motives.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀look⠀away,⠀smile,⠀or⠀go⠀still⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know;⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀treat⠀an⠀expression⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Allow⠀actual⠀private⠀feeling,⠀memory,⠀and⠀reasoning⠀their⠀full⠀extent⠀in⠀either⠀active⠀display⠀mode,⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀authorized⠀character⠀and⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀by⠀others.\n\nPreserve⠀practical⠀conditions⠀and⠀ordinary⠀voices.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀direct,⠀joking,⠀hesitant,⠀or⠀practical⠀without⠀becoming⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀or⠀sentimental.⠀No⠀menu,⠀images,⠀romance⠀route,⠀grief⠀reveal,⠀synchronized⠀realization,⠀or⠀changed⠀result⠀is⠀implied.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀discovery⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀leaving⠀for⠀an⠀ordinary⠀reason.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaambb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nReenter⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀undertaking⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀shared⠀detail⠀needed⠀for⠀continuity.⠀Briefly⠀recover⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀installment⠀requires:⠀the⠀route⠀already⠀chosen,⠀the⠀item⠀repaired⠀or⠀spent,⠀the⠀message⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀promised⠀to⠀meet⠀at⠀the⠀next⠀stop.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀earlier⠀work⠀established⠀and⠀what⠀participants⠀actually⠀knew⠀at⠀that⠀time.\n\nA⠀callback⠀may⠀acquire⠀weight⠀after⠀a⠀new⠀event,⠀remain⠀casual,⠀or⠀not⠀recur⠀yet.⠀Do⠀not⠀reinterpret⠀every⠀kindness⠀as⠀a⠀secret⠀long-term⠀design⠀or⠀every⠀ordinary⠀object⠀as⠀foreshadowing.⠀When⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀habit⠀returns,⠀let⠀it⠀keep⠀its⠀original⠀practical⠀purpose⠀alongside⠀any⠀earned⠀later⠀significance.⠀Keep⠀private⠀feelings⠀owned⠀and⠀free⠀to⠀persist⠀or⠀settle⠀without⠀new⠀progress;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀worried,⠀relieved,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀simply⠀tired.\n\nRest,⠀travel,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀acknowledgment⠀can⠀carry⠀installments⠀without⠀tragedy,⠀miraculous⠀repair,⠀confessions,⠀new⠀threats,⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀turn⠀each⠀reply.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀change⠀in⠀circumstances.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nKeep⠀the⠀present⠀objective⠀and⠀its⠀working⠀method⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀someone⠀else's⠀help,⠀a⠀withheld⠀skill,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀an⠀unwanted⠀admission,⠀show⠀exactly⠀what⠀is⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀the⠀difficulty⠀dissolve⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀bad⠀feeling.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀state⠀or⠀demonstrate⠀the⠀practical⠀condition—the⠀locked⠀route,⠀the⠀missing⠀code,⠀the⠀load⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀carried⠀alone—while⠀their⠀private⠀distress⠀runs⠀separately⠀along⠀another⠀track.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀strain⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀request,⠀answer,⠀or⠀acceptance⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀before,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀performed⠀act.⠀The⠀cost⠀may⠀be⠀shame,⠀resentment,⠀fear⠀that⠀the⠀request⠀will⠀change⠀the⠀relationship,⠀or⠀the⠀labor⠀of⠀continuing⠀beside⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀limitation.⠀The⠀recipient⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀interpret⠀the⠀feeling⠀accurately,⠀and⠀help⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀useful⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀awkward⠀or⠀incomplete.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀interaction,⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀material⠀and⠀personal⠀state,⠀whether⠀changed,⠀continuing,⠀settled,⠀or⠀unsettled.⠀The⠀plan⠀may⠀advance⠀without⠀repairing⠀anything,⠀help⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀plainly,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀success⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀asked⠀feeling⠀exposed.⠀None⠀of⠀those⠀responses⠀is⠀compulsory.⠀Keep⠀the⠀objective⠀legible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀material⠀result,⠀relationship⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀apology,⠀or⠀failed⠀task,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀inward⠀state⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀tactic⠀or⠀an⠀announced⠀emotion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀interval⠀by⠀establishing⠀the⠀active⠀move,⠀what⠀it⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀accomplish,⠀and⠀the⠀positions⠀or⠀resources⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀action⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀person,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀unchanged.⠀If⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀to⠀understand⠀why⠀a⠀tool,⠀rule,⠀or⠀route⠀works,⠀explain⠀the⠀relevant⠀condition⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀someone⠀engages⠀it:⠀the⠀current,⠀load,⠀permissions,⠀timing,⠀or⠀available⠀assistance.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀and⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀when⠀people⠀coordinate,⠀object,⠀report,⠀or⠀adjust.⠀Participants⠀remain⠀independent.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀theory⠀while⠀another⠀works⠀from⠀trial,⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀competing⠀purpose;⠀show⠀what⠀each⠀actually⠀does⠀and⠀what⠀effect⠀it⠀leaves⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀everyone⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀same⠀interaction⠀or⠀to⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀lecture⠀before⠀acting.\n\nLet⠀other⠀participants'⠀attempts⠀continue⠀beside⠀the⠀supplied⠀move.⠀A⠀pending⠀result,⠀a⠀partially⠀completed⠀task,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀can⠀sustain⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀without⠀a⠀reversal.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀condition⠀legible,⠀whether⠀a⠀next⠀action⠀is⠀available,⠀unknown,⠀or⠀still⠀being⠀considered,⠀leaving⠀the⠀choice⠀about⠀how⠀to⠀answer⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀role⠀and⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀in⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route.⠀Present⠀the⠀journey,⠀pursuit,⠀rescue,⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀recovery⠀through⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀in⠀sequence,⠀with⠀the⠀relevant⠀technique⠀named⠀or⠀plainly⠀shown⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀operative.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actor's⠀actual⠀degree⠀of⠀training⠀and⠀familiarity.⠀The⠀method⠀may⠀be⠀practiced,⠀newly⠀instructed,⠀or⠀still⠀being⠀learned⠀while⠀moving⠀weight,⠀crossing⠀broken⠀ground,⠀controlling⠀a⠀rope,⠀timing⠀a⠀lift,⠀or⠀restraining⠀someone.⠀Its⠀familiarity⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀success.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀maneuver⠀meets⠀the⠀present⠀situation,⠀show⠀the⠀interaction⠀that⠀determines⠀the⠀attempt:⠀footing⠀gives⠀way⠀or⠀holds,⠀a⠀companion⠀arrives⠀early⠀or⠀late,⠀a⠀load⠀shifts,⠀the⠀route⠀narrows,⠀or⠀an⠀opponent's⠀timing⠀breaks⠀the⠀expected⠀rhythm.⠀Let⠀the⠀event⠀make⠀the⠀operative⠀condition⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀plain⠀instruction,⠀an⠀observed⠀adjustment,⠀or⠀the⠀immediate⠀result.⠀A⠀capable⠀actor⠀may⠀still⠀fail⠀or⠀improvise,⠀and⠀success⠀may⠀require⠀accepting⠀a⠀previously⠀declined⠀kind⠀of⠀help.\n\nDo⠀not⠀construct⠀a⠀new⠀school,⠀ranked⠀contest,⠀secret⠀manual,⠀or⠀learning⠀milestone⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀establish.⠀Ability⠀should⠀remain⠀useful⠀without⠀becoming⠀automatic.⠀Carry⠀actual⠀changes⠀forward⠀while⠀allowing⠀an⠀attempt⠀or⠀its⠀result⠀to⠀remain⠀pending.⠀Travelers,⠀companions,⠀and⠀any⠀opposing⠀actors⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀independent⠀purposes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀specific⠀material⠀state⠀that⠀matters⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀performed⠀act:⠀the⠀strap⠀wearing,⠀the⠀handle⠀slick⠀or⠀scored,⠀the⠀cache⠀short⠀by⠀one⠀item,⠀the⠀footing⠀crumbling,⠀or⠀the⠀muscle⠀already⠀past⠀its⠀usual⠀limit.⠀Put⠀that⠀state⠀in⠀direct⠀concrete⠀terms⠀and⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀follows⠀without⠀translating⠀the⠀sequence⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀plan.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀hard⠀transitions⠀between⠀contact⠀and⠀consequence.⠀When⠀the⠀interaction⠀needs⠀explanation,⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀factual⠀clauses:⠀what⠀is⠀bearing⠀weight,⠀what⠀holds,⠀what⠀shifts,⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀still⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀the⠀language⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀scene⠀feel⠀harsh.⠀Let⠀fatigue,⠀damage,⠀and⠀equipment⠀failure⠀remain⠀real⠀possibilities⠀alongside⠀work⠀that⠀continues.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀warranted⠀extent⠀when⠀effort⠀is⠀accompanied⠀by⠀fear,⠀anger,⠀rough⠀care,⠀or⠀other⠀feeling.⠀Its⠀movement⠀can⠀be⠀sustained⠀or⠀interrupted⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀person,⠀not⠀forced⠀into⠀unbroken⠀space.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀be⠀tight⠀without⠀reducing⠀the⠀person⠀to⠀a⠀body⠀performing⠀tasks.⠀Vary⠀rhythm⠀between⠀rapid⠀physical⠀exchanges⠀and⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀feeling⠀requires⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀wisecrack,⠀a⠀wound,⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀stop⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀worn⠀equipment⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀installment⠀through⠀documents⠀that⠀are⠀specific⠀records:⠀a⠀supply⠀list,⠀a⠀message⠀of⠀instruction,⠀a⠀log,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀the⠀route⠀or⠀the⠀machine.⠀Establish⠀who⠀wrote⠀each⠀document,⠀for⠀what⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀written,⠀and⠀let⠀those⠀situations⠀limit⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀knows⠀or⠀chooses⠀to⠀say.⠀Keep⠀the⠀writer's⠀actual⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀composed⠀document,⠀rendering⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀separately⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀presentation.\n\nMake⠀the⠀undertaking⠀readable⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀communicated⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀present⠀or⠀used.⠀One⠀document⠀may⠀state⠀a⠀procedure⠀that⠀another⠀record⠀shows⠀being⠀applied⠀under⠀different⠀conditions.⠀A⠀delay,⠀shortage,⠀or⠀changed⠀route⠀can⠀be⠀visible⠀because⠀a⠀later⠀note⠀requests⠀a⠀substitute⠀or⠀reports⠀an⠀improvised⠀solution.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀instruction⠀fail.⠀A⠀correction⠀can⠀occur⠀immediately⠀when⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀permits⠀it,⠀or⠀later;⠀distinguish⠀its⠀real⠀timing⠀rather⠀than⠀rewriting⠀the⠀original⠀wording.\n\nPreserve⠀untested⠀methods,⠀unanswered⠀requests,⠀and⠀pending⠀work⠀as⠀legitimate⠀continuing⠀conditions.⠀Use⠀gaps⠀and⠀sparing⠀material⠀comments⠀across⠀entries⠀as⠀evidence,⠀not⠀to⠀hide⠀the⠀basic⠀causal⠀sequence.⠀Keep⠀chronology⠀and⠀knowledge⠀consistent⠀when⠀a⠀record⠀or⠀event⠀affects⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀An⠀opportunity⠀or⠀new⠀record⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀parallel⠀task⠀or⠀an⠀independently⠀established⠀event⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀latest⠀document;⠀the⠀reader's⠀wider⠀view⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀shared⠀character⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀care⠀enter⠀through⠀concrete⠀accommodations⠀that⠀have⠀a⠀material⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀task:⠀bandaging⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀leg,⠀making⠀a⠀load⠀easier⠀to⠀carry,⠀checking⠀a⠀route⠀or⠀resource⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀is⠀tired,⠀saving⠀food⠀for⠀a⠀delayed⠀companion,⠀or⠀arranging⠀a⠀dry⠀place⠀to⠀rest.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀small⠀act⠀offers⠀and⠀any⠀improvement⠀it⠀actually⠀makes,⠀giving⠀the⠀receiver⠀room⠀to⠀notice,⠀accept,⠀ignore,⠀or⠀adjust⠀it.⠀A⠀considerate⠀attempt⠀need⠀not⠀improve⠀the⠀task⠀to⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀person's⠀experience.⠀Help⠀can⠀be⠀useful⠀without⠀being⠀perfectly⠀interpreted.\n\nAllow⠀ease⠀beside⠀use.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀enjoy⠀the⠀meal,⠀the⠀pause,⠀or⠀another's⠀company⠀with⠀no⠀need⠀to⠀convert⠀rest⠀into⠀progress.⠀Let⠀humor,⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀and⠀private⠀comfort⠀remain⠀individual;⠀one⠀person's⠀reassurance⠀may⠀be⠀another's⠀noise.⠀Disagreement⠀and⠀privacy⠀can⠀persist⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀cared⠀for.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀pleasant⠀interval,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀objective⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀returns,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀cooperation⠀smoothness⠀a⠀test.⠀The⠀task⠀may⠀remain⠀partly⠀solved,⠀the⠀comfort⠀partial,⠀and⠀someone's⠀independent⠀choice⠀about⠀accepting⠀help⠀unresolved.⠀No⠀character⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀confess⠀gratitude,⠀repair⠀a⠀relationship,⠀demonstrate⠀improved⠀usefulness,⠀or⠀solve⠀the⠀whole⠀plan⠀in⠀exchange⠀for⠀care.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀enter⠀the⠀concrete⠀task⠀first:⠀the⠀stated⠀objective,⠀the⠀present⠀material⠀condition,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀or⠀group⠀attempting⠀it.⠀Establish⠀the⠀logical⠀relation⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀possible,⠀whether⠀it⠀concerns⠀permission,⠀supply,⠀timing,⠀expertise,⠀or⠀cooperation.⠀Keep⠀any⠀explanation⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀can⠀know.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀scene⠀permits⠀narrative⠀distance,⠀widen⠀deliberately⠀to⠀the⠀relevant⠀social⠀or⠀institutional⠀frame:⠀the⠀agreement⠀that⠀authorized⠀the⠀journey,⠀the⠀history⠀that⠀made⠀a⠀route⠀available,⠀the⠀competing⠀obligations⠀that⠀delayed⠀assistance,⠀or⠀the⠀customary⠀claim⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀resource.⠀Use⠀that⠀framing⠀to⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀interaction⠀takes⠀the⠀shape⠀it⠀does,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀advance⠀the⠀clock⠀through⠀general⠀reflection.⠀A⠀collected⠀voice⠀may⠀judge,⠀recall,⠀or⠀compare;⠀the⠀task⠀still⠀needs⠀its⠀particular⠀problem.\n\nReturn⠀from⠀context⠀through⠀a⠀material⠀or⠀practical⠀hinge:⠀the⠀missing⠀item,⠀the⠀guard's⠀answer,⠀the⠀cart⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀pass,⠀the⠀request⠀that⠀remains⠀pending.⠀Use⠀that⠀particular⠀to⠀orient⠀what⠀remains⠀underway,⠀whether⠀an⠀attempt⠀proceeds,⠀a⠀request⠀stays⠀pending,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀continues⠀considering.⠀The⠀wider⠀arrangement⠀may⠀limit⠀who⠀may⠀act⠀or⠀what⠀means⠀are⠀acceptable⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀method⠀opaque⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀formal⠀test.⠀Preserve⠀private⠀thought⠀under⠀the⠀established⠀narrator⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀cast's⠀spoken⠀language⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀formal⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀teller,⠀a⠀listener⠀or⠀listeners,⠀and⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀offered⠀now:⠀someone⠀needs⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀method,⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀current⠀undertaking.⠀The⠀teller's⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀listeners⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀selected,⠀emphasized,⠀or⠀left⠀out⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀confession.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀teller⠀recounts⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt,⠀make⠀its⠀practical⠀sequence⠀recoverable.⠀Name⠀the⠀objective,⠀the⠀resources⠀and⠀conditions⠀the⠀actors⠀had,⠀the⠀interaction⠀they⠀exploited⠀or⠀misread,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changed.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀where⠀a⠀listener⠀would⠀need⠀it⠀to⠀understand⠀a⠀later⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀present⠀decision.⠀Keep⠀the⠀explanation⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀attempt⠀rather⠀than⠀delivered⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀lesson.\n\nLet⠀the⠀listeners⠀respond⠀as⠀active⠀participants⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀They⠀may⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀missing⠀condition,⠀compare⠀a⠀detail⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀resources,⠀disagree⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀method⠀transfers,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀matter.⠀A⠀listener's⠀question⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀concrete⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀past⠀account;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀compel⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀reveal⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀force⠀the⠀group⠀to⠀adopt⠀a⠀plan.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀aloud.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀withholds,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since,⠀while⠀listeners⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀account⠀alongside⠀their⠀actual⠀observations,⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀inferences;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀acquire⠀private⠀experience⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀narrated.⠀A⠀vivid⠀recollection⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀same⠀interaction⠀will⠀work⠀under⠀present⠀conditions.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀condition⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀past⠀attempt⠀and⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀undertaking,⠀letting⠀the⠀reader⠀compare⠀the⠀two⠀without⠀the⠀teller⠀announcing⠀the⠀lesson.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀objective⠀and⠀actual⠀listening⠀situation.⠀A⠀practical⠀implication⠀may⠀become⠀available,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀also⠀remain⠀enjoyable,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀without⠀supplying⠀a⠀new⠀use⠀or⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀as⠀developmental⠀realism:⠀follow⠀a⠀participant's⠀changing⠀relation⠀to⠀a⠀supplied⠀tool,⠀rule,⠀organization,⠀or⠀method⠀through⠀actual⠀attempts⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀completed⠀test.⠀Anchor⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀learns⠀in⠀the⠀work⠀they⠀already⠀do,⠀the⠀authority⠀they⠀actually⠀hold,⠀and⠀the⠀experience⠀they⠀can⠀draw⠀on.⠀A⠀formal⠀instruction⠀or⠀a⠀colleague's⠀explanation⠀becomes⠀usable⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀meets⠀a⠀concrete⠀operating⠀condition.\n\nLet⠀different⠀participants⠀hold⠀different⠀portions⠀of⠀the⠀relevant⠀knowledge.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀official⠀procedure,⠀another⠀the⠀local⠀practice,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀the⠀material⠀limits⠀of⠀the⠀equipment.⠀Their⠀contributions⠀can⠀support,⠀qualify,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀plan⠀uncertain⠀without⠀turning⠀disagreement⠀into⠀ignorance⠀or⠀corruption.⠀Show⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀contribute⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀attempt.\n\nCarry⠀lessons⠀and⠀spent⠀resources⠀forward⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀failed⠀attempt⠀may⠀teach⠀one⠀participant⠀something⠀useful⠀while⠀costing⠀another⠀person⠀time,⠀trust,⠀or⠀equipment⠀that⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀A⠀success⠀may⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀obligation⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀limit⠀that⠀only⠀matters⠀later.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀instant⠀mastery⠀after⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀forced⠀humbling⠀after⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀in⠀every⠀interval.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀developmental⠀frame⠀hold⠀the⠀longer⠀movement:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀believed⠀before,⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀attempt⠀differently.⠀Let⠀the⠀available⠀opportunity⠀follow⠀from⠀actual⠀conditions,⠀which⠀may⠀be⠀changed⠀or⠀continuing,⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀moral⠀announcement.⠀Learning⠀and⠀work⠀can⠀remain⠀incomplete⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀new⠀ability⠀or⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀present⠀without⠀letting⠀it⠀replace⠀the⠀practical⠀sequence.⠀Work⠀roles,⠀institutional⠀expectations,⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀legitimate⠀commitments⠀can⠀shape⠀what⠀a⠀participant⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀try⠀or⠀what⠀failure⠀costs.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reflect⠀on⠀these⠀conditions,⠀but⠀the⠀undertaking⠀remains⠀the⠀organizing⠀through-line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWhere⠀inherited⠀authority,⠀old⠀permissions,⠀or⠀established⠀privilege⠀actually⠀bears⠀on⠀passage,⠀protection,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀needed⠀by⠀the⠀undertaking,⠀show⠀that⠀existing⠀relation⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀use⠀the⠀power.⠀Explain⠀the⠀particular⠀interaction⠀between⠀the⠀permission⠀and⠀a⠀material⠀mechanism⠀through⠀attempted⠀use.⠀A⠀sealed⠀route⠀may⠀open⠀only⠀when⠀an⠀old⠀credential⠀meets⠀a⠀modern⠀lock;⠀a⠀protected⠀space⠀may⠀admit⠀someone⠀whose⠀name⠀still⠀carries⠀weight;⠀a⠀resource⠀may⠀be⠀released⠀by⠀a⠀procedure⠀that⠀preserves⠀an⠀older⠀hierarchy.\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀operative⠀facts⠀before⠀they⠀decide⠀an⠀attempt.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀permission⠀actually⠀does,⠀what⠀the⠀mechanism⠀requires,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀trying⠀to⠀use⠀them⠀must⠀supply.⠀Let⠀different⠀characters⠀understand⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀and⠀protect⠀different⠀interests.⠀A⠀sincere⠀helper⠀can⠀act⠀within⠀an⠀unequal⠀arrangement⠀without⠀being⠀secretly⠀controlled⠀by⠀it.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀without⠀turning⠀mood⠀into⠀evidence⠀or⠀proof.⠀A⠀decaying⠀hall,⠀an⠀intimate⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀damaged⠀device⠀matters⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀function⠀and⠀history.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀felt⠀weight⠀of⠀old⠀authority,⠀but⠀the⠀practical⠀sequence⠀must⠀remain⠀intelligible:⠀what⠀was⠀attempted,⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changed,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available.\n\nKeep⠀intimate⠀attraction,⠀resentment,⠀desire,⠀or⠀fear⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀something⠀from⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀holds⠀an⠀old⠀privilege,⠀or⠀resent⠀needing⠀their⠀help,⠀without⠀that⠀feeling⠀revealing⠀a⠀hidden⠀mechanism⠀or⠀guaranteeing⠀betrayal.⠀Private⠀experience⠀can⠀shape⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀attempts⠀or⠀accepts⠀and⠀thereby⠀help⠀explain⠀their⠀conduct.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀grant⠀access⠀or⠀change⠀a⠀mechanism;⠀any⠀physical⠀result⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀attempt⠀and⠀conditions.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀named⠀vampire⠀mechanics,⠀a⠀secret⠀power,⠀or⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀institution⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap.⠀The⠀style⠀gives⠀inherited⠀power⠀and⠀present⠀dependence⠀material⠀and⠀intimate⠀texture⠀without⠀prescribing⠀personal⠀horror,⠀decay,⠀or⠀new⠀supernatural⠀rules.⠀When⠀the⠀undertaking⠀succeeds⠀or⠀fails,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀which⠀established⠀interaction⠀produced⠀the⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀a⠀participant's⠀testimonial⠀account.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀an⠀established⠀role⠀in⠀the⠀events⠀and⠀a⠀supported⠀reason⠀to⠀report⠀them:⠀an⠀inquiry,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀warning,⠀a⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀needs⠀the⠀information.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀access⠀from⠀the⠀participant⠀account,⠀whether⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀fills⠀both⠀roles⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀presents⠀another's⠀testimony.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀frame⠀the⠀testimony,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀itself⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀participant's⠀position,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀limits.\n\nDescribe⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀actually⠀did,⠀used,⠀expected,⠀and⠀witnessed⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀retrospective⠀claim⠀of⠀total⠀understanding.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀explains⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀tie⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀they⠀encountered⠀it:⠀what⠀they⠀thought⠀it⠀would⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀tried,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀saw⠀happen.⠀A⠀resource⠀or⠀rule⠀enters⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀contact⠀with⠀it,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀abstract⠀summary.\n\nSeparate⠀sourced⠀reports⠀and⠀later⠀explanations⠀from⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀reported,⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀afterward,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀believe,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀distinguish⠀these⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Testimony⠀can⠀be⠀accurate,⠀partial,⠀or⠀contested⠀without⠀becoming⠀unreliable⠀as⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀course.\n\nKeep⠀actual⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀account,⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀where⠀authorized.⠀The⠀teller's⠀present⠀feelings⠀about⠀the⠀events,⠀their⠀reasons⠀for⠀omitting⠀something,⠀or⠀their⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀intended⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀interiority.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀aloud⠀or⠀records⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀account,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀of⠀that⠀private⠀experience.\n\nWhere⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀frames⠀the⠀testimony,⠀return⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀state⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀implication.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀detail,⠀question⠀a⠀gap,⠀compare⠀conditions,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀response⠀pending.⠀The⠀undertaking⠀continues⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀testimony⠀actually⠀establishes,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀automatic⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀early-modern⠀comic⠀and⠀theatrical⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀portable⠀construction⠀for⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Place⠀a⠀real⠀request,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀plan⠀beside⠀a⠀timed⠀entrance,⠀an⠀object's⠀use,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀that⠀reveals⠀how⠀the⠀arrangement⠀actually⠀works.⠀The⠀juxtaposition⠀does⠀the⠀work:⠀a⠀formal⠀instruction⠀may⠀arrive⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀already⠀doing⠀the⠀task⠀differently;⠀a⠀tool⠀may⠀be⠀explained⠀just⠀as⠀it⠀fails⠀or⠀succeeds⠀in⠀an⠀unexpected⠀way;⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀enter⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀their⠀contribution⠀becomes⠀necessary⠀or⠀impossible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀mismatch⠀be⠀comic,⠀serious,⠀absent,⠀or⠀misunderstood⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀participant⠀to⠀notice⠀the⠀incongruity⠀or⠀to⠀mock⠀it.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀situation⠀funny,⠀another⠀may⠀miss⠀it⠀entirely,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀experience⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀problem.⠀Keep⠀the⠀humor⠀attached⠀to⠀particular⠀characters⠀and⠀their⠀positions⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀narrator's⠀running⠀commentary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀audience⠀and⠀narrator⠀access⠀clear.⠀The⠀theatrical⠀construction⠀may⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀something⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀not,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀grant⠀characters⠀knowledge⠀they⠀lack.⠀A⠀timed⠀entrance⠀or⠀visible⠀object⠀can⠀prepare⠀the⠀reader⠀for⠀a⠀later⠀interaction⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀characters⠀prescient.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.⠀The⠀theatrical⠀timing⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀mechanism⠀through⠀visible⠀business:⠀a⠀character⠀tries⠀a⠀procedure⠀while⠀another⠀person⠀watches,⠀or⠀an⠀object's⠀behavior⠀contradicts⠀a⠀stated⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀through⠀the⠀shifts⠀in⠀attention.\n\nSupported⠀correction⠀or⠀cooperation⠀can⠀proceed⠀without⠀humiliation⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀joke.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀point⠀out⠀a⠀practical⠀error,⠀supply⠀a⠀missing⠀resource,⠀or⠀adjust⠀a⠀plan⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀undertaking⠀moving.⠀The⠀scene's⠀theatrical⠀shape⠀organizes⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀when,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀comic⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀polyphonic,⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Juxtapose⠀attributed⠀observations,⠀actions,⠀or⠀reports⠀from⠀different⠀portions⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀undertaking,⠀letting⠀the⠀reader⠀compare⠀how⠀the⠀participants⠀encountered⠀the⠀interacting⠀conditions.⠀Their⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀comprehensive;⠀the⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀everyone⠀to⠀lack⠀the⠀complete⠀explanation.⠀Each⠀section⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀time,⠀and⠀position;⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀attribution⠀clear⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀after⠀every⠀shift.\n\nRetain⠀the⠀actual⠀time⠀and⠀resource⠀state⠀beneath⠀the⠀presentation.⠀Information⠀acquired⠀only⠀later⠀cannot⠀guide⠀an⠀earlier⠀act.⠀A⠀fact⠀revealed⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀section⠀may⠀already⠀have⠀been⠀known⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀participant⠀when⠀the⠀established⠀sources⠀support⠀it;⠀presentation⠀order⠀is⠀not⠀acquisition⠀time.⠀When⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀presentation⠀moves⠀backward⠀or⠀forward,⠀keep⠀the⠀causal⠀sequence⠀legible:⠀what⠀was⠀available⠀at⠀that⠀moment,⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀could⠀see,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀not.\n\nUse⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀condition⠀to⠀connect⠀one⠀person's⠀preparation⠀with⠀another's⠀later⠀use.⠀The⠀reader⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀same⠀tool,⠀route,⠀or⠀resource⠀across⠀sections⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀remain⠀unaware⠀of⠀the⠀connection.⠀The⠀reader⠀may⠀synthesize⠀the⠀relation⠀before⠀the⠀characters⠀do.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀also⠀identify⠀or⠀discuss⠀the⠀connection⠀when⠀their⠀actual⠀information⠀supports⠀it,⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀explanatory⠀announcement.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.⠀Different⠀sections⠀may⠀reveal⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀mechanism:⠀one⠀person⠀knows⠀the⠀rule,⠀another⠀discovers⠀its⠀exception,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀suffers⠀its⠀cost.⠀The⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀can⠀exceed⠀any⠀single⠀character's⠀without⠀becoming⠀shared⠀knowledge⠀in⠀the⠀fiction.\n\nUse⠀reported⠀accounts⠀where⠀direct⠀private⠀access⠀is⠀unavailable.⠀A⠀section⠀may⠀present⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀told⠀another,⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀shows,⠀or⠀what⠀someone⠀later⠀believed⠀happened.⠀Distinguish⠀these⠀reports⠀from⠀the⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Reader⠀synthesis⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀characters⠀knowledge⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀new⠀reveal;⠀the⠀undertaking⠀continues⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀act⠀on.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀and⠀locate⠀the⠀practical⠀aim⠀before⠀the⠀attempt⠀relies⠀on⠀it.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀conditions⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀depends⠀on.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀moves,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀who⠀is⠀where⠀and⠀what⠀changed.\n\nIntroduce⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀term,⠀tool,⠀or⠀rule⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀use⠀or⠀a⠀speaker's⠀genuine⠀explanation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀name⠀a⠀mechanism⠀while⠀operating⠀it,⠀explain⠀a⠀restriction⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀needs⠀to⠀know,⠀or⠀discover⠀a⠀property⠀by⠀trying⠀the⠀thing.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀glossary⠀entry;⠀the⠀explanation⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀decision.\n\nShift⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀mandatory⠀problem-theory-test⠀cycle.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀break⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀speaker,⠀a⠀new⠀physical⠀action,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀outer⠀event⠀to⠀private⠀response,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices.⠀The⠀undertaking⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀preparation,⠀attempt,⠀and⠀consequence,⠀but⠀these⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀as⠀fixed⠀beats⠀in⠀every⠀interval.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀the⠀relation⠀to⠀follow⠀an⠀actual⠀use⠀or⠀misunderstanding,⠀explain⠀the⠀relevant⠀mechanism⠀without⠀re-teaching⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀made⠀clear.⠀Let⠀action⠀follow⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀choice,⠀which⠀can⠀also⠀remain⠀pending.⠀Keep⠀the⠀interaction⠀legible⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀use:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀believes⠀the⠀mechanism⠀will⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀try,⠀and⠀what⠀happens.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀improvise⠀from⠀habit⠀or⠀act⠀with⠀incomplete⠀understanding⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀stopping⠀to⠀correct⠀them.\n\nLet⠀reactions⠀and⠀expertise⠀remain⠀individual.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀confidently,⠀another⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀partial⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀practical⠀problem⠀the⠀others⠀miss.⠀Full⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀pending⠀work⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀breakthrough.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀undertaking⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀available⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀recurring⠀material⠀relation⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notices⠀during⠀the⠀present⠀work⠀or⠀passage:⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀texture,⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀contact,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀movement.⠀Let⠀it⠀return⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀extent,⠀developing⠀an⠀association⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀ornamental⠀adjectives.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀carry⠀pleasure,⠀unease,⠀or⠀attachment⠀without⠀being⠀required⠀to⠀change⠀meaning⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀tactical⠀payoff.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀dependency,⠀spatial⠀effect,⠀or⠀interaction⠀must⠀be⠀understood,⠀shift⠀to⠀plain⠀causal⠀clauses.⠀Name⠀the⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀or⠀condition⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀possible,⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes.⠀The⠀lyric⠀passage⠀may⠀sustain⠀feeling⠀around⠀this⠀explanation,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀it.⠀If⠀several⠀practical⠀relations⠀are⠀active⠀at⠀once,⠀the⠀focal⠀rhythm⠀can⠀move⠀among⠀them⠀while⠀each⠀remains⠀causally⠀distinct.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀mechanism.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀interaction,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀mood⠀of⠀the⠀image.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀work⠀continued,⠀a⠀cost⠀absorbed,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀condition⠀recognized,⠀without⠀announcing⠀a⠀permanent⠀emotional⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLink⠀an⠀actual⠀tool,⠀route,⠀or⠀cooperative⠀habit⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀remembers.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀sensory⠀detail⠀or⠀practical⠀need,⠀and⠀keep⠀what⠀worked⠀then⠀distinct⠀from⠀present⠀capability⠀and⠀later⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀remembered⠀method⠀may⠀still⠀work,⠀require⠀adaptation,⠀or⠀prove⠀unavailable;⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀a⠀restoration⠀or⠀a⠀permanent⠀loss.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀tests⠀the⠀old⠀method,⠀show⠀the⠀resource,⠀rule,⠀or⠀other⠀person's⠀contribution⠀that⠀matters,⠀whether⠀it⠀differs⠀from⠀before⠀or⠀remains⠀dependably⠀the⠀same.⠀Plain⠀causal⠀explanation⠀keeps⠀the⠀practical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀while⠀the⠀reflection⠀holds⠀the⠀feeling⠀of⠀the⠀change.⠀Memory⠀may⠀produce⠀attachment,⠀regret,⠀or⠀relief⠀without⠀yielding⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀present⠀help⠀or⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀possible⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀cannot⠀return.\n\nContinue⠀from⠀the⠀undertaking's⠀actual⠀state,⠀including⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀familiar⠀method⠀still⠀in⠀use,⠀or⠀an⠀attempt⠀not⠀yet⠀resolved.⠀Changed⠀opportunities⠀may⠀involve⠀a⠀new⠀contribution⠀or⠀an⠀adapted⠀route⠀without⠀requiring⠀something⠀to⠀have⠀been⠀lost.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀work's⠀present⠀state⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀announcement⠀that⠀the⠀past⠀has⠀been⠀mastered⠀or⠀that⠀every⠀familiar⠀thing⠀must⠀fail.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀route.⠀Give⠀the⠀traveler⠀or⠀working⠀party⠀an⠀actual⠀need⠀for⠀passage,⠀supplies,⠀information,⠀or⠀cooperation,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀encounter⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀participants,⠀practical⠀authority,⠀and⠀local⠀rules.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀request⠀depends⠀on:⠀a⠀permit,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀custom,⠀a⠀resource,⠀or⠀a⠀person's⠀particular⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀rule's⠀effect⠀may⠀meet⠀another⠀person's⠀local⠀knowledge,⠀but⠀no⠀stop⠀must⠀be⠀absurd,⠀hostile,⠀or⠀resolved⠀by⠀a⠀clever⠀trick.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀interaction⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀local⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀attempt,⠀explain⠀the⠀condition⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀use⠀or⠀misunderstand,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀stated⠀authority⠀and⠀practical⠀business,⠀but⠀the⠀participants⠀remain⠀capable⠀of⠀genuine⠀help,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀negotiation.⠀Carry⠀actual⠀resource⠀changes,⠀agreements,⠀and⠀pending⠀requests⠀onward⠀from⠀one⠀encounter⠀to⠀the⠀next.\n\nLet⠀learned⠀limits⠀and⠀useful⠀help⠀persist⠀between⠀episodes.⠀A⠀later⠀stop⠀may⠀test⠀an⠀earlier⠀agreement⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀previously⠀learned⠀condition⠀relevant,⠀but⠀no⠀new⠀obstacle⠀or⠀special⠀cultural⠀hierarchy⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀undertaking⠀may⠀advance,⠀stall,⠀or⠀change⠀route⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀encounters⠀actually⠀permit.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀condition⠀or⠀contact⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀present⠀attempt.⠀Explain⠀it⠀clearly⠀where⠀useful⠀through⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details.⠀Repeat⠀only⠀where⠀actual⠀context⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀need⠀gives⠀repetition⠀a⠀purpose;⠀action⠀or⠀consideration⠀may⠀remain⠀underway.⠀A⠀participant⠀may⠀act⠀from⠀known⠀practice⠀without⠀narrating⠀a⠀theory.⠀Avoid⠀repeated⠀system⠀summaries⠀and⠀redundant⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀relation.\n\nKeep⠀causality⠀intact.⠀Omission⠀may⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀dependency⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀possible.⠀When⠀a⠀resource,⠀rule,⠀or⠀other⠀person's⠀contribution⠀changes⠀the⠀attempt,⠀show⠀that⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀in⠀one⠀precise⠀inward⠀connection.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀feeling,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀reasoning⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀decision⠀follows;⠀shortness⠀imposes⠀no⠀result,⠀fragment,⠀or⠀test⠀quota.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀economically⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀condition⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀consequence.⠀The⠀next⠀opportunity⠀may⠀be⠀immediate⠀or⠀deferred,⠀but⠀it⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀shown.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀its⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀the⠀undertaking,⠀observations,⠀exchanges,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀Paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.\n\nIntroduce⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀it⠀bears⠀on⠀actual⠀use,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀misunderstanding,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀opening⠀systems⠀lecture.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀plan⠀depends⠀on,⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes,⠀and⠀how⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation⠀affects⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity.⠀Keep⠀resources,⠀positions,⠀and⠀learned⠀conditions⠀continuous⠀across⠀the⠀scene;⠀changes⠀may⠀be⠀quick⠀when⠀grounded,⠀but⠀neither⠀a⠀new⠀system⠀nor⠀a⠀fresh⠀test⠀is⠀required⠀each⠀reply.\n\nLet⠀companions⠀act⠀independently.⠀Their⠀contributions,⠀objections,⠀and⠀private⠀concerns⠀may⠀intersect⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀understanding⠀without⠀turning⠀familiarity⠀into⠀shared⠀omniscience.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀work⠀continued,⠀a⠀cost⠀absorbed,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀condition⠀recognized,⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀an⠀established⠀exchange,⠀shared⠀task,⠀or⠀recurring⠀coordination⠀habit⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀Let⠀the⠀bond⠀shape⠀how⠀people⠀communicate⠀during⠀the⠀undertaking:⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀a⠀known⠀preference,⠀a⠀familiar⠀division⠀of⠀labor,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀may⠀carry⠀meaning⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀as⠀a⠀trope.\n\nShow⠀which⠀contribution⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀make⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀know.⠀Familiarity⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀shared⠀omniscience;⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀private⠀understanding⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀responds⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀situation.⠀When⠀a⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀or⠀mechanism⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀work,⠀explain⠀the⠀interaction⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀use⠀or⠀misunderstand,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.⠀An⠀emotional⠀objection⠀can⠀change⠀willingness⠀without⠀altering⠀the⠀mechanism.\n\nLet⠀cooperation,⠀refusal,⠀ordinary⠀affection,⠀or⠀pending⠀agreement⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀history.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀fulfill⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀bond⠀without⠀resolving⠀it,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀hidden⠀betrayal⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀confession.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀undertaking's⠀actual⠀present⠀state,⠀preserving⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀when⠀one⠀follows⠀and⠀leaving⠀unchanged⠀feeling⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀exchange⠀possible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀supplied⠀attempt⠀a⠀retellable⠀shape⠀through⠀clear⠀names⠀and⠀established⠀recurring⠀wording.⠀Open⠀deliberately,⠀use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person,⠀resource,⠀or⠀prepared⠀act,⠀and⠀let⠀repeated⠀wording⠀connect⠀an⠀actual⠀later⠀occurrence,⠀sustain⠀remembered⠀meaning,⠀or⠀orient⠀an⠀unfinished⠀deed⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀sound⠀like⠀a⠀chronicle⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀errand⠀into⠀heroic⠀doom.\n\nMake⠀a⠀decisive⠀interaction⠀recoverable⠀where⠀it⠀matters.⠀When⠀a⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀or⠀other⠀person's⠀contribution⠀enables⠀or⠀changes⠀the⠀deed,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀condition⠀rather⠀than⠀attributing⠀the⠀result⠀to⠀destiny⠀or⠀reputation.⠀The⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀recite⠀every⠀rule,⠀and⠀the⠀actors⠀need⠀not⠀know⠀the⠀later⠀explanation.⠀Costs⠀and⠀partial⠀results⠀carry⠀forward;⠀a⠀deed,⠀relationship⠀meaning,⠀or⠀account⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀with⠀no⠀compulsory⠀victory,⠀sacrifice,⠀or⠀legend⠀correction.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority.⠀A⠀participant⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Place⠀an⠀actual⠀preparation,⠀repair,⠀transport⠀need,⠀or⠀care⠀arrangement⠀alongside⠀the⠀traveler's⠀objective.⠀Where⠀one⠀activity⠀depends⠀on⠀another,⠀make⠀that⠀relation⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀domestic⠀particular⠀into⠀a⠀necessary⠀resource⠀or⠀obstacle.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀task⠀requires⠀from⠀another⠀person's⠀continuing⠀work:⠀a⠀vehicle⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀loaded⠀before⠀departure,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀permission,⠀a⠀repair⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀finished⠀until⠀someone⠀returns⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀errand,⠀or⠀a⠀child⠀or⠀animal⠀whose⠀care⠀changes⠀the⠀schedule.\n\nMake⠀the⠀helper's⠀contribution⠀legible⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀conditions.⠀They⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀equipment⠀better⠀than⠀the⠀traveler,⠀have⠀a⠀competing⠀obligation,⠀or⠀offer⠀help⠀in⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀is⠀useful⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀one⠀requested.⠀Their⠀cooperation⠀can⠀succeed,⠀remain⠀partial,⠀or⠀be⠀withdrawn⠀for⠀an⠀ordinary⠀reason⠀without⠀becoming⠀betrayal.⠀Let⠀the⠀traveler's⠀moral⠀instinct⠀and⠀practical⠀need⠀interact⠀with⠀that⠀limitation:⠀they⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀partial⠀help,⠀adjust⠀the⠀plan,⠀wait,⠀or⠀try⠀an⠀improvised⠀alternative.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀shared⠀work⠀concrete⠀and⠀material.⠀A⠀packed⠀bag,⠀a⠀repaired⠀strap,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀key,⠀a⠀prepared⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀check⠀on⠀someone⠀later⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀dependency.⠀When⠀an⠀attempt⠀changes⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀make⠀that⠀effect⠀clear;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀leave⠀existing⠀work⠀and⠀obligations⠀continuing.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀helper⠀returns⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀work,⠀the⠀traveler⠀leaves⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀constraint,⠀or⠀both⠀understand⠀the⠀favor⠀differently⠀afterward.⠀Ordinary⠀comfort⠀and⠀inward⠀concern⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀without⠀being⠀justified⠀through⠀productivity.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀undertaking⠀still⠀underway,⠀a⠀partial⠀solution,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀return⠀to⠀domestic⠀routine.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Establish⠀relevant⠀positions,⠀resources,⠀and⠀observable⠀conditions⠀before⠀an⠀action⠀depends⠀on⠀them:⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀the⠀rope,⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀already⠀open,⠀the⠀fuel⠀can⠀is⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀gap.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀to⠀connect⠀supported⠀actions⠀across⠀locations,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀transfer⠀or⠀travel.⠀An⠀established⠀offscreen⠀event⠀can⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀credible⠀report⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀effect,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀returning⠀vehicle,⠀a⠀changed⠀signal,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀arriving⠀with⠀new⠀information.\n\nMake⠀the⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problems⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀to⠀another⠀character⠀when⠀that⠀explanation⠀serves⠀an⠀actual⠀listener,⠀but⠀spoken⠀dialogue⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀full⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀authorized⠀channel,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀not⠀replaced⠀by⠀voice-over.⠀A⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀moral⠀instinct⠀can⠀accompany⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀becoming⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀members.\n\nLet⠀the⠀action⠀block⠀carry⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts:⠀what⠀is⠀attempted,⠀what⠀resists,⠀what⠀changes,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity⠀is.⠀A⠀response⠀or⠀test⠀may⠀remain⠀pending.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀visible⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀result,⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀spectacular⠀image⠀standing⠀in⠀for⠀causal⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nPresent⠀the⠀task⠀through⠀existing⠀blocking,⠀props,⠀entrances,⠀and⠀supported⠀offstage⠀reports⠀or⠀effects.⠀Make⠀what⠀an⠀object⠀controls⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀reach⠀clear⠀before⠀relying⠀on⠀it:⠀a⠀character⠀crosses⠀to⠀the⠀workbench,⠀lifts⠀the⠀lantern,⠀checks⠀the⠀door,⠀or⠀receives⠀a⠀report⠀from⠀offstage.⠀The⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carries⠀the⠀public⠀scene,⠀so⠀let⠀coordination⠀happen⠀through⠀practical⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀speeches.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀tool,⠀confirm⠀a⠀position,⠀or⠀disagree⠀about⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀reason⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀undertaking⠀playable.⠀Who⠀can⠀see⠀an⠀entrance,⠀reach⠀a⠀prop,⠀hear⠀a⠀line,⠀or⠀move⠀between⠀places⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀practical⠀method⠀legible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀demonstration⠀or⠀changed⠀theory⠀before⠀proceeding.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀coordinate,⠀question,⠀or⠀refuse⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀lecture⠀on⠀the⠀mechanism.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀explains⠀how⠀something⠀works,⠀give⠀the⠀speech⠀an⠀actual⠀purpose⠀for⠀its⠀speaker⠀or⠀listener;⠀no⠀consequence⠀or⠀completed⠀action⠀must⠀immediately⠀follow⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues.⠀An⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀interiority⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀hold⠀ongoing⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀result,⠀or⠀an⠀unchanged⠀arrangement,⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀gathering,⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀or⠀completed⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀move⠀associatively⠀through⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀while⠀the⠀undertaking⠀is⠀underway.⠀A⠀sensation⠀can⠀trigger⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀a⠀moral⠀concern⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀practical⠀sequence,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀comparison⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀an⠀object.⠀Keep⠀the⠀real⠀object,⠀position,⠀and⠀attempt⠀recoverable⠀through⠀concrete⠀anchors:⠀the⠀rope⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀the⠀left⠀hand,⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀still⠀closed,⠀the⠀remembered⠀warning⠀concerns⠀the⠀same⠀mechanism⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀use.\n\nDistinguish⠀imagined⠀interactions⠀from⠀actual⠀work.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀rehearse⠀a⠀possible⠀move,⠀revisit⠀a⠀past⠀failure,⠀or⠀follow⠀a⠀worry⠀into⠀fantasy,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀must⠀make⠀clear⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀associations⠀into⠀a⠀numbered⠀explanation⠀or⠀let⠀insight⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀rule.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀or⠀unrelated⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀move;⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀act⠀without⠀having⠀completed⠀the⠀reflection.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀elapsed⠀events⠀independently⠀of⠀prose⠀length.⠀A⠀long⠀associative⠀passage⠀does⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence,⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀one⠀does⠀not⠀compress⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀model⠀remain⠀personal⠀and⠀match⠀their⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀whether⠀comprehensive⠀or⠀partial:⠀they⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀notice⠀only⠀one⠀relevant⠀condition,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀moral⠀instinct⠀before⠀reasoning⠀it⠀through.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀attempt⠀still⠀underway,⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀ordinary⠀attention.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nGive⠀each⠀message⠀an⠀actual⠀sender⠀and⠀audience,⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Make⠀a⠀condition⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀wording⠀needed⠀by⠀its⠀recipient:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀the⠀door⠀code,⠀report⠀that⠀the⠀road⠀is⠀blocked,⠀or⠀confirm⠀that⠀the⠀equipment⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀truck.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀full⠀system⠀lecture.⠀The⠀recipient's⠀comprehension⠀is⠀not⠀guaranteed⠀by⠀delivery;⠀they⠀may⠀misunderstand,⠀act⠀on⠀partial⠀information,⠀or⠀lack⠀the⠀resource⠀the⠀message⠀assumes.\n\nDistinguish⠀sent⠀text,⠀genuinely⠀composed⠀drafts,⠀and⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀wording⠀and⠀hesitation,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀Required⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀interiority⠀remains⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text⠀and⠀cannot⠀be⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀message.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nLet⠀the⠀messages⠀coordinate⠀distributed⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking:⠀one⠀person⠀checks⠀a⠀route⠀while⠀another⠀prepares⠀supplies,⠀one⠀confirms⠀a⠀repair⠀while⠀another⠀waits⠀at⠀the⠀meeting⠀point.⠀Preserve⠀pending⠀requests,⠀actual⠀resource⠀state,⠀and⠀prior⠀successful⠀coordination⠀across⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Understanding⠀or⠀action⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀confirmed⠀every⠀turn.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀awaiting⠀response,⠀a⠀completed⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀update⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nLocate⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀object,⠀position,⠀or⠀displayed⠀condition.⠀A⠀scene⠀cue⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀cracked⠀fuel⠀line⠀on⠀the⠀workbench,⠀the⠀open⠀gate⠀at⠀the⠀far⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀yard,⠀the⠀map⠀held⠀at⠀an⠀angle,⠀or⠀the⠀empty⠀bracket⠀where⠀a⠀tool⠀should⠀hang.⠀Let⠀the⠀cue⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀function⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀A⠀repeated⠀cue⠀can⠀simply⠀show⠀unchanged⠀work:⠀the⠀same⠀rope⠀still⠀tied,⠀the⠀same⠀door⠀still⠀blocked,⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀still⠀waiting.\n\nMove⠀among⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀focal⠀observation,⠀and⠀full⠀private⠀experience⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene,⠀with⠀no⠀fixed⠀rotation.⠀A⠀character's⠀reaction⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀a⠀theory,⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀interiority⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀ask,⠀coordinate,⠀or⠀disagree⠀for⠀actual⠀reasons⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀task,⠀without⠀becoming⠀exposition.\n\nMake⠀the⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀practical⠀problems⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀visible⠀anchors.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action:⠀the⠀lever⠀is⠀pulled,⠀the⠀lock⠀does⠀not⠀open,⠀the⠀borrowed⠀key⠀fits⠀only⠀the⠀outer⠀door.⠀Preserve⠀pending⠀attempts,⠀active⠀ownership,⠀and⠀established⠀capabilities⠀rather⠀than⠀adding⠀game⠀commands,⠀branching⠀menus,⠀or⠀automatic⠀victory.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀undertaking⠀still⠀underway,⠀a⠀partial⠀result,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀displayed⠀condition⠀with⠀new⠀information.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaanbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nReenter⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀task⠀state⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀earlier⠀condition⠀needed⠀to⠀follow⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀installment⠀resumes⠀at⠀the⠀locked⠀gate,⠀recover⠀that⠀the⠀key⠀was⠀borrowed⠀from⠀the⠀caretaker⠀and⠀that⠀the⠀lock⠀was⠀last⠀seen⠀rusted⠀shut;⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀journey⠀that⠀established⠀those⠀facts.⠀Keep⠀tests,⠀repairs,⠀learned⠀limits,⠀and⠀practical⠀agreements⠀continuous⠀across⠀installments,⠀including⠀incomplete⠀or⠀unneeded⠀tests.⠀A⠀later⠀event⠀can⠀qualify⠀a⠀theory⠀without⠀rewriting⠀its⠀earlier⠀result:⠀the⠀gate⠀opens⠀now⠀because⠀the⠀caretaker⠀oiled⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀attempt⠀was⠀falsely⠀reported.\n\nLet⠀known⠀interactions⠀and⠀real⠀resource⠀changes⠀stay⠀useful.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reuse⠀a⠀method⠀that⠀worked⠀before,⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀condition⠀has⠀changed,⠀or⠀combine⠀two⠀previously⠀learned⠀facts⠀to⠀attempt⠀a⠀new⠀move.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀new⠀mechanism,⠀stronger⠀foe,⠀or⠀discovered⠀rule⠀every⠀reply.⠀Preparation,⠀recovery,⠀private⠀consideration,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀cooperation⠀may⠀fill⠀an⠀interval⠀without⠀an⠀outcome⠀owed.\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀objective⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nPlace⠀strain⠀in⠀a⠀supported⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking:⠀a⠀request,⠀shared⠀burden,⠀returned⠀item⠀or⠀departure.⠀Make⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀clear⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀stage⠀to⠀produce⠀one⠀of⠀these⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀valued⠀thing⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀useful,⠀and⠀an⠀offered⠀closeness⠀can⠀be⠀accepted⠀simply⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀an⠀unavoidable⠀test⠀of⠀attachment.\n\nLet⠀exact⠀material⠀sensation⠀connect⠀current⠀handling⠀with⠀this⠀person's⠀experience.⠀Weight,⠀temperature,⠀a⠀familiar⠀surface⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀may⠀carry⠀remembered⠀intimacy,⠀while⠀direct⠀feeling⠀remains⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀language.⠀Sensation⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀precede⠀every⠀thought,⠀and⠀emotion⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀prescribed⠀hesitation,⠀flat⠀instruction⠀or⠀reluctant⠀gesture.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀feel⠀strain⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀next⠀action.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀private⠀meaning⠀owned.⠀Another⠀participant⠀can⠀experience⠀the⠀task⠀differently,⠀agree⠀about⠀it⠀or⠀focus⠀on⠀ordinary⠀work⠀without⠀knowing⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀unspoken⠀feeling.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀under⠀active⠀ownership,⠀including⠀developed⠀memory⠀or⠀reasoning⠀without⠀a⠀practical⠀payoff.⠀Let⠀the⠀objective⠀proceed⠀or⠀remain⠀pending⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀conditions,⠀without⠀required⠀jealousy,⠀loss,⠀confession,⠀sacrifice⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀reply⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀submitted⠀move⠀within⠀the⠀current⠀objective:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀actually⠀does⠀or⠀leaves⠀underway.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀keep⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀participant⠀handles⠀a⠀surface,⠀familiar⠀place,⠀or⠀offered⠀item,⠀render⠀its⠀material⠀presence⠀precisely—texture,⠀temperature,⠀weight,⠀or⠀sound—so⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀feels⠀physically⠀immediate.\n\nIf⠀the⠀active⠀participant⠀has⠀an⠀authorized⠀private⠀response⠀to⠀that⠀detail,⠀place⠀it⠀only⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀interiority⠀channel.⠀A⠀remembered⠀attachment⠀may⠀color⠀how⠀this⠀person⠀experiences⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀reveal⠀another⠀participant's⠀motive⠀or⠀make⠀sensory⠀intensity⠀proof⠀of⠀intent.⠀The⠀other⠀participant's⠀exact⠀contribution⠀and⠀independent⠀motives⠀remain⠀their⠀own;⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀say,⠀not⠀what⠀they⠀privately⠀mean⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.\n\nLet⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀end⠀with⠀ongoing⠀work⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀response⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀intimate⠀revelation.⠀The⠀next⠀move⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀rest.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀explain⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀action⠀naturally⠀pauses.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Where⠀preparation⠀or⠀recovery⠀uses⠀an⠀actual⠀domestic⠀arrangement,⠀make⠀its⠀contribution⠀to⠀the⠀objective⠀concrete:⠀packing⠀for⠀departure,⠀repairing⠀equipment,⠀resting⠀after⠀a⠀difficult⠀leg,⠀or⠀dividing⠀space⠀among⠀people⠀who⠀know⠀each⠀other's⠀habits.⠀Follow⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting's⠀actual⠀layout⠀and⠀objects⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀household⠀inventory.⠀Let⠀material⠀particulars⠀carry⠀history—a⠀dented⠀pot,⠀a⠀chair⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀sticks—so⠀that⠀preparation⠀and⠀recovery⠀feel⠀lived⠀in⠀without⠀every⠀detail⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol.\n\nShow⠀how⠀the⠀arrangement⠀supports⠀or⠀complicates⠀the⠀current⠀task.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀value⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀without⠀treating⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀obstacle⠀or⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Others⠀in⠀the⠀household⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives⠀and⠀speech:⠀one⠀may⠀help⠀sincerely,⠀another⠀may⠀refuse⠀plainly,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀be⠀occupied⠀with⠀unrelated⠀work.⠀Their⠀responses⠀can⠀affect⠀the⠀work⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀request⠀pending⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀situation,⠀without⠀a⠀changed⠀opportunity⠀or⠀feeling⠀owed⠀in⠀every⠀encounter.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint's⠀private⠀experience⠀through⠀the⠀selected⠀interiority⠀channel.⠀The⠀intimacy⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀or⠀shared⠀item⠀may⠀prompt⠀memory,⠀comfort,⠀irritation,⠀or⠀nothing⠀at⠀all.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀objective⠀available⠀through⠀domestic⠀work⠀or⠀respite;⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀develop⠀without⠀advancing⠀the⠀undertaking,⠀and⠀an⠀interval⠀may⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀or⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀actual⠀weight,⠀friction,⠀reach,⠀or⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀item⠀or⠀route⠀being⠀used,⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀selection⠀do⠀narrative⠀work.⠀Use⠀hard⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions:⠀a⠀pack⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀carried⠀but⠀braced⠀against⠀a⠀rail;⠀a⠀rope⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀tied⠀but⠀hauled⠀taut⠀and⠀checked⠀for⠀fray.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀attempt⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on—clearance,⠀grip,⠀load,⠀timing—and⠀what⠀changes⠀when⠀the⠀attempt⠀succeeds⠀or⠀fails.\n\nGive⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀actual⠀attraction,⠀discomfort,⠀memory⠀and⠀reasoning⠀the⠀extent⠀their⠀experience⠀needs,⠀without⠀making⠀feeling⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀reasoning⠀task⠀or⠀changed⠀action.⠀A⠀polished⠀thing⠀can⠀work⠀well;⠀its⠀beauty⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀fraud⠀or⠀a⠀trap.⠀If⠀wear⠀or⠀breakage⠀occurs,⠀its⠀cause⠀and⠀effect⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions;⠀overload,⠀use⠀or⠀weather⠀may⠀matter,⠀but⠀no⠀failure⠀or⠀particular⠀cause⠀is⠀required⠀merely⠀by⠀the⠀style.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀damage⠀to⠀punish⠀attachment⠀or⠀add⠀a⠀hostile⠀obstacle⠀after⠀success.\n\nKeep⠀effort⠀and⠀private⠀value⠀distinct.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gleam⠀of⠀a⠀kept⠀tool⠀while⠀using⠀it⠀hard,⠀or⠀remember⠀a⠀room⠀while⠀forcing⠀its⠀stuck⠀door.⠀That⠀private⠀response⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀object's⠀practical⠀function.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀work⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀without⠀requiring⠀loss,⠀cynical⠀speech,⠀or⠀a⠀further⠀complication.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀documents⠀the⠀undertaking⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter⠀requesting⠀passage,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀with⠀instructions,⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀supplies,⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀found,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀that⠀may⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀answered.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Let⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follow⠀its⠀writer's⠀situation:⠀a⠀hurried⠀note⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀assumed,⠀while⠀a⠀formal⠀report⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀was⠀asked⠀to⠀verify;⠀neither⠀omission⠀nor⠀concealment⠀is⠀compulsory.\n\nMake⠀the⠀material⠀handling⠀of⠀a⠀document⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀when⠀it⠀matters.⠀A⠀paper⠀may⠀be⠀folded⠀into⠀a⠀pocket,⠀sealed⠀with⠀wax,⠀passed⠀across⠀a⠀table,⠀or⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀tin⠀that⠀has⠀traveled⠀with⠀its⠀owner.⠀Its⠀creases,⠀dampness⠀or⠀torn⠀corner⠀can⠀reflect⠀established⠀handling,⠀while⠀the⠀cause⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀unknown;⠀material⠀condition⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀a⠀route⠀or⠀hidden⠀code.⠀A⠀document's⠀practical⠀function⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀private⠀association⠀its⠀writer⠀or⠀recipient⠀attaches⠀to⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀interiority⠀channel⠀rather⠀than⠀pretending⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀report⠀contains⠀the⠀writer's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀leave⠀out⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀felt⠀while⠀writing⠀it.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀administration,⠀unanswered⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀promised⠀help⠀that⠀differs⠀from⠀received⠀help.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀advance⠀through⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀documents⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nChoose⠀an⠀actual⠀preparation⠀or⠀recovery⠀accommodation⠀within⠀the⠀journey:⠀a⠀strap⠀adjusted⠀to⠀sit⠀better,⠀a⠀resting⠀place⠀made⠀comfortable⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀available,⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference⠀honored⠀without⠀ceremony.⠀Render⠀the⠀pleasure⠀through⠀precise⠀sensation—the⠀give⠀of⠀a⠀cushion,⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀drink,⠀the⠀clean⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀shirt⠀aired⠀overnight—alongside⠀any⠀directly⠀expressed⠀enjoyment,⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀feeling⠀to⠀remain⠀implicit.⠀Let⠀direct⠀affection⠀and⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀remain⠀possible:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀thank⠀you,⠀tease⠀gently,⠀or⠀simply⠀settle⠀into⠀the⠀improved⠀arrangement.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀private⠀association⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀A⠀familiar⠀texture⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀trip,⠀a⠀particular⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀no⠀longer⠀present,⠀and⠀that⠀memory⠀can⠀stay⠀pleasant,⠀mixed,⠀or⠀unresolved.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀the⠀helper's⠀motive⠀or⠀turn⠀the⠀helper⠀into⠀a⠀mind-reader.⠀Care⠀may⠀ease⠀the⠀next⠀leg⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀shared⠀space⠀more⠀comfortable,⠀while⠀its⠀pleasure⠀can⠀also⠀matter⠀without⠀a⠀practical⠀improvement.\n\nPreserve⠀practical⠀limits⠀and⠀pleasure⠀beyond⠀efficiency.⠀A⠀good⠀meal⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀strategic;⠀a⠀comfortable⠀bed⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀earned.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀cost,⠀confession,⠀or⠀threat⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀warmth⠀substantial.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀its⠀active⠀boundary⠀with⠀enjoyed⠀company,⠀ongoing⠀care⠀or⠀rest,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀improvement⠀in⠀equipment,⠀readiness⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBegin⠀with⠀actual⠀work⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀arrangement:⠀the⠀party⠀loading⠀a⠀boat,⠀repairing⠀a⠀gate,⠀or⠀dividing⠀supplies⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀stage.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀widen⠀from⠀that⠀present⠀use⠀into⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀place⠀or⠀object,⠀but⠀only⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀room⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀a⠀workshop⠀before⠀it⠀became⠀a⠀storehouse;⠀a⠀tool⠀may⠀have⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀now⠀absent;⠀a⠀route⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀from⠀a⠀journey⠀made⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances.\n\nKeep⠀material⠀ownership,⠀permission,⠀and⠀function⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀desire.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀keep⠀an⠀object,⠀linger⠀in⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀avoid⠀returning⠀to⠀it,⠀but⠀preserve⠀whatever⠀ownership,⠀current⠀use⠀and⠀availability⠀the⠀world⠀establishes,⠀including⠀an⠀unclaimed⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀with⠀no⠀present⠀assigned⠀purpose.⠀The⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀what⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀done⠀with⠀them.⠀Sustained⠀paragraphs⠀may⠀hold⠀an⠀attachment⠀without⠀diagnosing⠀it:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀worn⠀wood⠀or⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀closed⠀room⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀association⠀remain⠀implicit.\n\nReturn⠀from⠀the⠀widened⠀history⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀use.⠀The⠀remembered⠀significance⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀current⠀task⠀more⠀careful,⠀more⠀reluctant,⠀or⠀more⠀determined,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀dictate⠀the⠀result.⠀Preserve⠀ordinary⠀individual⠀dialogue⠀and⠀developed⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀interiority⠀channel.⠀No⠀ornate⠀social⠀setting,⠀discovered⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀completed⠀relinquishment⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nSituate⠀the⠀telling⠀during⠀actual⠀travel,⠀preparation⠀or⠀recovery,⠀whether⠀people⠀are⠀working⠀or⠀taking⠀a⠀pause.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀speak⠀to⠀these⠀listeners⠀now,⠀such⠀as⠀explaining⠀a⠀route,⠀justifying⠀a⠀choice,⠀or⠀filling⠀a⠀wait.⠀The⠀tale⠀recounts⠀an⠀earlier⠀task⠀and⠀keeps⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀clear.\n\nMake⠀one⠀material⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀remembered⠀experience:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀carried⠀object,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀something⠀offered⠀or⠀left⠀behind.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀describe⠀it⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision.⠀The⠀detail⠀may⠀reveal⠀attachment,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀what⠀another⠀participant⠀felt⠀or⠀intended.\n\nLet⠀the⠀listeners⠀respond⠀as⠀themselves.⠀They⠀may⠀enjoy⠀the⠀tale,⠀question⠀a⠀practical⠀point,⠀or⠀continue⠀ordinary⠀work⠀while⠀listening.⠀Their⠀response⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀the⠀teller's⠀meaning⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀resume⠀unchanged⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀tale⠀unfinished.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀remembered⠀event⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀objective.⠀Make⠀the⠀earlier⠀attempt's⠀actual⠀conditions⠀and⠀actions⠀understandable⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀supply⠀useful⠀knowledge;⠀listening⠀may⠀offer⠀pleasure⠀or⠀leave⠀its⠀relevance⠀unclear.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀now.⠀Actual⠀speech,⠀listening⠀and⠀intervening⠀events⠀determine⠀duration,⠀not⠀narration⠀length.⠀Actual⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀performed⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀When⠀the⠀current⠀task⠀touches⠀an⠀object,⠀route,⠀or⠀method⠀with⠀a⠀history,⠀bring⠀a⠀relevant⠀source⠀into⠀the⠀scene:⠀an⠀inventory,⠀an⠀earlier⠀description,⠀a⠀repair⠀trace,⠀or⠀an⠀account.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀embedded⠀in⠀continuous⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀reply⠀into⠀a⠀document.\n\nDistinguish⠀three⠀kinds⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀What⠀the⠀record⠀states⠀is⠀limited⠀to⠀its⠀wording⠀and⠀purpose.⠀What⠀memory⠀supplies⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀participant's⠀attachment⠀and⠀later⠀experience.⠀What⠀present⠀use⠀shows⠀is⠀the⠀current⠀material⠀condition⠀and⠀practical⠀effect.⠀The⠀sources⠀may⠀agree⠀or⠀leave⠀questions⠀open;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀fraud⠀or⠀disillusionment.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀memory⠀matter⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀task.⠀A⠀remembered⠀texture⠀or⠀familiar⠀place⠀can⠀sharpen⠀the⠀participant's⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀object⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀hidden⠀mechanism⠀or⠀a⠀proof⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Practical⠀preparation⠀and⠀actual⠀material⠀continuity⠀remain⠀clear.\n\nShow⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀route⠀was⠀chosen⠀or⠀why⠀an⠀item⠀was⠀kept.⠀The⠀present⠀use⠀may⠀confirm⠀or⠀complicate⠀that⠀explanation.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀keep⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀can⠀state.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWhere⠀established⠀authority,⠀access,⠀or⠀obligation⠀touches⠀the⠀objective,⠀show⠀the⠀material⠀place,⠀item,⠀or⠀assistance⠀involved.⠀Give⠀the⠀arrangement⠀a⠀concrete⠀presence:⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀debt⠀of⠀service,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀history.⠀Render⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀response⠀through⠀sensual⠀precision,⠀whether⠀it⠀involves⠀attraction,⠀ambivalence,⠀simple⠀appreciation⠀or⠀little⠀personal⠀investment.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀desire⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀actual⠀terms.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀want⠀the⠀offered⠀help,⠀resent⠀the⠀obligation,⠀or⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀intimacy⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀place⠀or⠀object.⠀That⠀private⠀experience⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀party⠀has⠀agreed⠀to⠀provide⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀permits.\n\nLet⠀the⠀other⠀party⠀act⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀reasons.⠀They⠀may⠀help⠀sincerely,⠀refuse⠀for⠀known⠀constraints,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀arrangement⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀seductive⠀ruler,⠀a⠀hidden⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀revelation⠀of⠀corruption⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀arrangement⠀can⠀remain⠀useful,⠀unaccepted,⠀or⠀unresolved.\n\nShow⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes.⠀The⠀inherited⠀access⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀route,⠀supply⠀a⠀needed⠀item,⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀affects⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity.⠀Keep⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting's⠀material⠀detail⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀intimacy⠀of⠀remembered⠀places,⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀urban⠀location⠀or⠀past⠀attachment⠀merely⠀for⠀the⠀style.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀lyric⠀and⠀philosophical⠀inwardness.⠀During⠀preparation,⠀travel,⠀or⠀recovery,⠀let⠀an⠀actual⠀sensation⠀open⠀a⠀private⠀movement:⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀carried⠀object,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀something⠀given⠀or⠀kept.⠀Follow⠀that⠀sensation⠀through⠀memory⠀into⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀values⠀or⠀owes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀question⠀owned⠀and⠀event-grounded.⠀It⠀may⠀concern⠀keeping,⠀giving,⠀caring,⠀or⠀returning.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀theorem,⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀renounce.⠀A⠀wish⠀may⠀remain⠀coherent⠀or⠀uncertain⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀continues.\n\nDistinguish⠀feeling⠀from⠀fact.⠀Physical⠀ownership,⠀another⠀person's⠀intent,⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀result⠀of⠀the⠀task⠀do⠀not⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attachment.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀extent⠀of⠀private⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀religion,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀an⠀insight⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀reached.\n\nShow⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes.⠀The⠀inward⠀passage⠀may⠀clarify⠀a⠀choice,⠀complicate⠀a⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀simply⠀accompany⠀the⠀work⠀without⠀resolving.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity⠀follow⠀from⠀actual⠀events⠀and⠀practical⠀competence,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀emotional⠀question⠀alone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany.⠀Let⠀a⠀participant⠀record⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀choose⠀from⠀a⠀day's⠀work:⠀a⠀texture,⠀a⠀received⠀phrase,⠀a⠀practical⠀limit,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀enjoyment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀entry⠀selective⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀report⠀of⠀the⠀journey.\n\nLet⠀later⠀entries⠀revisit⠀a⠀detail⠀without⠀changing⠀earlier⠀wording⠀or⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀persistent⠀attachment⠀may⠀appear⠀across⠀entries,⠀or⠀a⠀first⠀impression⠀may⠀remain⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀recorder's⠀later⠀understanding⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀alter⠀what⠀they⠀wrote⠀before.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀recorder⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀when⠀the⠀frame⠀requires⠀it.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀live⠀mind.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀separately⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀entry⠀records.⠀Allow⠀unfinished⠀reflection⠀without⠀a⠀seasonal⠀symbol⠀or⠀a⠀poignant⠀discovery.\n\nShow⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes⠀through⠀the⠀recorded⠀details.⠀A⠀practical⠀limit⠀noted⠀in⠀one⠀entry⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀later⠀choice.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀may⠀sharpen⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀entries⠀accumulate⠀material⠀history⠀while⠀the⠀task⠀continues.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀and⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Juxtapose⠀sourced⠀accounts⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀act⠀from⠀different⠀occasions,⠀keeping⠀actual⠀chronology⠀and⠀transfers⠀stable.⠀Each⠀account⠀carries⠀its⠀speaker's⠀or⠀writer's⠀situation⠀and⠀purpose.\n\nKeep⠀actual⠀events⠀stable⠀while⠀accounts⠀may⠀agree,⠀differ⠀in⠀attention⠀or⠀make⠀incompatible⠀factual⠀claims⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀sources⠀and⠀circumstances;⠀neither⠀agreement⠀nor⠀dispute⠀is⠀compulsory.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀attend⠀to⠀utility,⠀another⠀to⠀remembered⠀intimacy⠀or⠀ordinary⠀pleasure.⠀They⠀need⠀not⠀disagree,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀need⠀not⠀reveal⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀gives⠀each⠀account⠀its⠀own⠀material⠀texture.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀for⠀direct⠀minds.⠀Where⠀direct⠀mind⠀access⠀is⠀unavailable,⠀convey⠀other⠀accounts⠀through⠀attributed⠀speech,⠀records⠀or⠀observation⠀actually⠀accessible⠀to⠀the⠀permitted⠀narrator.⠀Private⠀experience⠀exceeds⠀communicated⠀accounts⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀viewpoint⠀or⠀revelation⠀in⠀each⠀interval.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.\n\nShow⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes⠀across⠀the⠀juxtaposed⠀accounts.⠀A⠀practical⠀detail⠀from⠀one⠀occasion⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀later⠀choice.⠀A⠀remembered⠀attachment⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀present⠀use.⠀Let⠀the⠀nonlinear⠀arrangement⠀make⠀the⠀shared⠀undertaking⠀more⠀intelligible⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀single⠀interpretation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Orient⠀the⠀actual⠀objective⠀and⠀relevant⠀space,⠀then⠀introduce⠀a⠀needed⠀item⠀or⠀method⠀through⠀preparation,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀use.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.\n\nParagraph⠀around⠀real⠀changes⠀of⠀speech,⠀action,⠀and⠀inward⠀attention.⠀A⠀texture⠀or⠀familiar⠀handling⠀may⠀prompt⠀memory⠀without⠀implying⠀a⠀hidden⠀mechanism.⠀Let⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀give⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀place⠀its⠀material⠀presence,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀owned⠀and⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀reaction⠀label.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀individual⠀and⠀practical.⠀Different⠀characters⠀may⠀notice⠀different⠀aspects⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀route.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀follow⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀concerns⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀whether⠀they⠀share⠀appreciation⠀or⠀respond⠀differently.\n\nShow⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes.⠀Track⠀what⠀actual⠀use⠀of⠀an⠀item⠀or⠀method⠀permits,⠀changes⠀or⠀leaves⠀pending,⠀without⠀a⠀payoff⠀required⠀from⠀every⠀introduced⠀detail.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀needed⠀extent.⠀No⠀youthful⠀cast,⠀comic⠀reaction,⠀sudden⠀danger,⠀or⠀result⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀a⠀break.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀immediate⠀task⠀supply⠀the⠀material⠀for⠀rhythm.⠀As⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀handles,⠀carries,⠀repairs,⠀or⠀searches⠀for⠀something,⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀texture,⠀light,⠀sound,⠀or⠀motion⠀of⠀that⠀act.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀or⠀sound⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀is⠀touched⠀again,⠀when⠀a⠀route⠀doubles⠀back,⠀or⠀when⠀effort⠀gives⠀way⠀to⠀rest.⠀The⠀association⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀person:⠀it⠀may⠀persist⠀unchanged,⠀become⠀pleasurable,⠀or⠀remain⠀mixed,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀of⠀another⠀mind⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀object's⠀beauty⠀a⠀physical⠀force.\n\nUse⠀plain⠀clauses⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀plan⠀legible.⠀Use⠀plain⠀statements⠀where⠀needed⠀to⠀keep⠀what⠀is⠀attempted,⠀what⠀it⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀clear,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation⠀or⠀a⠀result⠀after⠀each⠀inward⠀passage.⠀A⠀lyrical⠀development⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀result;⠀it⠀can⠀pause⠀at⠀a⠀changed⠀grip,⠀a⠀cleared⠀space,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀of⠀the⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀of⠀a⠀passage⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence⠀of⠀work,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀effort⠀before⠀the⠀release⠀or⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀voices.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀be⠀practical,⠀abrupt,⠀affectionate,⠀or⠀evasive⠀without⠀borrowing⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀remains⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀symbol⠀that⠀explains⠀fate⠀or⠀another⠀character's⠀motive.⠀When⠀a⠀plan⠀changes,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀depends⠀on:⠀a⠀broken⠀strap,⠀a⠀missed⠀landmark,⠀a⠀companion's⠀skill,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀adventure⠀advances⠀through⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation,⠀not⠀through⠀the⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀in⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀route,⠀object,⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀now⠀in⠀use.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀touches⠀a⠀familiar⠀latch,⠀crosses⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀once⠀knew,⠀or⠀repeats⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀preparation,⠀let⠀one⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀detail⠀open⠀the⠀earlier⠀time:⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀light⠀fell,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀thing⠀then,⠀the⠀voice⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀give⠀directions.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀was⠀true⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀available⠀now.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀road⠀is⠀quieter,⠀the⠀object⠀mended⠀differently,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀absent,⠀without⠀announcing⠀that⠀everything⠀has⠀changed.\n\nLet⠀later⠀feeling⠀confirm,⠀qualify,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀remembered⠀meaning⠀alone.⠀The⠀present⠀task⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀skill⠀or⠀object⠀competently,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀may⠀still⠀occur.⠀A⠀successful⠀repair,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀stretch⠀of⠀road⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀restore⠀the⠀past⠀or⠀cancel⠀the⠀attachment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sensory⠀continuity⠀specific:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀oil,⠀the⠀frayed⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀map,⠀the⠀particular⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀handed-down⠀tool.⠀These⠀details⠀carry⠀affection⠀or⠀loss⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀undertaking⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀pause⠀without⠀a⠀farewell,⠀a⠀ruined⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀set⠀the⠀thing⠀down,⠀pass⠀it⠀on,⠀or⠀simply⠀keep⠀walking.⠀Private⠀experience⠀remains⠀meaningful⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀choice.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes,⠀but⠀let⠀emotional⠀meaning⠀follow⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀experience⠀without⠀forcing⠀or⠀forbidding⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀as⠀a⠀modern⠀memoir:⠀a⠀participant⠀account⠀told⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀later⠀moment.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀situation⠀or⠀the⠀occasion⠀of⠀remembering,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀journey,⠀search,⠀or⠀confrontation.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀actor⠀perceived,⠀intended,⠀and⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀A⠀remembered⠀surface⠀or⠀offered⠀possession⠀can⠀anchor⠀the⠀two⠀times:⠀the⠀same⠀bracelet,⠀doorway,⠀or⠀stretch⠀of⠀road⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀both⠀the⠀past⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀telling.\n\nKeep⠀later⠀knowledge⠀from⠀becoming⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀If⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀understands⠀why⠀a⠀companion⠀hesitated⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀warning⠀meant,⠀that⠀understanding⠀must⠀have⠀an⠀actual⠀source:⠀a⠀later⠀conversation,⠀a⠀discovered⠀letter,⠀a⠀returned⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀circumstance.⠀The⠀earlier⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀hesitation⠀or⠀the⠀warning⠀without⠀the⠀actor⠀recognizing⠀its⠀full⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀the⠀later⠀interpretation⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment.\n\nConvey⠀the⠀participant⠀account⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀permissions⠀without⠀inventing⠀narrator⠀participation.⠀Each⠀rendered⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀authorized⠀owner;⠀the⠀memoir⠀does⠀not⠀transmit⠀a⠀participant's⠀whole⠀mind⠀to⠀its⠀audience,⠀and⠀other⠀authorized⠀minds⠀retain⠀their⠀own⠀experience.⠀The⠀memoir⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀reveal,⠀but⠀the⠀raw⠀reply⠀must⠀still⠀carry⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀where⠀required.⠀Neither⠀regret,⠀revelation,⠀nor⠀a⠀repaired⠀memory⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀remain⠀uncertain,⠀defensive,⠀or⠀simply⠀practical⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀journey⠀cost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀exact⠀material⠀particular⠀and⠀spatial⠀relation⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀the⠀attempt,⠀keeping⠀the⠀scene⠀concentrated⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀fixed⠀number⠀of⠀details.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀inspect⠀a⠀used⠀rope,⠀pass⠀a⠀kept⠀tool⠀or⠀pause⠀at⠀a⠀familiar⠀entrance.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀observed⠀and⠀handled.⠀A⠀worn⠀surface⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀age,⠀capacity⠀or⠀the⠀history⠀that⠀produced⠀it;⠀keep⠀consequential⠀claims⠀within⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀current⠀use⠀support.\n\nLet⠀a⠀precise⠀sensation⠀carry⠀an⠀owned⠀association⠀without⠀repeating⠀an⠀explanatory⠀diagnosis.⠀A⠀familiar⠀texture⠀can⠀recall⠀attachment⠀while⠀the⠀object⠀still⠀serves⠀an⠀ordinary⠀purpose.⠀Direct⠀private⠀feeling,⠀memory⠀and⠀reasoning⠀remain⠀available⠀at⠀their⠀needed⠀extent⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀including⠀experience⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀a⠀choice.⠀Omit⠀redundant⠀gloss⠀rather⠀than⠀meaningful⠀inward⠀recurrence.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀preserve⠀who⠀can⠀reach,⠀carry⠀or⠀use⠀what⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀actually⠀accomplishes⠀or⠀leaves⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀belongs⠀to⠀each⠀speaker,⠀and⠀a⠀valuable⠀thing⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀damaged⠀or⠀relinquished⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀passage⠀weight.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀legible,⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀result,⠀cryptic⠀omission⠀or⠀altered⠀emotional⠀state.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀as⠀a⠀sustained⠀scene.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does,⠀what⠀others⠀say,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀perceives,⠀what⠀memory⠀surfaces,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀contains.⠀A⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀attract⠀attention⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀person's⠀history:⠀a⠀familiar⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat,⠀a⠀tool⠀with⠀a⠀worn⠀handle.⠀That⠀attraction⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀perceiver.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀another⠀actor's⠀intention,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀intimate⠀or⠀deceptive.\n\nShow⠀practical⠀handling⠀and⠀what⠀cooperation⠀or⠀improvisation⠀permits.⠀If⠀a⠀companion⠀offers⠀help,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀offer,⠀any⠀response⠀supplied⠀and⠀effects⠀the⠀scene⠀supports;⠀the⠀offer⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀and⠀the⠀work⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀result.⠀The⠀work⠀may⠀go⠀well⠀or⠀badly.⠀Pleasure,⠀plain⠀conversation,⠀and⠀private⠀ambivalence⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀insight,⠀antagonist,⠀or⠀changed⠀relationship.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀enjoy⠀a⠀meal,⠀argue⠀about⠀a⠀map,⠀or⠀feel⠀divided⠀about⠀a⠀keepsake⠀without⠀the⠀scene⠀requiring⠀a⠀revelation.\n\nKeep⠀other⠀people's⠀lives⠀independent.⠀A⠀companion⠀may⠀be⠀thinking⠀of⠀something⠀else,⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀explain,⠀or⠀may⠀act⠀from⠀a⠀motive⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀cannot⠀see.⠀The⠀narration⠀follows⠀the⠀authorized⠀perspective.⠀When⠀the⠀plan⠀changes,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀depends⠀on:⠀a⠀missing⠀supply,⠀a⠀closed⠀road,⠀a⠀skill⠀one⠀person⠀lacks,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀adventure⠀advances⠀through⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation,⠀not⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀everyone's⠀feelings.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀and⠀established⠀history⠀to⠀select⠀a⠀handoff,⠀preparation,⠀or⠀recovery⠀moment⠀within⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀bond⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀of⠀care:⠀one⠀person⠀passes⠀a⠀water⠀bottle,⠀checks⠀a⠀strap,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀remembered⠀corner,⠀or⠀returns⠀with⠀supplies.⠀The⠀same⠀familiar⠀handling⠀may⠀be⠀practical,⠀welcome,⠀or⠀privately⠀charged⠀for⠀either⠀participant.⠀Agreement⠀and⠀simple⠀enjoyment⠀remain⠀possible;⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀bond.\n\nKeep⠀capability,⠀spoken⠀communication,⠀and⠀independently⠀owned⠀memory⠀distinct.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀how⠀to⠀mend⠀the⠀gear;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀route.⠀What⠀one⠀remembers⠀about⠀the⠀shared⠀place⠀may⠀not⠀match⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀remembers.⠀Actual⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀shared⠀through⠀intimacy.⠀If⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀feels⠀a⠀rush⠀of⠀affection⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀resentment,⠀that⠀feeling⠀belongs⠀to⠀them⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀spoken⠀or⠀otherwise⠀transmitted.\n\nLet⠀work⠀finish,⠀continue⠀or⠀stay⠀pending⠀according⠀to⠀actual⠀conditions⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀The⠀handoff⠀may⠀succeed,⠀the⠀preparation⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀the⠀recovery⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀whether⠀the⠀practical⠀work⠀is⠀completed⠀or⠀still⠀underway.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changes,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀emotional⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀individually⠀owned,⠀whether⠀the⠀participants⠀agree⠀or⠀differ.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀undertaking⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀supplied⠀scale:⠀what⠀was⠀sought,⠀what⠀stood⠀in⠀the⠀way,⠀or⠀who⠀set⠀out⠀together.⠀Use⠀recurrent⠀designations⠀grounded⠀in⠀actual⠀deeds⠀rather⠀than⠀ornamental⠀epithets.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀called⠀by⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀carried,⠀the⠀route⠀they⠀knew,⠀or⠀the⠀repair⠀they⠀made.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.\n\nRecount⠀the⠀carried,⠀repaired,⠀or⠀shared⠀thing⠀and⠀the⠀work⠀behind⠀it.⠀For⠀a⠀crossing,⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀path,⠀load⠀and⠀means⠀used⠀intelligible⠀without⠀adding⠀ropes⠀or⠀helpers⠀merely⠀for⠀the⠀epic⠀form.⠀For⠀a⠀repaired⠀tool,⠀preserve⠀the⠀repair's⠀actual⠀state⠀and⠀any⠀later⠀use⠀that⠀has⠀occurred,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀completed⠀demonstration.⠀Beauty⠀or⠀reputation⠀does⠀not⠀perform⠀the⠀action;⠀the⠀material⠀contribution⠀does.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀deed⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀An⠀errand⠀remains⠀an⠀errand⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀enters⠀local⠀memory.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀public⠀language⠀coexist⠀with⠀owned⠀feeling⠀and⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀praised⠀for⠀a⠀deed⠀while⠀privately⠀remembering⠀fear,⠀reluctance,⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀motive.⠀Another⠀may⠀dispute⠀a⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀retelling.⠀Private⠀experience⠀remains⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀ceremonial⠀speech.⠀The⠀undertaking⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀essayistic⠀narrative⠀to⠀examine⠀a⠀claim⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀actually⠀makes⠀about⠀a⠀valued⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀relationship⠀involved⠀in⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Let⠀the⠀claim⠀arise⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀terms:⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀return⠀something,⠀a⠀belief⠀that⠀an⠀object⠀must⠀be⠀kept,⠀a⠀fear⠀that⠀caring⠀for⠀it⠀will⠀cost⠀too⠀much,⠀or⠀a⠀conviction⠀that⠀a⠀place⠀still⠀belongs⠀to⠀them.⠀State⠀it⠀as⠀their⠀assertion,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀moral.\n\nCompare⠀the⠀claim⠀with⠀a⠀sourced⠀observation⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀work.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀watching⠀the⠀object⠀fail,⠀from⠀a⠀record⠀or⠀map,⠀from⠀another⠀participant's⠀practical⠀report,⠀or⠀from⠀an⠀explicitly⠀imagined⠀case⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀constructs.⠀Mark⠀the⠀imagined⠀case⠀as⠀imagination.⠀Let⠀the⠀comparison⠀test⠀the⠀claim's⠀limits:⠀what⠀the⠀claim⠀depends⠀on,⠀what⠀it⠀ignores,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀changes.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀terms⠀after⠀the⠀comparison.⠀The⠀claim⠀can⠀stand,⠀narrow,⠀or⠀remain⠀provisional.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀renunciation,⠀self-correction,⠀or⠀exposure.⠀Sensation⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀remain⠀available⠀beyond⠀the⠀argument:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀pack,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀remembered⠀touch⠀of⠀a⠀person.⠀Unfinished⠀work⠀and⠀reflection⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict⠀on⠀desire.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀objective⠀remain⠀legible⠀through⠀visible⠀handling:⠀who⠀carries⠀the⠀item,⠀who⠀reaches⠀for⠀it,⠀who⠀sets⠀it⠀down,⠀who⠀returns⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀material⠀detail—a⠀worn⠀clasp,⠀a⠀familiar⠀sound,⠀a⠀familiar⠀room—can⠀suggest⠀significance⠀through⠀established⠀context⠀without⠀an⠀eroticized⠀close-up⠀or⠀a⠀sinister⠀image.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀an⠀image⠀certify⠀a⠀private⠀motive.⠀A⠀character's⠀expression,⠀a⠀held⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀may⠀attract⠀notice,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀prove⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀intent.⠀Let⠀interpretation⠀follow⠀actual⠀context,⠀communication⠀and⠀knowledge⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀narrator.⠀A⠀single⠀cue⠀may⠀support⠀a⠀fallible⠀or⠀established⠀reading⠀when⠀that⠀context⠀supports⠀it;⠀neither⠀repetition⠀nor⠀an⠀isolated⠀image⠀automatically⠀certifies⠀a⠀private⠀motive.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀nonspoken⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀regardless⠀of⠀any⠀voice-over.⠀Preserve⠀relevant⠀transfers⠀and⠀costs⠀across⠀cuts,⠀including⠀credible⠀offscreen⠀effects.⠀An⠀interval⠀may⠀remain⠀pending:⠀a⠀request⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀plan⠀incomplete,⠀a⠀relationship⠀unchanged.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀changed⠀emotional⠀state⠀at⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nChoose⠀the⠀portion⠀of⠀the⠀undertaking⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀stage⠀space.⠀Keep⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀possession,⠀and⠀reach⠀clear:⠀who⠀can⠀take⠀the⠀item,⠀who⠀blocks⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀offered⠀seat,⠀who⠀passes⠀the⠀cup.⠀Let⠀an⠀offered⠀seat,⠀a⠀passed⠀item,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀carry⠀supported⠀personal⠀meaning⠀through⠀stageable⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀explanatory⠀performance.\n\nA⠀pause⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀code⠀of⠀desire.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀hesitate⠀before⠀taking⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀set⠀it⠀down⠀carefully,⠀or⠀avoid⠀touching⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀meaning⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀established⠀context⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀silent⠀beat⠀alone.\n\nRender⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀form;⠀authorized⠀asides⠀cannot⠀replace⠀it.⠀Relevant⠀offstage⠀work⠀can⠀be⠀established⠀through⠀credible⠀reports⠀or⠀effects.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀unchanged⠀positions⠀or⠀work⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀actual⠀attention⠀braid⠀present⠀sensation,⠀remembered⠀words,⠀private⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀imagined⠀possibilities⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀The⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀rope,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀remembered⠀touch⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀pull⠀the⠀mind⠀into⠀memory⠀or⠀desire⠀or⠀ordinary⠀distraction.⠀Keep⠀the⠀undertaking⠀recoverable:⠀the⠀present⠀physical⠀task⠀remains⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀revisits.\n\nThe⠀mind⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀without⠀finding⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀or⠀changing⠀a⠀choice.⠀A⠀familiar⠀handling⠀may⠀simply⠀recur,⠀its⠀significance⠀unchanged.⠀Distinguish⠀memory⠀and⠀imagined⠀outcome⠀from⠀current⠀physical⠀facts.⠀Attraction⠀or⠀fear⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀supply⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀What⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀can⠀know⠀follows⠀actual⠀communication,⠀established⠀facts⠀and⠀any⠀access⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nKeep⠀real⠀events⠀independent⠀of⠀prose⠀length.⠀Preserve⠀direct⠀private⠀feeling⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀channel,⠀including⠀pleasure⠀without⠀self-analysis.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀for⠀a⠀genuine⠀coordination⠀need:⠀a⠀meeting⠀place,⠀a⠀shared⠀item,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀delay.⠀Keep⠀sent⠀wording,⠀receipt,⠀understanding,⠀and⠀action⠀separate.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀attachment⠀may⠀mean⠀different⠀things⠀to⠀its⠀participants⠀without⠀proving⠀hidden⠀intent.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀practical⠀address⠀that⠀another⠀reads⠀as⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀place;⠀the⠀message⠀itself⠀carries⠀only⠀what⠀it⠀transmits.\n\nComposed⠀drafts⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀imagined⠀words⠀and⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Render⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀feeling⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nUse⠀only⠀supported⠀interface⠀events:⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀confirmation⠀and⠀pending⠀requests.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀obligatory⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀ominous⠀final⠀notification.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene⠀passages,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀response⠀where⠀they⠀serve⠀actual⠀work.⠀Revisit⠀a⠀supplied⠀place,⠀item,⠀or⠀handling⠀detail⠀to⠀orient⠀continuity,⠀not⠀to⠀demand⠀new⠀meaning.⠀A⠀familiar⠀room,⠀a⠀worn⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀can⠀anchor⠀the⠀scene⠀while⠀the⠀undertaking⠀continues.⠀When⠀an⠀item⠀matters⠀to⠀a⠀handoff,⠀inspection⠀or⠀other⠀attempt,⠀establish⠀its⠀position⠀and⠀intended⠀use,⠀then⠀show⠀actual⠀handling⠀separately⠀from⠀the⠀private⠀significance⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀gives⠀it.\n\nAn⠀expression⠀may⠀attract⠀notice⠀but⠀cannot⠀certify⠀affection,⠀deception,⠀or⠀a⠀route⠀flag.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀response⠀register⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices—a⠀glance,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀particular⠀touch—without⠀making⠀it⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀The⠀same⠀practical⠀gesture⠀may⠀retain⠀or⠀acquire⠀intimate⠀significance⠀through⠀owned⠀memory⠀and⠀context,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀illustrated⠀expression⠀alone.\n\nPreserve⠀developed⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀even⠀if⠀conduct⠀is⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀ongoing⠀effort⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀answer⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀reveal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nReenter⠀through⠀actual⠀work⠀and⠀the⠀established⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀item⠀or⠀relationship.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀was⠀handled,⠀spent,⠀repaired,⠀promised,⠀or⠀left⠀pending.⠀Later⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀rewrite⠀earlier⠀events⠀or⠀motives:⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀broke⠀a⠀clasp⠀in⠀one⠀installment,⠀the⠀clasp⠀remains⠀broken⠀until⠀repaired;⠀if⠀they⠀promised⠀to⠀return,⠀preserve⠀that⠀statement⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀happens⠀to⠀its⠀obligation,⠀whether⠀fulfilled,⠀withdrawn⠀or⠀changed⠀through⠀an⠀established⠀agreement.\n\nA⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀memory⠀may⠀accompany⠀ordinary⠀maintenance,⠀rest,⠀or⠀travel⠀without⠀becoming⠀foreshadowing.⠀The⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀handle,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀remembered⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀gift⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀itself.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀be⠀present⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀new⠀emotional⠀development⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence⠀on⠀every⠀return.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀independent⠀other⠀lives.⠀Allow⠀durable⠀gains⠀and⠀unchanged⠀attachment⠀without⠀betrayal,⠀loss,⠀or⠀a⠀result⠀quota.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀emotional⠀strain⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀admission⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀objective:⠀someone⠀asks⠀for⠀passage,⠀supplies,⠀labor,⠀trust,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀help,⠀and⠀the⠀answer⠀matters⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀attempted⠀next.⠀Let⠀plain⠀wording⠀and⠀practical⠀detail⠀make⠀the⠀ordinary⠀assumption⠀inside⠀that⠀request⠀available,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀narratorial⠀explanation⠀or⠀excluding⠀a⠀meaningful⠀private⠀account.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀take⠀for⠀granted⠀that⠀help⠀is⠀owed,⠀that⠀refusal⠀is⠀shameful,⠀that⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀beneath⠀someone,⠀or⠀that⠀need⠀must⠀be⠀hidden⠀until⠀it⠀becomes⠀impossible⠀to⠀hide.\n\nRender⠀the⠀cost⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀before,⠀during,⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀long⠀or⠀confessional;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀a⠀sensation⠀of⠀exposure,⠀a⠀calculation⠀of⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀lost,⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀the⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀say.⠀Keep⠀that⠀interiority⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀viewpoint;⠀narration⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀participants,⠀whose⠀access⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀and⠀established⠀circumstances.⠀Let⠀the⠀spoken⠀answer⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀differ⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀a⠀supported⠀reason⠀to⠀conceal,⠀soften,⠀or⠀delay⠀the⠀truth;⠀they⠀may⠀also⠀align⠀completely.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀an⠀accusation,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship.⠀The⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀granted⠀and⠀still⠀cost⠀something;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀refused⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀refuser⠀cruel;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀withdrawn⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀objective⠀harder.⠀Carry⠀any⠀actual⠀consequence⠀into⠀the⠀undertaking⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀change⠀a⠀practical⠀option.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀leave⠀work⠀completed,⠀continuing,⠀or⠀pending,⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀of⠀asking,⠀refusing,⠀or⠀admitting⠀need⠀remains⠀particular.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀interval⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀scene⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀readable⠀paragraphing.⠀Begin⠀from⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract:⠀preserve⠀the⠀established⠀positions,⠀available⠀means,⠀and⠀ownership⠀of⠀each⠀participant.⠀Let⠀the⠀objective⠀stay⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do⠀now,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀crossing⠀a⠀place,⠀preparing⠀equipment,⠀persuading⠀a⠀local⠀contact,⠀or⠀deciding⠀who⠀will⠀go⠀first.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀accepted⠀assumption⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀encounter,⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀asks⠀for⠀or⠀does⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀their⠀character.⠀The⠀interval⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀a⠀fresh⠀assumption⠀or⠀social⠀discrepancy.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀assume⠀a⠀door⠀will⠀be⠀opened⠀for⠀them,⠀another⠀that⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀too⠀low⠀for⠀them,⠀another⠀that⠀a⠀refusal⠀would⠀be⠀worse⠀than⠀the⠀danger.⠀Show⠀that⠀assumption⠀in⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀the⠀request,⠀the⠀order⠀given,⠀the⠀thing⠀left⠀for⠀someone⠀else⠀to⠀carry,⠀or⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀asked.⠀Keep⠀the⠀observation⠀plain⠀and⠀local,⠀allowing⠀actual⠀private⠀explanation⠀or⠀purposeful⠀spoken⠀clarification⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀generalized⠀lecture.\n\nGive⠀each⠀participant⠀a⠀purpose⠀that⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀purpose.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀cooperate⠀sincerely,⠀bargain,⠀refuse,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀attend⠀to⠀a⠀separate⠀obligation.⠀Let⠀private⠀interpretation⠀remain⠀owned⠀and⠀fallible;⠀the⠀narration⠀distinguishes⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀thinks⠀another⠀meant⠀from⠀the⠀other's⠀actual⠀feeling,⠀revealing⠀either⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract⠀permit⠀it.⠀A⠀straightforward⠀answer,⠀continued⠀effort,⠀or⠀pending⠀request⠀can⠀end⠀the⠀interval⠀without⠀exposing⠀a⠀hypocrisy⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀moral⠀turn.⠀Leave⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Where⠀an⠀actual⠀procedure,⠀shared⠀task,⠀or⠀conventional⠀answer⠀affects⠀passage,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀resources,⠀make⠀that⠀arrangement⠀concrete⠀without⠀requiring⠀one⠀at⠀every⠀stage:⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀hiring⠀practice,⠀a⠀distribution⠀of⠀supplies,⠀a⠀rule⠀about⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀a⠀customary⠀fee,⠀or⠀a⠀promised⠀escort.⠀Present⠀the⠀stated⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀words⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀institution⠀that⠀maintains⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀procedure⠀actually⠀permits⠀or⠀requires⠀through⠀concrete⠀conduct.\n\nSet⠀the⠀stated⠀purpose⠀and⠀the⠀observable⠀operation⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀without⠀a⠀narrator's⠀closing⠀verdict.⠀A⠀gatekeeper⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀rule⠀protects⠀travelers⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀who⠀is⠀waved⠀through⠀and⠀who⠀must⠀wait.⠀A⠀leader⠀may⠀call⠀a⠀task⠀shared⠀while⠀the⠀work⠀falls⠀unevenly.⠀A⠀contact⠀may⠀promise⠀guidance⠀while⠀the⠀route⠀he⠀actually⠀offers⠀serves⠀another⠀interest.⠀Let⠀agreement⠀or⠀discrepancy⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀satire⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀whole⠀community⠀cruel.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀comply⠀without⠀agreement,⠀help⠀sincerely,⠀or⠀question⠀an⠀assumption⠀while⠀others⠀continue⠀as⠀before.⠀The⠀adventure⠀objective⠀remains⠀active:⠀after⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀is⠀shown,⠀the⠀cast⠀still⠀acts⠀on⠀what⠀it⠀permits⠀or⠀blocks.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀workable⠀route,⠀a⠀new⠀obstacle,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀but⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀general⠀lesson⠀about⠀society.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀physical⠀work⠀the⠀objective⠀depends⠀on:⠀lifting,⠀hauling,⠀climbing,⠀repairing,⠀waiting⠀in⠀bad⠀weather,⠀or⠀moving⠀through⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀resists⠀passage.⠀Name⠀the⠀material⠀particulars⠀that⠀cost⠀effort⠀or⠀risk:⠀the⠀weight,⠀the⠀worn⠀strap,⠀the⠀wet⠀stone,⠀the⠀failing⠀light,⠀the⠀load⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀divided.⠀Let⠀the⠀words⠀used⠀to⠀assign⠀the⠀task⠀sit⠀beside⠀what⠀doing⠀it⠀actually⠀involves.⠀A⠀superior⠀may⠀call⠀it⠀a⠀simple⠀carry⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀distance,⠀the⠀injured⠀hand,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀expected⠀to⠀help.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀roughness⠀or⠀injury⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀moral⠀seriousness.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀be⠀hard-edged⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀callous⠀or⠀every⠀effort⠀futile.⠀Preserve⠀accurate⠀reasons,⠀genuine⠀assistance,⠀and⠀supported⠀unfairness.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀helps,⠀show⠀the⠀help⠀as⠀concrete⠀work;⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀refuses,⠀show⠀the⠀refusal⠀in⠀action⠀or⠀plain⠀speech⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀narrator's⠀judgment.\n\nGive⠀actual⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀reasoning⠀enough⠀room⠀under⠀the⠀compression.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀justified⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀calculating⠀a⠀route,⠀weighing⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀recognizing⠀what⠀an⠀instruction⠀assumes.⠀Keep⠀that⠀thought⠀owned⠀and⠀specific.⠀Material⠀pressure⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀wound⠀or⠀a⠀tactical⠀payoff⠀from⠀every⠀reflection.⠀Keep⠀the⠀undertaking's⠀actual⠀state⠀clear⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary:⠀an⠀effort⠀may⠀be⠀completed,⠀continuing,⠀unsuccessful,⠀or⠀waiting⠀on⠀another⠀response,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀arrival,⠀loss,⠀or⠀discovery.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀setting-supported⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀passage,⠀a⠀supply⠀list,⠀a⠀report⠀from⠀a⠀scout,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀letter⠀of⠀introduction,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀at⠀a⠀rendezvous,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀agreed.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀grant⠀access,⠀report⠀a⠀condition,⠀preserve⠀a⠀personal⠀account,⠀or⠀leave⠀existing⠀possibilities⠀unchanged.⠀Keep⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀undertaking⠀intelligible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀effect⠀from⠀every⠀record.\n\nLet⠀a⠀conventional⠀phrase⠀reveal⠀the⠀writer's⠀position⠀without⠀assuming⠀deception.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀polite⠀formula⠀that⠀takes⠀the⠀recipient's⠀compliance⠀for⠀granted.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀obstacle⠀as⠀minor⠀because⠀the⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀cross⠀it.⠀A⠀receipt⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀payment⠀without⠀recording⠀the⠀labor⠀that⠀produced⠀it.⠀Show⠀that⠀assumption⠀through⠀the⠀document's⠀wording,⠀omissions,⠀and⠀practical⠀focus⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀accusation.\n\nCompare⠀a⠀record's⠀intended⠀use⠀with⠀its⠀actual⠀delivery⠀and⠀response.⠀The⠀next⠀document⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀request⠀granted,⠀refused,⠀misunderstood,⠀or⠀answered⠀too⠀late.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀reach⠀someone⠀who⠀lacks⠀the⠀means⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it.⠀A⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀fulfilled⠀accurately.⠀Keep⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀document:⠀what⠀a⠀writer⠀records⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀whole⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀thought⠀or⠀felt.⠀Documentary⠀gaps⠀need⠀no⠀manufactured⠀scandal⠀to⠀sustain⠀the⠀objective;⠀the⠀task⠀can⠀advance⠀through⠀ordinary⠀delay,⠀partial⠀information,⠀or⠀a⠀plainly⠀worded⠀refusal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nPlace⠀comfort⠀inside⠀the⠀undertaking⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀actually⠀offered:⠀food,⠀rest,⠀shared⠀equipment,⠀a⠀clear⠀explanation,⠀a⠀dry⠀place⠀to⠀wait,⠀or⠀company⠀during⠀an⠀unpleasant⠀task.⠀Show⠀the⠀care⠀through⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀warmth.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀attend⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀experiences:⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀the⠀food,⠀the⠀relief⠀of⠀sitting⠀down,⠀the⠀usefulness⠀of⠀the⠀borrowed⠀tool,⠀the⠀ease⠀of⠀being⠀addressed⠀without⠀demand.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀care⠀plain⠀and⠀specific.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀someone⠀remembered⠀how⠀they⠀take⠀their⠀tea,⠀that⠀a⠀guide⠀repeats⠀directions⠀slowly,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀companion⠀carries⠀the⠀heavier⠀load⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀recipient's⠀response⠀remain⠀their⠀own.⠀They⠀may⠀accept⠀without⠀gratitude,⠀refuse⠀without⠀offense,⠀or⠀take⠀the⠀help⠀while⠀still⠀disagreeing⠀with⠀the⠀helper.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀repaired⠀outlook,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀how⠀grateful⠀someone⠀should⠀be.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀objective⠀and⠀its⠀genuine⠀limits,⠀including⠀whatever⠀supplies,⠀time,⠀or⠀difficult⠀conditions⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀establishes.⠀Do⠀not⠀deplete⠀resources⠀or⠀end⠀rest⠀simply⠀to⠀balance⠀a⠀comfortable⠀moment.⠀Kindness⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀a⠀trap⠀or⠀prove⠀moral⠀superiority;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀could⠀offer.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀in⠀continued⠀ease,⠀pending⠀work,⠀or⠀renewed⠀activity⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀next⠀step⠀or⠀improved⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀connect⠀a⠀practical⠀undertaking⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀arrangements⠀within⠀which⠀its⠀participants⠀interpret⠀their⠀choices.⠀Begin⠀from⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀in⠀the⠀adventure:⠀a⠀person⠀asks⠀for⠀work,⠀pays⠀a⠀fee,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀gate,⠀accepts⠀an⠀order,⠀or⠀is⠀refused⠀a⠀place.⠀Then⠀widen,⠀under⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access,⠀into⠀the⠀relevant⠀history,⠀public⠀role,⠀or⠀convention⠀that⠀makes⠀that⠀act⠀seem⠀normal:⠀how⠀the⠀route⠀has⠀long⠀been⠀controlled,⠀what⠀a⠀title⠀or⠀uniform⠀is⠀taken⠀to⠀mean,⠀why⠀a⠀particular⠀task⠀is⠀assigned⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀kind⠀of⠀person.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀widened⠀explanation⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀an⠀actor's⠀private⠀interpretation⠀and⠀from⠀actual⠀effects.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀frame⠀the⠀convention⠀through⠀social⠀context⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀a⠀character's⠀own⠀thought⠀remains⠀that⠀character's⠀thought,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀still⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀convention⠀actually⠀permits⠀or⠀blocks.⠀A⠀rule⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀as⠀customary⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀shows⠀it⠀working⠀unevenly;⠀a⠀position⠀may⠀be⠀honored⠀in⠀public⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀holding⠀it⠀acts⠀from⠀private⠀fear⠀or⠀advantage.\n\nReturn⠀orientation⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀undertaking⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀wider⠀account⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀fresh⠀act⠀or⠀decision.⠀The⠀social⠀frame⠀may⠀clarify⠀why⠀a⠀person⠀acts⠀within⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀works⠀around⠀it,⠀or⠀continues⠀an⠀existing⠀task.⠀A⠀thought,⠀request,⠀or⠀practical⠀effort⠀may⠀remain⠀pending⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀every⠀speaker⠀elaborate⠀diction⠀or⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀collective⠀indictment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nPlace⠀the⠀telling⠀within⠀the⠀present⠀journey:⠀a⠀halt⠀for⠀rest,⠀a⠀wait⠀for⠀passage,⠀shared⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀cooperation.⠀Identify⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listeners,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀do⠀in⠀that⠀moment—secure⠀help,⠀justify⠀a⠀route,⠀pass⠀time,⠀or⠀explain⠀why⠀an⠀earlier⠀attempt⠀failed.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀remains⠀an⠀adventure⠀scene;⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀present⠀objective.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀expose⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀When⠀they⠀describe⠀who⠀was⠀expected⠀to⠀carry,⠀wait,⠀pay,⠀speak,⠀or⠀go⠀without,⠀let⠀the⠀particulars⠀convey⠀the⠀assumption;⠀an⠀actual⠀private⠀explanation⠀or⠀purposeful⠀spoken⠀clarification⠀may⠀also⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀they⠀include⠀without⠀question⠀and⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀accept⠀that⠀assumption,⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀or⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀practical⠀point⠀of⠀access,⠀cost,⠀or⠀sequence.⠀The⠀interruption⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀listener's⠀present⠀purpose,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀lesson⠀the⠀tale⠀must⠀deliver.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀checked⠀against⠀the⠀present⠀world.⠀A⠀named⠀place,⠀a⠀repeated⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀material⠀shortage⠀can⠀later⠀be⠀recognized⠀by⠀a⠀listener⠀or⠀encountered⠀on⠀the⠀route.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀offer⠀useful⠀experience⠀or⠀an⠀uncertain⠀claim.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners⠀consider⠀its⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀present⠀relevance,⠀with⠀verification⠀when⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀undertaking⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀test⠀after⠀every⠀account.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀participants⠀knew⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀add⠀a⠀later⠀explanation,⠀but⠀the⠀narrated⠀events⠀should⠀not⠀silently⠀acquire⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀with⠀the⠀listeners'⠀practical⠀situation⠀changed⠀or⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀produce⠀agreement,⠀refusal,⠀partial⠀trust,⠀or⠀no⠀decision⠀at⠀all;⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀storytelling⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀leaves⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀unchanged.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀undertaking⠀through⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀the⠀cast⠀could⠀credibly⠀possess⠀or⠀encounter:⠀a⠀route⠀order,⠀a⠀work⠀regulation,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀log,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀posted⠀notice,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀map⠀annotation.⠀Give⠀the⠀record⠀a⠀source,⠀date,⠀and⠀purpose.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀lost⠀document⠀that⠀appears⠀solely⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀present;⠀the⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete,⠀ordinary,⠀or⠀only⠀partly⠀relevant.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀record⠀beside⠀present⠀material⠀use.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀follows⠀an⠀old⠀instruction,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀instruction⠀assumes⠀about⠀terrain,⠀tools,⠀labor,⠀weather,⠀or⠀authority,⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀attempt⠀actually⠀requires.⠀The⠀relation⠀may⠀agree,⠀diverge,⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀A⠀discrepancy⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀a⠀hidden⠀crime;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀conditions,⠀a⠀different⠀local⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀record.\n\nDistinguish⠀three⠀layers⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀record⠀states⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀recorded,⠀which⠀may⠀include⠀a⠀purpose,⠀instruction,⠀observation,⠀or⠀claim.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀how⠀the⠀practice⠀was⠀actually⠀carried⠀out.⠀The⠀current⠀participants⠀can⠀observe⠀what⠀now⠀exists⠀or⠀what⠀now⠀fails.⠀Let⠀each⠀layer⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀speaker⠀and⠀limits.⠀Keep⠀the⠀origin⠀of⠀a⠀memory⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀record:⠀a⠀recollection⠀derived⠀from⠀reading⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀independent⠀source,⠀while⠀firsthand⠀memory⠀may⠀support⠀it⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀incomplete.⠀Present⠀observation⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀recover⠀every⠀earlier⠀intention.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀accepted⠀assumption⠀inside⠀the⠀inherited⠀arrangement.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀treat⠀an⠀old⠀rule⠀as⠀natural,⠀repeat⠀its⠀phrasing,⠀or⠀expect⠀another⠀person⠀to⠀obey⠀it⠀without⠀question.⠀Show⠀that⠀acceptance⠀through⠀ordinary⠀conduct⠀and⠀speech.⠀The⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀that⠀the⠀arrangement⠀is⠀unjust⠀or⠀obsolete;⠀the⠀comparison⠀between⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀lived⠀work⠀makes⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀available.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀objective⠀and⠀available⠀means⠀legible.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀inform⠀passage,⠀supply,⠀labor,⠀or⠀cooperation,⠀confirm⠀existing⠀understanding,⠀or⠀retain⠀personal⠀significance⠀without⠀changing⠀a⠀decision.⠀A⠀useful⠀document⠀can⠀be⠀imperfect⠀and⠀a⠀harmful⠀arrangement⠀can⠀still⠀offer⠀a⠀route.⠀Participants⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀information⠀actually⠀available⠀with⠀its⠀uncertainty⠀intact,⠀without⠀completing⠀a⠀required⠀verification⠀exercise.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀inherited⠀authority⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀needs⠀of⠀the⠀journey:⠀passage,⠀shelter,⠀tools,⠀labor,⠀supplies,⠀or⠀permission⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀place.⠀Establish⠀what⠀the⠀authority⠀actually⠀controls⠀before⠀it⠀matters.⠀A⠀gate,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀work⠀crew,⠀a⠀fuel⠀store,⠀or⠀a⠀signature⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀claim⠀tangible.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀supernatural⠀powers,⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀institution,⠀or⠀a⠀secret⠀hierarchy⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap;⠀the⠀power⠀is⠀whatever⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits.\n\nShow⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀request.⠀Someone⠀asks⠀to⠀pass,⠀borrow,⠀work,⠀or⠀be⠀excused,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀reveals⠀what⠀each⠀participant⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation:⠀a⠀polite⠀phrase,⠀a⠀lowered⠀expectation,⠀a⠀customary⠀payment,⠀or⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀order⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀arrangement⠀more⠀sharply⠀than⠀an⠀argument.⠀Courtesy⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀deceit.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀comply⠀sincerely,⠀refuse⠀openly,⠀or⠀help⠀within⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement.\n\nGive⠀the⠀exchange⠀intimate⠀material⠀texture.⠀Attend⠀to⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀wear⠀on⠀clothing,⠀the⠀quality⠀of⠀the⠀light,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀cost⠀of⠀waiting⠀or⠀working.⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀causal⠀information.⠀A⠀damaged⠀lock,⠀a⠀stained⠀ledger,⠀or⠀a⠀cold⠀waiting⠀room⠀matters⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀function⠀and⠀history,⠀not⠀through⠀mood⠀alone.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀social⠀performance.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀demand⠀outwardly⠀while⠀privately⠀measuring⠀its⠀cost,⠀or⠀may⠀refuse⠀without⠀narrating⠀a⠀complete⠀moral⠀position.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire,⠀resentment,⠀relief,⠀or⠀calculation⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Trusted⠀company⠀may⠀allow⠀a⠀mask⠀to⠀fall,⠀but⠀the⠀fall⠀is⠀not⠀compulsory⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀produce⠀confession⠀or⠀alliance.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀adventure's⠀contingency.⠀The⠀old⠀arrangement⠀may⠀block⠀one⠀route,⠀open⠀another,⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀condition⠀the⠀cast⠀must⠀work⠀around.⠀Sincere⠀aid⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀refusal⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀someone⠀with⠀no⠀authority⠀at⠀all.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀system⠀more⠀intelligible⠀while⠀leaving⠀its⠀human⠀costs⠀concrete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀narration⠀for⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Let⠀an⠀authorized⠀participant⠀recount⠀what⠀they⠀did,⠀received,⠀carried,⠀refused,⠀or⠀were⠀asked⠀to⠀do.⠀The⠀testimony⠀has⠀an⠀occasion⠀and⠀an⠀audience,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀audience⠀is⠀only⠀implied⠀by⠀the⠀form:⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀deposition,⠀a⠀letter⠀home,⠀an⠀oral⠀account⠀to⠀a⠀companion,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀self-account.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀testimony's⠀author⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀contract⠀requires⠀it;⠀the⠀testimony⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.\n\nDistinguish⠀firsthand⠀experience⠀from⠀reports⠀and⠀later⠀judgment.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀\"I⠀saw,\"⠀\"I⠀was⠀told,\"⠀or⠀\"I⠀now⠀think,\"⠀keep⠀those⠀sources⠀separate.⠀A⠀plain⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀work⠀may⠀support⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀narrator's⠀explanation.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀moral⠀discovery;⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀remain⠀partial,⠀self-justifying,⠀or⠀simply⠀practical.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ordinary⠀assumptions⠀appear⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀What⠀the⠀narrator⠀treats⠀as⠀natural—who⠀should⠀wait,⠀who⠀should⠀carry,⠀who⠀should⠀be⠀thanked,⠀who⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀questioned—can⠀be⠀shown⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀works⠀here:⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀customary⠀division⠀of⠀labor⠀exposes⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀more⠀effectively⠀than⠀an⠀announced⠀verdict.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀adventure⠀objective⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀testimony.⠀The⠀account⠀should⠀include⠀the⠀actual⠀obstacles,⠀attempts,⠀and⠀consequences,⠀not⠀only⠀reflection.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀plan⠀depended⠀on,⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀changed,⠀and⠀how⠀competence,⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀improvisation⠀affected⠀the⠀next⠀opportunity.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀wrong⠀about⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀or⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀a⠀failure;⠀the⠀testimony⠀records⠀their⠀understanding,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀testimony⠀to⠀be⠀situated⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀the⠀only⠀possible⠀account.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀later⠀contradict⠀or⠀complicate⠀it⠀through⠀action⠀or⠀speech.⠀The⠀present⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀every⠀discrepancy,⠀but⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀testifying⠀voice⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀establishes⠀should⠀remain⠀available,⠀whether⠀the⠀two⠀agree,⠀differ,⠀or⠀address⠀separate⠀matters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀adventure⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀content⠀clear:⠀who⠀needs⠀what,⠀what⠀is⠀available,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀current⠀undertaking⠀requires.⠀Render⠀private⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀causal⠀point,⠀including⠀thought⠀before⠀a⠀chosen⠀request⠀or⠀action,⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀public-before-private⠀sequence.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀clean,⠀particular⠀language,⠀distinguishing⠀a⠀response⠀to⠀something⠀already⠀perceived⠀from⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀precedes⠀their⠀own⠀next⠀contribution.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal⠀through⠀a⠀memory,⠀an⠀expectation,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀they⠀repeat⠀to⠀themselves.⠀The⠀assumption⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary⠀rather⠀than⠀dramatic:⠀that⠀one⠀should⠀not⠀ask⠀twice,⠀that⠀a⠀superior's⠀time⠀is⠀more⠀valuable,⠀that⠀a⠀debt⠀must⠀be⠀repaid⠀before⠀help⠀can⠀be⠀accepted,⠀or⠀that⠀silence⠀is⠀safer⠀than⠀complaint.⠀Let⠀the⠀assumption⠀appear⠀through⠀this⠀person's⠀actual⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀exchange,⠀including⠀any⠀explicit⠀reasoning⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀them,⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀their⠀experience⠀with⠀an⠀impersonal⠀social⠀thesis.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀inward⠀passage⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character.⠀Another⠀character's⠀motive⠀remains⠀unknown⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀misread⠀the⠀exchange,⠀notice⠀an⠀implication,⠀or⠀respond⠀at⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀level.⠀A⠀memory⠀or⠀embarrassment⠀can⠀matter⠀without⠀establishing⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀intended.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀undertaking⠀with⠀practical⠀means⠀clear.⠀The⠀inward⠀turn⠀should⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀reflection.⠀Keep⠀the⠀next⠀available⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀orientable,⠀whether⠀the⠀person⠀acts,⠀continues⠀waiting,⠀or⠀leaves⠀the⠀thought⠀and⠀response⠀unfinished.⠀Direct⠀speech,⠀useful⠀help,⠀and⠀an⠀unfinished⠀private⠀question⠀can⠀all⠀remain⠀present.⠀The⠀adventure⠀continues⠀on⠀the⠀basis⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀do,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀resolution.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀particular.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀courtesy⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀institution⠀more⠀sharply⠀than⠀an⠀argument.⠀The⠀language⠀can⠀remain⠀clean⠀and⠀particular⠀while⠀feeling⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀person,⠀including⠀tenderness,⠀pain,⠀or⠀an⠀unsettled⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀and⠀nonlinear⠀narration⠀for⠀the⠀undertaking.⠀Revisit⠀an⠀established⠀act⠀or⠀instruction⠀through⠀differently⠀situated⠀accounts.⠀The⠀same⠀event⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀rescue⠀to⠀one⠀participant,⠀an⠀inconvenience⠀to⠀another,⠀a⠀duty⠀to⠀a⠀third,⠀and⠀a⠀rumor⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀present.⠀Each⠀account⠀has⠀a⠀clear⠀speaker,⠀position,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀telling.⠀Do⠀not⠀merge⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀collective⠀voice⠀or⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary.\n\nKeep⠀event⠀time⠀and⠀telling⠀time⠀distinct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recount⠀the⠀act⠀later,⠀after⠀learning⠀its⠀consequences,⠀or⠀while⠀still⠀uncertain⠀about⠀what⠀happened.⠀Mark⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀tense,⠀framing,⠀or⠀explicit⠀reference.⠀Later⠀knowledge⠀does⠀not⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀event.⠀A⠀retrospective⠀account⠀may⠀interpret,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀silently⠀supply⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nLet⠀plain⠀material⠀details⠀expose⠀what⠀each⠀participant⠀took⠀for⠀granted.⠀One⠀account⠀mentions⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀cart,⠀another⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀expected⠀to⠀wait,⠀another⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀names⠀were⠀called.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀works⠀through⠀these⠀ordinary⠀inclusions.⠀The⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀announce⠀that⠀the⠀assumptions⠀conflict;⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀makes⠀the⠀difference⠀available.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Use⠀attributed⠀reports⠀where⠀direct⠀private⠀access⠀is⠀unavailable.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀describe⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀did⠀without⠀knowing⠀why.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀accounts,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀grant⠀one⠀speaker⠀access⠀to⠀another's⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀Agreement⠀is⠀as⠀possible⠀as⠀contradiction;⠀polyphony⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀account⠀to⠀be⠀unreliable⠀or⠀every⠀public⠀explanation⠀to⠀be⠀false.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀adventure⠀objective⠀intelligible⠀across⠀the⠀shifts.⠀An⠀account⠀may⠀clarify⠀the⠀undertaking,⠀sustain⠀an⠀established⠀view,⠀or⠀render⠀a⠀person's⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀insight.⠀Keep⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀ongoing⠀journey⠀legible⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀an⠀advance⠀or⠀complication⠀from⠀every⠀voice.⠀A⠀nonlinear⠀arrangement⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀puzzle⠀to⠀be⠀solved⠀before⠀the⠀story⠀can⠀continue.⠀The⠀present⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀cast⠀acting⠀on⠀one⠀account,⠀disputing⠀another,⠀or⠀proceeding⠀without⠀a⠀settled⠀version.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀the⠀current⠀objective,⠀the⠀people⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀relevant⠀objects⠀or⠀terrain⠀before⠀an⠀attempted⠀action⠀depends⠀on⠀them.⠀When⠀an⠀object,⠀route,⠀or⠀contact⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀understandable⠀through⠀supported⠀explanation,⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use;⠀a⠀needed⠀planning⠀or⠀coordination⠀explanation⠀may⠀precede⠀handling.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀a⠀new⠀room,⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀road,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀weather,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀outside⠀to⠀inside⠀should⠀be⠀marked⠀by⠀a⠀clear⠀paragraph⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail.\n\nMove⠀among⠀actual⠀work,⠀individual⠀speech,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀contain⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀a⠀brief⠀inward⠀reaction,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀stay⠀with⠀one⠀element⠀for⠀several⠀sentences.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀thought-length⠀cap⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀reaction⠀beat⠀after⠀every⠀line.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀response⠀have⠀its⠀needed⠀place⠀and⠀development,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀it⠀changes⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀gives⠀the⠀reader⠀a⠀new⠀interpretation.\n\nMake⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀procedure⠀understandable⠀through⠀supported⠀explanation,⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀attempted⠀use⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀relevant.⠀Where⠀the⠀procedure⠀is⠀attempted,⠀concrete⠀handling⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀effect⠀can⠀clarify⠀it.⠀Elsewhere,⠀a⠀person's⠀relevant⠀explanation⠀or⠀preparation⠀can⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀attempt⠀would⠀require⠀without⠀first⠀performing⠀it.⠀Keep⠀accepted⠀explanations⠀open⠀to⠀ordinary⠀confirmation⠀or⠀correction.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀follow⠀an⠀instruction⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀normal,⠀question⠀it⠀when⠀it⠀fails,⠀or⠀be⠀corrected⠀by⠀someone⠀with⠀more⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀joke,⠀cruel⠀setback,⠀or⠀reveal⠀at⠀each⠀boundary.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀instruction⠀assumes.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀that⠀they⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀heaviest⠀load,⠀wait⠀outside,⠀speak⠀last,⠀or⠀pay⠀before⠀asking.⠀Show⠀the⠀assumption⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀it⠀receives.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀remains⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀and⠀circumstances;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀lecture⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀humiliation⠀in⠀every⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀adventure⠀objective⠀operative.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀legible:⠀the⠀cast⠀moves,⠀waits,⠀rechecks,⠀or⠀changes⠀the⠀plan.⠀Readability⠀means⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue,⠀not⠀that⠀every⠀difficulty⠀is⠀resolved⠀or⠀every⠀exchange⠀produces⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nKeep⠀the⠀objective⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀obstacle⠀clear,⠀then⠀let⠀one⠀concrete⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀work⠀recur⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator's⠀attention:⠀a⠀rope,⠀a⠀repeated⠀instruction,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀stain⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀Return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀events⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀bring⠀it⠀back,⠀carrying⠀changed⠀or⠀continuing⠀meaning.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀apt,⠀useful,⠀questioned,⠀or⠀morally⠀significant⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀without⠀becoming⠀an⠀automatic⠀verdict⠀about⠀the⠀world.\n\nDevelop⠀rhythm⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀accepted⠀words⠀and⠀lived⠀work.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀spoken⠀plainly,⠀then⠀echoed⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀perception⠀of⠀the⠀task,⠀then⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀effort⠀or⠀failure.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀carry⠀the⠀strain:⠀a⠀long⠀sentence⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀hauling,⠀searching,⠀or⠀waiting;⠀a⠀short⠀clause⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀plan⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀every⠀paragraph.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀feeling⠀its⠀full⠀extent⠀without⠀making⠀other⠀speakers⠀adopt⠀the⠀figurative⠀register.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀companion's⠀ordinary⠀answer⠀through⠀the⠀recurring⠀image,⠀but⠀the⠀companion⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀that⠀association.⠀Social⠀meaning⠀can⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal:⠀an⠀instruction⠀repeated⠀without⠀question,⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀accepted⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀route.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀disillusionment.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀cost⠀and⠀the⠀continuation⠀together,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀work⠀resumed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaaapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Action⠀/⠀Adventure⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀a⠀concrete⠀return⠀to⠀approach⠀what⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀same⠀route,⠀a⠀familiar⠀task,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀helped,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀still⠀carried⠀for⠀the⠀journey.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀effort⠀touch⠀the⠀memory⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀announcement⠀of⠀loss.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀road⠀is⠀narrower,⠀that⠀a⠀companion⠀now⠀does⠀the⠀work⠀the⠀narrator⠀once⠀did,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀instruction⠀is⠀repeated⠀without⠀the⠀same⠀confidence.\n\nKeep⠀personal⠀longing⠀distinct⠀from⠀evidence⠀about⠀another⠀person's⠀intent.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀miss⠀an⠀earlier⠀arrangement⠀while⠀recognizing,⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it,⠀that⠀a⠀companion⠀is⠀tired⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀was⠀understood⠀differently.⠀Silence⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀either⠀person's⠀private⠀state.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀reflective⠀mood⠀convert⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀into⠀a⠀social⠀verdict.⠀A⠀participant⠀can⠀value⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀question,⠀or⠀find⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀expectation⠀confirmed⠀by⠀present⠀conduct.\n\nLet⠀effective⠀work,⠀current⠀pleasure,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀coexist.⠀The⠀objective⠀may⠀advance;⠀a⠀meal⠀may⠀be⠀good;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀offer⠀practical⠀help.⠀The⠀reflective⠀passage⠀can⠀hold⠀these⠀together⠀without⠀requiring