            "name": "<Init: Writing Recipes: Character Drama>",
            "content": "{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @section-header true }}{{// @header <Init: Writing Recipes: Character Drama> }}{{trim}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-character_drama-01",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Character Drama · 01/06",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == character_drama}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Character Drama. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 1 of 6. }}{{// Source group: recipes-character_drama; payload preserved. }}{{// Recipe Library: Character Drama }}\n{{setvar::NPabaaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nFollow⠀a⠀difficult⠀request,⠀admission,⠀refusal⠀or⠀return⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀stay⠀inside⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀speak⠀or⠀wait⠀for⠀an⠀answer.⠀Keep⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀who⠀heard⠀it⠀distinguishable⠀while⠀following⠀the⠀speaker's⠀or⠀listener's⠀attention⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀causal⠀order,⠀including⠀private⠀experience⠀before⠀speech.⠀An⠀interruption⠀can⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀word,⠀a⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀an⠀old⠀wound,⠀or⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀patience,⠀but⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀reliable⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Distinguish⠀delivered⠀speech⠀from⠀received⠀meaning⠀while⠀allowing⠀them⠀to⠀align:⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀meant⠀something⠀milder,⠀sharper,⠀or⠀more⠀practical,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀line⠀or⠀action⠀may⠀clarify⠀it⠀without⠀erasing⠀the⠀first⠀response.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀pain⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀A⠀clear⠀answer⠀can⠀remain⠀costly,⠀and⠀sincere⠀help⠀can⠀stand⠀even⠀while⠀one⠀person⠀feels⠀exposed.⠀Let⠀warmth⠀and⠀resentment⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀exchange⠀when⠀the⠀characters⠀do.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀register,⠀and⠀keep⠀private⠀interpretation⠀out⠀of⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀automatically⠀know⠀or⠀display.⠀Develop⠀emotional⠀strain⠀through⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀any⠀effects⠀on⠀conduct,⠀attention⠀or⠀wording,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀outward⠀display⠀or⠀relying⠀on⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nResolve⠀submitted⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person⠀and⠀character-ownership⠀contract,⠀writing⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀speaker⠀attribution⠀and⠀enough⠀surrounding⠀action⠀that⠀each⠀line⠀arrives⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀and⠀activity.⠀Keep⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀actually⠀been⠀offered,⠀asked⠀or⠀heard⠀legible⠀alongside⠀their⠀attention,⠀without⠀forcing⠀public⠀speech⠀to⠀precede⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀that⠀may⠀motivate⠀it.⠀A⠀distracting⠀sound,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀recollection,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀the⠀announced⠀subject⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀experience,⠀without⠀automatically⠀becoming⠀another⠀person's⠀knowledge.⠀Others⠀learn⠀through⠀actual⠀communication,⠀observations⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀access;⠀a⠀visible⠀response⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀disclose⠀the⠀complete⠀thought.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀delivered⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀reception⠀separate.⠀Another⠀speaker⠀may⠀continue⠀in⠀good⠀faith,⠀misread⠀the⠀pause,⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀unrelated⠀chore,⠀or⠀simply⠀wait.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀each⠀NPC⠀or⠀submitted⠀actor⠀into⠀an⠀instrument⠀testing⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀awareness.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀obligation⠀or⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀exchange,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀arrive⠀without⠀requiring⠀progress⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀activity:⠀an⠀answer⠀may⠀stand,⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀separate⠀concern⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation⠀or⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Locate⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀daily⠀errand,⠀meal,⠀or⠀recurring⠀arrangement⠀that⠀these⠀people⠀actually⠀use⠀and⠀maintain.⠀Ground⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀life,⠀allowing⠀personal⠀meaning⠀to⠀precede⠀its⠀present⠀use,⠀arise⠀during⠀the⠀encounter⠀or⠀remain⠀unchanged.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀hangs⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀word,⠀small⠀sound,⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀moment⠀of⠀waiting,⠀show⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀continuing⠀household⠀activity;⠀another⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀and⠀accommodate⠀the⠀distraction,⠀miss⠀it,⠀or⠀go⠀on⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀task.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀written⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀relevant⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀or⠀period⠀texture.⠀Emotional⠀significance⠀accumulates⠀through⠀concrete⠀use,⠀selection,⠀and⠀remembered⠀association,⠀not⠀through⠀making⠀each⠀detail⠀a⠀sign⠀of⠀hidden⠀resentment⠀or⠀an⠀announced⠀relationship⠀change.⠀Preserve⠀established⠀words⠀and⠀actions⠀while⠀distinguishing⠀who⠀actually⠀perceives⠀or⠀learns⠀of⠀them.⠀The⠀focal⠀person's⠀reading⠀is⠀private⠀experience;⠀later⠀conduct⠀may⠀confirm⠀it,⠀alter⠀it⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀slow⠀around⠀a⠀consequential⠀exchange⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀need⠀room⠀to⠀think⠀or⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀attention⠀breaks.⠀Keep⠀the⠀material⠀facts⠀precise⠀when⠀they⠀matter:⠀an⠀occupied⠀hand,⠀a⠀chair⠀on⠀a⠀cold⠀floor,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀chore,⠀a⠀mug⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀hard⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀asking,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀refusing⠀without⠀standing⠀in⠀for⠀feeling.⠀Describe⠀such⠀detail⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀contact⠀with⠀the⠀people⠀present,⠀not⠀as⠀scenic⠀garnish.\n\nGive⠀meaningful⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀feeling⠀and⠀association⠀the⠀development⠀their⠀actual⠀experience⠀needs,⠀including⠀experience⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀change⠀conduct.⠀A⠀caught⠀phrase⠀may⠀derail⠀speech⠀or⠀attach⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀wound;⠀show⠀that⠀movement⠀directly⠀while⠀keeping⠀its⠀relation⠀to⠀actual⠀words⠀and⠀actions⠀legible,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀interruption⠀to⠀resolve⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀pause.⠀Speech⠀follows⠀each⠀speaker's⠀social⠀register,⠀so⠀a⠀rough⠀room⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀uniformly⠀terse⠀cast,⠀and⠀tactile⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀produce⠀violence,⠀exhaustion,⠀or⠀contempt.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀clear⠀need,⠀practical⠀help,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀feeling⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀rupture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nChoose⠀the⠀concrete⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀journal⠀entry,⠀note,⠀report,⠀or⠀another⠀authored⠀record.⠀Establish⠀its⠀writer,⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀through⠀the⠀text⠀or⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator.⠀The⠀document⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀chose⠀or⠀managed⠀to⠀communicate,⠀not⠀the⠀finished⠀interior⠀equivalent⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀clean⠀completed⠀wording⠀from⠀an⠀interrupted⠀draft,⠀a⠀marginal⠀addition,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀annotation,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀evidence⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀determine⠀which⠀form⠀is⠀present.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀writer's⠀unrecorded⠀thought,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀unstable⠀reading⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀private⠀channel,⠀not⠀inside⠀the⠀document⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀letter⠀were⠀thinking.⠀When⠀the⠀document⠀reaches⠀a⠀recipient,⠀the⠀reception⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀intended⠀meaning,⠀remain⠀unknown,⠀or⠀matter⠀differently⠀through⠀that⠀person's⠀circumstances.⠀Allow⠀discrepancy⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀compulsory,⠀and⠀allow⠀a⠀record⠀to⠀say⠀something⠀useful⠀and⠀true⠀while⠀still⠀leaving⠀out⠀what⠀its⠀writer⠀experienced.⠀Keep⠀gaps⠀and⠀revisions⠀readable⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀kindness⠀or⠀shared⠀pleasure⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀these⠀people:⠀an⠀unhurried⠀meal,⠀a⠀known⠀preference⠀honored,⠀an⠀errand⠀taken⠀over,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀returned⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀selection⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀reveal⠀who⠀these⠀characters⠀are⠀rather⠀than⠀assembling⠀a⠀general⠀list⠀of⠀soothing⠀gestures.⠀The⠀comfort⠀can⠀be⠀offered⠀by⠀a⠀child,⠀parent,⠀friend,⠀partner,⠀or⠀acquaintance⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀relations⠀already⠀established,⠀and⠀its⠀worth⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀intended⠀feeling⠀and⠀the⠀recipient's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀successful⠀repair.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀accept,⠀enjoy,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀partly⠀enjoy⠀the⠀care⠀according⠀to⠀who⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀is.⠀Privacy⠀and⠀disagreement⠀remain⠀real;⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀appreciate⠀help⠀and⠀still⠀want⠀quiet⠀or⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀explain⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀difficulty,⠀and⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀emotional⠀confession,⠀a⠀visible⠀improvement,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀the⠀underlying⠀problem⠀is⠀solved.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀pace⠀of⠀the⠀day,⠀letting⠀the⠀scene⠀pause⠀during⠀an⠀offer,⠀its⠀reception⠀or⠀continuing⠀company,⠀without⠀requiring⠀care⠀to⠀be⠀accepted,⠀completed⠀or⠀turned⠀into⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nFrame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀access.⠀An⠀invitation,⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀obligation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀that⠀world's⠀expectations⠀while⠀remaining⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀relate⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀the⠀occasion's⠀actual⠀social⠀shape⠀and⠀any⠀wider⠀pattern⠀of⠀speech,⠀work⠀or⠀family⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Context⠀may⠀precede,⠀accompany⠀or⠀follow⠀the⠀encounter;⠀a⠀ceremony⠀or⠀completed⠀retrospective⠀judgment⠀is⠀not⠀required.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀judgment⠀devour⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀reasons.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀attention⠀catches⠀on⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀passing⠀noise,⠀or⠀unstable⠀interpretation,⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀register⠀the⠀actual⠀movement⠀of⠀attention,⠀including⠀a⠀settled⠀or⠀extended⠀passage⠀where⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀person's⠀experience.⠀The⠀phrase⠀that⠀was⠀said⠀should⠀remain⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀fears⠀or⠀hopes⠀it⠀meant.⠀Keep⠀who⠀spoke⠀and⠀what⠀happened⠀legible⠀across⠀the⠀interruption.⠀A⠀later⠀line,⠀gesture⠀or⠀social⠀turn⠀may⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀private⠀reading,⠀but⠀its⠀understanding⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀need⠀not⠀wait⠀for⠀one.⠀Speakers⠀retain⠀their⠀natural⠀registers;⠀formal⠀architecture⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀aristocratized⠀cast.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion⠀for⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀person⠀asks⠀to⠀hear⠀something,⠀wants⠀company,⠀wants⠀an⠀explanation,⠀or⠀needs⠀the⠀past⠀made⠀useful⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀Establish⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀as⠀situated⠀people⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀begins,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀rooted⠀in⠀their⠀immediate⠀surroundings.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀is⠀a⠀performed⠀act⠀in⠀this⠀frame.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀teller,⠀with⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀words⠀performed⠀aloud.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀shaped⠀performance.⠀Let⠀selection⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀remembered,⠀justified,⠀softened,⠀explained,⠀or⠀kept⠀out⠀of⠀reach.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀with⠀new⠀weight,⠀break⠀off⠀when⠀a⠀detail⠀becomes⠀difficult,⠀or⠀lose⠀the⠀thread.⠀Audience⠀response⠀can⠀occur⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀telling,⠀or⠀remain⠀unexpressed;⠀private⠀attention⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀performed⠀response.⠀Listeners⠀may⠀ask⠀questions⠀that⠀alter⠀what⠀gets⠀told,⠀react⠀to⠀a⠀gesture⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀words,⠀recognize⠀a⠀shared⠀moment,⠀or⠀drift⠀into⠀their⠀own⠀association.⠀The⠀listener's⠀association⠀is⠀real⠀private⠀experience;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀it⠀as⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀was⠀misunderstood.\n\nAllow⠀cross-currents⠀between⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀the⠀framing⠀moment.⠀A⠀detail⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀be⠀selected⠀because⠀it⠀answers⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀reminds⠀the⠀teller⠀of⠀a⠀danger,⠀or⠀lets⠀an⠀apology⠀arrive⠀indirectly.⠀But⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀see⠀the⠀two⠀levels⠀separately:⠀the⠀events⠀of⠀the⠀embedded⠀account,⠀its⠀present⠀performance,⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀shifting⠀attention⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀agree.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀help⠀connect⠀the⠀levels⠀without⠀confirming⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀reliable.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀actual⠀conduct⠀and⠀private⠀attention⠀available⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀continues⠀or⠀after⠀it⠀ends,⠀allowing⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀to⠀fall⠀within⠀an⠀unfinished⠀telling.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀continue⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀does⠀or⠀says⠀next—a⠀request⠀answered,⠀a⠀duty⠀resumed,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept,⠀a⠀question⠀set⠀aside—rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀the⠀told⠀story⠀to⠀persuade,⠀disclose,⠀or⠀complete⠀a⠀private⠀reflection.⠀Where⠀the⠀style's⠀present⠀occasion⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀an⠀outer⠀event,⠀follow⠀its⠀actual⠀reception⠀rather⠀than⠀guaranteeing⠀an⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀performance:⠀a⠀noise,⠀another⠀speaker,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀attention⠀may⠀be⠀noticed⠀or⠀missed,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀resume⠀or⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀resume.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose⠀grounded⠀in⠀an⠀actual⠀interpersonal⠀occasion.⠀Establish⠀a⠀surviving⠀message,⠀note,⠀entry,⠀or⠀other⠀record⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene:⠀who⠀produced⠀it,⠀for⠀whom,⠀and⠀under⠀what⠀practical⠀circumstance.⠀Then⠀write⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀present⠀or⠀later⠀recollection⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀exchanged⠀moment.⠀The⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀recollection⠀are⠀both⠀represented,⠀but⠀they⠀have⠀separate⠀status.\n\nMark⠀what⠀each⠀source⠀preserves.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀confirm⠀exact⠀words,⠀dates,⠀costs,⠀names,⠀or⠀arrangements⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀emotional⠀weather⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀absent.⠀The⠀recollection⠀may⠀preserve⠀tone,⠀hesitation,⠀what⠀was⠀noticed⠀or⠀missed,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀exchange⠀felt,⠀while⠀failing⠀to⠀reproduce⠀the⠀exact⠀wording.⠀When⠀the⠀two⠀are⠀placed⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀make⠀their⠀actual⠀agreements⠀and⠀differences⠀available⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀verdict⠀that⠀one⠀is⠀true⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀mistaken.⠀A⠀word⠀can⠀be⠀confirmed⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀differently⠀than⠀anyone⠀would⠀know⠀from⠀the⠀document⠀alone.\n\nWhere⠀interrupted⠀attention⠀actually⠀caused⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀recollection,⠀render⠀that⠀particular⠀cause⠀without⠀treating⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀sign⠀of⠀unreliability⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀gap.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀missed⠀a⠀phrase⠀because⠀of⠀noise,⠀intruding⠀thought,⠀pressure,⠀or⠀attention⠀elsewhere.⠀The⠀writer⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀received⠀portion⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀actually⠀experienced,⠀keeping⠀any⠀later⠀awareness⠀of⠀a⠀limitation⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀knew⠀then;⠀the⠀later⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀recognize⠀or⠀admit⠀every⠀gap.⠀Where⠀a⠀person⠀believes⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀moment⠀but⠀cannot⠀support⠀it,⠀distinguish⠀belief⠀from⠀confirmation.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀comparison's⠀significance⠀for⠀the⠀particular⠀people,⠀without⠀requiring⠀their⠀relationship⠀or⠀understanding⠀to⠀change.⠀A⠀note⠀may⠀prove⠀that⠀an⠀apology⠀was⠀actually⠀made⠀while⠀the⠀remembered⠀hurt⠀remains;⠀a⠀record⠀may⠀mean⠀little⠀if⠀it⠀was⠀never⠀delivered;⠀a⠀recollection⠀may⠀supply⠀warmth⠀for⠀words⠀that⠀the⠀document⠀shows⠀were⠀commonplace.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀pause⠀within⠀reading,⠀recollection⠀or⠀outward⠀conduct;⠀keeping,⠀rereading,⠀filing,⠀returning⠀or⠀leaving⠀a⠀document⠀unopened⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀closing⠀act.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀interpersonal⠀encounter⠀inside⠀a⠀supplied⠀arrangement⠀that⠀carries⠀inherited⠀or⠀institutional⠀authority,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀authority⠀through⠀actual⠀lived⠀detail:⠀a⠀room⠀entered⠀by⠀permission,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀someone⠀is⠀addressed,⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀ignored,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation⠀that⠀still⠀organizes⠀ordinary⠀conduct.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀should⠀be⠀practical⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀requests,⠀boundaries,⠀and⠀refusals⠀consequential.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀experience⠀the⠀arrangement⠀through⠀present⠀sensation⠀and⠀memory.⠀A⠀sound,⠀object,⠀familiar⠀handling,⠀or⠀remembered⠀rule⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀color⠀what⠀is⠀said.⠀Write⠀the⠀interruption⠀as⠀the⠀person's⠀private⠀experience:⠀attention⠀may⠀snag,⠀repeat,⠀lose⠀a⠀word,⠀or⠀compare⠀the⠀present⠀voice⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀speak⠀plainly⠀and⠀sincerely,⠀and⠀their⠀motive⠀remains⠀their⠀own.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀disturbance⠀or⠀suspicion⠀decide⠀someone⠀else's⠀interior⠀state.\n\nMake⠀room⠀for⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀ordinary⠀social⠀practice⠀at⠀once.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀want⠀something⠀from⠀this⠀encounter,⠀feel⠀loyalty,⠀embarrassment,⠀anger,⠀or⠀relief,⠀and⠀still⠀behave⠀with⠀courtesy,⠀bluntness,⠀evasion,⠀or⠀directness.⠀Trust⠀can⠀be⠀genuinely⠀present⠀while⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀mind⠀remains⠀alert.⠀Where⠀social⠀presentation⠀changes,⠀write⠀the⠀actual⠀changed⠀manner⠀and⠀its⠀circumstances,⠀whether⠀the⠀shift⠀is⠀voluntary⠀or⠀involuntary.⠀Trusted⠀company⠀may⠀allow⠀it,⠀but⠀other⠀supported⠀contexts⠀can⠀do⠀so⠀too;⠀inherited⠀authority⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀cause⠀exposure,⠀and⠀changed⠀behavior⠀does⠀not⠀disclose⠀the⠀person's⠀entire⠀private⠀experience.\n\nKeep⠀any⠀actual⠀consequences⠀of⠀the⠀encounter⠀concrete,⠀including⠀small⠀practical⠀continuities.⠀A⠀door⠀is⠀touched⠀or⠀not,⠀a⠀permission⠀is⠀used⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀routine⠀continues,⠀an⠀invitation⠀is⠀offered⠀or⠀left⠀unspoken.⠀If⠀interrupted⠀perception⠀creates⠀a⠀false⠀impression⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀follow⠀its⠀actual⠀private⠀and⠀interpersonal⠀effects,⠀which⠀may⠀remain⠀unexpressed⠀or⠀leave⠀conduct⠀unchanged;⠀neither⠀a⠀confession⠀nor⠀a⠀corrected⠀plan⠀is⠀required.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire,⠀faction,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀narration.⠀Organize⠀the⠀account⠀around⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀actually⠀present⠀at⠀a⠀consequential⠀exchange⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀giving⠀that⠀account⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀addressee.⠀Establish⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀addressee's⠀actual⠀interest⠀or⠀an⠀explicit⠀request:⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀reassurance,⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀what⠀went⠀wrong,⠀news,⠀or⠀the⠀story⠀of⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀occasion⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀question⠀shape⠀the⠀selection⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀interrogation⠀or⠀prior⠀request.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀chosen⠀rather⠀than⠀exhaustive.⠀The⠀speaker⠀can⠀include⠀what⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀request,⠀omit⠀what⠀seems⠀known⠀or⠀irrelevant,⠀hesitate⠀over⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀said⠀safely,⠀or⠀change⠀emphasis⠀for⠀the⠀listener.⠀Show⠀the⠀selection⠀through⠀the⠀testimony's⠀phrasing:⠀what⠀is⠀detailed,⠀what⠀is⠀compressed,⠀what⠀is⠀passed⠀over⠀in⠀a⠀sentence,⠀what⠀is⠀repeated⠀because⠀it⠀still⠀hurts⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀not⠀accept⠀it.⠀The⠀speaker's⠀told⠀account⠀and⠀their⠀present⠀private⠀experience⠀are⠀not⠀automatically⠀identical.⠀Use⠀the⠀required⠀interiority⠀to⠀render⠀what⠀is⠀felt⠀but⠀not⠀said.\n\nDistinguish⠀participation,⠀reception,⠀and⠀later⠀inference⠀with⠀precise⠀verbs⠀and⠀temporal⠀markers.⠀What⠀did⠀the⠀person⠀see,⠀say,⠀or⠀do?⠀What⠀did⠀they⠀hear⠀and⠀believe⠀at⠀the⠀time?⠀What⠀did⠀they⠀learn⠀afterward⠀from⠀another⠀person⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀event?⠀An⠀interrupted⠀perception—noise,⠀competing⠀attention,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought—may⠀create⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀can⠀honestly⠀testify⠀to;⠀write⠀that⠀gap⠀as⠀limitation,⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀deceit.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀understanding⠀arrives,⠀do⠀not⠀move⠀it⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀motive.\n\nLet⠀the⠀giving⠀or⠀receiving⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀matter⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀addressee⠀may⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀material⠀or⠀emphasis⠀they⠀actually⠀receive;⠀silence,⠀incomplete⠀reception⠀and⠀a⠀response⠀left⠀pending⠀remain⠀possible.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀testifying⠀role;⠀they⠀may⠀coincide⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀contract⠀makes⠀them⠀the⠀same⠀person.⠀A⠀first-person⠀story⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀request⠀while⠀a⠀permitted⠀third-person⠀account⠀follows⠀the⠀speaker's⠀selective⠀effort.⠀The⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀end⠀with⠀confession,⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward⠀fiction⠀within⠀a⠀concrete⠀interpersonal⠀exchange.⠀Keep⠀the⠀factual⠀frame⠀legible⠀while⠀following⠀actual⠀private⠀and⠀public⠀chronology:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀said⠀or⠀asked,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀matter⠀is⠀underway.⠀The⠀experimental⠀work⠀occurs⠀inside⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀should⠀not⠀dissolve⠀those⠀shared⠀events⠀into⠀uncertainty.\n\nRender⠀interruption⠀through⠀syntax⠀that⠀follows⠀actual⠀attention.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀consciousness,⠀a⠀displaced⠀clause⠀can⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀speaker's⠀words⠀are⠀fully⠀received,⠀or⠀the⠀direction⠀of⠀a⠀sentence⠀may⠀turn⠀from⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀sound,⠀image,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀demand.⠀Keep⠀the⠀device⠀local.⠀Where⠀attention⠀actually⠀breaks,⠀give⠀the⠀interruption⠀a⠀specific⠀experiential⠀shape⠀without⠀losing⠀orientation;⠀a⠀clear⠀stretch⠀need⠀not⠀acquire⠀a⠀disturbance⠀to⠀display⠀the⠀style.\n\nSeparate⠀the⠀literal⠀exchange,⠀memory,⠀and⠀intrusive⠀material⠀inside⠀the⠀prose⠀itself.⠀Use⠀direct⠀speech⠀and⠀clear⠀action⠀for⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀says⠀or⠀does;⠀use⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀for⠀what⠀is⠀heard,⠀missed,⠀repeated,⠀or⠀overlaid⠀with⠀private⠀material.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀can⠀color⠀attention⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀belief⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀If⠀memory⠀joins⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀folding⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀current⠀action⠀as⠀fact.\n\nLet⠀clear⠀perception⠀continue⠀or⠀resume.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀catch⠀the⠀next⠀words⠀accurately,⠀answer,⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀remain⠀able⠀to⠀accomplish⠀the⠀small⠀task⠀at⠀hand⠀while⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀elsewhere.⠀The⠀interruption⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀an⠀insight,⠀decision,⠀or⠀visible⠀breakdown.⠀After⠀the⠀inward⠀disturbance,⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀ordinary⠀outward⠀behavior—the⠀request⠀answered⠀carefully,⠀the⠀table⠀cleared,⠀the⠀street⠀crossed,⠀the⠀phone⠀returned—leaving⠀the⠀event⠀stable⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Ground⠀the⠀sequence⠀in⠀one⠀actual⠀exchange⠀or⠀recurring⠀relational⠀moment,⠀and⠀arrange⠀permitted⠀viewpoints,⠀testimonies⠀or⠀records⠀from⠀distinguishable⠀times⠀and⠀positions⠀across⠀the⠀account,⠀without⠀requiring⠀multiple⠀perspectives⠀in⠀each⠀passage.⠀Each⠀account⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀and⠀situation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀ordering⠀intelligible:⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀time⠀or⠀speaker⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀through⠀scene⠀detail,⠀direct⠀speech,⠀or⠀an⠀explicitly⠀introduced⠀source⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀abrupt⠀change⠀only⠀the⠀reader⠀may⠀infer.\n\nPrecisely⠀mark⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀could⠀know.⠀Give⠀each⠀account⠀the⠀words⠀that⠀person⠀heard,⠀the⠀actions⠀they⠀witnessed,⠀the⠀practical⠀circumstances⠀they⠀shared,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀they⠀actually⠀had⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀missed⠀a⠀phrase⠀because⠀of⠀noise,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀inward⠀attention,⠀represent⠀that⠀gap⠀through⠀authorized⠀inward⠀experience⠀or⠀an⠀attributed⠀account⠀when⠀direct⠀access⠀is⠀unavailable—not⠀as⠀a⠀later⠀claim⠀about⠀their⠀unreliability.⠀A⠀participant's⠀interpretation⠀may⠀be⠀partial⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀shared⠀event⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀the⠀accounts⠀align,⠀address⠀different⠀concerns,⠀or⠀remain⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀repeated⠀moment⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀different⠀accounts⠀with⠀different⠀weight:⠀one⠀person⠀remembers⠀what⠀was⠀asked,⠀another⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀said,⠀another⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀closing⠀door.⠀The⠀reader's⠀combined⠀view⠀may⠀be⠀fuller⠀than⠀any⠀single⠀account,⠀but⠀that⠀combined⠀view⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀available⠀to⠀all⠀characters;⠀they⠀learn⠀through⠀actual⠀communication⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀access.⠀If⠀two⠀accounts⠀conflict,⠀let⠀the⠀conflict⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀saw⠀or⠀believed⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀disagreement⠀into⠀a⠀resolution.\n\nResist⠀manufacturing⠀edifying⠀contrast.⠀A⠀moment⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀pass⠀quickly⠀for⠀another;⠀a⠀careful⠀observer⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀feeling⠀behind⠀a⠀plain⠀statement;⠀a⠀sincere⠀speaker⠀may⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀carried⠀afterward.⠀When⠀the⠀sequence⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀shared⠀action—meal⠀begun,⠀trip⠀continued,⠀agreement⠀kept,⠀letter⠀opened—keep⠀its⠀actual⠀time⠀and⠀participants⠀legible.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀also⠀pause⠀within⠀a⠀partial⠀account⠀or⠀inward⠀passage⠀without⠀a⠀shared⠀closing⠀action⠀or⠀unifying⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀already⠀legible:⠀show⠀who⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀exchange,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀current⠀request,⠀errand,⠀meeting,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀is⠀underway.⠀Introduce⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀social⠀arrangements⠀through⠀a⠀brief⠀explanatory⠀beat⠀or⠀an⠀encounter⠀that⠀makes⠀their⠀significance⠀usable,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀conversation⠀without⠀postponing⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀feature⠀list.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀scannable⠀by⠀paragraphing⠀around⠀distinct⠀functions:⠀outward⠀action,⠀direct⠀speech,⠀private⠀focal⠀response.⠀A⠀missed⠀word⠀or⠀intrusive⠀association⠀gets⠀enough⠀surrounding⠀context⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀interruption⠀intelligible.⠀When⠀a⠀person⠀misses⠀something⠀because⠀of⠀noise,⠀pressure,⠀or⠀an⠀unwanted⠀thought,⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀interruption⠀and⠀any⠀missed⠀material⠀distinguishable⠀under⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access,⠀following⠀their⠀causal⠀order⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀next⠀outward⠀act⠀before⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀pause.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀interruption⠀beforehand⠀or⠀summarize⠀it⠀afterward⠀when⠀the⠀live⠀rendering⠀is⠀enough.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀full⠀range⠀of⠀reaction.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀respond⠀seriously,⠀gently,⠀coolly,⠀practically,⠀or⠀with⠀unavoidable⠀silence,⠀and⠀the⠀reaction⠀may⠀extend⠀across⠀several⠀lines⠀while⠀the⠀exchange⠀continues.⠀An⠀interruption⠀may⠀produce⠀only⠀a⠀small⠀shift⠀in⠀attention—a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀a⠀rephrased⠀question,⠀a⠀glance—rather⠀than⠀a⠀visible⠀comic⠀beat⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀misunderstanding.⠀Let⠀each⠀character's⠀speech⠀remain⠀their⠀own;⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀is⠀not⠀authority⠀over⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀intends.\n\nEnd⠀or⠀pause⠀with⠀the⠀scene⠀ready⠀to⠀continue.⠀Leave⠀the⠀immediate⠀request,⠀conflict,⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀comfort⠀unfinished⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point,⠀with⠀continuation⠀available⠀through⠀actual⠀experience⠀or⠀conduct,⠀which⠀may⠀include:⠀a⠀task⠀begun,⠀a⠀question⠀held,⠀an⠀apology⠀not⠀yet⠀answered,⠀or⠀one⠀person⠀moving⠀toward⠀the⠀next⠀step.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀merely⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀installment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀an⠀actual⠀exchange⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀movement.⠀When⠀someone⠀asks,⠀withholds,⠀accepts,⠀or⠀misunderstands,⠀pick⠀up⠀a⠀word,⠀object,⠀or⠀small⠀ambient⠀noise⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀rhythm⠀or⠀texture⠀recur⠀when⠀actual⠀attention⠀returns⠀to⠀it,⠀with⠀altered⠀or⠀unchanged⠀resonance.⠀A⠀phrase⠀heard⠀in⠀one⠀exchange⠀can⠀come⠀back⠀as⠀an⠀internal⠀echo,⠀a⠀physical⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀notices⠀after⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀spoken.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀the⠀same⠀actual⠀material⠀being⠀encountered⠀again,⠀not⠀a⠀new⠀metaphor⠀substituted⠀for⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀events.⠀Connect⠀speech,⠀action,⠀perception⠀and⠀private⠀association⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀actual⠀experience⠀supports;⠀inward⠀experience⠀can⠀precede⠀speech⠀or⠀continue⠀across⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀return.⠀If⠀attention⠀breaks,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀catches⠀on:⠀the⠀repeated⠀syllable,⠀the⠀pause,⠀the⠀familiar⠀sound⠀from⠀outside.⠀Keep⠀that⠀interruption⠀anchored⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀whose⠀perception⠀it⠀is.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀know⠀or⠀share⠀the⠀association,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀imply⠀that⠀the⠀echoed⠀phrase⠀reveals⠀the⠀speaker's⠀hidden⠀motive⠀or⠀relationship⠀state.\n\nKeep⠀spoken⠀language⠀in⠀its⠀individual⠀register.⠀Lyrical⠀syntax⠀can⠀shape⠀the⠀narration⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀inner⠀movement,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀mode.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀long⠀rhythm⠀or⠀bring⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀into⠀sharp⠀relief.⠀Let⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀request⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀texture⠀matters⠀privately.⠀The⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀answer⠀it,⠀evade⠀it,⠀or⠀continue⠀along⠀its⠀own⠀practical⠀track.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀insight,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀falling⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nWhen⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀calls⠀up⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀its⠀connection⠀to⠀particular⠀people,⠀places⠀or⠀routines⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀experience.⠀The⠀trigger⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀familiar⠀question⠀phrased⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀way,⠀the⠀same⠀tea⠀poured⠀again,⠀silence⠀at⠀the⠀hour⠀when⠀something⠀else⠀used⠀to⠀happen.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀into⠀the⠀remembered⠀one⠀without⠀surrendering⠀the⠀live⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relation⠀to⠀current⠀words⠀and⠀actions⠀intelligible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀return⠀within⠀the⠀paragraph⠀or⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀pause.\n\nUse⠀reflection⠀to⠀show⠀coexistence,⠀not⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀verdict.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀acceptance⠀while⠀now⠀refusing,⠀or⠀may⠀feel⠀both⠀the⠀old⠀habit⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀decision⠀at⠀once.⠀Let⠀pleasure⠀remain⠀possible.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀good,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀can⠀also⠀contain⠀ordinary⠀warmth⠀or⠀competent⠀care.⠀If⠀an⠀intrusive⠀old⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀claiming⠀it⠀proves⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀still⠀means⠀the⠀same⠀thing.⠀The⠀other⠀character's⠀purpose⠀follows⠀their⠀established⠀motives⠀and⠀situation;⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀or⠀focal⠀person⠀can⠀know⠀of⠀it⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀access⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀emotional⠀force⠀of⠀a⠀recollection.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀remembers⠀clearly⠀and⠀any⠀genuine⠀limits⠀or⠀gaps,⠀including⠀content⠀already⠀shared⠀with⠀others.⠀The⠀present⠀experience⠀of⠀remembering⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀communicated;⠀narration⠀and⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀follow⠀their⠀authorized⠀access.⠀Reflection⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀choice⠀feel⠀heavier,⠀easier,⠀or⠀simply⠀strange,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀action.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀pause,⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀continuing⠀to⠀speak⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀is⠀still⠀partly⠀elsewhere.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀impermanence,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀an⠀instruction⠀that⠀every⠀familiar⠀thing⠀must⠀now⠀be⠀understood⠀as⠀lost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀modern⠀memoir.⠀Open⠀from⠀a⠀later⠀recollecting⠀position⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀occasion⠀for⠀telling:⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀remembering,⠀recording,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange⠀because⠀it⠀now⠀seems⠀significant.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀self's⠀access⠀intact.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀enters⠀the⠀past,⠀preserve⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀available⠀to⠀that⠀participant⠀then,⠀including⠀prior⠀experience⠀and⠀knowledge⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀current⠀observations,⠀hopes,⠀fears⠀or⠀missed⠀words.⠀Do⠀not⠀give⠀the⠀younger⠀self⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀say⠀now⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀clear⠀then,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀temporal⠀distance⠀legible⠀whether⠀later⠀understanding⠀confirms,⠀corrects⠀or⠀leaves⠀the⠀earlier⠀account⠀unresolved.\n\nFollow⠀a⠀specific⠀request,⠀acceptance,⠀duty,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀occasion⠀across⠀both⠀positions.⠀In⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene,⠀render⠀any⠀actual⠀interruption⠀from⠀noise,⠀a⠀caught⠀phrase⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀without⠀requiring⠀one⠀in⠀a⠀clear⠀stretch.⠀What⠀felt⠀intrusive⠀then⠀may⠀still⠀feel⠀intrusive⠀now,⠀may⠀have⠀faded,⠀or⠀may⠀have⠀changed⠀because⠀later⠀events⠀gave⠀it⠀another⠀meaning.⠀Make⠀the⠀change⠀or⠀the⠀persistence⠀particular.⠀When⠀the⠀later⠀voice⠀comments,⠀give⠀the⠀commentary⠀the⠀development⠀its⠀personal⠀significance⠀needs⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀remembered⠀events⠀and⠀present⠀recollection;⠀reflection⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀conduct.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀other⠀person,⠀resolve⠀the⠀relationship,⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀wrong.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀person,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀ownership.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀not⠀first-person,⠀present⠀the⠀memoir⠀as⠀the⠀recollecting⠀character's⠀composed⠀account⠀or⠀thought-attributed⠀memory⠀within⠀the⠀existing⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀shifting⠀the⠀whole⠀story⠀into⠀“I.”⠀The⠀recollecting⠀position⠀has⠀only⠀the⠀knowledge⠀actually⠀available⠀at⠀that⠀later⠀time,⠀which⠀may⠀include⠀retained⠀earlier⠀knowledge,⠀subsequent⠀learning⠀and⠀genuine⠀gaps;⠀neither⠀perfect⠀retention⠀nor⠀new⠀knowledge⠀is⠀automatic.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀any⠀composed⠀memoir⠀text.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀remembered⠀events,⠀later⠀reflection⠀or⠀current⠀conduct⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀concluding⠀image⠀or⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀concrete⠀details⠀that⠀perform⠀the⠀work.⠀For⠀an⠀ask,⠀boundary,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀misunderstanding,⠀select⠀the⠀words,⠀objects⠀or⠀positions⠀that⠀make⠀this⠀particular⠀exchange⠀and⠀its⠀personal⠀experience⠀intelligible,⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀item⠀count.⠀Let⠀those⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀immediate⠀state.⠀Keep⠀surroundings⠀exact⠀rather⠀than⠀redundant,⠀allowing⠀details⠀to⠀matter⠀through⠀feeling⠀or⠀association⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀practical⠀use.⠀A⠀cup⠀can⠀carry⠀personal⠀meaning⠀without⠀being⠀handled,⠀but⠀that⠀association⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.\n\nRepresent⠀an⠀attention⠀break⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀catch,⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀any⠀effects⠀it⠀has.⠀If⠀a⠀word⠀draws⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀away,⠀retain⠀the⠀particular⠀wording⠀and⠀repeat⠀it⠀only⠀as⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀account⠀warrants,⠀without⠀a⠀frequency⠀quota.⠀The⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation⠀that⠀follows⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀inhabited:⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀repeat⠀the⠀word⠀internally,⠀feel⠀a⠀delay,⠀notice⠀the⠀speaker⠀waiting,⠀or⠀miss⠀the⠀next⠀sentence.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀interruption⠀to⠀a⠀decorative⠀fragment⠀or⠀an⠀ellipsis.⠀Keep⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀causally⠀legible.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀pause⠀or⠀continue⠀without⠀seeing⠀it,⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀position⠀and⠀temperament.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀exact⠀transition⠀words.⠀Omit⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀details,⠀but⠀never⠀omit⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀exchange.⠀A⠀lengthy⠀necessary⠀reflection⠀can⠀stay:⠀the⠀person⠀may⠀need⠀two⠀sentences⠀to⠀connect⠀a⠀request⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀obligation.⠀Economy⠀comes⠀from⠀not⠀restating⠀the⠀connection⠀once⠀it⠀is⠀made.⠀Plain⠀agreement⠀and⠀clear⠀speech⠀are⠀not⠀failures⠀of⠀style;⠀preserve⠀them⠀as⠀they⠀occur⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀ambiguity⠀or⠀estrangement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀continuous⠀present⠀interval.⠀Begin⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀happening:⠀someone⠀arriving,⠀preparing⠀food,⠀working,⠀waiting,⠀answering.⠀Let⠀the⠀significant⠀matter⠀emerge⠀through⠀conduct⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀speech.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀sit⠀inside⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀ordinary⠀actions.⠀Use⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀perception⠀to⠀register⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀doing,⠀not⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀said.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀contains⠀silence,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀kind⠀of⠀action⠀by⠀giving⠀it⠀a⠀location⠀and⠀a⠀duration.\n\nWhen⠀attention⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀locate⠀the⠀exact⠀word,⠀sound,⠀or⠀object⠀that⠀caught⠀it,⠀then⠀render⠀the⠀private⠀movement⠀it⠀starts.⠀The⠀movement⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀doubt,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀realization⠀that⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀continued.⠀Keep⠀that⠀movement⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀person.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀keeps⠀living⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀concern:⠀they⠀check⠀a⠀phone,⠀leave⠀a⠀task⠀half-done,⠀revise⠀a⠀sentence,⠀notice⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀face,⠀or⠀continue⠀without⠀noticing.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀a⠀dramatic⠀recognition.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀snap⠀back⠀to⠀action;⠀it⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀thought⠀until⠀the⠀next⠀real⠀occurrence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀personal⠀stake⠀be⠀proportionate.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀concern⠀an⠀ordinary⠀acceptance,⠀a⠀preference,⠀a⠀difficult⠀obligation,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀dependence.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀crisis.⠀Use⠀recollection⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀attention⠀of⠀the⠀moment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀continuous⠀but⠀flexible⠀enough⠀to⠀move⠀between⠀exact⠀speech,⠀described⠀gesture,⠀and⠀inner⠀experience⠀without⠀recapping⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀significant.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀pause,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀thought,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀or⠀ordinary⠀activity,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀beat⠀or⠀issue⠀to⠀be⠀completed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀scenes⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀involves⠀long⠀familiarity,⠀choose⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀shows⠀how⠀that⠀familiarity⠀works⠀at⠀this⠀moment:⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀standing⠀joke,⠀a⠀room⠀entered⠀without⠀asking,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀only⠀this⠀person⠀would⠀know⠀to⠀ask.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀involves⠀rivalry,⠀unequal⠀care,⠀companionship,⠀or⠀something⠀else,⠀let⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀occasion⠀expose⠀that⠀specific⠀basis.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀confession,⠀jealousy,⠀hurt/comfort⠀pattern⠀or⠀step⠀toward⠀closeness⠀merely⠀to⠀display⠀the⠀style;⠀such⠀material⠀belongs⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀premise⠀and⠀events⠀support⠀it.\n\nMake⠀repeated⠀material⠀function⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀nickname,⠀small⠀ritual,⠀or⠀remembered⠀question⠀can⠀return.⠀When⠀it⠀returns,⠀make⠀clear⠀whose⠀material⠀it⠀is:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀use⠀it⠀deliberately,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀hears⠀it⠀through⠀distraction,⠀private⠀hurt,⠀or⠀unexpected⠀recognition.⠀The⠀focal⠀person's⠀reception⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀clarify⠀something⠀or⠀help⠀resolve⠀an⠀exchange⠀when⠀its⠀actual⠀delivery⠀and⠀reception⠀support⠀that⠀effect;⠀its⠀emotional⠀value⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀a⠀solution⠀or⠀the⠀speaker's⠀purpose.⠀Preserve⠀established⠀motives⠀and⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀another⠀participant⠀can⠀know⠀of⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀hidden⠀thought⠀separate.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀feel⠀an⠀intrusive⠀memory⠀or⠀unwanted⠀dependence⠀during⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange,⠀but⠀neither⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀nor⠀the⠀narrator⠀should⠀treat⠀that⠀private⠀feeling⠀as⠀the⠀relationship's⠀public⠀truth.⠀Show⠀care,⠀annoyance,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀distance⠀as⠀they⠀actually⠀happen.⠀Affection⠀may⠀be⠀strong⠀without⠀prompting⠀a⠀declaration;⠀avoid⠀a⠀required⠀admission⠀or⠀better⠀ending.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship⠀premise⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀two⠀people⠀handle⠀one⠀small⠀shared⠀obligation,⠀without⠀requiring⠀movement⠀along⠀an⠀arc;⠀any⠀actual⠀development⠀follows⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀events.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀something⠀already⠀shaped⠀by⠀telling.⠀A⠀compact⠀declaration⠀can⠀name⠀the⠀act:⠀the⠀promise⠀kept,⠀the⠀visit⠀paid,⠀the⠀refusal⠀given,⠀the⠀gift⠀carried.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀occasion⠀when⠀it⠀happened.⠀The⠀opening⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀grand.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀act⠀can⠀merit⠀retelling⠀because⠀people⠀have⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀must⠀resemble⠀heroic⠀legend.\n\nGround⠀recurrence⠀in⠀established⠀history⠀or⠀actual⠀present⠀experience,⠀distinguishing⠀a⠀private⠀return⠀from⠀a⠀publicly⠀repeated⠀act.⠀A⠀later⠀encounter⠀may⠀involve:⠀the⠀same⠀coat⠀still⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀same⠀instruction⠀repeated,⠀the⠀same⠀silence⠀when⠀the⠀visit⠀begins⠀again.⠀Let⠀any⠀new⠀application⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀later⠀event,⠀while⠀allowing⠀the⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀to⠀confirm⠀an⠀unchanged⠀association.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀private⠀reception⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀remembered⠀public⠀shape.⠀In⠀the⠀original⠀moment,⠀that⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀heard⠀the⠀promise⠀through⠀weariness,⠀caught⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀it,⠀doubted⠀it,⠀or⠀missed⠀the⠀other's⠀tone.⠀A⠀publicly⠀composed⠀retelling⠀may⠀preserve⠀what⠀was⠀agreed⠀while⠀saying⠀nothing⠀of⠀that⠀hesitation;⠀actual⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀available⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀beyond⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀records.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀later⠀reputation⠀erase⠀then-known⠀experience.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀permits⠀a⠀spoken⠀response,⠀let⠀dialogue⠀stand⠀beside⠀or⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀objection.⠀The⠀person⠀remembered⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀formal⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀complaint,⠀or⠀correct⠀a⠀detail⠀about⠀who⠀did⠀what.⠀The⠀correction⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀memory⠀or⠀their⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀event.⠀This⠀is⠀not⠀mockery.⠀A⠀domestic⠀task⠀remains⠀a⠀domestic⠀task,⠀and⠀a⠀shared⠀obligation⠀remains⠀shared⠀through⠀action.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀resumed⠀or⠀its⠀consequence⠀still⠀pending;⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀declared⠀by⠀every⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀essayistic⠀narration:⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀proposition⠀about⠀understanding⠀another⠀person,⠀stated⠀in⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator's⠀own⠀terms.⠀The⠀proposition⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀test—about⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀silence⠀means,⠀what⠀asking⠀reveals,⠀what⠀someone's⠀attention⠀proves,⠀or⠀what⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀costs.\n\nBring⠀that⠀claim⠀into⠀contact⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀interpersonal⠀case.⠀The⠀case⠀may⠀be⠀remembered,⠀present,⠀or⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical,⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀exchange⠀appropriate⠀to⠀that⠀source,⠀actual⠀or⠀clearly⠀imagined:⠀a⠀request⠀made⠀or⠀withheld,⠀an⠀answer⠀given⠀or⠀avoided,⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀carried⠀out⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀unfold⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀perception,⠀including⠀any⠀interruption⠀that⠀occurs⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀one.⠀A⠀caught⠀phrase,⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀pulls⠀attention⠀away,⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀voice⠀may⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀without⠀by⠀itself⠀establishing⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀intention;⠀any⠀inference⠀remains⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀support⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀privately⠀interpreted⠀or⠀feared.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀opening⠀proposition⠀with⠀confirmation,⠀qualification,⠀or⠀an⠀open⠀question.⠀The⠀case⠀need⠀not⠀refute⠀the⠀claim,⠀settle⠀motive,⠀or⠀make⠀reflection⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀response.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀conclude⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀conduct⠀supports⠀the⠀claim,⠀that⠀the⠀claim⠀explained⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀happened,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀exchange⠀leaves⠀the⠀claim⠀unsettled.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀resolution.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀essayistic⠀movement⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it:⠀the⠀narrator⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀statement⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange⠀and⠀then⠀back⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀statement⠀can⠀now⠀mean.⠀The⠀construction⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀across⠀replies;⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀can⠀reopen⠀the⠀same⠀proposition⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀might⠀have⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀screen⠀sequence:⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀for⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events,⠀and⠀speaker⠀cues⠀for⠀every⠀line.⠀Keep⠀the⠀main⠀track⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀an⠀observer⠀could⠀see⠀or⠀hear.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀access⠀to⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀action⠀blocks⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀physical⠀conditions⠀that⠀shape⠀delivery.⠀A⠀passing⠀train,⠀a⠀ringing⠀phone,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀or⠀a⠀room's⠀acoustics⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀line,⠀force⠀a⠀repeat,⠀or⠀pull⠀attention⠀away⠀from⠀an⠀answer.⠀Follow⠀any⠀actual⠀effect⠀on⠀delivery,⠀reception⠀or⠀subsequent⠀conduct,⠀allowing⠀the⠀line⠀and⠀action⠀to⠀continue⠀unchanged⠀when⠀the⠀sound⠀is⠀ignored⠀or⠀does⠀not⠀interfere.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀pause,⠀restart,⠀miss⠀a⠀word,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀fully⠀asked.\n\nWhen⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀visible⠀track.⠀Render⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀which⠀may⠀align⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀develop⠀independently⠀of⠀it:⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀stop⠀repeating,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀voice,⠀an⠀interpretation⠀they⠀know⠀may⠀be⠀wrong,⠀or⠀attention⠀caught⠀on⠀an⠀irrelevant⠀detail⠀while⠀someone⠀else⠀is⠀speaking.⠀A⠀separately⠀authorized⠀voice-over,⠀aside⠀or⠀spoken⠀disclosure⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀delivery⠀and⠀audience;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀required⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀advance⠀through⠀ordinary⠀conduct⠀and⠀pending⠀responses⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀reveal.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀withhold⠀an⠀answer,⠀accept⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀request,⠀or⠀choose⠀to⠀change⠀a⠀plan.⠀The⠀next⠀beat⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀done,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀hidden⠀thought⠀becoming⠀public.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀moment⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀exchange⠀seen⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀physical⠀position,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀meant.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀screenplay⠀form⠀operational:⠀action⠀blocks⠀describe⠀observable⠀behavior⠀and⠀material⠀conditions;⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀carry⠀spoken⠀words;⠀scene⠀headings⠀orient⠀changes⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀time.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands,⠀shot⠀labels,⠀or⠀editorial⠀explanations⠀of⠀emotion.⠀Develop⠀emotional⠀significance⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀relation⠀between⠀spoken⠀words,⠀conduct⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀whether⠀those⠀align,⠀differ⠀or⠀remain⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀actual⠀positions,⠀distances,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀objects,⠀and⠀continuing⠀practical⠀work.⠀Use⠀a⠀visible⠀task⠀or⠀arrangement⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀concrete:⠀one⠀person⠀sorting⠀a⠀parcel⠀while⠀another⠀waits,⠀clearing⠀a⠀table,⠀checking⠀a⠀window,⠀carrying⠀something⠀between⠀rooms.⠀Let⠀the⠀work⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀and⠀continuous;⠀it⠀can⠀mark⠀attention,⠀avoidance,⠀care,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀routine⠀without⠀turning⠀each⠀pause⠀into⠀a⠀confession.\n\nMake⠀the⠀physical⠀conditions⠀of⠀hearing⠀and⠀attention⠀playable.⠀A⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀spoken⠀over⠀actual⠀stage⠀noise,⠀from⠀another⠀room,⠀while⠀someone's⠀back⠀is⠀turned,⠀or⠀during⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀a⠀door.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀publicly⠀available:⠀make⠀delivery⠀and⠀positioning⠀legible⠀while⠀distinguishing⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀actually⠀receives.⠀A⠀word⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀be⠀missed⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀inward⠀distraction⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀masking⠀noise;⠀audibility⠀does⠀not⠀guarantee⠀comprehension.⠀When⠀weather,⠀machinery,⠀or⠀another⠀character's⠀activity⠀masks⠀a⠀phrase,⠀write⠀the⠀masking⠀event⠀into⠀the⠀stage⠀direction⠀rather⠀than⠀describing⠀the⠀hearing⠀loss⠀as⠀though⠀all⠀characters⠀shared⠀one⠀mind.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀format⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀phrase,⠀a⠀sudden⠀competing⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀response⠀to⠀a⠀word⠀remains⠀actual⠀written⠀fictional⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀not⠀merely⠀actor⠀preparation.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀hear⠀that⠀private⠀prose;⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀performed⠀disclosure⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀speaker,⠀audience⠀and⠀delivery.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀attributed⠀and⠀speakable.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀small⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀which⠀something⠀remains⠀unasked,⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀outdoor⠀storm,⠀a⠀slammed⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀confrontation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀passage⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀actual⠀movement.⠀Braid⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀perceives⠀now,⠀what⠀they⠀hear⠀or⠀almost⠀hear⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀speech,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀or⠀image,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀and⠀the⠀concern⠀already⠀active⠀before⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀can⠀follow⠀association,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀return.⠀When⠀attention⠀breaks,⠀show⠀what⠀broke⠀it:⠀an⠀actual⠀sound,⠀a⠀word,⠀a⠀physical⠀feeling,⠀a⠀compelling⠀private⠀phrase.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀conversation,⠀mark⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀receives⠀and⠀any⠀material⠀actually⠀missed,⠀without⠀requiring⠀loss.\n\nUse⠀concrete⠀anchors⠀to⠀keep⠀present,⠀remembered,⠀and⠀imagined⠀content⠀distinguishable.⠀A⠀current⠀object,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀repeated⠀posture,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀in⠀progress⠀can⠀tether⠀present⠀reception.⠀Let⠀memory⠀enter⠀associatively⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀present⠀events,⠀recollection⠀and⠀imagination,⠀whether⠀attention⠀returns⠀promptly,⠀remains⠀inward⠀or⠀settles;⠀a⠀private⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀An⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀urgent,⠀unwelcome,⠀or⠀seductive⠀without⠀conferring⠀a⠀plan;⠀it⠀can⠀leave⠀no⠀visible⠀decision⠀behind.\n\nKeep⠀this⠀associative⠀flow⠀situated⠀in⠀its⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀merging⠀minds.⠀The⠀flow⠀may⠀develop⠀an⠀interpretation,⠀hold⠀it,⠀doubt⠀it,⠀replace⠀it,⠀or⠀forget⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀focal⠀interpretation⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀establish⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀privately⠀intends.⠀The⠀exchange⠀remains⠀a⠀Character⠀Drama⠀scene:⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀practical⠀obligation,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀grievance.⠀Length⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀particular⠀experience,⠀not⠀elapsed⠀time.⠀A⠀short⠀interval⠀may⠀need⠀several⠀paragraphs;⠀a⠀long⠀conversation⠀may⠀compress⠀to⠀one⠀distinct⠀difficulty.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀pause,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀thought,⠀a⠀rest⠀or⠀an⠀interruption,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀decision,⠀admission⠀or⠀return.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀in⠀readable⠀form.⠀Show⠀only⠀supported⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀exchange:⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀typing⠀indicator,⠀an⠀edit,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀an⠀attachment,⠀a⠀channel⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀send.⠀Give⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀a⠀practical⠀shape.⠀One⠀sender⠀may⠀use⠀short⠀answers,⠀another⠀may⠀revise⠀repeatedly,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀put⠀the⠀phone⠀down⠀mid-thought;⠀these⠀differences⠀should⠀serve⠀what⠀we⠀already⠀know⠀of⠀them⠀rather⠀than⠀supplying⠀hidden⠀diagnosis.\n\nSeparate⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀privately⠀experienced.⠀Keep⠀any⠀unsent⠀draft⠀clearly⠀identified⠀as⠀an⠀untransmitted⠀written⠀artifact.⠀Render⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀nonspoken⠀presentation:⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀rises⠀while⠀reading,⠀a⠀reaction⠀to⠀sound⠀interrupting⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀interpretation⠀that⠀shifts⠀between⠀reading⠀and⠀reply.⠀Neither⠀a⠀draft⠀nor⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀exhausts⠀that⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀print⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀though⠀it⠀were⠀a⠀message,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀sender⠀receive⠀a⠀wish⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀saw⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀delay⠀follows,⠀the⠀narrative⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀supported⠀cause⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unknown.⠀A⠀delay⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀mean⠀anger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀avoidance.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀operate⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀character-drama⠀agency⠀as⠀a⠀spoken⠀scene.⠀A⠀practical⠀question⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀plainly;⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀open;⠀agreement⠀or⠀refusal⠀can⠀matter⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀noise,⠀a⠀competing⠀task,⠀or⠀an⠀intrusive⠀thought⠀while⠀the⠀typed⠀words⠀remain⠀ordinary.⠀Context⠀material,⠀when⠀needed,⠀should⠀be⠀visibly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀message⠀record.⠀Keep⠀the⠀continuation⠀natural:⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀planned⠀call,⠀or⠀a⠀stop⠀without⠀response⠀are⠀all⠀permissible,⠀depending⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀do.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Akira⠀(identity⠀unresolved)⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀shared⠀background,⠀positions,⠀and⠀immediate⠀circumstances⠀where⠀orientation⠀is⠀needed.⠀Write⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀let⠀dialogue,⠀focal⠀observation,⠀movement,⠀useful⠀cues⠀and⠀developed⠀private⠀response⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀sequence⠀or⠀thought-length⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀the⠀visual⠀references⠀purposeful.⠀A⠀character's⠀posture,⠀expression,⠀or⠀movement⠀can⠀anchor⠀attention;⠀it⠀can⠀also⠀attract⠀suspicion,⠀hope,⠀or⠀irritation.⠀But⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀cue⠀alone⠀certify⠀intention⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀illustrated⠀expression⠀does⠀not⠀speak.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀run⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀prose.⠀An⠀actual⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀a⠀word⠀that⠀snags⠀attention,⠀a⠀competing⠀ph