Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Each⠀message⠀should⠀read⠀as⠀that⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habit:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀full⠀sentence⠀at⠀once,⠀another⠀a⠀fragment,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀delivered⠀message⠀unanswered⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀else.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nMake⠀the⠀personal⠀exchange⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀selected⠀words⠀of⠀actual⠀messages.⠀A⠀request,⠀reply,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀update⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀every⠀message⠀announcing⠀an⠀emotion.⠀Exact⠀objects⠀and⠀procedures⠀can⠀supply⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀refers⠀to:⠀the⠀brand⠀of⠀cleaner,⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀shop⠀opens,⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀tasks⠀are⠀done.⠀Repetition⠀may⠀be⠀quotation,⠀genuine⠀concern,⠀or⠀plain⠀habit;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀prove⠀evasiveness.\n\nKeep⠀transmission⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀separate.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft;⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀transcript⠀itself⠀contains⠀only⠀what⠀reached⠀the⠀channel.⠀If⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀appears,⠀present⠀it⠀in⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀each⠀sender⠀knew⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀each⠀message.⠀A⠀person⠀cannot⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀message⠀they⠀have⠀not⠀received,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀reply⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀them⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀Allow⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀remain⠀ongoing,⠀with⠀no⠀required⠀delay,⠀forced⠀apology,⠀or⠀changed⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabacba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Chuck⠀Palahniuk⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Establish⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen:⠀light⠀through⠀a⠀kitchen⠀window,⠀a⠀jacket⠀hung⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀someone⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀mug.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀note⠀