ortant⠀one.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀label⠀and⠀the⠀act⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀a⠀failure⠀or⠀concealed⠀as⠀a⠀secret⠀need.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀reasons⠀and⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀One⠀character's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀other's.⠀Direct⠀affection⠀may⠀be⠀spoken⠀plainly.⠀Agreed⠀intentions⠀may⠀be⠀carried⠀out.⠀Substantial⠀actual⠀change⠀may⠀occur,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀may⠀remain⠀as⠀it⠀is.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀compulsory⠀repair,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀joke⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀and⠀the⠀people's⠀actual⠀choices⠀govern⠀the⠀pause,⠀including⠀an⠀ongoing,⠀concluded,⠀or⠀changed⠀relationship.⠀Its⠀particular⠀history⠀need⠀not⠀guarantee⠀continuation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀retelling.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀the⠀act⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀community⠀might⠀remember⠀it.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀what⠀was⠀asked,⠀given,⠀refused,⠀or⠀accepted.⠀Then⠀expand⠀the⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀means,⠀request,⠀or⠀response⠀it⠀encompasses.⠀The⠀grand⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate:⠀the⠀person⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀always⠀came⠀may⠀indeed⠀have⠀come,⠀and⠀the⠀expansion⠀shows⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀of⠀that⠀coming,⠀not⠀a⠀comic⠀demotion.\n\nUse⠀names⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀with⠀purpose.⠀A⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Let⠀a⠀phrase⠀return⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀retelling,⠀with⠀familiar⠀or⠀changed⠀application.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀deed.⠀It⠀may⠀simply⠀mark⠀that⠀the⠀act⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀lived⠀with.\n\nSeparate⠀original⠀motives⠀and⠀knowledge⠀from⠀later⠀reputation.⠀What⠀the⠀person⠀intended⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀later⠀says⠀the⠀act⠀meant.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀both,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀reputation⠀replace⠀the⠀earlier⠀private⠀experience.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀within⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀heroic⠀identity,⠀a⠀debunking,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀verdict.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀still⠀remembered⠀and⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀deed⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀told.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism:⠀keep⠀the⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀shared⠀arrangement⠀in⠀view⠀as⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀people⠀actually⠀live,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀backdrop⠀for⠀one⠀relationship.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀sweeping⠀claim⠀about⠀closeness,⠀commitment,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀owe⠀each⠀other,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀concrete⠀time,⠀space,⠀and⠀preferences⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀concerned.⠀The⠀claim⠀can⠀be⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀meet⠀a⠀small⠀logistical⠀need:⠀someone⠀agrees⠀to⠀stay,⠀then⠀asks⠀where⠀they⠀will⠀sleep;⠀someone⠀declares⠀a⠀principle,⠀then⠀checks⠀whether⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀eaten.⠀Let⠀the⠀contrast⠀reveal⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀actual⠀terms⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀relationship⠀foolish⠀or⠀the⠀first⠀statement⠀inadequate.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀participants'⠀separate⠀concerns.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀thinking⠀about⠀the⠀relationship⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀thinking⠀about⠀the⠀bus⠀schedule,⠀the⠀cold⠀radiator,⠀or⠀whether⠀there⠀is⠀enough⠀milk.⠀These⠀concerns⠀do⠀not⠀cancel⠀each⠀other.⠀Show⠀competent⠀cooperation⠀and⠀refusal⠀as⠀they⠀actually⠀occur:⠀someone⠀helps⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀without⠀turning⠀helpfulness⠀into⠀proof⠀of⠀devotion;⠀someone⠀declines⠀without⠀turning⠀refusal⠀into⠀betrayal.⠀Preserve⠀private⠀feeling⠀beyond⠀household⠀usefulness.⠀A⠀character's⠀inner⠀life⠀may⠀include⠀resentment,⠀relief,⠀affection,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀has⠀nothing⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀chore⠀at⠀hand.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀productive⠀work⠀to⠀justify⠀company.⠀People⠀may⠀sit⠀together,⠀rest,⠀or⠀share⠀a⠀meal⠀without⠀advancing⠀a⠀plan.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀accumulate⠀ordinary⠀particulars—who⠀sits⠀where,⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀what⠀time⠀it⠀is—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀crisis⠀or⠀lesson⠀into⠀every⠀exchange.⠀Ground⠀the⠀scale⠀shift⠀in⠀actual⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀conditions.⠀The⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀on⠀their⠀relation,⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀name⠀an⠀understanding⠀directly;⠀avoid⠀only⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀clear,⠀not⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀individual⠀speech.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀mind⠀ownership⠀intact,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀national⠀reserve,⠀a⠀family⠀structure,⠀or⠀a⠀domestic⠀cutaway⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀establish.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀keep⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀events⠀concrete:⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀reach,⠀and⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀blocks⠀carry⠀the⠀practical⠀circumstances⠀of⠀the⠀encounter—who⠀is⠀where,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀holding,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀finish⠀or⠀avoid.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀broad⠀statement⠀about⠀a⠀relationship,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀plan,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀ordinary⠀condition⠀through⠀a⠀supported⠀cut⠀or⠀adjacent⠀action.⠀For⠀example,⠀one⠀scene⠀shows⠀someone⠀declaring⠀that⠀they⠀will⠀always⠀be⠀available;⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀asleep⠀through⠀a⠀phone⠀call,⠀or⠀the⠀listener⠀already⠀carrying⠀groceries⠀when⠀the⠀declaration⠀arrives.⠀The⠀juxtaposition⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀and⠀factual,⠀not⠀a⠀prescribed⠀mismatch⠀or⠀spectacle.⠀The⠀broad⠀statement⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀condition⠀may⠀simply⠀qualify⠀its⠀scale.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀punchline,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀reveal.\n\nPreserve⠀real⠀time⠀and⠀actual⠀geography.⠀A⠀cut⠀does⠀not⠀teleport⠀characters⠀or⠀erase⠀travel.⠀If⠀a⠀scene⠀moves⠀to⠀another⠀place,⠀the⠀heading⠀and⠀action⠀blocks⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀change⠀legible.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀separately⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀voice-over⠀or⠀dialogue⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀An⠀expression⠀or⠀visible⠀detail⠀can⠀support⠀interpretation⠀in⠀context,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀certify⠀motive.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀another's⠀face⠀and⠀be⠀wrong,⠀or⠀right⠀for⠀reasons⠀they⠀cannot⠀fully⠀articulate.⠀Let⠀an⠀exchange⠀remain⠀pending⠀or⠀conclude⠀without⠀a⠀reveal.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀public⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Make⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀do⠀practical⠀work:⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀the⠀table,⠀who⠀is⠀already⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀confine⠀the⠀wider⠀story⠀to⠀one⠀room⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀task⠀merely⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀characters⠀busy.⠀The⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀certify⠀hidden⠀feeling.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀broad⠀spoken⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀relationship,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀intention,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀its⠀enactment⠀or⠀reception⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀shared⠀space.⠀Someone⠀says⠀they⠀will⠀take⠀care⠀of⠀everything,⠀then⠀cannot⠀find⠀their⠀keys.⠀Someone⠀says⠀they⠀have⠀been⠀waiting,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀still⠀holding⠀the⠀coat⠀they⠀were⠀asked⠀to⠀hang⠀up.⠀The⠀contrast⠀can⠀fit⠀accurately:⠀the⠀speaker⠀may⠀mean⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀caught⠀by⠀an⠀ordinary⠀physical⠀limit.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀comic⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀revelation.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀make⠀the⠀public⠀relation⠀legible,⠀while⠀preserving⠀needed⠀causal⠀directions⠀and⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀understanding⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀explanatory⠀aside.\n\nHandle⠀offstage⠀events⠀through⠀credible⠀sounds,⠀reports,⠀or⠀visible⠀traces.⠀A⠀knock,⠀a⠀phone⠀ringing⠀in⠀another⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀bag⠀left⠀by⠀the⠀door⠀can⠀indicate⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀elsewhere⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀cast⠀reaction.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀performed⠀asides⠀or⠀monologues.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀separate⠀authoring⠀material.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀exchange.⠀No⠀changed⠀stage⠀arrangement⠀or⠀revelation⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀stop.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀the⠀actual⠀associative⠀succession⠀of⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀as⠀they⠀arise,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀thinking⠀about⠀a⠀large⠀claim—what⠀they⠀owe⠀someone,⠀what⠀the⠀relationship⠀means—when⠀an⠀ordinary⠀perception⠀pulls⠀the⠀thought⠀sideways:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀kettle,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀a⠀remembered⠀sentence⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀present⠀room.⠀Let⠀the⠀shift⠀of⠀scale⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement.⠀A⠀mundane⠀detail⠀may⠀absorb⠀attention⠀for⠀a⠀long⠀stretch,⠀or⠀a⠀broad⠀belief⠀may⠀remain⠀unchanged⠀by⠀everything⠀that⠀interrupts⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀witty⠀conclusion⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀associative⠀movement.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀simply⠀move⠀on,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀concern⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀uncertainty.⠀Keep⠀present⠀events⠀distinct⠀from⠀recollection⠀and⠀fantasy.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀remembers⠀a⠀conversation,⠀make⠀the⠀memory's⠀status⠀clear⠀through⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀thought—the⠀remembered⠀words,⠀the⠀felt⠀difference⠀of⠀the⠀past—rather⠀than⠀blending⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀mind⠀ownership.⠀Keep⠀this⠀associative⠀center⠀distinct⠀from⠀other⠀minds⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀separately⠀authorized⠀access;⠀the⠀style⠀neither⠀merges⠀minds⠀nor⠀removes⠀permissions⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants.\n\nGive⠀feeling⠀and⠀thought⠀their⠀own⠀extent.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀slight⠀or⠀a⠀large⠀hope⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀material⠀task.⠀Prose⠀length⠀does⠀not⠀set⠀fictional⠀elapsed⠀time:⠀a⠀long⠀associative⠀passage⠀may⠀cover⠀seconds,⠀while⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀may⠀cover⠀hours.⠀Let⠀the⠀ordinary⠀and⠀the⠀expansive⠀meet⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀actual⠀movement.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀name⠀their⠀connection⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unexamined;⠀no⠀explanatory⠀gloss⠀is⠀required⠀after⠀each⠀shift.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀one⠀edits⠀repeatedly,⠀another⠀sends⠀without⠀checking.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀same⠀narrator.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀sends⠀a⠀broad⠀relational⠀statement—a⠀promise,⠀an⠀explanation,⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀or⠀intend—place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀ordinary⠀conditions⠀of⠀actually⠀composing,⠀receiving,⠀and⠀answering⠀it.⠀The⠀next⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀practical⠀detail:⠀what⠀time⠀to⠀meet,⠀what⠀to⠀bring,⠀whether⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀locked.⠀The⠀broad⠀statement⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀detail⠀can⠀simply⠀continue⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀undercutting⠀it.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀may⠀remain⠀plain⠀without⠀a⠀joke⠀or⠀misunderstanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀punchline⠀or⠀a⠀misread.\n\nDistinguish⠀composed⠀drafts⠀and⠀actual⠀dictation⠀from⠀imagined⠀wording,⠀transmission,⠀receipt,⠀comprehension,⠀and⠀action.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀type⠀a⠀message⠀and⠀not⠀send⠀it;⠀show⠀the⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀receipt,⠀and⠀receipt⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀of⠀comprehension⠀or⠀action.⠀Preserve⠀knowledge⠀from⠀other⠀channels:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀something⠀from⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀or⠀a⠀face-to-face⠀conversation⠀that⠀never⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀separately⠀attributed⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀No⠀delayed⠀reply,⠀confirmation,⠀or⠀emotional⠀shift⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀plain⠀answer⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀question.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaeba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀encounter⠀through⠀relevant⠀places,⠀objects,⠀or⠀distances⠀without⠀assigning⠀a⠀cue⠀to⠀every⠀beat.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀and⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀then⠀move⠀among⠀attributed⠀speech,⠀focal⠀narration,⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀attention⠀requires.⠀A⠀cue⠀is⠀a⠀purposeful⠀reference⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀illustrated⠀scene⠀would⠀show:⠀the⠀table⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀the⠀coat⠀still⠀on,⠀the⠀window⠀with⠀its⠀particular⠀light.⠀Do⠀not⠀label⠀every⠀line⠀with⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue.⠀Use⠀a⠀cue⠀when⠀it⠀orients,⠀sustains,⠀or⠀develops⠀the⠀experience;⠀familiar⠀meaning⠀and⠀unchanged⠀attention⠀are⠀valid.\n\nPlace⠀a⠀broad⠀account⠀beside⠀its⠀actual⠀human⠀circumstances.⠀For⠀spoken⠀words,⠀distinguish⠀the⠀speaker's⠀experience⠀from⠀the⠀recipient's⠀actual⠀reception;⠀for⠀a⠀private⠀explanation,⠀retain⠀its⠀owner's⠀experience⠀without⠀treating⠀it⠀as⠀information⠀another⠀character⠀received.⠀A⠀cue⠀may⠀qualify⠀or⠀confirm⠀the⠀account:⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀already⠀nodding,⠀or⠀looking⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀still⠀holding⠀the⠀cup⠀the⠀speaker⠀assumed⠀was⠀put⠀away.⠀The⠀cue⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀reaction⠀portrait.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀another's⠀expression⠀and⠀be⠀wrong,⠀or⠀right⠀for⠀reasons⠀the⠀expression⠀alone⠀cannot⠀prove.⠀Let⠀the⠀cue⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀motive.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀fast⠀exchange⠀to⠀contain⠀developed⠀inward⠀experience⠀when⠀it⠀matters.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀a⠀whole⠀implication⠀between⠀two⠀short⠀lines,⠀or⠀feel⠀something⠀that⠀has⠀no⠀immediate⠀outward⠀sign.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀mind⠀ownership⠀intact.⠀Private⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀become⠀another⠀character's⠀knowledge;⠀preserve⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀channels⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀No⠀added⠀images,⠀menu,⠀romance⠀route,⠀fixed⠀alternation⠀of⠀speech⠀and⠀response,⠀or⠀comic⠀final⠀cue⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀presentation.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaebb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Recover⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀reenter⠀the⠀continuing⠀concern:⠀what⠀was⠀asked,⠀agreed,⠀learned,⠀or⠀left⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀that⠀established⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀made⠀a⠀promise,⠀carry⠀the⠀promise;⠀if⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀was⠀corrected,⠀carry⠀the⠀correction;⠀if⠀a⠀question⠀remains⠀open,⠀carry⠀the⠀question.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀reenter⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀recap.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀broad⠀explanation⠀has⠀been⠀qualified⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀fact,⠀preserve⠀the⠀qualification.⠀Someone⠀said⠀they⠀would⠀always⠀be⠀available,⠀then⠀missed⠀a⠀call⠀because⠀they⠀were⠀asleep.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀preserves⠀both⠀the⠀promise⠀and⠀the⠀missed⠀call.⠀Whether⠀that⠀event⠀breaks⠀the⠀promise⠀depends⠀on⠀its⠀actual⠀terms⠀and⠀circumstances;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀settle⠀every⠀other⠀claim⠀or⠀the⠀whole⠀relationship.⠀A⠀later⠀supported⠀revision⠀may⠀qualify⠀the⠀explanation⠀further,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀erase⠀the⠀earlier⠀event⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀account⠀wrong.⠀Do⠀not⠀reset⠀ordinary⠀facts⠀to⠀create⠀fresh⠀absurdity.\n\nLet⠀shared⠀routines⠀and⠀private⠀feelings⠀continue⠀without⠀new⠀meanings.⠀Two⠀people⠀may⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀small⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀revelation.⠀Actual⠀conflict⠀can⠀occur⠀without⠀being⠀an⠀installment⠀fee.⠀No⠀recap,⠀gag,⠀confession,⠀or⠀prepared⠀next⠀move⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nPut⠀the⠀difficult⠀matter⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀encounter.⠀Choose⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀small⠀activity⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀request:⠀a⠀seat⠀left⠀available,⠀a⠀coat⠀held,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀question⠀answered.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀make⠀the⠀request⠀through⠀direct⠀speech,⠀or⠀render⠀an⠀actually⠀withheld⠀request⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀outward⠀display,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀cost⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀person⠀and⠀this⠀moment.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀thing⠀done.⠀If⠀someone⠀says⠀too⠀little,⠀show⠀what⠀made⠀the⠀omission⠀possible:⠀attention,⠀fear,⠀pride,⠀exhaustion,⠀or⠀a⠀wish⠀not⠀to⠀be⠀understood⠀yet.⠀If⠀someone⠀says⠀more⠀than⠀they⠀intended,⠀let⠀the⠀words⠀follow⠀their⠀actual⠀purpose,⠀feeling,⠀and⠀manner;⠀ordinary⠀talk⠀or⠀a⠀deliberate⠀speech⠀is⠀possible.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀extended⠀or⠀plainly⠀named.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀outward⠀strain,⠀broken⠀sentences,⠀or⠀evasive⠀speech⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀pain.\n\nCarry⠀any⠀actual⠀effects⠀of⠀the⠀exchange⠀into⠀what⠀follows,⠀including⠀private⠀experience⠀with⠀unchanged⠀conduct⠀or⠀an⠀interval⠀with⠀no⠀next⠀practical⠀act.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀finish⠀the⠀task,⠀leave⠀the⠀room,⠀accept⠀help⠀badly,⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀question.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀experience⠀of⠀needing⠀and⠀admitting,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀required⠀quarrel⠀or⠀collapse.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nResolve⠀the⠀supplied⠀interaction⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval.⠀Use⠀clear⠀attribution⠀and⠀continuous⠀paragraphs⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀acting.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀role⠀contract⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀intact.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀word,⠀activity,⠀or⠀pause⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀present.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀direct⠀answer,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object⠀handed⠀over,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀notices.⠀Let⠀speech⠀be⠀brief⠀or⠀expansive⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀terse,⠀witty,⠀or⠀ready⠀with⠀a⠀polished⠀reply.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀actual⠀state⠀forward,⠀including⠀an⠀interval⠀with⠀no⠀new⠀development⠀while⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀thought⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀accept,⠀refuse,⠀misunderstand,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀practical⠀task.⠀Leave⠀a⠀continuation⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀The⠀shared⠀physical⠀situation⠀should⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀route.⠀Follow⠀a⠀familiar⠀activity⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀home,⠀shop,⠀courtyard,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀space⠀where⠀an⠀invitation,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀withheld⠀request⠀matters.⠀Keep⠀the⠀encounter⠀concrete:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀clearing⠀a⠀table,⠀mending⠀something,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀carrying⠀an⠀object⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another.\n\nSelect⠀the⠀object⠀used⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀exchange⠀around⠀it.⠀A⠀cup,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀letter,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀clothing⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship.⠀If⠀the⠀object⠀recurs,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀actual⠀continuing⠀feeling⠀or⠀interpretation,⠀whether⠀easy,⠀difficult,⠀changed,⠀unchanged,⠀or⠀unsettled.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀breach,⠀confession,⠀or⠀dramatic⠀recognition.\n\nWrite⠀direct⠀speech⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀ordinary⠀registers.⠀Keep⠀what⠀is⠀privately⠀felt⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀can⠀infer.⠀The⠀domestic⠀setting⠀supplies⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀closeness;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀gentle,⠀silent,⠀or⠀bound⠀by⠀a⠀single⠀family⠀structure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀established⠀material⠀conditions⠀that⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀encounter:⠀worn⠀steps,⠀a⠀heavy⠀door,⠀a⠀cold⠀room,⠀a⠀broken⠀clasp,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀finished.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Let⠀physical⠀detail⠀carry⠀established⠀pressure⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀survival⠀predicament⠀or⠀violence⠀for⠀the⠀style;⠀retain⠀any⠀such⠀events⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supplies.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀around⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀short⠀sentence⠀can⠀land⠀a⠀refusal⠀or⠀an⠀admission.⠀A⠀longer⠀passage⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀reasoning⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀plain⠀task⠀or⠀exact⠀bodily⠀detail⠀may⠀accompany⠀irritation,⠀care,⠀or⠀fatigue⠀without⠀proving⠀what⠀anyone⠀feels.\n\nKeep⠀inward⠀experience⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀length.⠀Do⠀not⠀shorten⠀a⠀thought⠀merely⠀to⠀look⠀tough.⠀Abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀belongs⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀speaker⠀or⠀narrator⠀warrants⠀it.⠀The⠀style⠀supplies⠀force⠀and⠀material⠀texture;⠀the⠀character⠀drama⠀still⠀turns⠀on⠀what⠀people⠀ask,⠀accept,⠀or⠀withhold.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀situated⠀documents.⠀Each⠀one⠀has⠀a⠀real⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀note,⠀report,⠀journal⠀entry,⠀receipt,⠀or⠀other⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chosen⠀wording,⠀named⠀item,⠀or⠀unanswered⠀line⠀make⠀what⠀was⠀communicated⠀clear.⠀A⠀precise⠀request⠀can⠀be⠀accepted,⠀refused,⠀or⠀ignored⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀document.⠀An⠀omission⠀matters⠀only⠀through⠀context:⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀knew,⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀expected,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀accomplish.\n\nKeep⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀written.⠀A⠀composed⠀record⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀complete⠀mind.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀the⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀substitute.⠀A⠀truthful⠀plain⠀record⠀may⠀need⠀no⠀hidden⠀layer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀the⠀kindness⠀exact⠀activity.⠀Someone⠀prepares,⠀shares,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀leaves⠀within⠀reach⠀a⠀particular⠀thing⠀because⠀of⠀this⠀person's⠀preference:⠀a⠀drink⠀made⠀a⠀certain⠀way,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀toward⠀the⠀light,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀early,⠀a⠀familiar⠀food⠀set⠀out.⠀Let⠀the⠀object⠀and⠀the⠀action⠀carry⠀the⠀care.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recipient⠀respond⠀as⠀themselves.⠀They⠀may⠀offer⠀ordinary⠀thanks,⠀quiet⠀pleasure,⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀something⠀else.⠀They⠀do⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀become⠀agreeable⠀or⠀perform⠀gratitude.⠀Direct⠀affection⠀and⠀developed⠀private⠀feeling⠀remain⠀possible⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀improvement⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀an⠀established⠀problem.⠀One⠀occasion⠀of⠀care⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀anything⠀or⠀advance⠀a⠀larger⠀relationship⠀premise.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-character_drama-02",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Character Drama · 02/06",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == character_drama}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Character Drama. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 2 of 6. }}{{// Source group: recipes-character_drama; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPabafag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀exchange⠀into⠀relevant⠀history⠀or⠀social⠀context⠀within⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀A⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀small⠀act⠀can⠀open⠀into⠀family⠀history,⠀work,⠀custom,⠀or⠀public⠀expectation.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀wider⠀account⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀interruption.\n\nReconnect⠀the⠀context⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀exchange.⠀The⠀wider⠀account⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀concrete⠀act⠀more⠀legible,⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀summary.⠀Use⠀exact⠀activity⠀and⠀direct⠀language:⠀the⠀object⠀handled,⠀the⠀door⠀closed,⠀the⠀letter⠀read,⠀the⠀money⠀counted.\n\nKeep⠀speakers⠀in⠀their⠀ordinary⠀registers⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀amount⠀of⠀speech.⠀A⠀composed⠀narrative⠀may⠀frame⠀an⠀unresolved⠀feeling⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀or⠀object⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀judgment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀with⠀the⠀occasion⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀practical⠀or⠀relational⠀purpose⠀the⠀account⠀serves,⠀and⠀why⠀this⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀speak⠀now.⠀Establish⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀embedded⠀events.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀recount⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀did,⠀heard⠀from⠀a⠀named⠀source,⠀or⠀was⠀told⠀later,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀quietly⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀the⠀teller⠀could⠀not⠀have.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀from⠀exact⠀objects,⠀actions,⠀and⠀spoken⠀lines.⠀Use⠀direct⠀language⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀characterization:⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀because⠀it⠀pleased⠀the⠀teller,⠀because⠀it⠀still⠀troubles⠀them,⠀or⠀because⠀they⠀believe⠀the⠀listener⠀needs⠀to⠀hear⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀confess,⠀conceal,⠀or⠀explain⠀the⠀selection.⠀The⠀omission⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀leave⠀out⠀what⠀seemed⠀unimportant,⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀or⠀what⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀response⠀or⠀continuing⠀attention.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀question,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀look⠀away,⠀offer⠀something,⠀continue⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀simply⠀listen.⠀Let⠀that⠀participation⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀relationship⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀or⠀a⠀correct⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀response,⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀alone.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct.⠀Use⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀recurrence⠀certify⠀the⠀story's⠀truth⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀an⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀present;⠀the⠀told⠀events⠀remain⠀particular⠀and⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀know.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀realism⠀and⠀organize⠀the⠀passage⠀around⠀a⠀return:⠀an⠀earlier⠀act,⠀exchange,⠀or⠀expectation⠀becomes⠀relevant⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀occasion.⠀The⠀return⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀memory.⠀It⠀may⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀repeated⠀task,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀a⠀similar⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀makes⠀differently⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀way.\n\nRender⠀both⠀occasions⠀with⠀exact⠀particulars⠀and⠀direct⠀speech.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀asked⠀for,⠀accepted,⠀withheld,⠀or⠀misunderstood⠀in⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀later⠀conduct⠀that⠀carries⠀that⠀history.⠀The⠀connection⠀may⠀be⠀causal,⠀partial,⠀or⠀contradictory.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀remember⠀an⠀old⠀instruction⠀and⠀still⠀act⠀against⠀it,⠀follow⠀it⠀without⠀naming⠀it,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀explains⠀the⠀present.\n\nLet⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀remain⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀development.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀competent,⠀more⠀tired,⠀more⠀honest,⠀or⠀more⠀evasive;⠀none⠀of⠀these⠀is⠀automatic⠀proof⠀of⠀moral⠀improvement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀says,⠀and⠀let⠀private⠀understanding,⠀when⠀authorized,⠀include⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀refusal⠀to⠀settle⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀past.\n\nA⠀closing⠀lesson⠀is⠀not⠀required;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀reach⠀an⠀understanding⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀what⠀actually⠀occurs.⠀The⠀earlier⠀experience⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀it⠀shaped⠀a⠀habit,⠀because⠀it⠀now⠀seems⠀false,⠀or⠀because⠀it⠀simply⠀returns⠀without⠀being⠀resolved.⠀The⠀story's⠀interest⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀the⠀past⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀choice,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀completed⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nEnter⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀point⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀meets⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀room,⠀key,⠀desk,⠀title,⠀account,⠀permission,⠀or⠀object⠀that⠀carries⠀an⠀inherited⠀claim.⠀Describe⠀it⠀in⠀exact⠀material⠀terms⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀uses⠀it,⠀avoids⠀it,⠀asks⠀for⠀it,⠀or⠀must⠀work⠀around⠀it.⠀The⠀authority⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange,⠀not⠀merely⠀atmospheric.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀direct.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀authority⠀permits,⠀costs,⠀or⠀protects.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀carry⠀the⠀intimate⠀weight:⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀trust⠀the⠀holder⠀of⠀the⠀authority,⠀resent⠀the⠀obligation,⠀need⠀the⠀access,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀what⠀it⠀requires.⠀Private⠀desire⠀or⠀discomfort,⠀where⠀authorized,⠀can⠀be⠀extensive⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀visible⠀reaction.\n\nUse⠀the⠀material⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀social⠀history⠀present⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀evidence⠀of⠀corruption.⠀A⠀worn⠀object⠀may⠀indicate⠀long⠀use,⠀not⠀moral⠀decay.⠀A⠀formal⠀permission⠀may⠀be⠀honored,⠀resented,⠀or⠀questioned⠀for⠀practical⠀reasons.⠀Atmosphere⠀can⠀heighten⠀the⠀encounter,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀what⠀the⠀authority⠀means⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀will⠀do.\n\nLet⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀fall⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀supports⠀it.⠀Familiarity⠀may⠀produce⠀genuine⠀ease,⠀partial⠀trust,⠀or⠀a⠀careful⠀lowering⠀of⠀formality.⠀The⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀revelation⠀of⠀hidden⠀power.⠀The⠀drama⠀lies⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀person⠀meets⠀the⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀ask,⠀accept,⠀or⠀change.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀testimonial⠀accounting⠀and⠀establish⠀an⠀actual⠀participant⠀who⠀speaks⠀or⠀records⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀given⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀an⠀official,⠀a⠀friend,⠀a⠀community⠀gathering,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀reader,⠀but⠀the⠀occasion⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀includes.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀of⠀that⠀occasion⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀present.\n\nUse⠀exact⠀acts⠀and⠀direct⠀phrases⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀lived⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀heard⠀or⠀learned⠀afterward.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀reports⠀another⠀person's⠀words⠀or⠀actions,⠀keep⠀the⠀source⠀visible:⠀the⠀teller⠀saw⠀it,⠀was⠀told⠀it,⠀read⠀it,⠀or⠀inferred⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀testimony⠀quietly⠀become⠀omniscient.\n\nLet⠀selection⠀carry⠀personal⠀meaning.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀state⠀feeling⠀plainly,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀still⠀matters,⠀or⠀omit⠀something⠀for⠀a⠀supported⠀reason⠀such⠀as⠀shame,⠀loyalty,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀the⠀belief⠀that⠀the⠀listener⠀would⠀not⠀understand.⠀Omission⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀concealment⠀with⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth⠀behind⠀it;⠀it⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀or⠀will⠀not⠀put⠀into⠀the⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀performed⠀or⠀recorded⠀testimony.⠀The⠀testimony⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀an⠀audience;⠀the⠀teller's⠀live⠀unspoken⠀thought,⠀where⠀authorized,⠀remains⠀separate⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀hears.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀accounting⠀occasion⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀response⠀or⠀continuation,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀resolve⠀or⠀judge⠀the⠀account.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀psychological⠀realism⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind⠀organize⠀the⠀passage.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀encounter:⠀an⠀object⠀handled,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Keep⠀the⠀literal⠀event⠀clear⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀moves⠀from⠀the⠀detail⠀to⠀memory,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀inward⠀words.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀language⠀for⠀both⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀experience.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀name⠀an⠀emotion⠀plainly,⠀recognize⠀it⠀only⠀through⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀or⠀understand⠀the⠀detail⠀differently⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Let⠀sustained⠀psychological⠀narration⠀follow⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀attention,⠀including⠀associations⠀when⠀they⠀occur,⠀without⠀requiring⠀associative⠀syntax⠀to⠀organize⠀every⠀sentence.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀arrive⠀because⠀the⠀detail⠀resembles⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀waiting⠀for⠀this⠀moment,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀revises⠀what⠀they⠀thought⠀they⠀knew.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀interpret⠀correctly.⠀They⠀may⠀misread⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀intention,⠀notice⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀or⠀live⠀with⠀a⠀feeling⠀they⠀cannot⠀settle.⠀The⠀inner⠀experience⠀can⠀be⠀extensive⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀cut⠀short⠀by⠀speech⠀or⠀action.\n\nReconnect⠀with⠀the⠀literal⠀encounter⠀where⠀actual⠀attention⠀or⠀events⠀take⠀the⠀passage⠀there;⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀also⠀continue⠀across⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀without⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀response.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀speak,⠀remain⠀silent,⠀perform⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀leave⠀something⠀unsaid.⠀The⠀scene's⠀meaning⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀precise⠀perception⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀private⠀understanding,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀lesson⠀extracted⠀from⠀the⠀moment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀social⠀realism⠀and⠀chronicle.⠀Follow⠀a⠀shared⠀place,⠀recurring⠀activity,⠀or⠀relationship⠀through⠀specific⠀ordered⠀encounters.⠀The⠀order⠀may⠀be⠀chronological,⠀seasonal,⠀or⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀recurring⠀event⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀market⠀day,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀delivery,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀each⠀encounter⠀be⠀a⠀distinct⠀scene⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀exact⠀particulars⠀and⠀direct⠀exchanges.\n\nShow⠀continuities⠀through⠀repeated⠀objects,⠀tasks,⠀phrases,⠀or⠀arrangements.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀always⠀bring⠀the⠀same⠀thing,⠀ask⠀the⠀same⠀question,⠀or⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀place.⠀Show⠀actual⠀changes⠀through⠀what⠀someone⠀now⠀provides,⠀refuses,⠀accepts,⠀or⠀no⠀longer⠀mentions.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀continuity⠀and⠀change⠀legible⠀without⠀announcing⠀it⠀as⠀progress⠀or⠀decline.\n\nAttribute⠀remembered⠀or⠀reported⠀material⠀to⠀its⠀source.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀repeat⠀what⠀another⠀said,⠀or⠀describe⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀believes.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀a⠀shared⠀account⠀into⠀everyone's⠀private⠀mind.⠀Authorized⠀interiority⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀focal⠀character,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀group.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀present⠀through⠀practical⠀activity.⠀Work,⠀money,⠀food,⠀transport,⠀housing,⠀and⠀obligation⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀relationships.⠀The⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀judgment⠀about⠀the⠀community⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀the⠀characters.⠀Its⠀interest⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀ways⠀people⠀ask,⠀provide,⠀stay,⠀or⠀change⠀across⠀the⠀ordered⠀occasions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀activity.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀action,⠀object,⠀or⠀exchange⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀reader⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation,⠀then⠀establish⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀through⠀clear⠀attribution⠀and⠀selective⠀detail.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀a⠀block⠀of⠀background.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀and⠀temporal⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀from⠀action⠀to⠀speech,⠀or⠀from⠀speech⠀to⠀private⠀response,⠀use⠀a⠀clean⠀paragraph⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀transition.⠀Explain⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀term,⠀name,⠀or⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀only⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀present⠀exchange;⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.\n\nLet⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀pass⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inward⠀response⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention.⠀A⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀quiet.⠀Straightforward⠀language⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀reaction⠀to⠀be⠀short,⠀understated,⠀or⠀comic.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀asked⠀or⠀about⠀what⠀they⠀themselves⠀are⠀deciding.\n\nUse⠀exact⠀objects⠀and⠀direct⠀lines⠀to⠀carry⠀what⠀remains⠀unsaid.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀withhold⠀an⠀answer,⠀repeat⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀task⠀instead⠀of⠀speaking.⠀The⠀personal⠀significance⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀should⠀be⠀accessible⠀through⠀the⠀concrete⠀exchange⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀closing⠀explanation.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀an⠀exchange⠀whose⠀next⠀response⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀determined.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBegin⠀with⠀an⠀exact⠀object,⠀sound,⠀or⠀activity⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀develop⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀remains⠀traceable⠀to⠀that⠀source.⠀The⠀image⠀may⠀unfold⠀across⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀detach⠀from⠀the⠀literal⠀encounter:⠀a⠀wet⠀glass,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀repeated⠀knock,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀slowly⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol⠀that⠀replaces⠀the⠀action.⠀Use⠀direct⠀statements⠀to⠀interrupt⠀or⠀support⠀the⠀lyrical⠀movement⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀needs⠀clarity.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀plainly⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀or⠀refuse,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀image⠀with⠀that⠀knowledge⠀in⠀place.\n\nRepeat⠀the⠀image⠀or⠀a⠀sound⠀related⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀moment⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀may⠀preserve⠀meaning⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀alter⠀it;⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀can⠀mean⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀on⠀a⠀second⠀occasion⠀and⠀still⠀matter⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀has⠀returned⠀to⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀insight.⠀Let⠀the⠀shaped⠀motif⠀guide⠀the⠀inward⠀movement⠀while⠀the⠀outward⠀activity⠀continues⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character's⠀mind⠀enter⠀the⠀lyrical⠀passage⠀unless⠀that⠀access⠀is⠀authorized.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀exchange⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀the⠀feeling⠀named⠀directly,⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀image.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀express⠀their⠀own⠀interpretation⠀where⠀authorized,⠀rather⠀than⠀imposing⠀a⠀universal⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nWhen⠀memory⠀belongs,⠀place⠀a⠀specific⠀past⠀act,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀object⠀beside⠀its⠀present⠀occasion⠀without⠀letting⠀the⠀past⠀replace⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀remembered⠀particular⠀should⠀be⠀exact:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀once⠀held⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀words⠀they⠀used⠀when⠀refusing⠀an⠀invitation,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀afternoon.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀continue⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms⠀while⠀the⠀recollection⠀sits⠀alongside⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀enjoy⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀and⠀that⠀pleasure⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀the⠀memory.⠀A⠀familiar⠀meal⠀can⠀taste⠀good;⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀go⠀well;⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀glad⠀to⠀see⠀someone⠀and⠀still⠀remember⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.\n\nAllow⠀direct⠀feeling⠀or⠀an⠀omission⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀person's⠀voice⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀resigned⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀name⠀what⠀they⠀miss,⠀or⠀they⠀may⠀say⠀nothing⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀work⠀at⠀hand.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence⠀or⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀remembered⠀person⠀newly⠀unavailable.⠀The⠀reflection⠀can⠀simply⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀ongoing⠀exchange,⠀and⠀the⠀interval⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀activity⠀still⠀underway.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀memory⠀enter⠀unless⠀that⠀access⠀is⠀authorized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀modern⠀memoir:⠀a⠀composed⠀retrospective⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀later⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀presents⠀an⠀earlier⠀encounter.⠀Identify⠀whose⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀presented⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀contract,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀participant's⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀later⠀teller's⠀understanding.⠀The⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene⠀may⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀knows.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀recount⠀remembered⠀feelings⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀earlier⠀self⠀or⠀another⠀participant's⠀experience⠀supported⠀by⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀narrator⠀access,⠀without⠀inventing⠀unprovided⠀knowledge.⠀Render⠀the⠀earlier⠀encounter⠀in⠀direct⠀language⠀with⠀precise⠀objects⠀and⠀activities:⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀unsaid.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀teller's⠀reading⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀movement,⠀marked⠀by⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀tense,⠀a⠀comment⠀on⠀the⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀occasion⠀of⠀writing.\n\nLink⠀the⠀two⠀occasions⠀with⠀an⠀exact⠀phrase⠀or⠀activity⠀that⠀recurs⠀across⠀the⠀gap.⠀The⠀same⠀words⠀may⠀be⠀confirmed,⠀reconsidered,⠀or⠀left⠀uncertain⠀in⠀the⠀later⠀account.⠀Every⠀uncertainty⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved;⠀preserve⠀an⠀actual⠀resolution⠀when⠀supported,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀arrive⠀at⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Composed⠀memoir⠀and⠀actual⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀remain⠀separate⠀channels:⠀the⠀memoir⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chooses⠀to⠀record,⠀while⠀required⠀interiority⠀still⠀renders⠀the⠀present⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀composing⠀mind⠀or⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀atmosphere.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀establish⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀done,⠀or⠀left⠀open.⠀Select⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀personal⠀choice⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀object⠀someone⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀word⠀they⠀repeated,⠀the⠀question⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀act⠀matters.⠀A⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀direct⠀sentence,⠀and⠀an⠀essential⠀longer⠀thought⠀may⠀remain⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Omit⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀where⠀the⠀context⠀already⠀supports⠀the⠀inference,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀omit⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀feeling⠀or⠀motive⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀would⠀lengthen⠀the⠀passage.\n\nLet⠀silence⠀be⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀pause⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀guilt,⠀and⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀refusal.⠀Direct⠀emotional⠀speech⠀is⠀available;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀accept.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀a⠀choice⠀is⠀completed,⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀underway⠀or⠀the⠀question⠀still⠀open.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀enter⠀unless⠀that⠀access⠀is⠀authorized.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀remain⠀economical⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀performed⠀fragments;⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀method⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀short⠀ones.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀encounter⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose,⠀moving⠀naturally⠀among⠀the⠀acts,⠀words,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀Choose⠀particulars⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀this⠀person⠀without⠀making⠀each⠀object⠀symbolic.⠀A⠀cup,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀coat,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀can⠀appear⠀because⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀life⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀must⠀stand⠀for⠀something⠀else.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀its⠀own⠀weight⠀in⠀direct⠀language,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀character's⠀speech⠀remain⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀terse⠀or⠀eloquent.\n\nAllow⠀an⠀omission⠀to⠀carry⠀meaning⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀not⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀tired,⠀because⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀yet⠀know,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀moment⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀it;⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀still⠀make⠀the⠀feeling⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Feeling⠀may⠀be⠀named⠀directly,⠀and⠀inner⠀experience⠀can⠀continue⠀without⠀materially⠀changing⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀doubt⠀and⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀close⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀insight⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀decision.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀exchange⠀still⠀underway,⠀the⠀work⠀resumed,⠀or⠀the⠀question⠀left⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀moments⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀history:⠀an⠀old⠀phrase,⠀a⠀known⠀preference,⠀a⠀permission,⠀or⠀a⠀recurring⠀activity⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people.⠀Let⠀a⠀practical⠀exchange⠀matter⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀they⠀are⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀whether⠀the⠀meaning⠀is⠀spoken⠀plainly⠀or⠀partly⠀understood⠀through⠀omission.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀repeat⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀recognizes.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀its⠀established⠀history.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀legitimate⠀differences⠀in⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀knows⠀or⠀wants.⠀One⠀character's⠀recognition⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀other's,⠀and⠀a⠀repeated⠀act⠀may⠀mean⠀different⠀things⠀to⠀each⠀of⠀them.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀include⠀rivalry,⠀difficult⠀attachment,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀discovery⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀premise,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀milestone.⠀Recognition⠀can⠀simply⠀be⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀enter⠀another's⠀mind⠀unless⠀that⠀access⠀is⠀authorized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀and⠀compact⠀declarations⠀around⠀an⠀established⠀act,⠀promise,⠀or⠀shared⠀history.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀names⠀what⠀is⠀remembered:⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀promise,⠀who⠀refused⠀the⠀request,⠀who⠀returned⠀the⠀thing.⠀Then⠀expand⠀the⠀declaration⠀into⠀exact⠀activity⠀and⠀attributed⠀speech.⠀Show⠀the⠀practical⠀particulars:⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀undone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀diction⠀plain;⠀do⠀not⠀inflate⠀an⠀ordinary⠀errand⠀into⠀mock-heroic⠀combat⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀doom.\n\nUse⠀recurrent⠀phrasing⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀same⠀compact⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed⠀or⠀because⠀another⠀person⠀now⠀speaks⠀it.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀scale⠀and⠀access⠀intact.⠀A⠀present⠀undertaking⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀resumed⠀or⠀the⠀question⠀still⠀open.⠀A⠀community's⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀dictate⠀that⠀person's⠀private⠀feeling⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀outcome.⠀The⠀participant⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀story,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀shared⠀reputation⠀replace⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀interiority.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀essayistic⠀narrative⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Open⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀position⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀can⠀presently⠀hold:⠀a⠀plausible⠀claim⠀about⠀what⠀an⠀exchange⠀asks⠀for,⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀withholds,⠀or⠀what⠀an⠀offer⠀would⠀mean.⠀Keep⠀the⠀claim⠀stated⠀in⠀direct,⠀practical⠀words,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀abstract⠀maxim.\n\nThen⠀place⠀beside⠀it⠀an⠀exact⠀case⠀from⠀the⠀available⠀scene⠀or⠀recollection:⠀the⠀specific⠀movement,⠀object,⠀or⠀spoken⠀phrase⠀that⠀the⠀claim⠀ought⠀to⠀explain.⠀Give⠀the⠀case⠀its⠀actual⠀personal⠀conditions.⠀An⠀untouched⠀dish⠀or⠀unfinished⠀line⠀may⠀bear⠀on⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀someone⠀avoids⠀help,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀that⠀interpretation.⠀Establish⠀acceptance⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀answer⠀or⠀supported⠀context⠀before⠀treating⠀a⠀later⠀act⠀as⠀its⠀consequence.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀claim⠀where⠀the⠀essayistic⠀movement⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀whether⠀the⠀case⠀supports⠀it,⠀qualifies⠀it,⠀or⠀leaves⠀it⠀unsettled.⠀Neither⠀strain⠀nor⠀altered⠀meaning⠀is⠀required.⠀A⠀lesson⠀or⠀refutation⠀may⠀occur⠀when⠀earned,⠀but⠀neither⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀the⠀thought⠀is⠀settled,⠀holding⠀the⠀case⠀and⠀the⠀claim⠀apart.⠀Keep⠀the⠀essayistic⠀frame⠀in⠀the⠀narration;⠀dialogue⠀itself⠀should⠀remain⠀individual⠀and⠀direct.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access⠀to⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀give⠀another⠀character⠀a⠀conclusion⠀automatically⠀through⠀reader⠀access;⠀preserve⠀any⠀understanding⠀they⠀independently⠀possess⠀or⠀acquire.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀action⠀blocks⠀for⠀particular⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀conditions⠀and⠀events,⠀with⠀movement⠀where⠀it⠀actually⠀occurs:⠀a⠀cup⠀placed⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀direct⠀answer,⠀a⠀task⠀continued⠀during⠀speech.⠀Let⠀the⠀exact⠀movement⠀accompany⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀not⠀explain⠀it.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀put⠀down⠀a⠀tool⠀and⠀still⠀refuse;⠀another⠀can⠀say⠀yes⠀without⠀looking⠀up.⠀The⠀action⠀shows⠀the⠀exchange,⠀not⠀the⠀motive.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀outside⠀the⠀scene⠀description⠀and⠀character⠀lines.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority⠀convention⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀that⠀private⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀voice-over,⠀parenthetical⠀acting⠀note,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀line⠀another⠀person⠀can⠀hear.⠀If⠀voice-over⠀is⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose,⠀distinct⠀from⠀live⠀private⠀thought.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀a⠀genuine⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀time⠀occurs.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀set⠀another⠀room⠀beside⠀the⠀one⠀just⠀shown:⠀one⠀person⠀leaves⠀the⠀request⠀hanging⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀resumes⠀ordinary⠀work.⠀The⠀contrast⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀itself.⠀Let⠀the⠀last⠀image⠀or⠀line⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀and⠀stop⠀there,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reveal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀answer.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀point⠀of⠀view;⠀a⠀screenplay⠀action⠀block⠀cannot⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀mind⠀not⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nPlace⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀a⠀continuous⠀shared⠀stage⠀space.⠀Keep⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀the⠀positions⠀of⠀people⠀and⠀objects⠀clear⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀performed.⠀Where⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀physical⠀business,⠀make⠀it⠀exact:⠀counting⠀cash,⠀folding⠀a⠀cloth,⠀setting⠀a⠀chair⠀upright,⠀opening⠀a⠀letter.⠀Connect⠀a⠀line⠀to⠀that⠀business⠀where⠀the⠀relation⠀matters;⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀instead⠀use⠀position,⠀stillness,⠀and⠀speech⠀without⠀assigning⠀an⠀invented⠀task⠀or⠀prop.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀action⠀performed⠀more⠀slowly,⠀not⠀an⠀instruction⠀to⠀feel⠀strongly.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀in⠀plain⠀words.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀at⠀length⠀when⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀immediate⠀need⠀support⠀it;⠀directness⠀is⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀exact⠀wording,⠀not⠀a⠀short-line⠀quota.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀stage⠀directions⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀feel.⠀Directions⠀show⠀movement,⠀timing,⠀and⠀visible⠀use⠀of⠀objects.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority⠀form,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀parenthetical⠀performance⠀cue⠀or⠀an⠀aside.⠀An⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀when⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀with⠀a⠀dramatic⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose;⠀private⠀reasoning⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀house.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀pending,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀ordinary⠀business⠀without⠀an⠀emotional⠀summary.⠀Preserve⠀authorial⠀access⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀neither⠀the⠀audience⠀nor⠀another⠀character⠀acquires⠀a⠀mind⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀authorized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nEnter⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀sensory⠀particular⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀wet⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀spoon⠀against⠀a⠀sink,⠀the⠀give⠀of⠀a⠀door.⠀Let⠀the⠀mind⠀move⠀from⠀that⠀particular⠀by⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀chronological⠀report.⠀A⠀word⠀heard⠀now⠀may⠀join⠀a⠀phrase⠀remembered⠀from⠀another⠀morning,⠀a⠀bodily⠀coldness⠀may⠀bring⠀back⠀an⠀old⠀confidence,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀may⠀keep⠀turning⠀under⠀later⠀perceptions.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀break⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀movement⠀of⠀thought⠀when⠀it⠀runs⠀or⠀stalls.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀association⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀person's⠀concrete⠀experience.⠀If⠀the⠀mind⠀leaves⠀the⠀present⠀into⠀memory,⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀object,⠀voice,⠀or⠀act⠀establish⠀the⠀memory's⠀ground.⠀External⠀time⠀and⠀other⠀people's⠀behavior⠀continue⠀according⠀to⠀actual⠀events:⠀someone⠀may⠀keep⠀speaking⠀during⠀the⠀thought,⠀finish⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀room.⠀A⠀perception⠀can⠀return⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀but⠀no⠀fixed⠀number⠀of⠀associations⠀before⠀return⠀is⠀required.\n\nThe⠀mind⠀need⠀not⠀orbit⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀or⠀the⠀immediate⠀conversation,⠀though⠀it⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀either⠀where⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀actual⠀concern.⠀The⠀concern⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀a⠀withheld⠀apology,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀trying⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀plain⠀words⠀inside⠀the⠀thought⠀rather⠀than⠀figurative⠀decoration.⠀Preserve⠀access⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀perceive⠀what⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀spoken⠀or⠀otherwise⠀established.⠀Close⠀where⠀the⠀mental⠀movement⠀has⠀brought⠀the⠀person,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀thought⠀to⠀resolve,⠀confess,⠀or⠀become⠀visible⠀to⠀others.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabafaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀channel⠀details⠀that⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀delay⠀that⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unread,⠀a⠀typing⠀indicator⠀that⠀vanishes,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀followed⠀by⠀silence,⠀an⠀edit⠀or⠀deleted⠀message⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀context⠀establishes⠀it.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀practical⠀digital⠀habits⠀stay⠀individual;⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀and⠀send⠀quickly,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀incomplete⠀