sodes⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.⠀When⠀such⠀a⠀repetition⠀appears,⠀mark⠀whose⠀account⠀or⠀habit⠀it⠀comes⠀from,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀gather⠀through⠀successive⠀occasions⠀without⠀requiring⠀each⠀recurrence⠀to⠀reveal⠀hypocrisy⠀or⠀complete⠀a⠀decision.⠀A⠀family⠀saying⠀may⠀mean⠀different⠀things⠀to⠀different⠀hearers.\n\nContinuity⠀can⠀rest⠀on⠀an⠀unchanged⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀debt⠀still⠀unpaid,⠀a⠀visit⠀still⠀expected,⠀a⠀house⠀visited⠀again,⠀a⠀promise⠀remembered⠀unevenly.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step⠀clear⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀stage⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀strong⠀verbs,⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀and⠀concrete⠀physical⠀contact⠀to⠀locate⠀a⠀request,⠀boundary,⠀or⠀admission⠀in⠀present⠀activity.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀handles,⠀sets⠀down,⠀avoids,⠀or⠀relies⠀on:⠀a⠀worn⠀tool,⠀a⠀held⠀door,⠀a⠀crowded⠀table,⠀a⠀hand⠀given⠀or⠀withdrawn.⠀Compress⠀redundant⠀transitional⠀explanation⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀feeling⠀or⠀association⠀between⠀noticing⠀and⠀acting,⠀whether⠀brief⠀or⠀developed.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀place⠀opens⠀the⠀past,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀gather⠀that⠀history⠀around⠀a⠀particular⠀person.⠀The⠀recollection⠀can⠀stretch⠀the⠀prose⠀while⠀remaining⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀prompted⠀it;⠀memory⠀need⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀present⠀or⠀alter⠀the⠀next⠀act.⠀Keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀voice⠀separate⠀from⠀present⠀speech⠀and⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀the⠀recollection⠀clear.\n\nAbrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀language⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀cast.⠀Other⠀speakers⠀may⠀be⠀plain,⠀careful,⠀or⠀quiet.⠀Let⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀serve⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀short⠀refusal⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀longer⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀cramped⠀practical⠀task⠀can⠀interrupt⠀feeling.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀interiority⠀permissions,⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀limits.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports:⠀a⠀letter,⠀note,⠀entry,⠀receipt,⠀will,⠀notice,⠀or⠀other⠀record.⠀Make⠀obvious⠀who⠀composed⠀it,⠀for⠀whom,⠀and⠀when.⠀Let⠀the⠀document⠀contain⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀actually⠀record⠀in⠀that⠀situation,⠀including⠀what⠀they⠀omit,⠀soften,⠀repeat,⠀or⠀misunderstand.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀wording⠀link⠀records⠀across⠀time⠀by⠀appearing⠀in⠀different⠀writers'⠀hands⠀or⠀through⠀someone⠀quoting⠀an⠀old⠀phrase.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀original⠀record⠀from⠀a⠀copy,⠀a⠀later⠀annotation,⠀or⠀a⠀recollection⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀said.⠀A⠀recurring⠀name⠀or⠀phrase⠀may⠀confirm⠀a⠀habit,⠀alter⠀its⠀meaning⠀through⠀use,⠀or⠀remain⠀unexamined⠀without⠀uncovering⠀a⠀secret.\n\nTreat⠀delivery,⠀reading,⠀and⠀response⠀as⠀separate⠀events:⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀arrive⠀late,⠀be⠀read⠀aloud,⠀be⠀answered⠀differently⠀than⠀intended,⠀or⠀remain⠀unopened.⠀Required⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀document's⠀composed⠀text.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀readable,⠀and⠀follow⠀what⠀each⠀record⠀actually⠀communicates⠀about⠀a⠀person's⠀request,⠀offer,⠀refusal⠀or⠀understanding,⠀allowing⠀a⠀continuing⠀or⠀pending⠀matter⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀development.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀a⠀particular⠀act⠀of⠀kindness⠀or⠀shared⠀pleasure:⠀food⠀remembered⠀from⠀home,⠀a⠀task⠀taken⠀over⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀asked,⠀a⠀place⠀arranged⠀for⠀rest,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀joke⠀repeated⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment,⠀or⠀another⠀small⠀care⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀Show⠀the⠀act⠀in⠀its⠀practical⠀detail⠀so⠀the⠀warmth⠀is⠀an⠀event⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀atmosphere.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀custom⠀connects⠀the⠀care⠀to⠀earlier⠀occasions,⠀name⠀whose⠀habit⠀or⠀memory⠀it⠀is.⠀The⠀familiar⠀thing⠀may⠀be⠀welcomed,⠀altered,⠀or⠀declined;⠀another⠀person⠀can⠀enjoy⠀the⠀gesture⠀without⠀understanding⠀its⠀history.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀cancel⠀a⠀difficulty⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀time⠀continue⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀care,⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀free⠀to⠀fall⠀while⠀the⠀offer⠀or⠀its⠀reception⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀recipient⠀may⠀speak,⠀return⠀to⠀work,⠀sit⠀quietly,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀different⠀choice.⠀Personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀remain⠀intact.⠀No⠀confession,⠀inclusion,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair⠀is⠀required,⠀and⠀the⠀interval⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀moment⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nShape⠀the⠀reply⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀between⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀and⠀the⠀family,⠀social,⠀or⠀public⠀context⠀that⠀surrounds⠀it.⠀Allow⠀the⠀narrative⠀enough⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀an⠀obligation⠀or⠀choice⠀through⠀history⠀and⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀while⠀keeping⠀spoken⠀language⠀in⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀register⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀concrete.\n\nGather⠀contextual⠀detail⠀around⠀a⠀specific⠀human⠀exchange:⠀a⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀promise,⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀decision⠀to⠀change.⠀Move⠀between⠀times⠀and⠀accounts⠀with⠀clear⠀orientation,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀fixed⠀scene-history-return⠀pattern.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀gesture,⠀move⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀remembers⠀about⠀that⠀gesture,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀word⠀without⠀announcing⠀each⠀shift.\n\nKeep⠀every⠀source⠀distinguishable:⠀what⠀happened⠀earlier,⠀what⠀someone⠀said⠀later,⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀claims,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀judges.⠀A⠀contextual⠀judgment⠀may⠀confirm⠀established⠀understanding,⠀remain⠀limited⠀to⠀one⠀person's⠀view,⠀or⠀stay⠀private⠀without⠀changing⠀visible⠀conduct.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀interiority⠀permissions,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀telling⠀situation:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀offered⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀or⠀emotional⠀need⠀brings⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀passing⠀time,⠀preparing⠀someone⠀for⠀a⠀request,⠀explaining⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀simply⠀keeping⠀company.⠀Establish⠀the⠀listeners⠀as⠀particular⠀people⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀immediate⠀concerns,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀passive⠀audience⠀awaiting⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nMove⠀between⠀narrated⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀performance⠀by⠀marking⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀choose⠀what⠀to⠀include,⠀what⠀to⠀compress,⠀and⠀what⠀to⠀repeat.⠀A⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀past⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀telling⠀because⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀now,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀proves⠀a⠀point.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀difference⠀remain⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀account.\n\nGive⠀the⠀listeners⠀private⠀reception⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀attend⠀closely,⠀drift⠀toward⠀a⠀personal⠀worry,⠀compare⠀the⠀tale⠀with⠀another⠀version,⠀or⠀offer⠀no⠀response⠀at⠀all.⠀Their⠀silence⠀or⠀distraction⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀failure⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀fall⠀naturally⠀at⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀persuasion,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀story⠀to⠀end⠀the⠀interval.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀telling⠀pauses,⠀follow⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀actual⠀activity⠀and⠀private⠀attention⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀question⠀or⠀outward⠀change:⠀someone⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀withhold⠀an⠀answer,⠀accept⠀a⠀small⠀change,⠀or⠀simply⠀resume⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task.⠀The⠀tale⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀may⠀illuminate⠀each⠀other⠀without⠀one⠀explaining⠀the⠀other.⠀Keep⠀recurring⠀language⠀and⠀layered⠀time⠀anchored⠀in⠀human⠀consequence,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀compulsory⠀nested⠀tale.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀Place⠀an⠀actual⠀available⠀record⠀beside⠀an⠀authorized⠀recollection⠀of⠀a⠀relational⠀occasion.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀a⠀notice,⠀a⠀photograph⠀caption,⠀or⠀another⠀artifact⠀that⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.⠀Mark⠀its⠀author,⠀date,⠀and⠀intended⠀purpose,⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀that⠀author⠀could⠀have⠀known⠀at⠀that⠀time.\n\nIntroduce⠀the⠀recollection⠀through⠀a⠀permitted⠀mind.⠀The⠀remembered⠀version⠀may⠀agree⠀with⠀the⠀record⠀in⠀its⠀facts⠀while⠀preserving⠀another⠀aspect⠀of⠀experience:⠀the⠀heat⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀tone⠀of⠀a⠀voice,⠀the⠀reason⠀someone⠀stayed⠀late,⠀the⠀unease⠀no⠀one⠀wrote⠀down.⠀Let⠀the⠀two⠀sources⠀sit⠀together⠀without⠀forcing⠀them⠀to⠀contradict⠀each⠀other.⠀A⠀shared⠀phrase⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀both,⠀but⠀the⠀record's⠀official⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀memory's⠀private⠀weight⠀remain⠀distinct.\n\nMove⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀recollection⠀through⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀that⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀record,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀person⠀holding⠀it⠀or⠀remembering⠀the⠀day⠀it⠀was⠀made.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀illuminate⠀a⠀relationship⠀without⠀resolving⠀it:⠀someone⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀parent's⠀choice⠀more⠀clearly,⠀recognize⠀what⠀a⠀friend⠀omitted,⠀or⠀simply⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀record⠀leaves⠀out⠀what⠀mattered⠀most.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀comparison⠀into⠀an⠀obligatory⠀investigation,⠀a⠀newly⠀discovered⠀secret,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀lesson.⠀The⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀can⠀remain⠀meaningful⠀without⠀deciding⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀changing⠀a⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀of⠀reflection⠀or⠀resumed⠀practical⠀life,⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀document.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGround⠀inherited⠀authority⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀arrangements⠀and⠀lived⠀places⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀A⠀family⠀name,⠀an⠀old⠀building,⠀a⠀public⠀designation,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀obligation⠀may⠀color⠀a⠀permission,⠀intimacy,⠀or⠀refusal.⠀Show⠀how⠀that⠀authority⠀operates⠀through⠀actual⠀access,⠀expectation,⠀or⠀material⠀consequence:⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀an⠀answer,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀maintained.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀authority⠀supernatural⠀properties⠀or⠀guaranteed⠀effects⠀merely⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀style;⠀preserve⠀any⠀powers⠀and⠀limits⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀establishes.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀circulation⠀of⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀reputation⠀from⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀desire.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀publicly⠀known⠀as⠀an⠀heir,⠀a⠀caretaker,⠀a⠀disappointment,⠀or⠀a⠀keeper⠀of⠀some⠀old⠀arrangement,⠀while⠀privately⠀wanting⠀something⠀else.⠀Render⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀public⠀role⠀and⠀private⠀desire,⠀which⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ⠀and⠀may⠀be⠀expressed⠀directly⠀or⠀remain⠀unspoken:⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀accepting⠀an⠀invitation,⠀a⠀task⠀performed⠀with⠀resentment⠀or⠀relief,⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀public⠀role.\n\nRender⠀any⠀supported⠀change⠀of⠀social⠀manner⠀in⠀its⠀real⠀context.⠀A⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀but⠀show⠀what⠀trust⠀consists⠀of⠀here:⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀a⠀shared⠀history,⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀usual⠀audience⠀is⠀absent.⠀The⠀change⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀dramatic.⠀Someone⠀may⠀speak⠀more⠀plainly,⠀accept⠀help,⠀admit⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀stop⠀performing⠀competence⠀for⠀a⠀moment.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀and⠀memory⠀remain⠀personally⠀significant⠀without⠀unmasking⠀a⠀secret,⠀producing⠀distrust,⠀or⠀making⠀old⠀power⠀mystical.\n\nLet⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀material⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀A⠀worn⠀stair,⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀renovated⠀room,⠀a⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀buzzer,⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀once⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀else⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focus⠀on⠀particular⠀people⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀ask,⠀withhold,⠀accept,⠀or⠀change,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Follow⠀the⠀ordinary⠀distribution⠀of⠀shared⠀responsibilities⠀among⠀particular⠀people:⠀who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀arranges⠀transport,⠀who⠀answers⠀a⠀letter,⠀who⠀remembers⠀an⠀anniversary,⠀who⠀asks⠀for⠀help,⠀who⠀declines.⠀Let⠀the⠀arrangement⠀be⠀visible⠀through⠀actual⠀tasks⠀and⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀theme.\n\nAllow⠀an⠀inherited⠀saying,⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀habit⠀to⠀accompany⠀present⠀work.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀parent⠀may⠀surface⠀while⠀someone⠀folds⠀clothes⠀or⠀prepares⠀a⠀meal;⠀an⠀old⠀grievance⠀may⠀return⠀during⠀a⠀routine⠀errand.⠀Render⠀custom⠀as⠀the⠀particular⠀living⠀practice⠀established⠀here;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary,⠀sacred,⠀coercive⠀or⠀freely⠀valued⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀arrangements,⠀without⠀an⠀automatic⠀label.⠀The⠀same⠀habit⠀may⠀feel⠀like⠀care⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀burden⠀to⠀another,⠀and⠀both⠀responses⠀remain⠀legitimate.\n\nDevelop⠀private⠀responses⠀independently⠀of⠀spoken⠀agreement.⠀Someone⠀may⠀agree⠀to⠀help⠀while⠀privately⠀resenting⠀the⠀assumption,⠀or⠀refuse⠀while⠀privately⠀regretting⠀the⠀refusal.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀difference⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀another⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Let⠀existing⠀care⠀work⠀smoothly⠀when⠀it⠀does;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contested⠀duty⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀negotiation.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀story⠀remains⠀about⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀actual⠀self-understanding,⠀whether⠀continuing⠀or⠀changing,⠀with⠀remembered⠀language⠀and⠀public⠀events⠀gathered⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀without⠀overwhelming⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany.⠀Present⠀selected⠀observations⠀or⠀entries⠀with⠀a⠀situated⠀time⠀and⠀owner.⠀Mark⠀when⠀the⠀entry⠀was⠀written,⠀who⠀wrote⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀could⠀have⠀known⠀then.⠀A⠀later⠀annotation⠀or⠀recollection⠀may⠀follow,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀original⠀record:⠀the⠀writer⠀may⠀now⠀understand⠀something⠀differently,⠀or⠀may⠀simply⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀entry⠀left⠀out.\n\nLet⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀remain⠀plain⠀noticing⠀or⠀gather⠀personal⠀and⠀public⠀memory.⠀A⠀particular⠀sound,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀detail,⠀a⠀household⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀remark⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀entry⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀finish⠀or⠀gain⠀a⠀new⠀symbolic⠀meaning.⠀The⠀association⠀may⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀record.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀Under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀felt⠀but⠀did⠀not⠀record,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀recorded⠀while⠀privately⠀thinking⠀something⠀else.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀entry's⠀chosen⠀wording⠀from⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀surrounding⠀its⠀composition.\n\nMove⠀between⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀through⠀clear⠀transitions.⠀The⠀present⠀scene⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀person⠀rereading⠀an⠀entry,⠀recalling⠀its⠀occasion⠀or⠀setting⠀it⠀aside;⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀diary's⠀writer⠀or⠀reader.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀reflection⠀or⠀resumed⠀practical⠀life,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀completed⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀a⠀uniform⠀quietness.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaham::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Arrange⠀permitted⠀voices,⠀memories,⠀or⠀records⠀from⠀distinguishable⠀positions⠀and⠀times⠀around⠀an⠀actual⠀relational⠀moment:⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀return,⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀public⠀event⠀that⠀touched⠀a⠀household.⠀Each⠀account⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀with⠀limited⠀access,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀collective⠀memory.\n\nLet⠀a⠀shared⠀saying⠀or⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀carry⠀different,⠀aligned,⠀or⠀simply⠀separate⠀significance⠀for⠀each⠀speaker.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀remember⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀promise,⠀another⠀as⠀a⠀joke,⠀another⠀as⠀something⠀overheard.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀original⠀access⠀intact:⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀knew,⠀or⠀guessed⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Use⠀attributed⠀testimony⠀when⠀private⠀access⠀is⠀unavailable,⠀so⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀claim⠀knowledge⠀it⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀granted.\n\nMove⠀between⠀accounts⠀through⠀deliberate⠀shifts⠀in⠀time⠀and⠀speaker.⠀The⠀sequence⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀chronological,⠀but⠀each⠀shift⠀should⠀be⠀legible:⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀an⠀account⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀A⠀voice⠀may⠀break⠀off,⠀a⠀memory⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀that⠀still⠀matters,⠀a⠀record⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀explanation.\n\nPreserve⠀established⠀events.⠀The⠀accounts⠀may⠀differ⠀in⠀emphasis,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀interpretation,⠀but⠀they⠀cannot⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀has⠀already⠀established.⠀Let⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀illuminate⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀return⠀to⠀reveal⠀a⠀contradiction⠀or⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀exchange⠀is⠀underway.⠀Introduce⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀social⠀arrangements⠀through⠀needed⠀explanation⠀or⠀encounter:⠀a⠀brief⠀identification⠀when⠀a⠀name⠀first⠀appears,⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀that⠀shows⠀a⠀relationship's⠀standing,⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀exchange⠀that⠀makes⠀an⠀obligation⠀legible.⠀Avoid⠀redundant⠀genealogical⠀explanation⠀while⠀giving⠀family⠀history⠀or⠀private⠀recollection⠀the⠀development⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀account,⠀including⠀passages⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀speech,⠀movement,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀action,⠀then⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling.⠀Vary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀of⠀speech,⠀action,⠀and⠀interiority.⠀Let⠀a⠀meaningful⠀thought⠀take⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀needs⠀without⠀a⠀brevity⠀cap.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀remembered⠀saying⠀or⠀public⠀story⠀to⠀enter⠀with⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀matter.⠀A⠀name⠀from⠀the⠀past,⠀a⠀phrase⠀a⠀parent⠀used,⠀or⠀a⠀rumor⠀about⠀a⠀family⠀may⠀surface⠀during⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀Keep⠀it⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀source:⠀who⠀said⠀it,⠀when,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀meant⠀then.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀illuminate⠀the⠀present⠀request⠀or⠀refusal⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀prophecy.\n\nLet⠀humor⠀and⠀emotional⠀reaction⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀person.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀dry,⠀warm,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀plain-spoken⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀established⠀voice.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow,⠀and⠀close⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀present⠀word,⠀sound,⠀or⠀image⠀gathers⠀connected⠀details⠀across⠀time⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀associations.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀that⠀gathering:⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀now⠀can⠀open⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀first⠀heard,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀used⠀it⠀differently,⠀or⠀the⠀public⠀story⠀that⠀later⠀attached⠀to⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀literal⠀exchange⠀legible⠀beneath⠀the⠀cadence.⠀Keep⠀legible⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀can⠀establish⠀about⠀present⠀words⠀and⠀actions,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀sentence⠀carries⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice⠀alongside⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀recalled⠀voices⠀from⠀current⠀speech.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀remembers⠀something⠀someone⠀said,⠀attribute⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀it⠀blur⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀conversation.⠀A⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀its⠀original⠀speaker's⠀tone,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀arrive⠀altered⠀by⠀later⠀retellings;⠀either⠀way,⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀memory⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀now⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀resonant⠀image⠀make⠀a⠀memory⠀true⠀or⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀The⠀cadence⠀can⠀suggest⠀connection,⠀but⠀the⠀connection⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀knowledge⠀and⠀associations,⠀with⠀personal⠀experience,⠀reports,⠀records⠀and⠀imagined⠀possibilities⠀kept⠀distinguishable.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀preserve⠀familiar⠀meaning⠀or⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀because⠀it⠀still⠀means⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀uses⠀it,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀return⠀precisely⠀because⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀become⠀uncertain.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀recurrence⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀symbolic⠀meaning.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀and⠀individual⠀dialogue⠀registers⠀provide⠀contrast.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary,⠀unlyrical⠀way,⠀let⠀that⠀speech⠀stand⠀as⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀absorbing⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀voice⠀in⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀established⠀change,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀continuing⠀memory⠀enters⠀current⠀experience⠀without⠀displacing⠀it.⠀Let⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀habitual⠀act⠀carry⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀The⠀present⠀relationship⠀remains⠀the⠀scene's⠀center:⠀what⠀someone⠀asks⠀for,⠀accepts,⠀withholds,⠀or⠀chooses⠀to⠀change⠀now.⠀The⠀remembered⠀material⠀accompanies⠀that⠀present⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀past.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀actual⠀clarity⠀or⠀limits⠀of⠀recollection.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀something,⠀preserve⠀its⠀actual⠀clarity⠀and⠀any⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀gap.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀remember⠀exactly⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀expression⠀that⠀accompanied⠀it,⠀or⠀remember⠀the⠀occasion⠀vividly⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀events.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀reflection⠀fill⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀known.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀private⠀remembering⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀communicated,⠀allowing⠀their⠀content⠀to⠀coincide⠀or⠀differ.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀share⠀the⠀experience⠀or⠀its⠀content;⠀preserve⠀any⠀knowledge⠀actually⠀gained⠀through⠀shared⠀events,⠀communication⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀access.\n\nLet⠀warmth⠀and⠀pleasure⠀stand.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀may⠀be⠀pleasurable⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available,⠀and⠀present⠀comfort⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀regret,⠀altered⠀decision,⠀or⠀concluding⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀continuing⠀in⠀its⠀present⠀form,⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀resumed,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀open.⠀The⠀reflective⠀treatment⠀shapes⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀attends⠀to⠀time⠀and⠀attachment;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀dictate⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀must⠀be⠀mourned⠀or⠀repaired.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀lyric,⠀reflective,⠀and⠀philosophical⠀prose.⠀Choose⠀a⠀word⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀and⠀its⠀history—belonging,⠀owing,⠀returning,⠀or⠀another⠀term⠀the⠀characters⠀themselves⠀would⠀use—and⠀let⠀that⠀word⠀gather⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀memories,⠀sensations,⠀and⠀questions.⠀The⠀word⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀concrete⠀material:⠀what⠀someone⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀owed⠀or⠀returned,⠀what⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀person⠀felt⠀when⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀was⠀acknowledged.⠀Do⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀an⠀abstract⠀definition.⠀Let⠀the⠀inward⠀connections⠀develop⠀through⠀sustained⠀syntax⠀and⠀concrete⠀remembered⠀voices.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀meditation⠀anchored⠀in⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀actual⠀exchange.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀person⠀reflects⠀on⠀what⠀belonging⠀has⠀meant,⠀ground⠀the⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀occasion:⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀the⠀word⠀was⠀spoken,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀refused⠀it,⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀it⠀became⠀a⠀question.⠀A⠀remembered⠀voice⠀should⠀arrive⠀with⠀its⠀source⠀and⠀time.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀reflecting⠀person's⠀private⠀understanding⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀have⠀said⠀or⠀know,⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀independently⠀of⠀that⠀focal⠀role.⠀The⠀philosophical⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀inward⠀experience⠀being⠀represented,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀collective⠀voice⠀or⠀an⠀omniscient⠀cultural⠀pronouncement.\n\nLet⠀the⠀saying⠀remain⠀personally⠀meaningful⠀whether⠀the⠀person⠀affirms⠀it,⠀questions⠀it⠀or⠀leaves⠀it⠀open;⠀neither⠀a⠀verdict⠀nor⠀a⠀resulting⠀action⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀turn⠀the⠀word⠀over⠀without⠀reaching⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀word⠀still⠀open,⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀act⠀continuing⠀alongside⠀the⠀reflection,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀not⠀answered.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀creed,⠀wisdom⠀verdict,⠀or⠀universal⠀cultural⠀value.⠀The⠀tradition⠀supplies⠀the⠀reflective⠀and⠀philosophical⠀route;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀settle⠀a⠀moral⠀argument⠀or⠀to⠀speak⠀for⠀an⠀entire⠀community.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Choose⠀the⠀particular⠀request,⠀preference,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀act⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀familiar⠀expression⠀or⠀object⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀recall⠀without⠀retelling⠀the⠀past⠀redundantly.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀they⠀said⠀years⠀ago,⠀let⠀present⠀use⠀carry⠀the⠀history⠀where⠀the⠀available⠀context⠀supports⠀inference,⠀retaining⠀any⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀needed⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀connection⠀intelligible.⠀The⠀detail⠀must⠀be⠀exact⠀enough⠀to⠀carry⠀that⠀inference:⠀the⠀specific⠀word,⠀the⠀specific⠀object,⠀the⠀specific⠀gesture⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀people.\n\nKeep⠀attribution⠀clear⠀where⠀a⠀saying⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀reported.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀something⠀someone⠀said,⠀identify⠀the⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀directly⠀with⠀enough⠀context⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀account.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀float⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀spoken⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀A⠀reported⠀saying⠀from⠀a⠀third⠀party⠀needs⠀its⠀own⠀attribution.⠀The⠀minimalist⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀omitting⠀the⠀source;⠀it⠀favors⠀direct⠀attribution⠀while⠀retaining⠀whatever⠀development⠀makes⠀a⠀source⠀or⠀its⠀personal⠀significance⠀intelligible.\n\nOmit⠀repeated⠀explanation,⠀not⠀meaningful⠀reasoning⠀or⠀feeling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀deciding,⠀and⠀that⠀thought⠀should⠀remain⠀intact.⠀Cut⠀restatements⠀and⠀explanatory⠀gloss⠀only⠀where⠀they⠀are⠀redundant;⠀retain⠀recurrence⠀that⠀develops⠀the⠀actual⠀thought,⠀feeling⠀or⠀account⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀point.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀counts⠀for⠀objects,⠀thoughts,⠀or⠀recurrences.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀selective⠀attention,⠀not⠀a⠀quota.⠀Personal⠀significance⠀can⠀remain⠀present⠀without⠀changing⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀preference⠀may⠀be⠀stated,⠀accepted,⠀or⠀refused,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀the⠀relationship⠀having⠀been⠀altered⠀by⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀in⠀their⠀causal⠀order.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀carry⠀the⠀story:⠀what⠀someone⠀asks⠀for,⠀withholds,⠀accepts,⠀misunderstands,⠀or⠀chooses⠀to⠀change⠀now.⠀When⠀a⠀name,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀continuing⠀concern⠀gathers⠀earlier⠀occasions⠀or⠀public⠀stories,⠀mark⠀the⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀as⠀the⠀memory⠀or⠀report⠀enters⠀the⠀narration.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀whether⠀the⠀material⠀comes⠀from⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀direct⠀experience,⠀a⠀family⠀account,⠀public⠀rumor⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀source,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀belongs;⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀participant.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀flashback⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀past⠀on⠀every⠀turn.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀may⠀enter⠀as⠀a⠀brief⠀association,⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀earlier⠀event⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀longer⠀recollection⠀when⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀calls⠀for⠀development,⠀even⠀without⠀explaining⠀or⠀changing⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀movement⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀pressure:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀of⠀the⠀past⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀conversation⠀makes⠀it⠀relevant,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narration⠀has⠀a⠀quota⠀of⠀memory⠀to⠀fill.⠀Keep⠀others'⠀reasons⠀and⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀understand⠀something⠀privately⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know,⠀and⠀another⠀character's⠀motive⠀may⠀remain⠀unavailable.\n\nLet⠀a⠀preference,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀unexpressed⠀feeling⠀sustain⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀an⠀obstacle⠀plot⠀or⠀relationship⠀lesson.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀agree⠀to⠀something⠀without⠀the⠀agreement⠀resolving⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀something⠀and⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀it,⠀and⠀that⠀unexpressed⠀feeling⠀can⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀private⠀texture⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀secret⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀revealed.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀resumed,⠀a⠀conversation⠀concluded,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀without⠀announcing⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀for⠀everyone⠀involved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀moments⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀through⠀present⠀choices,⠀private⠀language,⠀and⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀ordinary⠀acts.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀premise⠀legible⠀without⠀announcing⠀it:⠀what⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other,⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀or⠀refrain⠀from⠀saying⠀reveals⠀the⠀relationship's⠀terms.⠀Use⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀selection⠀principle.⠀If⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀built⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀kind⠀of⠀care,⠀rivalry,⠀dependency,⠀or⠀discovery,⠀choose⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀that⠀shows⠀that⠀particular⠀promise⠀in⠀operation⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nLet⠀a⠀shared⠀phrase⠀or⠀repeated⠀occasion⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history.⠀The⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀and⠀understood⠀identically⠀by⠀both⠀people,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀to⠀each⠀of⠀them.⠀Its⠀emotional⠀force⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀intent.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀phrase⠀with⠀full⠀knowledge⠀of⠀its⠀history⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀uses⠀it⠀casually,⠀or⠀both⠀may⠀feel⠀its⠀weight⠀without⠀either⠀being⠀certain⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀feels.⠀Keep⠀inherited⠀accounts⠀and⠀private⠀memories⠀with⠀their⠀owners.⠀What⠀a⠀family⠀account⠀says⠀may⠀align⠀with,⠀differ⠀from⠀or⠀address⠀another⠀aspect⠀of⠀either⠀participant's⠀memory,⠀and⠀what⠀one⠀participant⠀remembers⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀other.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀continue⠀unchanged⠀or⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀actual⠀events.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀comfort,⠀friction,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀cooperation⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀relationship⠀exactly⠀where⠀it⠀was.⠀It⠀may⠀also⠀show⠀a⠀small⠀change:⠀an⠀acceptance,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀knowledge,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀ask.⠀Do⠀not⠀prescribe⠀jealousy,⠀confession,⠀or⠀increasing⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀by⠀the⠀particularity⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀required⠀emotional⠀escalation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀relational⠀act⠀that⠀has⠀acquired⠀or⠀is⠀acquiring⠀a⠀retold⠀form:⠀a⠀visit,⠀promise,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀care.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀act⠀in⠀time⠀and⠀names⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀human⠀circumstances⠀and⠀sources⠀behind⠀that⠀reputation.⠀Where⠀circulating⠀language⠀connects⠀the⠀act⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀account⠀or⠀public⠀occasion,⠀show⠀who⠀carries⠀that⠀formulation⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀telling⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀to⠀that⠀person.⠀The⠀retold⠀form⠀should⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀communal⠀verdict.⠀Identify⠀actual⠀witnesses,⠀reports⠀and⠀later⠀additions⠀where⠀they⠀exist,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀tellers⠀for⠀every⠀act.⠀A⠀reputation⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀partial,⠀or⠀contested,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀distinguish⠀the⠀act⠀itself⠀from⠀the⠀accounts⠀that⠀circulate⠀about⠀it.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀and⠀grounded⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀or⠀confirms⠀its⠀continuity.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀may⠀simply⠀confirm⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀remained⠀what⠀it⠀was,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀phrase⠀to⠀gain⠀a⠀new⠀symbolic⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale.⠀A⠀promise⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀remains⠀a⠀particular⠀human⠀exchange⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀public⠀form.\n\nPreserve⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀any⠀public⠀account.⠀The⠀person⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀may⠀have⠀helped⠀reluctantly,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀remembered⠀as⠀having⠀refused⠀may⠀have⠀done⠀so⠀with⠀private⠀grief⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀saw.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀follows⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀speech,⠀uncompleted⠀action,⠀or⠀ongoing⠀recollection⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀with⠀a⠀promise⠀still⠀being⠀kept,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀itself⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀attributed⠀account⠀still⠀available⠀to⠀continue,⠀without⠀deciding⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf⠀what⠀the⠀act⠀must⠀mean.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀essayistic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀state⠀a⠀situated⠀proposition⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀terms:⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀phrase⠀meant,⠀why⠀someone⠀belonged⠀somewhere,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀family⠀or⠀community⠀came⠀to⠀believe.⠀The⠀proposition⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀position⠀and⠀available⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀cast.\n\nSet⠀that⠀proposition⠀beside⠀a⠀specific⠀interpersonal⠀case.⠀The⠀case⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀established⠀exchange⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access,⠀whether⠀firsthand,⠀reported⠀or⠀recorded,⠀an⠀explicitly⠀hypothetical⠀situation⠀the⠀narrator⠀constructs⠀to⠀test⠀the⠀claim,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀whose⠀details⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀still⠀distinguish⠀from⠀later⠀retellings.⠀Give⠀the⠀case⠀a⠀concrete⠀decision⠀or⠀relation⠀appropriate⠀to⠀its⠀actual⠀or⠀hypothetical⠀status:⠀someone⠀asked,⠀withheld,⠀accepted,⠀misunderstood,⠀or⠀chose⠀to⠀change.⠀Draw⠀on⠀the⠀personal⠀experience,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀account⠀or⠀recurring⠀language⠀actually⠀relevant⠀to⠀the⠀occasion,⠀keeping⠀each⠀source⠀attributable⠀instead⠀of⠀requiring⠀every⠀layer⠀or⠀reducing⠀the⠀case⠀to⠀an⠀abstract⠀illustration.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀proposition⠀through⠀confirmation,⠀qualification,⠀or⠀continued⠀uncertainty.⠀The⠀return⠀need⠀not⠀correct⠀the⠀belief,⠀disclose⠀a⠀motive,⠀or⠀alter⠀anyone's⠀next⠀response.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀emotional⠀authority⠀of⠀a⠀circulating⠀account⠀from⠀what⠀its⠀source⠀actually⠀supports.⠀A⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀by⠀many⠀people⠀may⠀carry⠀weight⠀without⠀becoming⠀evidence⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀original⠀speaker⠀felt.⠀A⠀private⠀memory⠀may⠀qualify⠀the⠀public⠀version⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀to⠀anyone⠀else.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀essayistic⠀movement⠀available⠀across⠀replies.⠀One⠀installment⠀may⠀state⠀the⠀claim⠀and⠀open⠀the⠀case;⠀a⠀later⠀one⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀new⠀experience⠀or⠀recollection.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀arrive⠀within⠀a⠀single⠀scene,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀proposition⠀before⠀the⠀story⠀can⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀readable⠀action⠀blocks,⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀cues⠀to⠀locate⠀an⠀actual⠀interpersonal⠀act.⠀Let⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀they⠀handle,⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀unsaid.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀memory⠀sequence⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀experience,⠀distinguish⠀its⠀source,⠀time⠀and⠀place⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀scene.⠀It⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀spoken⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀an⠀ongoing⠀private⠀concern⠀without⠀a⠀fresh⠀visible⠀trigger.⠀Use⠀a⠀separate⠀heading⠀when⠀presenting⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀as⠀a⠀scene,⠀with⠀readable⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue;⠀private⠀recollection⠀may⠀instead⠀remain⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relation⠀to⠀current⠀events⠀legible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cut⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀return⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary.\n\nPreserve⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀independently⠀of⠀voice-over⠀or⠀performed⠀narration.⠀Private⠀thought,⠀feeling,⠀and⠀association⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀private⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀and⠀are⠀not⠀converted⠀into⠀dialogue⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀or⠀into⠀a⠀voice-over⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀performs.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀a⠀memory⠀aloud⠀when⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀occasion⠀support⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀spoken⠀version⠀is⠀a⠀chosen⠀communication,⠀not⠀the⠀automatic⠀destination⠀of⠀private⠀recollection.\n\nA⠀cut⠀or⠀expression⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀motive.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀look⠀away,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀room⠀without⠀the⠀screenplay⠀declaring⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀reader's⠀access⠀to⠀private⠀experience⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀the⠀visible⠀expression.⠀No⠀memory⠀sequence,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀changed⠀result⠀is⠀required⠀for⠀each⠀scene.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀continuation,⠀or⠀the⠀simple⠀fact⠀that⠀someone⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nMake⠀positions,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀objects,⠀and⠀ongoing⠀business⠀playable⠀around⠀the⠀actual⠀request⠀or⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀whom,⠀who⠀is⠀near⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀is⠀holding⠀or⠀avoiding⠀an⠀object,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀task⠀continues⠀while⠀people⠀speak.⠀Let⠀live⠀choices⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship,⠀keeping⠀stageable⠀business⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀private⠀presentation⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀either⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀accounts⠀enter⠀through⠀speech⠀only⠀when⠀someone⠀actually⠀tells⠀them.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀family⠀phrase,⠀describe⠀a⠀past⠀occasion,⠀or⠀report⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀says,⠀but⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀a⠀present⠀action⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀hear⠀it,⠀interrupt⠀it,⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀or⠀decline⠀to⠀respond.⠀The⠀spoken⠀version⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀include⠀everything⠀the⠀teller⠀privately⠀associates⠀with⠀the⠀memory.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀prop's⠀personal⠀history⠀from⠀broadcasting⠀itself.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀object⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀or⠀in⠀someone's⠀hands⠀may⠀carry⠀private⠀meaning⠀for⠀one⠀character,⠀but⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀that⠀meaning.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀object⠀follows⠀actual⠀observation,⠀memory,⠀communication⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀access.⠀Preserve⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀private⠀presentation,⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀rather⠀than⠀disguising⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀that⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear.\n\nKeep⠀offstage⠀lives⠀and⠀actual⠀hearing⠀distinct⠀from⠀narrator⠀access.⠀An⠀exit⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀grant⠀or⠀remove⠀knowledge:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀can⠀hear⠀offstage,⠀receive⠀through⠀communication⠀or⠀otherwise⠀access⠀follows⠀the⠀actual⠀circumstances.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀may⠀still⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀another⠀character⠀privately⠀feels.⠀Permit⠀a⠀pending⠀response⠀or⠀quiet⠀continuation⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀entrance,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀resolution.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀someone⠀still⠀waiting,⠀still⠀working,⠀or⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀current⠀sensation,⠀private⠀wording,⠀personal⠀memory,⠀and⠀received⠀public⠀accounts⠀connect⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀associations.⠀Begin⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀perceives⠀or⠀feels⠀now,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice,⠀a⠀family⠀phrase,⠀a⠀rumor,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀event⠀when⠀the⠀association⠀makes⠀that⠀movement⠀intelligible.⠀The⠀braid⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀mind:⠀its⠀concerns,⠀its⠀vocabulary,⠀its⠀bodily⠀experience,⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀any⠀limits.\n\nMark⠀enough⠀temporal⠀and⠀source⠀anchors⠀to⠀distinguish⠀heard⠀rumor,⠀remembered⠀speech,⠀and⠀present⠀event.⠀A⠀remembered⠀sentence⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀flow,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀whether⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀hearing⠀it⠀now,⠀recalling⠀who⠀said⠀it,⠀or⠀repeating⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀claims.⠀Use⠀small⠀anchors⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀time⠀marker,⠀or⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀levels⠀separate.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀public⠀account⠀become⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀memory⠀merely⠀because⠀both⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph.\n\nThe⠀stream⠀can⠀settle⠀or⠀continue⠀inward⠀without⠀changing⠀conduct.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀follow⠀an⠀association⠀to⠀a⠀painful⠀or⠀comforting⠀place⠀and⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task,⠀or⠀remain⠀absorbed⠀without⠀acting.⠀Give⠀meaningful⠀experience⠀its⠀needed⠀development⠀without⠀charging⠀fictional⠀time⠀for⠀prose⠀length.⠀The⠀length⠀of⠀the⠀inward⠀passage⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀advanced,⠀and⠀a⠀short⠀passage⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀feeling⠀was⠀trivial.\n\nDo⠀not⠀merge⠀other⠀minds⠀into⠀the⠀flow.⠀Another⠀character's⠀remembered⠀words⠀enter⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀recalls⠀them,⠀with⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀that⠀recollection.⠀Another⠀character's⠀present⠀thought⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀stream⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.⠀The⠀communal⠀story⠀is⠀material⠀the⠀character⠀carries,⠀not⠀a⠀shared⠀consciousness⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀enter.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀and⠀supported⠀transmission⠀events.⠀Each⠀message⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀sender⠀and⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀represented⠀record,⠀with⠀any⠀relevant⠀differences⠀between⠀sending⠀and⠀delivery⠀made⠀clear.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀or⠀type⠀and⠀delete.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀forwarded⠀saying,⠀old⠀thread,⠀or⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀enters⠀the⠀exchange,⠀make⠀its⠀source,⠀time,⠀and⠀recipient⠀clear.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀forward⠀a⠀family⠀phrase,⠀quote⠀an⠀old⠀message,⠀or⠀paste⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀but⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀transmitted⠀and⠀to⠀whom.⠀A⠀copy⠀is⠀a⠀copy,⠀not⠀the⠀original⠀occasion.⠀An⠀old⠀thread⠀is⠀a⠀record,⠀not⠀the⠀live⠀memory⠀of⠀everyone⠀who⠀participated⠀in⠀it.\n\nDistinguish⠀copies,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀reading,⠀and⠀response⠀from⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀transmitted;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀become⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀another⠀character's⠀access⠀depends⠀on⠀actual⠀visibility,⠀communication⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀circumstances⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀transmission⠀that⠀never⠀occurred.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀supported⠀interface⠀actually⠀confirms;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀establish⠀comprehension⠀or⠀feeling.⠀A⠀delay⠀need⠀not⠀imply⠀resentment,⠀and⠀a⠀quick⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀imply⠀ease.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀memory⠀and⠀association⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀private⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transmitted⠀exchange.⠀A⠀shared⠀text⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀associated⠀memory⠀shared⠀knowledge.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀and⠀privately⠀recall⠀its⠀original⠀occasion,⠀but⠀sending⠀the⠀phrase⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀disclose⠀what⠀it⠀stirred;⠀any⠀knowledge⠀of⠀that⠀response⠀follows⠀actual⠀communication⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀access.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀shared⠀scene⠀and⠀actual⠀dialogue⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀a⠀flexible⠀rhythm⠀of⠀movement⠀and⠀inward⠀prose.⠀Use⠀focal⠀narration⠀for⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀attention⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀any⠀additional⠀permitted⠀access;⠀a⠀focal⠀passage⠀does⠀not⠀authorize⠀new⠀minds⠀or⠀erase⠀access⠀the⠀contract⠀already⠀supplies.\n\nUse⠀purposeful⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀references⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀background,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀posture⠀can⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀the⠀relationship's⠀state.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀cue⠀and⠀interpret⠀it,⠀miss⠀its⠀significance,⠀or⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀personal⠀or⠀public⠀account⠀whose⠀source⠀remains⠀intact.⠀A⠀repeated⠀cue⠀can⠀gather⠀history⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀at⠀every⠀revisit.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀recalls⠀a⠀personal⠀or⠀public⠀account,⠀let⠀the⠀association⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀memory⠀or⠀concern.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀to⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀and⠀back,⠀keeping⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀source⠀distinguishable.⠀A⠀family⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀in⠀dialogue⠀is⠀a⠀present⠀utterance;⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀association⠀with⠀it⠀is⠀separate⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀spoken⠀aloud.\n\nPreserve⠀all⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀visible⠀reaction,⠀concise⠀thought,⠀or⠀new⠀meaning⠀at⠀a⠀revisit.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀something⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀assigning⠀an⠀expression⠀cue⠀to⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀may⠀remain⠀private⠀without⠀becoming⠀dialogue.⠀Features⠀such⠀as⠀menus⠀and⠀images⠀follow⠀their⠀separate⠀authorization;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabahbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nCarry⠀forward⠀established⠀words,⠀decisions,⠀and⠀pending⠀matters⠀without⠀replacing⠀them⠀with⠀a⠀full⠀recap.⠀Where⠀orientation⠀is⠀needed,⠀recover⠀the⠀particular⠀context⠀that⠀matters⠀now:⠀the⠀request⠀still⠀unanswered,⠀the⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used,⠀the⠀task⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀returned.⠀Continue⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀current⠀situation,⠀recalling⠀earlier⠀history⠀when⠀useful⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀or⠀redundant⠀full⠀recap.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀or⠀account⠀recurs,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀continuing⠀private⠀concern⠀or⠀present⠀circumstance.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀repeat⠀the⠀phrase⠀aloud,⠀hear⠀it⠀from⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀privately⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀makes⠀it⠀matter⠀again.⠀Its⠀meaning⠀may⠀remain⠀unchanged⠀or⠀develop⠀as⠀warranted.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀new⠀significance⠀onto⠀every⠀recurrence,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀pretend⠀the⠀phrase⠀was⠀never⠀said⠀before.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀person's⠀access⠀across⠀the⠀interval.⠀Knowledge⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀exchange⠀follows⠀actual⠀perception,⠀reports,⠀records⠀or⠀other⠀established⠀access;⠀absence⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀settle⠀what⠀someone⠀could⠀know.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀left⠀with⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀may⠀continue⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀that⠀misunderstanding⠀until⠀actual⠀reconsideration⠀or⠀new⠀information⠀changes⠀their⠀interpretation,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀fresh⠀external⠀fact.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀show⠀separate⠀activity⠀in⠀different⠀places⠀without⠀merging⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀knows.\n\nAn⠀installment⠀can⠀contain⠀company,⠀separate⠀activity,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀decision⠀without⠀requiring⠀progress,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship.⠀The⠀through-line⠀is⠀the⠀continuing⠀life⠀of⠀these⠀particular⠀people:⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀they⠀remember,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀waiting⠀for,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Stop⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀existing⠀role⠀and⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀not⠀a⠀quota⠀of⠀completed⠀turns.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nFocus⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀one⠀exchange⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀character⠀asks,⠀admits,⠀refuses,⠀or⠀apologizes.⠀Choose⠀the⠀particular⠀word,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀distance⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀cost⠀for⠀this⠀relationship.⠀Write⠀with⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement:⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀answered,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀feels⠀or⠀understands.⠀Where⠀an⠀actual⠀pause,⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀or⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀encounter,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀its⠀particular⠀meaning⠀without⠀hiding⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀direct⠀continuous⠀exchange⠀is⠀also⠀possible;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀gap.⠀Render⠀the⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀fully:⠀the⠀character's⠀need,⠀hurt,⠀resolve,⠀or⠀hope⠀remains⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀not⠀spoken.⠀A⠀later⠀response⠀may⠀alter,⠀sustain,⠀or⠀leave⠀unchanged⠀the⠀significance⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀and⠀a⠀response⠀can⠀remain⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀demand⠀betrayal,⠀cryptic⠀wit,⠀interrupted⠀confession,⠀visible⠀distress,⠀or⠀a⠀revealed⠀motive;⠀the⠀scene's⠀power⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀precise⠀exposure⠀already⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀submitted⠀contribution:⠀identify⠀the⠀ongoing⠀occasion,⠀the⠀active⠀speakers,⠀and⠀any⠀ownership⠀or⠀control⠀boundaries.⠀Choose⠀one⠀direct⠀answer,⠀noticed⠀particular,⠀or⠀supported⠀pause⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀interval⠀its⠀focus⠀for⠀this⠀reply.⠀Write⠀in⠀clear,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Use⠀brief⠀narrative⠀movement⠀while⠀preserving⠀each⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀diction⠀and⠀needed⠀extent:⠀state⠀actions⠀and⠀speech⠀directly,⠀leave⠀meaningful⠀gaps⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀truly⠀does⠀not⠀respond⠀or⠀has⠀no⠀access,⠀and⠀select⠀a⠀distilled⠀image⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀relational⠀weight.⠀Preserve⠀all⠀NPC⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀world.⠀Render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀full—thoughts,⠀feelings,⠀uncertainties—without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀others.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀prepared⠀next⠀move.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀tradition.⠀Locate⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀how⠀characters⠀actually⠀use⠀a⠀room,⠀possession,⠀visit,⠀or⠀shared⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀teapot⠀left⠀out,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned,⠀a⠀coat⠀hung⠀by⠀the⠀door.⠀Follow⠀their⠀real⠀exchange⠀with⠀brief,⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀and⠀a⠀few⠀telling⠀particulars.⠀Let⠀a⠀space⠀between⠀utterances⠀or⠀actions⠀preserve⠀ease,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀attention⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀pause⠀to⠀hide⠀a⠀feeling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀fully⠀rendered—what⠀they⠀notice,⠀remember,⠀or⠀decide—even⠀when⠀not⠀voiced.⠀Allow⠀a⠀later⠀occasion⠀to⠀confirm⠀or⠀qualify⠀an⠀interpretation⠀without⠀obligatory⠀conflict,⠀domestic⠀duty,⠀cultural⠀stereotype,⠀or⠀sudden⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀the⠀actual⠀physical⠀condition⠀bearing⠀on⠀the⠀exchange:⠀comfort,⠀distance,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀effort⠀freely⠀undertaken.⠀Write⠀with⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀clauses⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀that⠀make⠀that⠀condition⠀felt.⠀Use⠀exact⠀details—a⠀worn⠀handrail,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀jacket,⠀cold⠀air⠀between⠀seats—and⠀let⠀their⠀significance⠀be⠀supported⠀by⠀actual⠀context,⠀avoiding⠀redundant⠀gloss⠀without⠀withholding⠀a⠀known⠀meaning⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀direct⠀private⠀understanding.⠀Keep⠀needed⠀causes⠀explicit:⠀show⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀or⠀refrains.⠀Use⠀concise⠀outward⠀narration⠀without⠀shortening⠀a⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀utterance⠀or⠀deleting⠀inner⠀life⠀merely⠀to⠀maintain⠀brevity.⠀Develop⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀feeling,⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀as⠀fully⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀requires,⠀even⠀when⠀their⠀outward⠀actions⠀are⠀br