r⠀recognition,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀certify⠀corruption,⠀concealed⠀intent,⠀or⠀a⠀mask⠀about⠀to⠀fall.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀be⠀sincere,⠀assistance⠀can⠀be⠀genuine,⠀and⠀affection⠀can⠀be⠀freely⠀offered⠀inside⠀the⠀inherited⠀arrangement.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀through⠀the⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits;⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀feels⠀or⠀suspects⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀another⠀knows⠀or⠀promises,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀focal⠀concern⠀only⠀if⠀access⠀exists.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀concrete⠀through⠀selected⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀or⠀intimate⠀conditions⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀includes.⠀A⠀room,⠀a⠀key,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀obligation⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀encounter⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol⠀of⠀hidden⠀price.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀ordinary⠀need⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀authority⠀intact⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀unchanged,⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀mask⠀to⠀fall⠀or⠀a⠀secret⠀cost⠀to⠀surface.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nCompose⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀situated⠀testimony⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀participant.⠀Choose⠀one⠀person⠀whose⠀experience⠀of⠀an⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀stay,⠀departure,⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀the⠀segment⠀will⠀carry,⠀and⠀establish⠀that⠀account's⠀occasion:⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀told,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀with⠀what⠀present⠀purpose.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀that⠀participant;⠀reported⠀speech⠀or⠀written⠀record⠀may⠀stand⠀when⠀direct⠀access⠀is⠀unavailable,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀must⠀clearly⠀originate⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀source.\n\nLet⠀the⠀participant⠀present⠀exact⠀words⠀and⠀concrete⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀encounter.⠀Their⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀accurate,⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀contested⠀as⠀the⠀world⠀supports;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀contradiction⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.⠀Use⠀brief⠀declarative⠀presentation⠀for⠀the⠀key⠀exchange,⠀and⠀leave⠀meaningful⠀gaps⠀where⠀the⠀participant⠀did⠀not⠀notice,⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀or⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀happened.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀could⠀observe⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀claim:⠀outside⠀report,⠀later⠀inference,⠀and⠀direct⠀experience⠀remain⠀separate.\n\nPreserve⠀any⠀known⠀private⠀reason⠀separately⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀or⠀written⠀selection.⠀A⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀motive⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀contract,⠀but⠀the⠀testimony⠀itself⠀carries⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀chose⠀to⠀disclose.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀conclude⠀with⠀confession,⠀corroboration,⠀or⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer;⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀simple⠀acceptance,⠀further⠀practical⠀need,⠀or⠀silence.⠀The⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀settle⠀the⠀relationship;⠀follow⠀its⠀actual⠀reception⠀and⠀consequences,⠀including⠀supported⠀clarification⠀or⠀an⠀unchanged⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaial::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀early-modern⠀comic⠀and⠀theatrical⠀telling⠀as⠀narrative⠀construction⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀and⠀narrator⠀contract.⠀Select⠀a⠀direct⠀exchange⠀and⠀arrange⠀it⠀for⠀timing:⠀place⠀an⠀attributed⠀line⠀beside⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀it⠀accompanies,⠀then⠀mark⠀what⠀follows—a⠀stop,⠀a⠀continuation,⠀a⠀glance,⠀a⠀second⠀line.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀words⠀and⠀circumstances⠀create⠀the⠀effect.⠀An⠀incongruity⠀can⠀emerge⠀when⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀meets⠀an⠀over-elaborate⠀object,⠀a⠀formal⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀practical⠀task,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀also⠀run⠀on⠀accurate⠀speech⠀and⠀straightforward⠀affection⠀without⠀comic⠀defeat.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀narrative⠀transitions⠀while⠀keeping⠀each⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀register⠀and⠀needed⠀extent;⠀neither⠀the⠀whole⠀exchange⠀nor⠀its⠀private⠀experience⠀has⠀a⠀brevity⠀quota.⠀Let⠀the⠀selection⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀says,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀instead⠀of⠀saying,⠀and⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀actually⠀receives⠀carry⠀the⠀meaning.⠀Meaningful⠀gaps⠀are⠀pauses⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀omissions⠀of⠀necessary⠀fact:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀stop⠀because⠀the⠀timing⠀is⠀wrong,⠀because⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀easier⠀than⠀explanation,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀already⠀acted.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀private⠀recognition⠀beside⠀the⠀presented⠀action⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀no⠀mandatory⠀gag,⠀witty⠀retort,⠀or⠀stage⠀audience⠀is⠀required.\n\nUse⠀a⠀distilled⠀image⠀or⠀physical⠀particular⠀to⠀anchor⠀the⠀comic/theatrical⠀arrangement:⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀handled,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀garment,⠀a⠀serving⠀tray,⠀a⠀shared⠀bench.⠀Let⠀that⠀particular⠀make⠀the⠀timing⠀legible⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀deliver⠀a⠀punchline,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nCompose⠀the⠀segment⠀as⠀nonlinear⠀polyphony.⠀Choose⠀an⠀established⠀orienting⠀element⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀world—a⠀word⠀someone⠀repeated,⠀an⠀object⠀passed⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal—and⠀let⠀its⠀recurrence⠀mark⠀shifts⠀between⠀actual⠀accounts.⠀Keep⠀event⠀order⠀and⠀source⠀time⠀distinct:⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀without⠀being⠀treated⠀as⠀knowledge⠀its⠀source⠀did⠀not⠀have⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nUse⠀several⠀voices⠀or⠀records⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀and⠀world⠀support.⠀Each⠀account⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀an⠀identifiable⠀source⠀with⠀particular⠀access:⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀said,⠀or⠀later⠀learned.⠀Let⠀accounts⠀change⠀the⠀reading⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail,⠀confirm⠀it,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀ordinary;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀contradictory⠀testimony,⠀delayed⠀disclosure,⠀or⠀a⠀puzzle⠀that⠀must⠀snap⠀shut.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀include⠀direct⠀interiority⠀for⠀authorized⠀minds,⠀but⠀for⠀characters⠀without⠀a⠀mind⠀available,⠀use⠀attributed⠀speech⠀or⠀written⠀record⠀rather⠀than⠀claiming⠀their⠀private⠀thought.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀account,⠀use⠀direct⠀declarative⠀movement⠀where⠀it⠀concentrates⠀attention,⠀preserving⠀the⠀source's⠀individual⠀voice⠀and⠀any⠀needed⠀extended⠀account⠀or⠀private⠀passage.⠀Select⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀or⠀concrete⠀actions⠀that⠀matter,⠀and⠀use⠀meaningful⠀gaps⠀where⠀a⠀source⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀or⠀did⠀not⠀say⠀something,⠀without⠀turning⠀silence⠀into⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀pause⠀within⠀one⠀account,⠀return⠀through⠀the⠀orienting⠀element,⠀or⠀slide⠀to⠀another⠀source⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀source's⠀access⠀justifies⠀the⠀shift.⠀The⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀converge⠀on⠀a⠀final⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀relationship;⠀the⠀sequence⠀may⠀remain⠀multiple⠀and⠀open⠀without⠀a⠀reveal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaian::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀name⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion,⠀the⠀people⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀relevant⠀spatial⠀detail⠀that⠀lets⠀a⠀reader⠀picture⠀who⠀can⠀speak,⠀move,⠀or⠀touch⠀what.⠀Use⠀direct⠀sentences⠀to⠀concentrate⠀an⠀exchange⠀while⠀paragraphing⠀keeps⠀speech,⠀activity,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀readable⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀cycle.⠀A⠀dialogue⠀beat⠀may⠀stand⠀alone;⠀a⠀private⠀passage⠀may⠀extend⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀feeling,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀attention⠀needs;⠀no⠀short-thought⠀rule⠀applies.\n\nExplain⠀unfamiliar⠀context⠀only⠀through⠀the⠀narration's⠀permitted⠀access,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use.⠀A⠀term,⠀object,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀can⠀become⠀clear⠀because⠀someone⠀uses⠀it⠀or⠀recalls⠀it,⠀without⠀a⠀demonstration⠀or⠀a⠀break⠀to⠀gloss⠀it.⠀Keep⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement:⠀select⠀the⠀few⠀actions⠀and⠀lines⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀encounter,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀distilled⠀image—a⠀cup⠀put⠀down,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed—orient⠀the⠀reader⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀shifts.\n\nLet⠀private⠀interpretation⠀differ⠀from⠀established⠀fact⠀without⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship⠀or⠀a⠀revelation.⠀A⠀noticed⠀detail⠀or⠀pause⠀can⠀remain⠀familiar⠀and⠀unresolved:⠀someone⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀may⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀more,⠀may⠀continue⠀an⠀ordinary⠀routine.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀private⠀attention,⠀but⠀that⠀private⠀content⠀need⠀not⠀predict⠀a⠀later⠀turn⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀joke.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀private⠀attention⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reaction⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀outward⠀movement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀attention⠀to⠀develop⠀one⠀scene-grounded⠀image—a⠀sound,⠀a⠀visual⠀relation,⠀a⠀texture—across⠀a⠀paragraph.⠀Let⠀its⠀cadence⠀open⠀and⠀close⠀the⠀attention:⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀that⠀selects⠀the⠀image,⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀inward⠀movement⠀to⠀trace⠀its⠀felt⠀duration⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀direct⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀image⠀concentrate⠀attention⠀when⠀it⠀belongs,⠀whether⠀understanding⠀changes⠀or⠀remains⠀familiar.⠀A⠀completed⠀return⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀image⠀a⠀fixed⠀symbol⠀for⠀the⠀relationship;⠀let⠀its⠀significance⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀person's⠀current⠀interpretation,⠀which⠀may⠀shift⠀later.\n\nRecurring⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀may⠀appear⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀in⠀subsequent⠀replies.⠀When⠀it⠀recurs,⠀preserve⠀or⠀alter⠀its⠀significance⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀since⠀experienced⠀or⠀decided.⠀The⠀private⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀image⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced⠀to⠀others,⠀and⠀no⠀new⠀action⠀or⠀concealed⠀motive⠀is⠀required.⠀Keep⠀sensed⠀experience,⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀imagined⠀possibility,⠀and⠀known⠀fact⠀distinct⠀in⠀the⠀prose.⠀Actual⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀directly⠀named⠀or⠀left⠀under⠀consideration,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀accessible⠀as⠀this⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.\n\nLet⠀the⠀selected⠀image⠀anchor⠀the⠀character⠀drama⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀it:⠀the⠀request,⠀withheld⠀truth,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀remains⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀development⠀gives⠀that⠀exchange⠀felt⠀duration⠀and⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀pause⠀symbolic⠀or⠀every⠀reflection⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀plot.⠀A⠀conversation⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀image,⠀but⠀the⠀image⠀only⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀carries⠀this⠀person's⠀attention,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀predicts⠀a⠀later⠀twist⠀or⠀stands⠀for⠀an⠀abstract⠀theme.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nSelect⠀a⠀particular⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene—a⠀word,⠀a⠀place,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act—that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀associates⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀already⠀established⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀continuity.⠀Present⠀the⠀detail⠀first⠀in⠀direct⠀terms⠀as⠀it⠀appears⠀now,⠀then⠀allow⠀the⠀association⠀to⠀draw⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀to⠀that⠀former⠀experience.⠀Do⠀not⠀blur⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀then⠀and⠀now:⠀keep⠀original⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀thinks⠀or⠀feels⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀The⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀should⠀be⠀signaled⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀permitted⠀memory⠀or⠀private⠀realization,⠀never⠀as⠀new⠀information⠀the⠀reader⠀is⠀expected⠀to⠀infer⠀from⠀silence.\n\nThe⠀reflective⠀movement⠀need⠀not⠀issue⠀in⠀a⠀visible⠀reaction.⠀Let⠀the⠀association⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion.⠀Other⠀participants⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀outward⠀sign⠀or⠀continue⠀without⠀noticing,⠀and⠀their⠀knowledge⠀follows⠀actual⠀channels⠀rather⠀than⠀automatic⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀recollection.⠀Recurrence⠀of⠀the⠀detail⠀can⠀sustain⠀attachment⠀or⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀register⠀real⠀alteration.⠀Do⠀not⠀supply⠀death,⠀failed⠀reunion,⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀poignant⠀meaning⠀merely⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀pause⠀significant.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀include⠀unfinished⠀longing,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀announce⠀loss⠀or⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀doomed⠀to⠀repeat⠀absence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀reply⠀leave⠀the⠀reflection⠀continuing⠀or⠀conclude⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀treatment⠀is⠀a⠀mode⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀an⠀outcome;⠀the⠀character⠀drama⠀proceeds⠀through⠀the⠀concrete⠀request,⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀anchors⠀the⠀scene.⠀What⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀need⠀not⠀overshadow⠀what⠀is⠀presently⠀being⠀done⠀or⠀said.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀modern⠀memoir⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀participant's⠀account⠀conveyed⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀perspective,⠀without⠀inventing⠀the⠀narrator's⠀participation⠀or⠀authorship⠀of⠀the⠀memoir.⠀Reconstruct⠀a⠀particular⠀relationship⠀act—a⠀request,⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀care—using⠀the⠀knowledge⠀available⠀at⠀that⠀earlier⠀time.⠀Present⠀the⠀original⠀exchange⠀in⠀direct⠀terms⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀degree⠀of⠀uncertainty⠀or⠀clarity⠀the⠀character⠀had⠀then.⠀Do⠀not⠀allow⠀later⠀understanding⠀to⠀color⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀or⠀intended⠀in⠀the⠀remembered⠀moment.\n\nMove⠀between⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀and⠀the⠀memoirist's⠀later⠀interpretation⠀as⠀actually⠀recorded⠀or⠀recounted.⠀When⠀that⠀later⠀account⠀comments,⠀place⠀that⠀commentary⠀at⠀its⠀proper⠀retrospective⠀time,⠀clearly⠀distinguished⠀from⠀the⠀original⠀event.⠀A⠀selected⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀former⠀occasion⠀may⠀become⠀newly⠀understood⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀or⠀remain⠀familiar⠀without⠀overturning⠀the⠀original⠀reason.⠀The⠀memoir⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀confession,⠀regret,⠀absolution,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀past.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀composed⠀account.⠀The⠀memoir⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀account⠀by⠀its⠀actual⠀author,⠀not⠀a⠀transparent⠀window⠀into⠀all⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀a⠀document⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀must⠀create.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority,⠀write⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀the⠀memoir's⠀composed⠀record,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀substitute⠀the⠀document⠀for⠀that⠀inner⠀life.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relationship⠀being⠀recalled⠀and⠀any⠀actual⠀present⠀occasion⠀intelligible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀live⠀writing⠀scene,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀closure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀relevant⠀word,⠀position,⠀or⠀act⠀that⠀constitutes⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀between⠀characters.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀done⠀and⠀to⠀retain⠀its⠀causal⠀and⠀personal⠀connection⠀to⠀the⠀speaker's⠀decision.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀the⠀exchange⠀alone:⠀include⠀the⠀minimum⠀context—who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀obligation⠀or⠀history⠀is⠀active,⠀what⠀physical⠀circumstance⠀matters—necessary⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀infer⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Omit⠀restatement,⠀redundant⠀interpretation,⠀and⠀explanations⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀materially⠀contribute.\n\nA⠀pause⠀may⠀indicate⠀ease,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀another⠀supported⠀state;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer.⠀A⠀plain⠀answer⠀may⠀settle⠀the⠀matter⠀without⠀a⠀follow-up⠀twist.⠀Speech⠀and⠀thought⠀can⠀align,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀can⠀be⠀long⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀short.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀known⠀motives,⠀important⠀context,⠀or⠀developed⠀feeling⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀brevity;⠀minimalism⠀is⠀economy⠀of⠀presentation,⠀not⠀absence⠀of⠀inner⠀life.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀pause,⠀including⠀within⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀or⠀private⠀consideration⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀after⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀terms⠀should⠀remain⠀inferable⠀through⠀precise⠀context⠀without⠀a⠀reveal,⠀a⠀prepared⠀next⠀move,⠀or⠀redundant⠀gloss;⠀needed⠀explanation⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀take⠀a⠀paragraph.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀private⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀artificially⠀delay⠀information⠀already⠀established⠀in⠀continuity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaias::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀exchange,⠀ordinary⠀activity,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience.⠀Use⠀a⠀direct⠀line⠀or⠀selected⠀detail⠀to⠀concentrate⠀attention⠀within⠀a⠀longer⠀passage,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀terseness⠀on⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀remain⠀flexible:⠀a⠀paragraph⠀may⠀shift⠀from⠀observation⠀to⠀memory⠀to⠀unspoken⠀thought⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀requires,⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀continuity⠀of⠀action.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀later⠀context⠀qualifies⠀or⠀confirms⠀an⠀interpretation,⠀ground⠀that⠀shift⠀in⠀material⠀already⠀present⠀or⠀later⠀supplied,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀hidden⠀fact⠀introduced⠀solely⠀for⠀effect.⠀Ordinary⠀particulars—a⠀chair⠀moved,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀glass⠀set⠀down—may⠀carry⠀personal⠀meaning,⠀without⠀having⠀to⠀become⠀clues.⠀A⠀supported⠀inference⠀can⠀follow⠀actual⠀context,⠀while⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀may⠀simply⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀lived⠀experience.⠀Preserve⠀independent⠀NPC⠀life:⠀those⠀not⠀in⠀focus⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀choices⠀and⠀responses,⠀visible⠀or⠀offstage.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀authority.⠀The⠀narrative⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀knowledge⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀it.⠀A⠀pending⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange⠀can⠀stand⠀without⠀a⠀crisis,⠀lesson,⠀or⠀concealed⠀motive⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Let⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀choices⠀carry⠀their⠀actual⠀human⠀context;⠀a⠀sudden⠀turn⠀can⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀circumstances⠀support⠀it,⠀without⠀being⠀required⠀for⠀dramatic⠀interest.⠀Close⠀the⠀passage⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀pause⠀dictated⠀by⠀the⠀existing⠀scene⠀and⠀role.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀material.⠀Choose⠀a⠀present⠀request,⠀offer,⠀ordinary⠀pleasure,⠀or⠀established⠀callback⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀those⠀particular⠀people.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀proceed⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀terms:⠀shared⠀understanding⠀and⠀direct⠀affection⠀are⠀possible,⠀as⠀are⠀confusion,⠀restraint,⠀or⠀disagreement.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀selected⠀word⠀or⠀gesture⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀devotion.\n\nUse⠀a⠀selected⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀recurring⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀shared⠀history⠀to⠀locate⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀keep⠀its⠀significance⠀local.⠀A⠀familiar⠀expression⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀familiar;⠀a⠀remembered⠀habit⠀may⠀recall⠀attachment⠀without⠀implying⠀a⠀hidden⠀wound.⠀Each⠀person's⠀known⠀history,⠀private⠀reasons,⠀and⠀actual⠀response⠀remain⠀distinct.⠀New⠀acquaintances⠀need⠀no⠀invented⠀past⠀to⠀create⠀intimacy.\n\nThe⠀relationship⠀may⠀continue,⠀change,⠀or⠀conclude⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation⠀or⠀repair.⠀Passionate⠀language⠀is⠀allowed⠀but⠀not⠀obligatory;⠀genuine⠀care⠀can⠀be⠀quiet.⠀When⠀private⠀feeling⠀is⠀authorized,⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀experience,⠀including⠀directly⠀named⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning⠀when⠀appropriate,⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀detached⠀commentary⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀think.⠀The⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀how⠀these⠀people⠀actually⠀treat⠀each⠀other⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀imposed⠀arc⠀of⠀discovery⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀within⠀continued⠀company,⠀uncertain⠀understanding,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion,⠀without⠀a⠀newly⠀legible⠀relationship⠀being⠀a⠀prerequisite.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀named⠀acts,⠀and⠀coherent⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀authority⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀passage⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀a⠀retelling.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀relationship⠀act—a⠀request,⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀contribution—and⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀actual⠀particulars⠀bearing⠀on⠀its⠀scope⠀and⠀accuracy.⠀A⠀public⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate,⠀limited,⠀or⠀mistaken⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀rewriting⠀events⠀to⠀vindicate⠀it.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀state⠀what⠀was⠀done⠀while⠀leaving⠀private⠀reasons⠀unattributed⠀or⠀uncertain.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀return⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀account,⠀with⠀familiar⠀or⠀changed⠀application;⠀repeated⠀epithets⠀are⠀not⠀required.⠀A⠀later⠀detail⠀may⠀qualify⠀the⠀earlier⠀retelling⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀debunking⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀significance⠀at⠀every⠀recurrence.⠀Keep⠀original⠀knowledge⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀public⠀version⠀records.⠀The⠀saga⠀voice⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀omniscient⠀access⠀to⠀motives⠀named⠀in⠀the⠀declaration;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀authority⠀follows⠀the⠀selected⠀person⠀and⠀contract.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀pause⠀unfinished⠀or⠀conclude⠀without⠀heroic⠀promotion,⠀hidden⠀sacrifice,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀verdict.⠀The⠀relationship⠀act⠀remains⠀the⠀center:⠀what⠀was⠀asked,⠀given,⠀withheld,⠀or⠀resolved.⠀The⠀retelling⠀may⠀elevate⠀the⠀act⠀without⠀falsifying⠀its⠀human⠀scale.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀telling⠀naturally⠀rests,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀installment⠀available⠀but⠀not⠀declaring⠀the⠀story's⠀meaning⠀for⠀anyone⠀beyond⠀the⠀narrator.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀psychological⠀and⠀essayistic⠀mode.⠀Select⠀a⠀direct⠀claim⠀that⠀one⠀person⠀actually⠀makes⠀about⠀a⠀relationship—spoken⠀aloud⠀or⠀held⠀as⠀an⠀authorized⠀private⠀judgment—and⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀a⠀particular⠀instance⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀remember,⠀perceive,⠀or⠀clearly⠀imagine.⠀Keep⠀the⠀claim's⠀source⠀and⠀the⠀instance's⠀source⠀distinct:⠀a⠀remembered⠀act⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀the⠀later⠀sentence⠀that⠀interprets⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀hypothetical⠀case⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀event⠀that⠀occurred.\n\nLet⠀the⠀claim⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀brief⠀declarative⠀statement.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀compressed⠀inward⠀formulation.⠀Preserve⠀needed⠀context⠀and⠀the⠀claimant's⠀actual⠀words⠀or⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀without⠀adding⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀around⠀the⠀declaration.⠀Then⠀develop⠀the⠀comparison⠀through⠀sustained⠀inward⠀consideration:⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀noticed⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀recall,⠀what⠀the⠀claim⠀would⠀mean⠀if⠀applied⠀to⠀that⠀particular,⠀and⠀whether⠀the⠀fit⠀is⠀exact,⠀imperfect,⠀or⠀still⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀comparison⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀claim,⠀qualify⠀it,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀open.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀test,⠀a⠀refutation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀argument.\n\nKeep⠀feeling⠀available⠀beyond⠀the⠀reasoning.⠀An⠀authorized⠀person⠀may⠀experience⠀bodily⠀discomfort,⠀a⠀recurring⠀image,⠀or⠀reluctance⠀to⠀finish⠀the⠀comparison.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀owner⠀of⠀that⠀response;⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀claimant⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀experiencing⠀it.⠀Another⠀character's⠀private⠀motive⠀remains⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀infers.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Gu⠀Long⠀movement⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀omission.⠀Concentrate⠀on⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀this⠀claim's⠀scope⠀intelligible⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count.⠀Where⠀an⠀actual⠀interval⠀or⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀falls⠀between⠀claim⠀and⠀instance,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀its⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀gap,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀distilled⠀image—a⠀room,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀gesture—carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀comparison⠀without⠀being⠀decoded.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀question⠀remains⠀open,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀crisis⠀or⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀keep⠀cuts⠀to⠀supported⠀shifts⠀in⠀place,⠀time,⠀or⠀attention.⠀An⠀action⠀line⠀should⠀establish⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀object⠀is⠀handled,⠀where⠀a⠀person⠀stands,⠀what⠀sound⠀interrupts.⠀Do⠀not⠀crowd⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands⠀or⠀symbolic⠀close-ups.\n\nLet⠀a⠀noticed⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀silence⠀orient⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀becoming⠀proof⠀of⠀private⠀motive.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀cup,⠀look⠀toward⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀sentence⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀records⠀the⠀observable⠀fact.⠀The⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀fact⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀interpretation,⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀may⠀interpret⠀it⠀differently⠀or⠀not⠀notice⠀it⠀at⠀all.\n\nKeep⠀direct⠀speech⠀brief⠀and⠀declarative⠀where⠀the⠀speaker⠀would⠀be⠀brief.⠀A⠀line⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀partial⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀exchange⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀statement.⠀Let⠀physical⠀time⠀follow⠀the⠀events:⠀a⠀pause⠀is⠀a⠀pause,⠀not⠀a⠀coded⠀confession.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀a⠀performed⠀or⠀narrated⠀layer⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀sensation⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀without⠀being⠀converted⠀into⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀within⠀consideration,⠀ordinary⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀later⠀moment⠀without⠀implying⠀that⠀the⠀intervening⠀silence⠀resolved⠀anything.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀clear⠀name,⠀and⠀use⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀performed⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀space.⠀A⠀stage⠀direction⠀should⠀tell⠀an⠀actor⠀or⠀director⠀what⠀is⠀physically⠀present⠀and⠀what⠀changes:⠀who⠀moves,⠀what⠀is⠀picked⠀up⠀or⠀set⠀down,⠀where⠀a⠀person⠀stands⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀another,⠀what⠀sound⠀comes⠀from⠀offstage.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀ordinary—folding⠀a⠀cloth,⠀checking⠀a⠀door,⠀pouring⠀water—or⠀may⠀stop⠀moving⠀before⠀answering.⠀The⠀action⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀illustrate⠀the⠀line.⠀A⠀pause⠀is⠀a⠀supported⠀silence,⠀not⠀a⠀coded⠀emotion.⠀One⠀character's⠀stillness⠀can⠀mean⠀attention,⠀fatigue,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀something⠀else;⠀the⠀script⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀which.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀declarative⠀speech⠀where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀speaker.⠀A⠀request,⠀an⠀admission,⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀character⠀to⠀be⠀witty,⠀cryptic,⠀or⠀eloquent.⠀Offstage⠀events⠀remain⠀available⠀through⠀credible⠀sounds,⠀reports,⠀or⠀visible⠀traces.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀also⠀fail⠀to⠀react,⠀and⠀that⠀absence⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀playable⠀choice.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀asides⠀and⠀monologues.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀an⠀audience;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀sensation⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀without⠀being⠀disguised⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀consideration,⠀ordinary⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.⠀The⠀boundary⠀need⠀not⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀disclosure⠀or⠀a⠀rearranged⠀stage⠀picture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀telling⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀mental⠀succession.⠀Follow⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀among:⠀a⠀present⠀perception,⠀a⠀memory,⠀an⠀imagined⠀reply,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀those⠀associations⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀linear⠀report⠀of⠀events.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀only⠀imagined⠀or⠀wished.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Gu⠀Long⠀movement⠀within⠀this⠀associative⠀flow.⠀A⠀brief⠀declarative⠀return⠀can⠀concentrate⠀attention:⠀a⠀short⠀sentence⠀that⠀names⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀has⠀just⠀realized,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀image⠀that⠀stops⠀the⠀drift.⠀Do⠀not⠀shorten⠀the⠀inward⠀movement⠀itself⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀material⠀interruption⠀to⠀create⠀drama.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀unanswered⠀question⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀knows.⠀A⠀conclusion⠀already⠀reached⠀remains⠀available⠀in⠀thought⠀even⠀when⠀unspoken⠀to⠀others.⠀A⠀later⠀realization⠀cannot⠀be⠀backdated⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀person's⠀private⠀words⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀would⠀say⠀aloud;⠀they⠀may⠀rehearse⠀a⠀sentence,⠀reject⠀it,⠀or⠀imagine⠀another⠀person's⠀response⠀without⠀sending⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀access⠀boundaries⠀intact.⠀The⠀associative⠀movement⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀only.⠀Another⠀character's⠀thoughts⠀remain⠀separate⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀The⠀active⠀narrator's⠀role⠀and⠀any⠀additional⠀permitted⠀access⠀stay⠀in⠀force.⠀No⠀reveal,⠀decision,⠀or⠀return⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀boundary;⠀the⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀turning⠀something⠀over.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀sender⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unsent.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀direct⠀wording⠀be⠀brief⠀or⠀developed⠀as⠀its⠀speaker⠀needs.⠀A⠀request,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀question,⠀a⠀shared⠀reference,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀message.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀may⠀recur⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀coded⠀signal.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀exchange⠀to⠀produce⠀an⠀answer,⠀a⠀reveal,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀stages⠀of⠀communication.⠀A⠀composed⠀draft⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀sent⠀message.⠀An⠀imagined⠀reply⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀received⠀one.⠀Transmission⠀is⠀not⠀receipt,⠀receipt⠀is⠀not⠀comprehension,⠀and⠀comprehension⠀is⠀not⠀action.⠀Keep⠀other⠀knowledge⠀channels⠀separate:⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀knows⠀from⠀a⠀call,⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀or⠀an⠀earlier⠀conversation⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀enter⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀sent⠀text.⠀A⠀sender's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀feeling⠀remains⠀available⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀short⠀answer,⠀silence,⠀or⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀a⠀motive,⠀predict⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀bond.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀relationship⠀remains⠀exactly⠀where⠀it⠀was.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaiba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀relevant⠀place,⠀object,⠀or⠀distance.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀to⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀visibly⠀present.⠀Then⠀move⠀among⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀focal⠀narration,⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀attention⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀rhythm.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀is⠀a⠀purposeful⠀reference,⠀not⠀an⠀executable⠀engine⠀command⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀cue⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀or⠀acquire⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀reading.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀same⠀doorway,⠀the⠀same⠀cup,⠀the⠀same⠀posture⠀as⠀before.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀unchanged,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀may⠀give⠀it⠀new⠀significance.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀fixed⠀cue-and-reaction⠀cycles,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀changed⠀significance⠀where⠀none⠀is⠀supported.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀interpretation⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀another⠀character⠀knows.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀infers,⠀doubts,⠀or⠀privately⠀recalls.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀inference⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀Conversely,⠀do⠀not⠀conceal⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀until⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast⠀catches⠀up.\n\nPreserve⠀developed⠀inward⠀experience⠀during⠀quick⠀exchanges.⠀A⠀short⠀dialogue⠀line⠀may⠀be⠀surrounded⠀by⠀a⠀longer⠀private⠀response:⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀reply.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀final⠀reveal.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀question⠀remains⠀open,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀statement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaibb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀a⠀new⠀installment,⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀continuing⠀relation,⠀ordinary⠀activity,⠀or⠀private⠀concern.⠀Name⠀the⠀actual⠀earlier⠀request,⠀response,⠀commitment,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀matter⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀that⠀established⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀what⠀people⠀already⠀know.⠀A⠀previously⠀settled⠀answer⠀stays⠀available.⠀A⠀later⠀interpretation⠀cannot⠀be⠀backdated⠀into⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀now⠀understands⠀something⠀differently,⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀new⠀understanding⠀arriving⠀now;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀pretend⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment⠀already⠀contained⠀it.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀particular⠀recur⠀without⠀forcing⠀it⠀to⠀change⠀meaning.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀gesture⠀as⠀before.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀unchanged,⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀new⠀fact⠀may⠀give⠀it⠀new⠀significance.⠀Repetition⠀may⠀sustain⠀or⠀deepen⠀understanding⠀without⠀restarting⠀a⠀settled⠀suspicion⠀or⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀delayed⠀disclosure.\n\nKeep⠀inward⠀experience⠀and⠀independent⠀lives⠀continuing⠀without⠀a⠀per-installment⠀reveal,⠀conflict,⠀new⠀detail,⠀or⠀prepared⠀next⠀move.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀spend⠀the⠀installment⠀working,⠀resting,⠀talking,⠀or⠀thinking.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀settled⠀answers⠀and⠀continuing⠀uncertainty⠀alike;⠀serial⠀duration⠀supplies⠀no⠀deadline⠀for⠀resolving⠀a⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nSituate⠀the⠀difficult⠀request,⠀admission,⠀apology,⠀or⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀encounter.⠀Where⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀is⠀already⠀present,⠀give⠀it⠀unhurried⠀attention:⠀clearing⠀a⠀table,⠀waiting⠀for⠀water⠀to⠀boil,⠀or⠀walking⠀to⠀a⠀station.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀also⠀simply⠀speak,⠀wait,⠀or⠀think⠀without⠀an⠀invented⠀task,⠀and⠀activity⠀may⠀continue⠀or⠀pause⠀according⠀to⠀actual⠀events.⠀The⠀speaker⠀may⠀pause,⠀restart,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀sentence⠀incomplete⠀because⠀the⠀request⠀costs⠀something,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀become⠀a⠀confrontation.\n\nAttach⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notices⠀in⠀the⠀present:⠀a⠀stain,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bag,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀has⠀been⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀place.⠀Let⠀the⠀detail⠀recur⠀where⠀attention⠀brings⠀it⠀back,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count⠀or⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀explain⠀its⠀meaning.⠀It⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀person's⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀signal⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀understands⠀it⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀already⠀changed.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀inward⠀experience⠀the⠀room⠀it⠀actually⠀needs.⠀A⠀direct⠀thought,⠀a⠀sustained⠀reflection,⠀or⠀a⠀sharp⠀physical⠀reaction⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀outward⠀exchange.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀responds⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀purposes.⠀They⠀may⠀answer⠀the⠀spoken⠀request,⠀address⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀it,⠀notice⠀the⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀remain⠀occupied⠀with⠀the⠀task.⠀Their⠀response⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀feeling.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀ordinary⠀register.⠀A⠀plain⠀sentence⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀strain⠀than⠀an⠀elaborate⠀one.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀reconciliation,⠀rupture,⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀behavior.⠀The⠀difficult⠀thing⠀may⠀remain⠀partly⠀unsaid,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀may⠀simply⠀reach⠀its⠀own⠀small⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nCompose⠀the⠀current⠀interaction⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀role⠀contract.⠀Use⠀readable⠀scene⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Orient⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀ordinary⠀spatial⠀and⠀practical⠀details:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unfinished⠀around⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀shared⠀activity⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀when⠀that⠀connection⠀occurs.⠀The⠀association⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound,⠀or⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀another⠀person⠀performs⠀a⠀routine⠀action.⠀It⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀experience⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀active⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge⠀and⠀purposes.⠀They⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀task,⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀pursue⠀an⠀independent⠀concern.⠀Their⠀speech⠀and⠀behavior⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀who⠀they⠀are⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀private⠀interpretation.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀interval⠀to⠀remain⠀unhurried.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stay⠀in⠀thought,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀routine⠀activity⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀continuity,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀able⠀to⠀continue⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀routine⠀of⠀proximity:⠀sharing⠀a⠀room,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀visitor,⠀working⠀beside⠀someone,⠀or⠀moving⠀through⠀a⠀familiar⠀neighborhood⠀together.⠀Keep⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀community.\n\nLet⠀a⠀recurring⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀connect⠀present⠀contact⠀to⠀earlier⠀feeling.⠀The⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀sound⠀from⠀the⠀street,⠀a⠀household⠀object,⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀particular⠀task⠀is⠀divided.⠀It⠀should⠀return⠀naturally⠀within⠀the⠀routine,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀symbolic⠀announcement.⠀The⠀focal⠀person's⠀association⠀with⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀private,⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀experiences⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀differently⠀or⠀simply⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀day.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀unhurried⠀Murakami⠀surface.⠀Describe⠀practical⠀activities⠀evenly⠀and⠀allow⠀conversational⠀distance⠀to⠀remain.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀direct⠀feeling⠀can⠀surface⠀through⠀the⠀routine,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀break⠀the⠀shared⠀activity⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀visible⠀confrontation.\n\nAllow⠀ease⠀to⠀remain⠀ease.⠀Co-presence⠀may⠀be⠀companionable,⠀strained,⠀or⠀simply⠀ordinary.⠀Do⠀not⠀presume⠀estrangement,⠀hidden⠀resentment,⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀routine⠀still⠀in⠀progress⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀association⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀for⠀the⠀material⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀worn⠀surfaces,⠀exact⠀sounds,⠀bodily⠀effort,⠀the⠀weight⠀or⠀resistance⠀of⠀objects.⠀Keep⠀these⠀details⠀concrete⠀and⠀brief.⠀Let⠀their⠀actual⠀presence⠀register⠀through⠀the⠀outward⠀exchange⠀or⠀focal⠀attention,⠀with⠀interruption⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀occurs,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀survival⠀predicament⠀for⠀the⠀style,⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀such⠀conditions⠀actually⠀supplied.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀arises,⠀allow⠀the⠀prose⠀to⠀slow.⠀A⠀sustained⠀thought⠀or⠀memory⠀may⠀occupy⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀even⠀though⠀the⠀surrounding⠀action⠀remains⠀compressed.⠀An⠀association⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀detail,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀or⠀the⠀person's⠀established⠀memory⠀and⠀concern;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀worn⠀object⠀or⠀repeated⠀sound.⠀It⠀brings⠀the⠀concern⠀back⠀without⠀proving⠀danger⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀physical⠀response.\n\nKeep⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀in⠀the⠀mouth⠀of⠀its⠀actual⠀speaker.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀or⠀with⠀care.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀voice⠀hard-edged,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀to⠀answer⠀inward⠀pain⠀with⠀visible⠀toughness.\n\nUse⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀compressed⠀action⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀longer⠀inward⠀passage,⠀then⠀by⠀a⠀short⠀practical⠀exchange.⠀The⠀inner⠀movement⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀completed⠀by⠀the⠀scene's⠀end.⠀Material⠀pressure⠀may⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀remains⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀actual⠀documents.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀note,⠀report,⠀message,⠀or⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀an⠀ordinary⠀phrase⠀or⠀item⠀recur⠀across⠀records⠀where⠀the⠀history⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀detail⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀different⠀documents.⠀Each⠀writer⠀may⠀associate⠀it⠀differently,⠀but⠀the⠀recurrence⠀should⠀not⠀invent⠀contradictions⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀hidden⠀pattern.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀document's⠀wording⠀straightforward.⠀A⠀writer⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀they⠀want,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀the⠀recipient⠀needs⠀to⠀know.⠀The⠀record⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀says⠀from⠀what⠀its⠀writer⠀or⠀reader⠀privately⠀feels.⠀The⠀recorded⠀meaning⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀resonance⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀is⠀larger.\n\nUse⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀to⠀carry⠀time⠀and⠀change.⠀A⠀later⠀record⠀may⠀answer⠀an⠀earlier⠀request,⠀avoid⠀it,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀practical⠀matter⠀without⠀addressing⠀the⠀private⠀concern.⠀The⠀reader's⠀private⠀association⠀with⠀a⠀recurring⠀detail⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀confirmed⠀by⠀any⠀document.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀a⠀feasible⠀gesture,⠀shared⠀routine,⠀or⠀remembered⠀preference⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people.⠀The⠀care⠀may⠀be⠀practical:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀adjusting⠀a⠀room,⠀walking⠀together,⠀or⠀completing⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀been⠀avoiding.⠀Describe⠀it⠀unhurriedly,⠀with⠀enough⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀comfort⠀tangible.\n\nLet⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail⠀sustain⠀warmth⠀or⠀an⠀individual⠀association⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀explanation.⠀The⠀smell⠀of⠀tea,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀rain,⠀or⠀the⠀familiar⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀arranges⠀objects⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀private⠀feeling.⠀The⠀detail⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀named⠀as⠀significant⠀by⠀anyone⠀else.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀recipient's⠀response⠀their⠀own.⠀They⠀may⠀enjoy⠀the⠀kindness⠀directly,⠀need⠀different⠀help,⠀remain⠀preoccupied,⠀or⠀accept⠀the⠀care⠀while⠀thinking⠀of⠀something⠀else.⠀Their⠀reaction⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀match⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀intention⠀or⠀resolve⠀a⠀private⠀uncertainty.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀comfort⠀to⠀remain⠀partial.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀an⠀unresolved⠀concern.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀emotional⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀complete⠀understanding.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀ordinary⠀care⠀still⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator's⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀access:⠀the⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀meeting,⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀obligations⠀that⠀bring⠀these⠀people⠀together,⠀or⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀this⠀framing⠀give⠀the⠀exchange⠀context⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nMove⠀between⠀the⠀shared⠀occasion⠀and⠀a⠀sustained⠀private⠀concern⠀through⠀clear⠀transitions.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀the⠀outward⠀activity,⠀turn⠀toward⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀association,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀moment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀association⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀experiences⠀it;⠀it⠀may⠀remain⠀unspoken⠀or⠀be⠀communicated⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀exchange,⠀without⠀automatic⠀transfer⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀factual⠀explanation⠀of⠀another⠀character's⠀behavior⠀or⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀official⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀ordinary⠀individual⠀register.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀with⠀care.⠀Conversational⠀distance⠀can⠀remain⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narrator's⠀prose⠀is⠀composed.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀formal⠀arc⠀to⠀remain⠀in⠀progress.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀reach⠀a⠀judgment,⠀resolution,⠀or⠀completed⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀private⠀association⠀may⠀stay⠀open,⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀may⠀continue⠀to⠀exert⠀pressure⠀without⠀determining⠀the⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀telling⠀situation:⠀identify⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀and⠀what⠀immediate⠀need⠀or⠀pleasure⠀makes⠀the⠀story⠀worth⠀telling⠀now.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀want⠀company,⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀decision,⠀to⠀fill⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀question,⠀but⠀the⠀occasion⠀itself⠀should⠀remain⠀concrete⠀and⠀social.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀begins,⠀shift⠀levels⠀cleanly.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀describe⠀ordinary⠀actions⠀in⠀an⠀unhurried,⠀even⠀way:⠀a⠀person⠀making⠀tea,⠀walking⠀a⠀familiar⠀route,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀call,⠀returning⠀an⠀object.⠀Give⠀the⠀account⠀its⠀own⠀literal⠀time⠀and⠀place,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀visible.⠀A⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀returns⠀to⠀may⠀carry⠀private⠀feeling⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀significant.\n\nInside⠀the⠀tale,⠀let⠀ordinary⠀things⠀associate⠀with⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀concern⠀where⠀their⠀attention⠀makes⠀that⠀connection,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀count.⠀The⠀association⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀attention,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation:⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound,⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀alone.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀become⠀strange⠀or⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀association.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀social⠀event.⠀Show⠀an⠀actual⠀response⠀or⠀continuing⠀attention:⠀a⠀small⠀action,⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀delay,⠀or⠀quiet⠀listening⠀may⠀locate⠀the⠀ongoing⠀occasion.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀connect⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀situation,⠀but⠀need⠀not⠀decode⠀it,⠀confront⠀the⠀teller,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀new⠀understanding.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀affect⠀the⠀room's⠀atmosphere⠀or⠀sustain⠀it⠀unchanged;⠀no⠀atmospheric⠀or⠀relationship⠀change⠀is⠀required.\n\nIf⠀the⠀scene⠀continues,⠀let⠀the⠀outer⠀exchange⠀continue⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀people's⠀actual⠀attention;⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀remain⠀a⠀private⠀concern,⠀a⠀shared⠀pleasure,⠀or⠀something⠀they⠀have⠀simply⠀finished⠀hearing.⠀Recurrence⠀can⠀work⠀through⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀reappearing⠀in⠀the⠀frame,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀certify⠀a⠀hidden⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀Romantic⠀and⠀uncanny⠀narration⠀as⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀holding⠀a⠀familiar⠀encounter⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀recognition.⠀Where⠀the⠀encounter⠀contains⠀a⠀relevant⠀threshold,⠀work⠀with⠀that⠀actual⠀occasion⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀crossing:⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀street⠀corner,⠀a⠀station⠀entrance,⠀the⠀moment⠀before⠀a⠀visitor⠀speaks,⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀absence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀place⠀literal⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀access⠀to⠀it⠀real.\n\nDescribe⠀the⠀threshold⠀through⠀unhurried⠀practical⠀activity⠀and⠀exact⠀surfaces.⠀Let⠀attention⠀settle⠀on⠀an⠀actual⠀familiar⠀detail,⠀whether⠀unchanged⠀or⠀changed:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀lock,⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀light,⠀a⠀coat⠀on⠀a⠀hook,⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀objects⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀familiarity⠀reside⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀attention⠀and⠀even⠀description;⠀an⠀explanation⠀or⠀remembered⠀source⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀when⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀knows⠀it.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀impression⠀to⠀develop⠀slowly.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀pause,⠀repeat⠀a⠀small⠀action,⠀or⠀continue⠀speaking⠀while⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀familiarity⠀gathers.⠀The⠀threshold⠀feeling⠀can⠀settle⠀into⠀comfort,⠀persist⠀as⠀an⠀unresolved⠀strangeness,⠀or⠀fade⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀ordinary⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀it⠀to⠀become⠀dread,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀supernatural⠀event.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀encounter⠀active.⠀Another⠀person⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀withhold⠀an⠀answer,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀offer⠀help⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀remains⠀partly⠀absorbed⠀in⠀the⠀threshold⠀impression.⠀Let⠀conversation⠀and⠀inward⠀attention⠀coexist,⠀pause,⠀or⠀interrupt⠀one⠀another⠀according⠀to⠀actual⠀events⠀and⠀this⠀person's⠀attention,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation⠀or⠀compulsory⠀simultaneous⠀continuation.\n\nIf⠀the⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀threshold⠀later,⠀let⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀accumulated⠀feeling⠀without⠀announcing⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Where⠀an⠀uncanny⠀effect⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀experience,⠀develop⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀the⠀known⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀sense⠀of⠀it.⠀Familiarity⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀comfortable⠀or⠀ordinary;⠀no⠀feeling⠀of⠀dislocation⠀or⠀invented⠀cause⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀an⠀established⠀authority⠀enter⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀its⠀practical⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀backdrop.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀work⠀in⠀an⠀old⠀building,⠀carry⠀out⠀a⠀task⠀governed⠀by⠀an⠀inherited⠀rule,⠀visit⠀someone⠀who⠀holds⠀a⠀position,⠀or⠀handle⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀institution.⠀Show⠀the⠀authority⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀permits,⠀requires,⠀or⠀makes⠀awkward⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.\n\nDescribe⠀the⠀material⠀setting⠀with⠀unhurried⠀attention:⠀worn⠀surfaces,⠀locked⠀drawers,⠀a⠀particular⠀chair,⠀the⠀way⠀light⠀falls⠀on⠀a⠀nameplate⠀or⠀a⠀schedule.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀create⠀an⠀intimate⠀atmosphere,⠀but⠀keep⠀them⠀as⠀actual⠀features⠀of⠀the⠀place.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀mood⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀information⠀about⠀the⠀institution⠀or⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀or⠀concern⠀that⠀the⠀authority⠀touches.⠀The⠀desire⠀may⠀be⠀small⠀and⠀practical:⠀to⠀be⠀believed,⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀promise,⠀to⠀leave⠀early,⠀to⠀be⠀allowed⠀a⠀particular⠀choice.⠀Let⠀it⠀appear⠀through⠀actual⠀attention,⠀association,⠀or⠀direct⠀speech;⠀a⠀confession⠀is⠀possible⠀where⠀supported⠀but⠀is⠀not⠀required.⠀The⠀character's⠀feeling⠀about⠀the⠀authority⠀can⠀be⠀mixed⠀without⠀becoming⠀paranoia⠀or⠀automatic⠀rebellion.\n\nAllow⠀trust⠀and⠀help⠀to⠀remain⠀possible.⠀A⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀institution⠀may⠀listen,⠀cooperate,⠀or⠀offer⠀comfort⠀without⠀being⠀secretly⠀corrupt⠀or⠀about⠀to⠀unmask.⠀Social⠀masks⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀a⠀trusted⠀exchange,⠀but⠀they⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀in⠀place⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀requires⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀actually⠀does.\n\nIf⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀toward⠀a⠀decision,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀practical⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀request⠀granted,⠀a⠀rule⠀bent,⠀an⠀obligation⠀named,⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀acknowledged.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀give⠀the⠀actual⠀encounter⠀and⠀any⠀personal⠀cost⠀concrete⠀texture,⠀not⠀supply⠀a⠀hidden⠀threat⠀where⠀none⠀exists.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀lyric⠀and⠀philosophical⠀inwardness⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀reflective⠀construction.⠀Begin⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀contains:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀waiting⠀for⠀someone,⠀folding⠀cloth,⠀walking⠀beside⠀another⠀person,⠀clearing⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀a⠀sensation⠀or⠀repeated⠀act⠀open⠀a⠀particular⠀question⠀about⠀closeness,⠀wanting,⠀or⠀obligation.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀association⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀language⠀and⠀feeling.⠀The⠀question⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀stated⠀as⠀a⠀thesis;⠀it⠀can⠀emerge⠀through⠀a⠀comparison,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention⠀from⠀the⠀task⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reflection⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀inward⠀movement⠀does⠀not⠀float⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀literal⠀activity.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀activity⠀where⠀attention⠀returns.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀complete⠀the⠀task,⠀speak,⠀or⠀notice⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀watching.⠀The⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀settle⠀plainly,⠀or⠀acquire⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀through⠀actual⠀experience.⠀A⠀maxim,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀spiritual⠀conclusion⠀is⠀neither⠀required⠀nor⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀style.⠀The⠀value⠀of⠀the⠀passage⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀effort⠀to⠀think⠀through⠀something⠀that⠀matters⠀while⠀continuing⠀to⠀live.\n\nIf⠀another⠀person⠀is⠀present,⠀let⠀them⠀remain⠀distinct.⠀They⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀silence,⠀or⠀offer⠀something⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀ask⠀for.⠀The⠀inward⠀question⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀ordinary⠀exchange,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀need⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀thought.\n\nAt⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀preserve⠀the⠀question's⠀actual⠀state,⠀whether⠀unfinished,⠀settled,⠀or⠀no⠀longer⠀occupying⠀attention;⠀no⠀lingering⠀pressure⠀or⠀lesson⠀is⠀owed.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀carry⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀let⠀it⠀recede.⠀The⠀reflective⠀construction⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀legible⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀encounter⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀debate⠀or⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀form.⠀Follow⠀a⠀situated⠀recorder⠀or⠀an⠀authorized⠀reflective⠀account⠀through⠀selected⠀encounters,⠀phrases,⠀and⠀observations.⠀The⠀recorder⠀may⠀be⠀writing⠀soon⠀after⠀the⠀event⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀it⠀much⠀later;⠀keep⠀those⠀times⠀distinct⠀when⠀they⠀matter.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recorder⠀choose⠀what⠀to⠀include.⠀Some⠀details⠀should⠀be⠀exact⠀and⠀unhurried:⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀kettle,⠀a⠀sentence⠀someone⠀said,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀hour.⠀Details⠀may⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀and⠀uninterpreted⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀recorder's⠀actual⠀attention.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀observation⠀into⠀a⠀hidden⠀pattern⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀emotional⠀meaning.\n\nAllow⠀an⠀occasional⠀detail⠀to⠀associate⠀with⠀private⠀concern.⠀The⠀recorder⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀task⠀because⠀it⠀has⠀begun⠀to⠀matter.⠀The⠀association⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀recorder's⠀attention⠀and⠀language,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation.⠀A⠀printed⠀diary⠀entry⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀omit⠀or⠀arrange⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀felt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀active.⠀The⠀recorder⠀may⠀describe⠀another⠀person's⠀request,⠀silence,⠀help,⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀while⠀attributing⠀any⠀knowledge⠀of⠀that⠀person's⠀thought⠀to⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀narrator⠀access.⠀Let⠀the⠀entry⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀later⠀understood.\n\nIf⠀the⠀passage⠀includes⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀entry⠀or⠀reflective⠀return,⠀let⠀returns⠀follow⠀the⠀recorder's⠀actual⠀selections:⠀some⠀may⠀develop⠀a⠀concern,⠀while⠀others⠀can⠀remain⠀independent⠀observations⠀connected⠀by⠀the⠀occasion⠀or⠀recording⠀voice.⠀A⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀reappear⠀with⠀changed⠀weight.⠀The⠀miscellany⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀person⠀keeping⠀a⠀record⠀over⠀time,⠀not⠀like⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀forced⠀epiphanies.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀with⠀psychological⠀co-presence⠀as⠀the⠀method.⠀Follow⠀an⠀actual⠀encounter⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀social⠀setting:⠀people⠀together,⠀a⠀person⠀awaiting⠀someone,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀exchange⠀brought⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀setting.⠀A⠀street,⠀workplace,⠀home,⠀bus,⠀or⠀public⠀building⠀can⠀supply⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀already⠀established.⠀Keep⠀the⠀public⠀activity⠀traceable⠀even⠀when⠀private⠀meaning⠀becomes⠀unsettled.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀connect⠀an⠀ordinary⠀feature⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀concern.⠀The⠀connection⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀perception:⠀a⠀particular⠀color,⠀a⠀familiar⠀smell,⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀waits,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀phrase⠀overheard.⠀Describe⠀the⠀feature⠀evenly⠀and⠀without⠀forcing⠀it⠀to⠀become⠀symbolic⠀for⠀everyone⠀present.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀experience⠀separate.⠀They⠀may⠀notice⠀something⠀different,⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀continue⠀talking⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀drifts.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀alternates⠀perspectives,⠀do⠀so⠀only⠀when⠀authorized,⠀and⠀attribute⠀each⠀person's⠀associations⠀clearly;⠀their⠀content⠀may⠀differ⠀or⠀overlap⠀without⠀automatically⠀becoming⠀shared⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀private⠀meaning⠀leak⠀into⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀speech⠀or⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀the⠀encounter⠀develop⠀through⠀ordinary⠀decisions:⠀where⠀to⠀sit,⠀whether⠀to⠀wait,⠀what⠀to⠀buy,⠀how⠀to⠀answer,⠀whether⠀to⠀mention⠀something.⠀The⠀psychological⠀movement⠀can⠀run⠀beside⠀these⠀decisions⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀interrupt⠀them.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀understanding⠀may⠀occur,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀shared⠀or⠀resolved.\n\nIf⠀the⠀scene⠀continues,⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀and⠀its⠀established⠀inhabitants,⠀whether⠀urban⠀or⠀otherwise.⠀People⠀who⠀are⠀present⠀may⠀pass,⠀work,⠀argue,⠀help,⠀or⠀remain⠀still⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀lives.⠀The⠀private⠀association⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀one⠀person's⠀experience⠀inside⠀a⠀shared⠀world,⠀not⠀like⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth⠀the⠀city⠀is⠀waiting⠀to⠀reveal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀actual⠀activity⠀with⠀clear⠀orientation.⠀Name⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀present,⠀and⠀make⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀who⠀is⠀standing,⠀who⠀is⠀holding⠀something,⠀who⠀turns⠀toward⠀the⠀door.⠀If⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name,⠀object,⠀or⠀practical⠀term⠀appears,⠀present⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀context⠀when⠀clarification⠀is⠀useful⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀continue⠀without⠀confusion.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀unmistakable.⠀Let⠀each⠀speaker's⠀words⠀carry⠀their⠀own⠀rhythm⠀and⠀diction,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀flatten⠀everyone⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀conversational⠀distance.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀practical⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀reply⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀line⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀beat.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀attention⠀drifts⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail,⠀let⠀the⠀association⠀develop⠀with⠀the⠀extent⠀the⠀actual⠀experience⠀needs,⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀labeled⠀reaction.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀cup⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound,⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀checks⠀a⠀phone⠀or⠀adjusts⠀a⠀bag.\n\nLet⠀the⠀private⠀resonance⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀conversation.⠀The⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀answer,⠀ask,⠀or⠀remain⠀quiet⠀while⠀the⠀association⠀continues.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀need⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀felt,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀discovery,⠀confession,⠀or⠀comic⠀interruption⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀moment.\n\nIf⠀the⠀scene⠀continues,⠀keep⠀any⠀actual⠀next⠀action⠀legible,⠀while⠀allowing⠀waiting⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀to⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀movement.⠀The⠀break⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀practical⠀movement,⠀a⠀spoken⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀shift⠀in⠀attention.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀question.⠀The⠀light⠀novel⠀presentation⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀readable⠀while⠀preserving⠀its⠀unhurried⠀emotional⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nDevelop⠀a⠀concrete⠀element⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀established⠀associations:⠀a⠀sound,⠀object,⠀activity,⠀or⠀phrase⠀may⠀recur⠀where⠀attention⠀brings⠀it⠀back.⠀Its⠀meaning⠀or⠀felt⠀weight⠀can⠀remain⠀the⠀same,⠀change,⠀or⠀stay⠀open.⠀Keep⠀its⠀literal⠀presence⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀its⠀private⠀resonance⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀practical⠀use⠀or⠀an⠀advancing⠀task.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀to⠀develop⠀the⠀image,⠀allowing⠀sound⠀or⠀syntax⠀to⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀feeling.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀aloud⠀that⠀they⠀are⠀tired⠀or⠀relieved⠀or⠀worried,⠀let⠀that⠀plain⠀statement⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀translating⠀the⠀image⠀into⠀a⠀message.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀private⠀associations⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀kettle's⠀whistle⠀arrives⠀exactly⠀as⠀an⠀old⠀friend⠀asks⠀about⠀the⠀same⠀decision⠀twice,⠀but⠀the⠀friend⠀need⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀sound⠀has⠀come⠀to⠀mean.⠀Develop⠀the⠀motif⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀course⠀of⠀attention,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀observation-association-change⠀sequence.⠀Physical⠀alterations⠀such⠀as⠀dimmer⠀light⠀or⠀a⠀slower⠀movement⠀follow⠀actual⠀causes⠀and⠀timing;⠀a⠀changed⠀association⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀produce⠀them.⠀The⠀image⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved;⠀it⠀is⠀enough⠀for⠀it⠀to⠀continue⠀existing⠀after⠀the⠀encounter⠀without⠀compelling⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀name⠀what⠀it⠀meant.\n\nBalance⠀unhurried⠀practical⠀activity⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀drama's⠀request,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀withholding.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀stay⠀calm⠀and⠀indirect,⠀and⠀another⠀person's⠀speech⠀can⠀be⠀plainly⠀useful⠀while⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀attention⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀image⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀rhythm.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀or⠀require⠀every⠀phrase⠀to⠀be⠀figuratively⠀shaped.⠀A⠀single⠀recurrence⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀effective⠀than⠀several,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀action⠀that⠀carries⠀it⠀may⠀conclude⠀or⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀symbol⠀of⠀that⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀begin⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀statement⠀about⠀the⠀past.⠀A⠀character⠀filling⠀an⠀order,⠀walking⠀past⠀a⠀shut⠀shop,⠀or⠀adjusting⠀a⠀curtain⠀can⠀be⠀enough⠀to⠀bring⠀back⠀one⠀specific⠀earlier⠀occasion:⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀then,⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀habit⠀someone⠀no⠀longer⠀performs.⠀Keep⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀physically⠀legible⠀while⠀the⠀remembered⠀event⠀crosses⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀memory⠀replace⠀the⠀present⠀action;⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀miss⠀a⠀turning,⠀or⠀finish⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀now⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀Avoid⠀giving⠀the⠀remembered⠀self⠀a⠀conclusion⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀teller.⠀If⠀the⠀current⠀person⠀says⠀a⠀friendship⠀did⠀not⠀last,⠀the⠀later⠀outcome⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀into⠀proof⠀of⠀an⠀inevitable⠀ending.⠀A⠀supported⠀connection⠀may⠀be⠀considered⠀from⠀the⠀later⠀vantage⠀without⠀rewriting⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀then.⠀Let⠀warmth,⠀relief,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stay⠀available⠀in⠀both⠀times.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀laughing⠀hard⠀during⠀an⠀evening⠀that⠀later⠀changed⠀nothing⠀and⠀still⠀find⠀the⠀laughter⠀real.\n\nAllow⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀to⠀surface⠀through⠀practical⠀recurrence:⠀the⠀same⠀meal⠀is⠀still⠀made⠀with⠀too⠀much⠀salt,⠀the⠀same⠀radio⠀station⠀still⠀warns⠀of⠀rain,⠀a⠀name⠀still⠀sounds⠀close⠀when⠀someone⠀else⠀says⠀it.⠀These⠀recurrences⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀resolved⠀or⠀announced.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀matter⠀lie,⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀choice⠀and⠀any⠀behavior⠀it⠀produc