r⠀response⠀alongside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reasoning,⠀so⠀the⠀essayistic⠀movement⠀stays⠀grounded⠀in⠀particular⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀detached⠀meditation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀and⠀attributed⠀speech⠀that⠀establish⠀the⠀observable⠀conditions⠀of⠀an⠀encounter⠀without⠀letting⠀a⠀quiet⠀gesture⠀stand⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀emotional⠀distance,⠀closeness,⠀or⠀concealment.⠀Scene⠀headings⠀mark⠀changes⠀of⠀location⠀or⠀time,⠀and⠀cuts⠀may⠀juxtapose⠀actual⠀occasions⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀practical⠀details⠀concrete⠀and⠀evenly⠀presented:⠀a⠀person⠀arriving⠀with⠀wet⠀shoes,⠀coffee⠀left⠀cooling,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀slowly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀remain⠀unhurried⠀even⠀when⠀nothing⠀visible⠀resolves.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀withhold⠀it,⠀accept⠀it,⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀or⠀choose⠀to⠀change⠀it⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do,⠀while⠀the⠀public⠀exchange⠀remains⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀separately⠀from⠀performance⠀or⠀voice-over,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀viewpoint⠀without⠀automatically⠀supplying⠀it⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀through⠀reader⠀access.⠀An⠀unchanged⠀physical⠀scene⠀can⠀accompany⠀extensive⠀inward⠀movement,⠀so⠀the⠀action⠀blocks⠀do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀signal⠀every⠀private⠀association.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀camera⠀commands,⠀probative⠀close-ups,⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀final⠀image.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀playable⠀space⠀to⠀carry⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange.⠀Stage⠀clear⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀and⠀practical⠀business,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀in⠀that⠀space⠀move⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀forward.⠀The⠀action⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀demonstrative:⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀fold⠀a⠀cloth,⠀wait⠀at⠀a⠀table,⠀put⠀a⠀cup⠀down,⠀or⠀remain⠀seated⠀while⠀another⠀speaks,⠀and⠀the⠀supplied⠀context⠀gives⠀such⠀movement⠀its⠀weight.\