ough⠀their⠀actual⠀established⠀access⠀or⠀information,⠀not⠀automatically⠀through⠀narration.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀an⠀external⠀event⠀remains⠀unfinished⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀question⠀remains⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages,⠀using⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀sequence.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀and⠀send⠀immediately,⠀another⠀may⠀type,⠀delete,⠀and⠀wait;⠀one⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀directly⠀while⠀postponing⠀another⠀subject.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀genuinely⠀composed⠀interface⠀text,⠀distinct⠀from⠀live⠀private⠀experience.⠀Its⠀storage⠀and⠀visibility⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀interface⠀and⠀narrator⠀access;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀delivered⠀to⠀another⠀participant⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀it.⠀A⠀visible⠀message⠀may⠀acquire⠀a⠀recipient's⠀private⠀resonance⠀through⠀its⠀timing,⠀phrasing,⠀or⠀relation⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀exchange,⠀but⠀the⠀transcript⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀interpretation;⠀the⠀recipient⠀may⠀respond⠀plainly,⠀misread⠀the⠀message,⠀or⠀let⠀it⠀pass⠀without⠀addressing⠀it.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀or⠀scene⠀grounding.⠀Another⠀message⠀need⠀not⠀settle⠀the⠀recipient's⠀feeling⠀or⠀make⠀an⠀ordinary⠀conversational⠀distance⠀into⠀proof⠀of⠀estrangement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀passages⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀actual⠀encounter.⠀Give⠀practical⠀details⠀plainly:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀or⠀reach⠀for.⠀Keep⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀for⠀the⠀illustrated⠀rhythm,⠀not⠀as⠀mandatory⠀labels⠀or⠀automatic⠀indicators⠀of⠀what⠀someone⠀feels⠀or⠀conceals.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀share⠀the⠀rhythm⠀with⠀the⠀public⠀dialogue.⠀When⠀attention⠀turns⠀from⠀a⠀visible⠀cue⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀association,⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀inward⠀experience⠀fully⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀viewpoint:⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀or⠀a⠀concern⠀that⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cue's⠀literal⠀status⠀distinct⠀from⠀its⠀felt⠀significance:⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀expression,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀conversation⠀may⠀acquire⠀a⠀private⠀weight⠀for⠀one⠀character⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀confirmed⠀message⠀from⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀to⠀the⠀presentation.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀changed⠀interpretation⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀alternation⠀between⠀dialogue⠀and⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabajbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments⠀by⠀keeping⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀a⠀relevant⠀detail⠀or⠀previous⠀exchange⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀current⠀interval⠀make⠀sense⠀to⠀the⠀reader:⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀errand,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀mentioned⠀earlier.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀events⠀and⠀stable⠀conditions⠀already⠀established,⠀so⠀a⠀later⠀recurrence⠀cannot⠀rewrite⠀them.\n\nLet⠀a⠀private⠀concern⠀persist,⠀settle,⠀or⠀return⠀unchanged⠀across⠀installments.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀particular⠀may⠀carry⠀that⠀concern⠀without⠀acquiring⠀a⠀promised⠀hidden⠀explanation,⠀a⠀supernatural⠀cause,⠀an⠀emotional⠀milestone,⠀or⠀a⠀fresh⠀mystery.⠀The⠀interval⠀can⠀close⠀after⠀practical⠀work,⠀company,⠀or⠀inward⠀reflection;⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀and⠀a⠀request⠀unanswered⠀without⠀any⠀new⠀local⠀change⠀or⠀advance⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀situation.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀when⠀they⠀occur,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀installment⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Recurrence⠀deepens⠀the⠀ongoing⠀lived⠀continuity⠀rather⠀than⠀restarting⠀the⠀same⠀suspicion⠀each⠀time.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabakaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nCenter⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀an⠀actual⠀relationship⠀matter⠀involving⠀asking,⠀acceptance,⠀refusal,⠀admission⠀or⠀omission.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀raise⠀it,⠀privately⠀consider⠀it,⠀withhold⠀it⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unspoken.⠀Where⠀terms⠀are⠀actually⠀offered⠀or⠀discussed,⠀keep⠀what⠀is⠀requested,⠀acknowledged⠀or⠀declined⠀clear⠀along⠀with⠀its⠀practical⠀or⠀social⠀constraints;⠀no⠀public⠀step⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀make⠀private⠀strain⠀meaningful.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reception⠀of⠀those⠀terms⠀develop⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀offer,⠀whether⠀it⠀complicates⠀acceptance⠀or⠀coexists⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀answer.⠀Strain⠀need⠀not⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀misunderstanding;⠀it⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀knowing⠀the⠀request⠀is⠀reasonable,⠀wanting⠀to⠀grant⠀it,⠀and⠀being⠀unable⠀to⠀do⠀so⠀cleanly.\n\nFollow⠀any⠀actual⠀after-effect⠀of⠀exposure⠀while⠀allowing⠀ordinary⠀conduct⠀to⠀continue⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀omission⠀of⠀a⠀reply,⠀the⠀retreat⠀into⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀the⠀particular⠀comfort⠀a⠀person⠀accepts,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀later⠀topic⠀reopens⠀the⠀original⠀subject⠀can⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight⠀when⠀those⠀responses⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀admission⠀to⠀produce⠀relief,⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀bond.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀a⠀state⠀of⠀wanting⠀with⠀no⠀one⠀at⠀fault.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀attention⠀to⠀received⠀social⠀meaning⠀to⠀give⠀one⠀exchange⠀several⠀active⠀meanings:⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀a⠀claim,⠀a⠀courtesy⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀an⠀accusation,⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀may⠀also⠀announce⠀dependency.⠀Keep⠀the⠀private⠀interpretation⠀owned⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀sources⠀and⠀permitted⠀access.⠀Other⠀motives⠀can⠀be⠀known,⠀partly⠀known⠀or⠀uncertain⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀reduce⠀that⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ironic⠀distance⠀cancel⠀the⠀felt⠀urgency;⠀where⠀free⠀indirect⠀t