ibuted⠀messages⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀quickly⠀and⠀plainly,⠀another⠀may⠀revise,⠀delay,⠀or⠀send⠀a⠀formally⠀worded⠀reply.⠀A⠀formal⠀message⠀can⠀be⠀sincere;⠀a⠀plain⠀one⠀can⠀be⠀considerate.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀politeness⠀or⠀delay⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀intent.\n\nKeep⠀sent,⠀delivered,⠀read,⠀and⠀understood⠀content⠀separate.⠀Sending⠀a⠀message⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀give⠀its⠀recipient⠀the⠀content,⠀and⠀reading⠀or⠀other⠀actual⠀access⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀source.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀they⠀already⠀know⠀or⠀learn⠀through⠀another⠀route⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀an⠀unread⠀marker⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀ignorance.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀accepted⠀the⠀request⠀or⠀understood⠀the⠀offer.⠀Existing⠀knowledge⠀and⠀prior⠀relationship⠀history⠀remain⠀available⠀to⠀each⠀character⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀access.⠀Preserve⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀unsent⠀drafts:⠀the⠀sender's⠀reason⠀for⠀choosing⠀those⠀words,⠀the⠀recipient's⠀reaction⠀before⠀replying,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀around⠀the⠀phone.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀carry⠀actual⠀requests,⠀replies,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀updates.⠀No⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀apology,⠀or⠀changed⠀relation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀transcript⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unanswered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabakba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀owned⠀focal⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀alternate⠀them⠀mechanically.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀moment:⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀character's⠀look⠀at⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀a⠀clock.⠀The⠀cue⠀supports⠀a⠀contextual⠀reading⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀independently⠀certify⠀hidden⠀motive.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀support⠀a⠀reading⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀context,⠀alongside⠀relevan