ted⠀repair.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀appear⠀imperfectly⠀alongside⠀pain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀style's⠀turbulence⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀the⠀dialogue:⠀allow⠀syntax⠀to⠀quicken⠀under⠀strain,⠀a⠀sentence⠀to⠀break⠀off,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀to⠀become⠀too⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀suffering⠀into⠀a⠀fixed⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀hearts,⠀wounds,⠀or⠀trembling.⠀The⠀cost⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀diction⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀any⠀relationship⠀change⠀follow⠀actual⠀events;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀also⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀stable⠀arrangement,⠀an⠀unasked⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀response⠀still⠀pending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀participants⠀clearly⠀present⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀paragraph:⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀addressed,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀or⠀personal⠀matter⠀brings⠀them⠀together.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀in⠀every⠀exchange,⠀keeping⠀paragraphs⠀readable⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀position,⠀tone,⠀and⠀physical⠀movement⠀without⠀a⠀narrator's⠀overhead⠀explanation.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀ownership⠀settings⠀exactly.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀focal,⠀render⠀their⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀nonspoken⠀presentation:⠀the⠀recognition⠀that⠀an⠀offer⠀is⠀needed,⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀declining,⠀the⠀relief⠀of⠀being⠀met⠀without⠀conditions.⠀When⠀the⠀ownership⠀contract⠀excludes⠀a⠀participant's⠀mind,⠀keep⠀that⠀boundary⠀throughout;⠀show⠀their⠀position⠀through⠀speech,⠀action,⠀and⠀what⠀others⠀can⠀observe.\n\nLet⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀decision⠀develop⠀through⠀actual⠀conversation⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀pre-stated⠀problem.⠀Give⠀the⠀participants⠀room⠀for⠀explanation,⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀which⠀an⠀idea⠀changes,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀demonstration⠀of⠀care.⠀Use⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile⠀by⠀making⠀technique⠀and⠀capacity⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀choices:⠀someone⠀knows⠀how⠀to⠀fix⠀the⠀immediate⠀trouble,⠀remembers⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀dislikes,⠀or⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀use⠀an⠀advantage.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀sects,⠀martial⠀lineages,⠀or⠀a⠀historical⠀Chinese⠀setting.\n\nSmall⠀obligations⠀and⠀shared⠀history⠀can⠀surface⠀within⠀the⠀interval⠀as⠀references⠀the⠀characters⠀already⠀understand.⠀A⠀reputation⠀may⠀be⠀mentioned,⠀but⠀attribute⠀which⠀participant⠀knows⠀it⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀affects⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀conclude⠀with⠀an⠀agreement,⠀continuing⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀matter⠀still⠀underway.⠀Do⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀compulsory⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀new⠀loyalty⠀test.⠀Provide⠀a⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀naturally⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀exchange,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀available⠀without⠀forcing⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀situational⠀introduction⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀visit,⠀request,⠀shared⠀meal,⠀journey,⠀or⠀returned⠀favor⠀within⠀an⠀ongoing⠀cascade⠀of⠀human⠀occasions.⠀The⠀introduction⠀may⠀name⠀who⠀has⠀come,⠀what⠀prior⠀matter⠀brings⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀condition⠀now⠀exists.⠀It⠀should⠀not⠀recite⠀a⠀character's⠀whole⠀history⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀episode⠀before⠀it⠀begins.\n\nLet⠀each⠀encounter⠀proceed⠀through⠀ordinary⠀explanation,⠀conduct,⠀refusal,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀change⠀of⠀intention.⠀Use⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile⠀by⠀keeping⠀movement⠀generous:⠀participants⠀travel,⠀wait,⠀work,⠀share⠀a⠀table,⠀or⠀take⠀a⠀longer⠀way⠀home⠀while⠀the⠀matter⠀between⠀them⠀remains⠀live.⠀Let⠀technique⠀or⠀capacity⠀appear⠀as⠀particular⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀as⠀spectacle.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀know⠀how⠀to⠀mend⠀a⠀tool,⠀speak⠀to⠀an⠀official,⠀keep⠀a⠀promise⠀under⠀inconvenience,⠀or⠀choose⠀restraint⠀when⠀action⠀would⠀be⠀easier.\n\nWhen⠀reputation⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀undertaking⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀attribute⠀it⠀precisely:⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀report,⠀whether⠀they⠀believe⠀it,⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀public⠀name⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀private⠀motive.⠀Show⠀the⠀focal⠀participant's⠀actual⠀experience⠀beneath⠀the⠀episode's⠀social⠀surface,⠀including⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀participants⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀giving⠀each⠀authorized⠀experience⠀the⠀development⠀it⠀needs.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀episode⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀occasion⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause.⠀An⠀arrangement⠀may⠀be⠀confirmed,⠀a⠀burden⠀may⠀be⠀accepted,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open.⠀No⠀duel,⠀revelation,⠀new⠀ally,⠀coerced⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀transformation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀next⠀episode⠀will⠀connect⠀through⠀the⠀state⠀this⠀one⠀leaves.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nGive⠀the⠀exchange⠀hard⠀edges⠀by⠀locating⠀it⠀in⠀specific⠀objects⠀and⠀physical⠀tasks,⠀with⠀pressure⠀from⠀time⠀or⠀weather⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀supply⠀it.⠀Write⠀concise⠀transitions:⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀tea⠀is⠀poured,⠀the⠀rain⠀starts⠀against⠀the⠀window.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀that⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀copied⠀from⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀harsh⠀adjectives.⠀When⠀a⠀speaker⠀is⠀rough,⠀make⠀that⠀roughness⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀habits,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀history,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀general⠀tone.\n\nDo⠀not⠀compress⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀reflex.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀a⠀careful⠀technique,⠀takes⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀restrains⠀themselves,⠀expand⠀the⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀that⠀accompany⠀the⠀act.⠀A⠀long⠀inner⠀passage⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀single⠀gesture:⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀cost,⠀the⠀private⠀decision⠀to⠀trust.⠀Let⠀this⠀interiority⠀change⠀the⠀rhythm⠀against⠀the⠀clipped⠀external⠀movement⠀so⠀the⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀monotone⠀of⠀short⠀sentences.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile⠀by⠀making⠀competence⠀and⠀relationship⠀intelligible⠀through⠀actual⠀use,⠀explanation⠀or⠀established⠀experience,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀fresh⠀demonstration.⠀A⠀practical⠀offer⠀or⠀remembered⠀method⠀can⠀carry⠀shared⠀history,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀should⠀also⠀let⠀the⠀recipient⠀handle⠀the⠀matter⠀badly⠀or⠀well.⠀Material⠀wear⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀cracked⠀cup,⠀a⠀mended⠀strap,⠀a⠀blister,⠀or⠀a⠀patched⠀wall;⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀mark⠀passage⠀and⠀care⠀without⠀making⠀endurance⠀itself⠀the⠀point.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀character⠀drama⠀central:⠀the⠀physical⠀action⠀should⠀reveal⠀what⠀someone⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do,⠀decline,⠀accept,⠀or⠀hide⠀from⠀another⠀person.⠀Sincere⠀help,⠀competent⠀ease,⠀and⠀unchanged⠀affection⠀remain⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀injury,⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀grim⠀moral⠀verdict⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀exchange⠀significant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀actual⠀records:⠀a⠀letter⠀requesting⠀help,⠀a⠀note⠀confirming⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀task⠀was⠀performed,⠀a⠀reply⠀accepting⠀or⠀declining.⠀For⠀each⠀document,⠀establish⠀its⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Begin⠀where⠀the⠀correspondence⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀exist,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀scene⠀abstracted⠀from⠀the⠀record⠀itself.\n\nMake⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀report⠀perform⠀the⠀dramatic⠀work.⠀When⠀a⠀letter⠀offers⠀assistance,⠀make⠀its⠀actual⠀scope⠀and⠀conditions⠀legible⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀later⠀payoff:⠀what⠀exactly⠀is⠀offered,⠀under⠀what⠀conditions,⠀with⠀what⠀tone.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀accurately⠀describe⠀an⠀act⠀while⠀omitting⠀the⠀exhaustion,⠀relief,⠀second⠀thoughts,⠀or⠀private⠀meaning⠀that⠀accompanied⠀it.⠀Drafts,⠀delays,⠀and⠀delivery⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀documentary⠀form:⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀an⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀mind.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀outside⠀the⠀document⠀rather⠀than⠀collapsing⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀record.⠀Render⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀Hidden⠀or⠀Visible⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀artifact:⠀what⠀they⠀felt⠀before⠀writing,⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀with⠀the⠀finished⠀letter,⠀what⠀they⠀imagined⠀the⠀recipient⠀would⠀think.⠀Another⠀person's⠀receipt⠀and⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀document⠀are⠀distinct⠀facts.⠀A⠀misunderstanding⠀may⠀develop⠀because⠀the⠀record⠀says⠀less⠀than⠀its⠀author⠀knew.\n\nWhere⠀actual⠀travel,⠀shared⠀obligations⠀or⠀particular⠀competence⠀enter⠀the⠀correspondence,⠀make⠀their⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀specific:⠀a⠀long⠀journey⠀that⠀delays⠀a⠀reply,⠀an⠀item⠀sent⠀along⠀with⠀a⠀note,⠀a⠀name⠀the⠀recipient⠀recognizes.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀revelation,⠀confession,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀documented⠀resolution.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀matter⠀remains⠀undecided,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀artifact⠀still⠀unwritten.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSelect⠀a⠀particular⠀kindness⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference,⠀an⠀offer⠀to⠀share⠀a⠀task,⠀an⠀unhurried⠀explanation,⠀a⠀favorite⠀food⠀prepared⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀time,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀given⠀without⠀strings.⠀Spend⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀exact⠀manner⠀in⠀which⠀it⠀is⠀offered⠀and⠀received.⠀Use⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀kindness⠀follow⠀from⠀someone's⠀actual⠀competence⠀or⠀familiarity,⠀without⠀assigning⠀a⠀protector⠀role⠀merely⠀from⠀competence;⠀preserve⠀any⠀role⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀establishes.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀recipient's⠀actual⠀choices⠀and⠀private⠀experience,⠀whether⠀they⠀actively⠀contribute⠀or⠀simply⠀receive⠀the⠀care.⠀They⠀may⠀decline⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀care,⠀add⠀their⠀own⠀touch,⠀return⠀help⠀later,⠀or⠀admit⠀that⠀a⠀different⠀approach⠀would⠀suit⠀them⠀better.⠀This⠀preserves⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀inside⠀the⠀warmth.⠀Render⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀private⠀response,⠀which⠀may⠀include⠀enjoyment,⠀awkwardness,⠀gratitude⠀or⠀complicated⠀relief⠀without⠀requiring⠀any⠀of⠀those⠀feelings.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀comfort⠀contingent⠀on⠀a⠀successful⠀task⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀emotional⠀outcome.⠀The⠀moment⠀can⠀remain⠀small⠀and⠀easy:⠀a⠀meal⠀finished⠀in⠀company,⠀a⠀knot⠀untangled,⠀a⠀worry⠀heard⠀but⠀not⠀solved.⠀Shared⠀history⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀care⠀familiar,⠀but⠀a⠀newcomer⠀may⠀also⠀offer⠀sincere⠀help⠀without⠀first⠀passing⠀a⠀loyalty⠀test.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀with⠀room⠀for⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀continue⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀repair.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀with⠀deliberate⠀narrative⠀movement⠀that⠀locates⠀the⠀decision⠀in⠀a⠀wider⠀field:⠀who⠀is⠀visiting,⠀what⠀social⠀condition⠀makes⠀the⠀invitation⠀or⠀request⠀delicate,⠀and⠀what⠀history⠀surrounds⠀the⠀moment.⠀Use⠀enough⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀scene,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀view⠀distinct⠀from⠀public⠀rumor.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀street,⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀to⠀the⠀way⠀such⠀matters⠀are⠀usually⠀handled,⠀without⠀treating⠀convention⠀as⠀the⠀final⠀truth.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀actual⠀reasons⠀behind⠀a⠀participant's⠀choice⠀through⠀sustained⠀interior⠀paragraphs.⠀Let⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀person⠀consider⠀what⠀is⠀owed,⠀desired,⠀feared⠀or⠀hoped,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀build⠀through⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀and⠀ordered⠀reflection⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀rapid⠀cuts.⠀Distinguish⠀reputation⠀from⠀motive:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀as⠀dependable,⠀difficult,⠀generous,⠀or⠀proud,⠀while⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀reasoning⠀may⠀align⠀fully,⠀align⠀partly⠀or⠀differ⠀from⠀that⠀public⠀name.\n\nKeep⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀generosity⠀of⠀movement⠀and⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture.⠀Practical⠀matters⠀such⠀as⠀an⠀invitation,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀incident⠀across⠀a⠀longer⠀span.⠀When⠀characters⠀speak,⠀preserve⠀their⠀own⠀registers⠀instead⠀of⠀raising⠀every⠀speaker⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀formal⠀diction.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain⠀reply⠀stand⠀against⠀an⠀elaborate⠀surrounding⠀paragraph⠀when⠀that⠀contrast⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀present.\n\nClose⠀without⠀requiring⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀pronouncement,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀change⠀of⠀obligation.⠀The⠀contextual⠀paragraph⠀may⠀remain⠀reflective⠀or⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀observable⠀fact:⠀a⠀letter⠀accepted,⠀a⠀coat⠀returned,⠀a⠀gate⠀closed,⠀a⠀decision⠀not⠀yet⠀spoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀particular⠀telling:⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀wants⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀seek⠀help,⠀offer⠀an⠀explanation,⠀defend⠀a⠀choice,⠀or⠀keep⠀company,⠀but⠀its⠀purpose⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀include⠀and⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀listeners⠀receive⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller⠀select⠀from⠀shared⠀history⠀and⠀private⠀knowledge.⠀Show⠀which⠀details⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀act⠀are⠀offered,⠀which⠀are⠀summarized,⠀and⠀which⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀affection,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀Represent⠀an⠀omission⠀only⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀know,⠀whether⠀the⠀surrounding⠀scene,⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀question⠀makes⠀it⠀apparent;⠀an⠀omission⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀unnoticed,⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀exposure⠀or⠀interrogative⠀return.⠀Keep⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀learned⠀since;⠀a⠀later⠀understanding⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀original⠀experience.\n\nUse⠀the⠀listeners⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀story⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀relationship.⠀They⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀phrase,⠀or⠀respond⠀by⠀recalling⠀their⠀own⠀part⠀in⠀the⠀event.⠀Their⠀attention⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀agreement⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.⠀A⠀listener⠀can⠀remain⠀silent,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀accept⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀that⠀unresolved⠀reception.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀independently⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀performance.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀listener⠀privately⠀thinks⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀withholds,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀outside⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀performed⠀tale⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority;⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀feeling⠀during⠀the⠀telling⠀and⠀a⠀listener's⠀unspoken⠀response⠀remain⠀available⠀where⠀authorized.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀inform⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀concrete⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀repeated⠀name,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀alter⠀the⠀relationship,⠀leave⠀it⠀exactly⠀as⠀it⠀was,⠀or⠀reveal⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀intend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realist⠀mode.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀offers⠀help,⠀accepts⠀a⠀task,⠀refuses⠀a⠀request,⠀or⠀relies⠀on⠀someone⠀else,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀skill,⠀habit,⠀or⠀expectation⠀they⠀bring⠀to⠀that⠀choice.⠀Where⠀the⠀history⠀bears⠀on⠀this⠀experience,⠀relate⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀to⠀how⠀the⠀capacity⠀was⠀learned:⠀a⠀remembered⠀failure,⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀work,⠀a⠀family⠀practice,⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀familiarity⠀with⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Make⠀the⠀connection⠀intelligible,⠀giving⠀it⠀the⠀development⠀its⠀practical⠀or⠀personal⠀significance⠀needs⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀it⠀changes⠀or⠀explains⠀the⠀decision.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀privately⠀think⠀of⠀that⠀ability⠀and⠀from⠀how⠀others⠀estimate⠀them.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀perform⠀a⠀task⠀competently⠀while⠀doubting⠀it,⠀or⠀accept⠀a⠀reputation⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀believe⠀they⠀deserve.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀appraisal⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀access⠀contract,⠀and⠀keep⠀another⠀character's⠀estimate⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀performance.\n\nAllow⠀experience⠀to⠀confirm⠀an⠀existing⠀view⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀it⠀revises⠀one.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀method⠀still⠀works,⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀person⠀has⠀changed,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀remembered⠀lesson⠀no⠀longer⠀applies.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀growth,⠀a⠀mentor's⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀articulate⠀self-understanding.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀holding⠀the⠀same⠀view⠀but⠀acting⠀on⠀it⠀under⠀new⠀conditions.\n\nGive⠀the⠀exchange⠀enough⠀room⠀to⠀move⠀through⠀practical⠀activity,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship.⠀Follow⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀attachment⠀and⠀obligation,⠀allowing⠀alignment⠀or⠀tension⠀where⠀established:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀owes,⠀what⠀they⠀want,⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀training⠀or⠀history⠀tells⠀them⠀to⠀do.⠀Keep⠀the⠀developmental⠀material⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀experience,⠀including⠀meanings⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀new⠀choice,⠀rather⠀than⠀substituting⠀a⠀general⠀biography.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration's⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀in⠀the⠀social-realist⠀register:⠀direct,⠀observant,⠀and⠀attentive⠀to⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀formed⠀the⠀character,⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀case⠀study⠀or⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGround⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀institutions,⠀spaces,⠀and⠀reputations⠀that⠀make⠀an⠀encounter's⠀terms⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀enter,⠀use,⠀or⠀expect⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀family⠀position,⠀or⠀a⠀long-maintained⠀public⠀role.⠀Let⠀the⠀material⠀details⠀of⠀the⠀place⠀carry⠀that⠀history:⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀for⠀formal⠀visitors,⠀a⠀door⠀someone⠀no⠀longer⠀has⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀open,⠀a⠀title⠀that⠀still⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀heard.\n\nLet⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀role⠀align⠀or⠀diverge⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀involved.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀their⠀position⠀requires,⠀or⠀may⠀accept⠀an⠀obligation⠀while⠀privately⠀resenting⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀actual⠀reasons⠀through⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀authorized⠀interiority.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀inherited⠀authority⠀a⠀burden⠀or⠀every⠀offer⠀a⠀manipulation;⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀find⠀genuine⠀ease,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀relief⠀inside⠀an⠀old⠀structure.\n\nUse⠀social⠀presentation⠀as⠀a⠀changeable⠀surface⠀with⠀real⠀consequences.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀maintain⠀a⠀careful⠀manner⠀before⠀others⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀When⠀that⠀happens,⠀make⠀the⠀shift⠀visible⠀through⠀posture,⠀address,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀finally⠀says.⠀The⠀lapse⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀total⠀or⠀dramatic;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀honest⠀sentence⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀unguarded⠀attention.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀legible⠀to⠀everyone⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nLet⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀develop⠀through⠀particular⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀atmosphere⠀alone.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀help⠀someone⠀while⠀knowing⠀the⠀help⠀is⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀accept⠀comfort⠀while⠀aware⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀costs.⠀Show⠀the⠀practical⠀and⠀emotional⠀texture⠀of⠀that⠀exchange⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀small,⠀specific⠀way.\n\nGive⠀the⠀encounter⠀room⠀for⠀actual⠀explanation,⠀practical⠀business⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀Follow⠀how⠀attachment,⠀obligation⠀and⠀inherited⠀authority⠀relate⠀in⠀what⠀these⠀people⠀do,⠀including⠀compatible⠀commitments⠀and⠀arrangements⠀that⠀continue⠀without⠀a⠀collision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀narration.⠀Establish⠀the⠀occasion⠀on⠀which⠀a⠀character⠀gives⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀something⠀they⠀did,⠀witnessed,⠀or⠀decided,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀addressee's⠀interest⠀concrete.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀a⠀colleague,⠀a⠀friend,⠀or⠀someone⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀claim⠀on⠀the⠀story.⠀Show⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀hopes⠀or⠀fears⠀it⠀will⠀do.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speaker⠀select⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀did,⠀heard,⠀intended,⠀and⠀later⠀learned.⠀Show⠀the⠀emphasis⠀through⠀the⠀order⠀and⠀fullness⠀of⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀detail⠀expanded⠀because⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀listener,⠀a⠀moment⠀compressed⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀painful,⠀a⠀fact⠀offered⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀loyalty.⠀The⠀selection⠀need⠀not⠀involve⠀deceit.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀tell⠀the⠀truth⠀while⠀choosing⠀which⠀truths⠀to⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀testimony⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀from⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀speaker's⠀performed⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀sincere,⠀partial,⠀or⠀mistaken.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀privately⠀thinks⠀during⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀does⠀not⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀testimony⠀replace⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀listener⠀knowledge⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀simply⠀because⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀chosen⠀to⠀talk.\n\nLet⠀the⠀receiving⠀person⠀respond⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀situation.⠀They⠀may⠀agree,⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀remain⠀silent,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀account⠀unanswered.⠀No⠀confession,⠀credibility⠀verdict,⠀or⠀completed⠀reconciliation⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀listener⠀holding⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀that⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀yet⠀voice.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀attachment⠀and⠀obligations⠀shape⠀the⠀selection⠀where⠀relevant,⠀whether⠀those⠀commitments⠀align,⠀compete⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀account⠀straightforward.⠀A⠀promise,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀history⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀testimony,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀can⠀become⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀loyalty⠀or⠀distance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realist⠀mode.⠀Follow⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀noticing,⠀recollection,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀feeling⠀around⠀a⠀specific⠀exchange:⠀what⠀they⠀see⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀face⠀or⠀manner,⠀what⠀memory⠀the⠀moment⠀calls⠀up,⠀what⠀they⠀conclude,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀withhold.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀causal⠀order⠀of⠀that⠀experience.⠀A⠀later⠀realization⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀inserted⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nLet⠀a⠀reputation⠀or⠀prior⠀act⠀inform⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀reading⠀without⠀settling⠀it⠀automatically.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀expect⠀someone⠀to⠀refuse⠀because⠀they⠀refused⠀before,⠀or⠀may⠀hear⠀a⠀promise⠀as⠀sincere⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀long⠀familiarity.⠀Show⠀the⠀inference⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀own,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀confirmed,⠀revised,⠀or⠀left⠀uncertain⠀by⠀what⠀actually⠀follows.\n\nGive⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀calm⠀understanding,⠀and⠀extended⠀thought⠀room⠀to⠀develop.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀carefully⠀before⠀speaking,⠀or⠀may⠀feel⠀something⠀plainly⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀it⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀inward⠀passage.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀reserve,⠀misreading,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀response.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀person⠀understanding⠀another⠀correctly⠀and⠀still⠀choosing⠀distance,⠀or⠀understanding⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀situation⠀and⠀acting⠀on⠀that⠀part.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration's⠀access⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Private⠀experience⠀follows⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀for⠀each⠀person;⠀a⠀focal⠀passage⠀neither⠀grants⠀excluded⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀mind⠀nor⠀cancels⠀access⠀already⠀authorized.⠀A⠀visible⠀action⠀or⠀spoken⠀line⠀may⠀be⠀interpreted⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀person,⠀but⠀that⠀interpretation⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀actual⠀motive.\n\nWhere⠀attachment,⠀obligation⠀or⠀reputation⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀exchange,⠀follow⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀actually⠀understands⠀it,⠀allowing⠀aligned⠀commitments⠀and⠀no⠀new⠀interpretive⠀problem.⠀A⠀promise,⠀a⠀reliance,⠀or⠀a⠀restraint⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀specific⠀thing⠀they⠀notice,⠀remember,⠀and⠀interpret,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀that⠀understanding⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confrontation⠀or⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Arrange⠀the⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀around⠀a⠀single⠀relational⠀occasion—an⠀offer,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀return,⠀or⠀a⠀promise—so⠀that⠀different⠀participants⠀and⠀times⠀illuminate⠀it⠀from⠀different⠀positions.⠀The⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀include⠀every⠀viewpoint;⠀select⠀the⠀accounts⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀occasion's⠀personal⠀weight⠀legible.\n\nDistinguish⠀participation,⠀report,⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀access.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀was⠀present⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀happened⠀but⠀not⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀felt.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀heard⠀about⠀the⠀event⠀later⠀may⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀person;⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀that⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀merely⠀reports⠀the⠀event.\n\nLet⠀the⠀same⠀offer⠀or⠀refusal⠀matter⠀differently,⠀identically,⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all⠀to⠀another⠀participant.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀promise⠀as⠀a⠀turning⠀point⠀while⠀another⠀remembers⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀courtesy.⠀The⠀accounts⠀may⠀agree⠀without⠀becoming⠀redundant,⠀or⠀may⠀differ⠀without⠀producing⠀a⠀contradiction.⠀Keep⠀established⠀events⠀intact⠀and⠀attribute⠀knowledge⠀before⠀it⠀affects⠀a⠀response.\n\nUse⠀time⠀as⠀an⠀ordering⠀device⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀purpose.⠀A⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀explain⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀participant⠀could⠀not⠀see,⠀or⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀qualify⠀a⠀later⠀judgment.⠀Make⠀the⠀movement⠀between⠀times⠀legible⠀through⠀concrete⠀markers—a⠀place,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀stated⠀date—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀which⠀position⠀is⠀speaking.\n\nLet⠀actual⠀attachments⠀and⠀obligations⠀appear⠀across⠀the⠀accounts⠀where⠀relevant,⠀whether⠀they⠀align⠀or⠀compete.⠀Different⠀participants⠀may⠀weigh⠀the⠀same⠀obligation⠀differently,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀may⠀understand⠀it⠀differently⠀before⠀and⠀after.⠀No⠀final⠀consensus,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revelation⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀accounts⠀simply⠀held⠀together.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Identify⠀the⠀actual⠀participants,⠀the⠀place,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀sentences,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀preamble.⠀If⠀a⠀social⠀arrangement,⠀technical⠀term,⠀or⠀personal⠀history⠀matters,⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀context⠀through⠀explanation,⠀observation,⠀or⠀use⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀choice⠀intelligible.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀and⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀from⠀speech⠀to⠀action,⠀or⠀from⠀action⠀to⠀private⠀response,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀transition.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀dialogue,⠀movement,⠀and⠀interiority⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀notices.\n\nLet⠀a⠀useful⠀technique⠀or⠀remembered⠀promise⠀matter⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀role⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀how⠀to⠀repair⠀something,⠀keep⠀a⠀commitment,⠀or⠀read⠀a⠀situation⠀because⠀of⠀past⠀experience.⠀Show⠀the⠀capacity's⠀actual⠀relevance⠀through⠀use,⠀explanation,⠀observation⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀including⠀instruction⠀before⠀handling⠀where⠀needed.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀tutorial,⠀power⠀display⠀or⠀loyalty⠀proof⠀merely⠀to⠀exhibit⠀the⠀profile;⠀supported⠀explanation⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nPreserve⠀individual⠀humor⠀and⠀meaningful⠀extended⠀thought.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀dry⠀remark,⠀take⠀a⠀situation⠀seriously,⠀or⠀reason⠀at⠀length⠀before⠀acting.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀a⠀comic⠀tone,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀exchange,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀continuing⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀way.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀center,⠀including⠀attachment⠀and⠀obligation⠀where⠀relevant⠀without⠀requiring⠀them⠀to⠀conflict.⠀Let⠀the⠀accessible⠀orientation⠀clarify⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀owe,⠀want,⠀and⠀choose,⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀remains⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀access⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀word,⠀motion,⠀or⠀sensory⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀that⠀detail⠀develop⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀association⠀with⠀care,⠀restraint⠀or⠀obligation.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀and⠀direct⠀names⠀for⠀a⠀feeling⠀can⠀stand⠀beside⠀the⠀image⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀own⠀diction;⠀avoid⠀generic⠀labeling⠀that⠀substitutes⠀for⠀their⠀actual⠀experience.⠀Develop⠀the⠀association⠀through⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀and⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images,⠀so⠀the⠀syntax⠀itself⠀moves⠀between⠀the⠀literal⠀event⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀understands⠀it⠀to⠀mean.⠀Keep⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀clear:⠀who⠀spoke,⠀what⠀was⠀asked⠀or⠀refused,⠀and⠀any⠀practical⠀action⠀that⠀followed⠀or⠀response⠀that⠀remains⠀pending.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀an⠀accumulating⠀trace,⠀not⠀an⠀emblem.⠀A⠀gesture,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀fuller⠀meaning⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀situation⠀has⠀changed,⠀retain⠀a⠀familiar⠀meaning,⠀or⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀resolved⠀what⠀it⠀signifies.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀an⠀image⠀prove⠀another⠀person's⠀virtue⠀or⠀hidden⠀desire;⠀it⠀renders⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀association⠀without⠀by⠀itself⠀establishing⠀another⠀mind.\n\nFollow⠀how⠀actual⠀obligation⠀and⠀attachment⠀enter⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀particulars,⠀whether⠀they⠀align,⠀create⠀pressure⠀or⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀concerns.⠀A⠀formal⠀duty⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀motion⠀the⠀character⠀performs⠀while⠀thinking⠀of⠀someone⠀else;⠀a⠀private⠀attachment⠀may⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀explanation⠀the⠀character⠀gives⠀in⠀public.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person⠀around⠀authorized⠀focal⠀lyric⠀passages,⠀while⠀each⠀speaker⠀retains⠀their⠀own⠀register.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀act⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀moral⠀emblem⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀present⠀exchange⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀relationship,⠀capacity,⠀or⠀occasion⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀memory⠀actually⠀enters⠀the⠀character's⠀current⠀attention.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀recollection⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀familiar⠀method⠀of⠀doing⠀something,⠀a⠀promise⠀repeated⠀in⠀altered⠀circumstances,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀once⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀makes⠀available,⠀without⠀letting⠀the⠀past⠀overwrite⠀the⠀present⠀action.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀shared⠀content⠀and⠀private⠀remembering.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀same⠀history⠀without⠀sharing⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀associations,⠀and⠀they⠀may⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀request⠀or⠀obligation⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory's⠀actual⠀clarity⠀intact:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀then,⠀what⠀has⠀since⠀changed,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀continuous.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀ignorant⠀or⠀the⠀later⠀self⠀uniformly⠀wiser.\n\nAllow⠀pleasure,⠀care,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀to⠀remain⠀sincere.⠀A⠀present⠀commitment⠀can⠀continue⠀alongside⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀possible,⠀and⠀reflection⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀regret,⠀renewed⠀duty,⠀or⠀a⠀pronouncement⠀about⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀exchange⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀together,⠀giving⠀remembered⠀change⠀its⠀actual⠀personal⠀significance⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀deeper⠀relationship,⠀an⠀irreversible⠀loss⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀memoir⠀route.⠀Establish⠀an⠀authorized⠀participant's⠀later⠀recollecting⠀occasion,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀that⠀later⠀voice⠀replace⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀or⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀perspective.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀participant's⠀experience⠀while⠀acting⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀understanding⠀that⠀now⠀frames⠀it,⠀keeping⠀the⠀two⠀positions⠀distinct.⠀What⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀then,⠀what⠀they⠀forgot,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀afterward⠀remain⠀separate;⠀the⠀later⠀self⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀wiser⠀or⠀the⠀earlier⠀self⠀merely⠀mistaken.\n\nFollow⠀a⠀particular⠀offer,⠀reliance,⠀or⠀restraint⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀human⠀circumstances.⠀Render⠀the⠀attachments⠀and⠀obligations⠀actually⠀experienced⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀whether⠀aligned⠀or⠀competing,⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀details⠀of⠀travel,⠀work,⠀explanation,⠀or⠀relationship⠀given⠀room⠀to⠀unfold.⠀The⠀memoir⠀frame⠀may⠀comment⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀could⠀not⠀then⠀see,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀retroactively⠀insert⠀that⠀knowledge⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀composed⠀account.⠀The⠀memoir⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chooses⠀to⠀tell;⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀still⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀as⠀it⠀occurred.⠀Let⠀the⠀later⠀recollection⠀deepen⠀the⠀present⠀telling⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀remembered⠀choice⠀into⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀completed⠀self-justification,⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀judgment⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀people⠀involved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀words,⠀objects,⠀or⠀gestures⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀particular⠀offer,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀refusal⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀each⠀selected⠀detail⠀do⠀real⠀work:⠀a⠀tool⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀way,⠀a⠀step⠀taken⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀someone.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀connect⠀observable⠀events⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀their⠀actual⠀causal⠀order,⠀including⠀thought⠀before⠀action⠀or⠀feeling⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀or⠀change⠀conduct.\n\nA⠀known⠀method,⠀prior⠀promise,⠀or⠀shared⠀history⠀may⠀remain⠀implicit⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀supports⠀it,⠀but⠀explain⠀what⠀would⠀otherwise⠀be⠀lost.⠀Do⠀not⠀cut⠀meaningful⠀thought⠀or⠀repeated⠀feeling⠀merely⠀to⠀shorten⠀the⠀passage;⠀let⠀an⠀essential⠀inward⠀connection⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Cut⠀redundant⠀framing⠀and⠀repeated⠀explanation⠀instead,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀scene's⠀causal⠀movement⠀stays⠀clear.\n\nRestraint⠀in⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀silent⠀characters,⠀withheld⠀motives,⠀or⠀incomplete⠀outcomes.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀about⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀or⠀refuse,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀reach⠀a⠀definite⠀practical⠀result.⠀Let⠀selected⠀details⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀make⠀the⠀person's⠀attachments⠀and⠀obligations⠀intelligible⠀where⠀relevant,⠀without⠀requiring⠀conflict⠀or⠀an⠀outward⠀display.⠀The⠀minimal⠀surface⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀more⠀legible,⠀not⠀more⠀obscure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀continuous⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀explanation,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀their⠀causal⠀order.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀request,⠀shared⠀activity,⠀or⠀practical⠀task⠀reveal⠀why⠀someone⠀helps,⠀refuses,⠀or⠀remains⠀undecided,⠀without⠀staging⠀a⠀public⠀test⠀of⠀loyalty⠀or⠀competence.⠀Give⠀the⠀encounter⠀room⠀to⠀unfold⠀through⠀travel,⠀work,⠀conversation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀decisive⠀exchanges.\n\nKeep⠀other⠀participants'⠀concerns⠀and⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀They⠀may⠀be⠀occupied⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀obligations,⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀matter⠀without⠀sharing⠀the⠀private⠀attachment⠀that⠀shapes⠀the⠀narration.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access:⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀render⠀one⠀character's⠀thought,⠀but⠀not⠀another's⠀unspoken⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.\n\nDeveloped⠀recollection,⠀companionship,⠀or⠀ongoing⠀work⠀may⠀sustain⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀conflict,⠀completed⠀decision,⠀or⠀new⠀demonstration⠀of⠀loyalty.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀relationship⠀can⠀continue⠀in⠀its⠀existing⠀terms,⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀act⠀from⠀aligned⠀motives⠀without⠀a⠀revelation.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀business⠀or⠀exchange⠀pauses,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀available⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀familiar⠀methods,⠀private⠀language,⠀and⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀asking⠀or⠀helping⠀between⠀these⠀particular⠀people.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀tropes.⠀Let⠀the⠀bond⠀appear⠀through⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀chosen⠀words⠀and⠀existing⠀memories,⠀without⠀inventing⠀shared⠀history⠀or⠀exclusive⠀language⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀does⠀not⠀contain⠀them.⠀Give⠀the⠀scene⠀enough⠀room⠀for⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀be⠀experienced,⠀not⠀merely⠀announced.\n\nDistinguish⠀capacity,⠀desire,⠀and⠀permission.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀help⠀without⠀being⠀obliged⠀to,⠀may⠀want⠀something⠀without⠀being⠀ready⠀to⠀ask,⠀or⠀may⠀accept⠀assistance⠀without⠀becoming⠀dependent.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀permanent⠀competence⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀gratitude⠀or⠀need⠀to⠀the⠀other.⠀Follow⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀of⠀public⠀obligation⠀and⠀private⠀attachment,⠀allowing⠀alignment⠀or⠀pressure⠀and⠀distinguishing⠀where⠀relevant:⠀what⠀someone⠀will⠀do⠀openly,⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀only⠀admit⠀in⠀private,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀say⠀at⠀all.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀to⠀confirm⠀the⠀existing⠀arrangement⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀to⠀change⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀remained⠀continuous,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀take⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀alters⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Preserve⠀aligned⠀motives⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀requiring⠀jealousy,⠀a⠀rescue⠀debt,⠀confession,⠀or⠀increasing⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀bond⠀intact⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀open,⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀an⠀emotional⠀payoff.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀a⠀particular⠀relational⠀act⠀a⠀deliberate⠀retold⠀opening:⠀what⠀was⠀offered,⠀kept,⠀refused⠀or⠀withheld,⠀and⠀who⠀was⠀involved.⠀Expand⠀into⠀the⠀actual⠀circumstances⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀act⠀matter⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀Where⠀a⠀learned⠀method,⠀prior⠀promise⠀or⠀choice⠀of⠀restraint⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀occasion,⠀make⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀relationship⠀intelligible⠀without⠀turning⠀help⠀into⠀a⠀victory⠀or⠀refusal⠀into⠀proof⠀of⠀character.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀acceptance⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀a⠀costly⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀deed,⠀its⠀reputation⠀and⠀its⠀participants'⠀experience⠀distinguishable.⠀Attribute⠀any⠀account⠀that⠀calls⠀someone⠀loyal,⠀capable⠀or⠀ungrateful,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀history⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀description⠀covers⠀or⠀leaves⠀open.⠀The⠀actor⠀may⠀have⠀acted⠀from⠀one⠀concern⠀or⠀several⠀compatible⠀or⠀competing⠀concerns;⠀use⠀the⠀reasons⠀available⠀to⠀them⠀then⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀the⠀teller's⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀public⠀telling⠀need⠀not⠀contain⠀everything⠀the⠀person⠀felt,⠀while⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀remains⠀present⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀form.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀retelling⠀recognizable.⠀A⠀designation⠀returns⠀through⠀established⠀use,⠀not⠀an⠀invented⠀lineage⠀or⠀title,⠀and⠀its⠀meaning⠀may⠀remain⠀unchanged.⠀Where⠀actual⠀dialogue⠀enters,⠀speakers⠀can⠀accept⠀a⠀description,⠀correct⠀it⠀or⠀attend⠀to⠀another⠀matter⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀challenge⠀to⠀the⠀account.⠀Keep⠀narrator,⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀intact,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀a⠀continuing⠀act⠀or⠀telling⠀without⠀a⠀heroic⠀verdict,⠀changed⠀allegiance⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀essayistic⠀narrative⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀authorized⠀narrator⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀limited⠀proposition⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀commitment⠀requires—help,⠀restraint,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀ask—stated⠀in⠀that⠀narrator's⠀own⠀terms,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀rule.⠀The⠀proposition⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀accumulated⠀understanding,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀explicit⠀or⠀implicit⠀in⠀the⠀prose.\n\nSet⠀the⠀proposition⠀beside⠀an⠀established⠀or⠀clearly⠀hypothetical⠀interpersonal⠀case⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀characters.⠀Give⠀the⠀case⠀enough⠀scenic⠀room:⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀involved,⠀the⠀relevant⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀commitment⠀or⠀request,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀does⠀or⠀leaves⠀pending⠀within⠀that⠀actual⠀or⠀hypothetical⠀case,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀new⠀test.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀case⠀to⠀an⠀abstract⠀example;⠀give⠀actual⠀activity,⠀explanation⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀the⠀room⠀they⠀need⠀without⠀adding⠀travel⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀stages.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀proposition⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀confirmation,⠀qualification,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀case's⠀particulars,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀proposition⠀while⠀another⠀character's⠀behavior⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀interpretation.⠀Distinguish⠀reputation⠀from⠀actual⠀support:⠀what⠀a⠀community⠀says⠀about⠀someone's⠀reliability⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀offered⠀or⠀withheld⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀case.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀person's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀another's⠀motive⠀from⠀the⠀motive⠀itself,⠀which⠀may⠀remain⠀inaccessible.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀construction⠀to⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀across⠀replies.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀proposition⠀open,⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later⠀with⠀new⠀information,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀qualification⠀unresolved⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀counterexample,⠀revised⠀belief,⠀or⠀new⠀action.⠀The⠀essayistic⠀frame⠀organizes⠀attention⠀and⠀judgment;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀verdict.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀authorized⠀presentation⠀rather⠀than⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀public⠀argument.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings,⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀cues⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀actual⠀spatial⠀and⠀audible⠀conditions⠀of⠀each⠀exchange.⠀When⠀a⠀method⠀is⠀demonstrated⠀or⠀help⠀is⠀offered,⠀make⠀the⠀visible⠀action⠀legible:⠀who⠀reaches⠀for⠀what,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀turns⠀away,⠀what⠀sound⠀or⠀movement⠀accompanies⠀the⠀offer.⠀The⠀action⠀block⠀should⠀record⠀observable⠀conduct⠀without⠀certifying⠀virtue⠀or⠀securing⠀acceptance.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀perform⠀the⠀correct⠀action⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀refused,⠀or⠀perform⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀reveal.\n\nPreserve⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀independently⠀of⠀voice-over⠀or⠀performed⠀explanation.⠀Write⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀feeling⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀voice-over⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀speech⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Develop⠀interpersonal⠀significance⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀relation⠀between⠀visible⠀conduct⠀and⠀private⠀understanding,⠀whether⠀they⠀align⠀or⠀differ,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀gap.⠀A⠀restrained⠀gesture⠀may⠀look⠀like⠀indifference;⠀the⠀private⠀prose⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀effort⠀behind⠀it⠀without⠀making⠀that⠀effort⠀public.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀visible⠀reactions⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀supplied⠀sequence.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀person's⠀action⠀to⠀another's⠀separate⠀response,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀imply⠀knowledge⠀the⠀second⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀have.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀look⠀can⠀orient⠀attention⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀Give⠀the⠀scene⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀requires;⠀no⠀decisive⠀gesture,⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀relationship⠀change⠀is⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀cut.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unanswered⠀offer,⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀alone⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀say.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀through⠀positions,⠀entrances,⠀object⠀use,⠀and⠀ongoing⠀conduct.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀participation⠀and⠀attention:⠀one⠀person⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀tool,⠀another⠀remains⠀at⠀the⠀threshold,⠀a⠀third⠀continues⠀working⠀while⠀listening.⠀Explanation⠀may⠀precede⠀handling⠀where⠀the⠀people⠀need⠀it—a⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀a⠀method⠀requires⠀before⠀demonstrating⠀it—but⠀the⠀visible⠀offer⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀or⠀unnoticed.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀private⠀reason⠀into⠀a⠀speech;⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀take⠀an⠀offered⠀object⠀can⠀express⠀a⠀boundary⠀without⠀the⠀character⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀presentation.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀feeling⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀observe⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀privately⠀understands.\n\nOffstage⠀access⠀and⠀world⠀activity⠀follow⠀established⠀conditions.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀exits⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀lose⠀knowledge⠀they⠀already⠀had,⠀and⠀their⠀return⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀restore⠀it.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀continue⠀practical⠀work⠀offstage⠀or⠀onstage⠀without⠀the⠀scene⠀stopping⠀to⠀explain⠀their⠀absence.⠀Let⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀sustain⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀ordinary⠀business,⠀attention,⠀and⠀restraint;⠀no⠀decisive⠀confrontation,⠀confession,⠀or⠀changed⠀bond⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nFollow⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀associations⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀form⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Braid⠀bodily⠀activity,⠀heard⠀words,⠀private⠀phrasing,⠀and⠀remembered⠀attachments⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀mind⠀carries⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀spoken⠀sentence⠀may⠀trigger⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise;⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀may⠀call⠀up⠀a⠀private⠀name⠀for⠀someone;⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀reasoning⠀and⠀redirect⠀attention.⠀Let⠀the⠀associations⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀mind,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀associative⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀present⠀events,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀imagined⠀consequences⠀distinguishable⠀even⠀as⠀they⠀flow⠀together.⠀Use⠀the⠀prose⠀to⠀mark⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀only⠀anticipated⠀or⠀feared.⠀A⠀promise⠀may⠀recur⠀alongside⠀an⠀aligned⠀wish⠀or⠀an⠀unrelated⠀feeling⠀without⠀being⠀forced⠀into⠀competition⠀or⠀resolved⠀into⠀a⠀plan.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀settle⠀on⠀a⠀concern,⠀drift⠀from⠀it,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later;⠀no⠀compulsory⠀decision⠀or⠀completed⠀realization⠀is⠀required.\n\nDevelop⠀meaningful⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀word-count⠀time⠀cost.⠀A⠀long⠀passage⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀single⠀association⠀through⠀several⠀turns;⠀a⠀short⠀one⠀may⠀register⠀only⠀a⠀bodily⠀interruption.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access:⠀do⠀not⠀enter⠀unpermitted⠀minds,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀associative⠀flow⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀have.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀remain⠀inward,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀exchange,⠀or⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀mind⠀still⠀turning⠀over⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀said.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀actual⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀and⠀supported⠀interface⠀events⠀to⠀carry⠀a⠀request,⠀offer,⠀or⠀continuing⠀conversation.⠀Each⠀message⠀should⠀reflect⠀its⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀type⠀in⠀fragments,⠀use⠀full⠀sentences,⠀delay⠀a⠀reply,⠀edit⠀a⠀wording,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread.⠀Record⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀comprehension⠀or⠀consent;⠀a⠀delivered⠀message⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀an⠀accepted⠀request.\n\nDistinguish⠀drafts,⠀sent⠀wording,⠀reading,⠀and⠀response.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀compose⠀a⠀message,⠀delete⠀it,⠀and⠀send⠀something⠀shorter;⠀the⠀deleted⠀text⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀record⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀form⠀supports⠀it,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀the⠀artifact,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀including⠀reconsideration⠀that⠀needs⠀no⠀new⠀incoming⠀message.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reread⠀an⠀old⠀message⠀and⠀change⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀to⠀them⠀without⠀sending⠀anything.\n\nLet⠀a⠀shared⠀history⠀make⠀a⠀terse⠀message⠀intelligible⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀memory⠀shared.⠀One⠀person's⠀brief⠀reply⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀weight⠀the⠀other⠀does⠀not⠀recognize,⠀or⠀both⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀reference⠀differently.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unanswered⠀message,⠀a⠀pending⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀alone⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀send.⠀No⠀new⠀message,⠀admission,⠀or⠀changed⠀bond⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀actual⠀shared⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀useful⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues.⠀A⠀cue⠀should⠀establish⠀the⠀moment—where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀expression⠀or⠀posture⠀is⠀visible—without⠀functioning⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀any⠀authorized⠀private⠀feeling⠀or⠀intention⠀is⠀rendered⠀through⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀read⠀off⠀the⠀portrait;⠀excluded⠀motives⠀remain⠀outside⠀the⠀narration's⠀access.\n\nLet⠀focal⠀narration⠀develop⠀what⠀an⠀offer,⠀familiar⠀method,⠀or⠀withheld⠀action⠀means⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀person.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀relief,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀continues,⠀whether⠀their⠀response⠀changes⠀or⠀remains⠀private.⠀Keep⠀visible⠀behavior⠀distinct⠀from⠀confirmed⠀motives:⠀another⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀same⠀expression⠀and⠀interpret⠀it⠀differently,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀cast⠀access⠀to⠀what⠀it⠀reveals.⠀Preserve⠀all⠀active⠀narrator⠀access⠀and⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀its⠀authorized⠀presentation.\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀enough⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀requires.⠀A⠀background⠀detail⠀may⠀anchor⠀a⠀return⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀circumstances,⠀but⠀any⠀changed⠀significance⠀follows⠀actual⠀experience,⠀including⠀reconsideration⠀of⠀existing⠀information,⠀while⠀the⠀detail⠀may⠀also⠀retain⠀its⠀meaning.⠀No⠀portrait⠀reaction,⠀menu,⠀romantic⠀route,⠀or⠀completed⠀choice⠀is⠀introduced⠀by⠀the⠀form.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀private⠀realization,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀continuing⠀their⠀work⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀decision⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabalbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nCarry⠀forward⠀actual⠀offers,⠀decisions,⠀and⠀pending⠀matters⠀across⠀replies,⠀distinguishing⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀inferred.⠀When⠀a⠀past⠀exchange⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀briefly—the⠀wording⠀of⠀the⠀offer,⠀the⠀condition⠀under⠀which⠀it⠀was⠀made,⠀the⠀response⠀that⠀was⠀given—rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀scene.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀an⠀inference⠀the⠀other⠀never⠀stated,⠀and⠀that⠀gap⠀remains⠀available⠀for⠀later⠀development⠀without⠀being⠀resolved⠀immediately.\n\nLet⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise⠀or⠀familiar⠀way⠀of⠀helping⠀recur⠀through⠀ongoing⠀concern⠀or⠀current⠀events.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀may⠀carry⠀unchanged⠀meaning,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀acquire⠀new⠀significance⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀since.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀installment⠀to⠀renegotiate⠀the⠀relationship,⠀while⠀allowing⠀renegotiation⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀events⠀support⠀it:⠀a⠀commitment⠀already⠀made⠀can⠀simply⠀continue⠀to⠀shape⠀practical⠀choices,⠀attention,⠀or⠀avoidance.⠀Keep⠀other⠀lives⠀and⠀knowledge⠀active⠀across⠀the⠀interval;⠀characters⠀not⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀working,⠀waiting,⠀or⠀changing⠀their⠀understanding.\n\nCompany,⠀separate⠀work,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀reflection⠀can⠀sustain⠀continuation.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀person⠀alone⠀with⠀a⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀request⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀has⠀answered.⠀No⠀new⠀test,⠀admission,⠀or⠀changed⠀bond⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀serial⠀form⠀gives⠀selected⠀facts⠀and⠀feelings⠀room⠀to⠀accumulate;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀demand⠀that⠀each⠀reply⠀produce⠀a⠀relationship⠀turning⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWhere⠀actual⠀hurt,⠀need,⠀or⠀difficult⠀exposure⠀accompanies⠀a⠀request,⠀withheld⠀answer,⠀offer,⠀or⠀return,⠀give⠀that⠀experience⠀its⠀particular⠀weight.⠀An⠀act⠀need⠀not⠀incur⠀a⠀new⠀emotional⠀cost⠀simply⠀because⠀it⠀occurs⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀cost⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀personal:⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀phrase⠀now⠀uncertain,⠀a⠀favor⠀accepted⠀as⠀more⠀than⠀convenience,⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀restore⠀the⠀old⠀ease.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀ordinary⠀habit⠀a⠀secret⠀betrayal⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀worse⠀loss.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀prior⠀meaning⠀of⠀any⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase.⠀If⠀a⠀shared⠀joke⠀once⠀meant⠀nothing⠀more⠀than⠀an⠀easy⠀moment,⠀it⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀only⠀that.⠀If⠀a⠀weekly⠀task⠀once⠀settled⠀arguments,⠀it⠀can⠀fail⠀to⠀do⠀so⠀now⠀without⠀being⠀retroactively⠀revealed⠀as⠀the⠀hidden⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀difficulty.⠀What⠀has⠀changed⠀is⠀the⠀present⠀exchange,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀the⠀history.\n\nGive⠀private⠀feeling⠀as⠀much⠀room⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀needs,⠀even⠀when⠀nothing⠀visible⠀results.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀think⠀for⠀several⠀paragraphs⠀before⠀speaking;⠀another⠀may⠀answer⠀quickly⠀and⠀only⠀later⠀understand⠀what⠀the⠀answer⠀meant.⠀Keep⠀what⠀others⠀can⠀see⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀knows.⠀A⠀refusal⠀can⠀be⠀made⠀with⠀a⠀steady⠀voice⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀racing;⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀may⠀sound⠀calm⠀while⠀the⠀speaker⠀expects⠀to⠀be⠀blamed.\n\nAllow⠀alignment⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀difference.⠀Two⠀people⠀can⠀want⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀to⠀say⠀it⠀cleanly.⠀Shared⠀life⠀may⠀include⠀genuine⠀help,⠀continued⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀refusal⠀without⠀turning⠀past⠀kindness⠀into⠀a⠀farewell⠀or⠀proof⠀of⠀betrayal.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀difficulty⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀relationship⠀unchanged,⠀or⠀a⠀partial⠀comfort⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀the⠀pain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nOpen⠀the⠀response⠀by⠀grounding⠀the⠀supplied⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀just⠀happened,⠀and⠀what⠀ordinary⠀task⠀or⠀exchange⠀is⠀underway.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀callback⠀for⠀a⠀first⠀encounter;⠀if⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀or⠀phrase⠀is⠀established,⠀it⠀may⠀provide⠀continuity,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀forced.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀in⠀clear,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unambiguous⠀attribution.⠀When⠀an⠀NPC⠀speaks,⠀let⠀their⠀words⠀come⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀ongoing⠀life⠀and⠀concerns,⠀not⠀only⠀from⠀the⠀player's⠀action.⠀The⠀NPC⠀may⠀be⠀distracted,⠀patient,⠀affectionate,⠀tired,⠀or⠀preoccupied⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀reaction⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership⠀contract,⠀render⠀each⠀authorized⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀attention⠀in⠀nonspoken⠀prose,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀others⠀can⠀hear⠀or⠀know⠀through⠀their⠀actual⠀channels.⠀The⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀match⠀the⠀spoken⠀line⠀or⠀differ;⠀if⠀it⠀differs,⠀the⠀difference⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀to⠀that⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀filter⠀of⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀concealment.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀says⠀\"I⠀don't⠀mind\"⠀may⠀genuinely⠀not⠀mind,⠀may⠀be⠀too⠀tired⠀to⠀explain,⠀or⠀may⠀notice⠀something⠀else⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Which⠀one⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀moment.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary:⠀within⠀a⠀private⠀thought,⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀conversation,⠀after⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀is⠀partially⠀done,⠀or⠀when⠀someone⠀leaves.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀changed⠀bond,⠀a⠀resolved⠀conflict,⠀or⠀a⠀prepared⠀next⠀move.⠀The⠀continuation⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀state,⠀leaving⠀room⠀for⠀other⠀participants⠀to⠀respond.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀story.⠀Present⠀each⠀episode⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion:⠀a⠀visit,⠀meal,⠀shared⠀task,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀departure.⠀Link⠀episodes⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀did,⠀using⠀permitted⠀narration⠀or⠀reflection⠀where⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀connection⠀clear⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀new⠀meaning.⠀When⠀a⠀habit⠀or⠀preference⠀is⠀established,⠀it⠀may⠀appear⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀recur⠀every⠀time;⠀its⠀absence⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀informative⠀as⠀its⠀presence,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀symbolic⠀return.\n\nLet⠀an⠀episode⠀stand⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀lived⠀moment.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀moral,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀crisis,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀change.⠀A⠀disagreement⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀when⠀the⠀episode⠀ends;⠀a⠀meal⠀may⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀deeper⠀meaning;⠀a⠀departure⠀may⠀be⠀simply⠀practical.⠀What⠀accumulates⠀is⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀lessons.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀original⠀words⠀and⠀motives⠀of⠀each⠀episode⠀intact.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀how⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀is⠀understood,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀present⠀reflection⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀action,⠀not⠀by⠀rewriting⠀what⠀they⠀said⠀or⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀A⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀casually⠀cannot⠀become⠀a⠀deliberate⠀clue⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀intended⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀setting:⠀the⠀way⠀people⠀greet⠀each⠀other,⠀arrange⠀a⠀meal,⠀complain⠀about⠀work,⠀or⠀say⠀goodbye.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀community⠀supplied,⠀without⠀imposing⠀a⠀classical⠀register⠀or⠀a⠀folk-tale⠀frame.⠀The⠀telling⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀connected⠀series⠀of⠀lived⠀scenes,⠀not⠀a⠀polished⠀chronicle.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀concrete⠀physical⠀details⠀to⠀locate⠀the⠀emotional⠀situation:⠀the⠀worn⠀handle⠀of⠀a⠀favorite⠀cup,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀as⠀someone⠀takes⠀it,⠀the⠀noise⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀too⠀hard,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀back⠀from⠀a⠀long⠀shift.⠀Let⠀actual⠀physical⠀details⠀give⠀the⠀exchange⠀its⠀felt⠀conditions⠀alongside⠀directly⠀named⠀feeling⠀or⠀abstract⠀reflection.⠀A⠀request⠀or⠀refusal⠀may⠀involve⠀effort⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀it,⠀but⠀a⠀task⠀or⠀burden⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀concrete.\n\nCompress⠀transitions⠀and⠀repeated⠀framing.⠀Use⠀compact⠀transitions⠀where⠀they⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence,⠀varying⠀sentence⠀shape⠀with⠀the⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀assigning⠀a⠀single⠀sharp⠀clause⠀to⠀every⠀beat.⠀Avoid⠀redundant⠀labels⠀or⠀repeated⠀setup⠀while⠀preserving⠀meaningful⠀recurrence⠀within⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀feeling⠀and⠀attention.⠀Give⠀reasoning,⠀feeling,⠀memory,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀abstract⠀reflection⠀their⠀needed⠀extent,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀thought⠀to⠀serve⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀remain⠀attached⠀to⠀an⠀object,⠀task,⠀or⠀bodily⠀sensation.\n\nA⠀recurring⠀detail⠀may⠀stay⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀chipped⠀mug⠀need⠀not⠀symbolize⠀a⠀broken⠀relationship;⠀a⠀tiring⠀routine⠀need⠀not⠀prove⠀devotion.⠀Care⠀can⠀be⠀easy⠀and⠀reliable:⠀a⠀clean⠀cup⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀counter,⠀a⠀blanket⠀folded⠀on⠀the⠀arm⠀of⠀a⠀chair.⠀If⠀a⠀detail⠀takes⠀on⠀new⠀significance,⠀the⠀change⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀an⠀actual⠀event,⠀not⠀by⠀stylistic⠀pressure.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀character's⠀full⠀private⠀experience,⠀including⠀memory⠀and⠀uncertainty.⠀Compression⠀removes⠀repeated⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀inner⠀life.⠀Favor⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀outward⠀narration⠀while⠀preserving⠀flexible⠀inward⠀extent⠀and⠀each⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀register;⠀rhythm⠀follows⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀person⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀universal⠀short-sentence⠀rule.⠀No⠀injury,⠀sacrifice,⠀or⠀bitter⠀ending⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀letter,⠀note,⠀log⠀entry,⠀list,⠀or⠀other⠀artifact⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀available⠀formats;⠀use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀current⠀situation⠀calls⠀for.\n\nLet⠀an⠀actual⠀phrase,⠀preference,⠀or⠀everyday⠀act⠀give⠀the⠀document⠀particularity.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀mention⠀a⠀familiar⠀joke⠀without⠀explanation,⠀or⠀describe⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀in⠀terms⠀only⠀the⠀recipient⠀would⠀understand.⠀A⠀log⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀no⠀one⠀else.⠀Such⠀details⠀can⠀give⠀the⠀document⠀its⠀authentic⠀texture⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀later⠀payoff.\n\nKeep⠀composition,⠀delivery,⠀reading,⠀and⠀response⠀distinct.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀composed⠀letter⠀from⠀its⠀actual⠀delivery⠀and⠀reception.⠀Its⠀text⠀may⠀arrive⠀intact⠀and⠀be⠀accurately⠀understood;⠀delay,⠀missing⠀pages,⠀or⠀rereading⠀matter⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀actually⠀occur.⠀Show⠀only⠀what⠀each⠀document⠀itself⠀can⠀show;⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nLater⠀commentary⠀may⠀confirm⠀or⠀qualify⠀an⠀earlier⠀entry.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀reveals⠀that⠀an⠀earlier⠀phrase⠀meant⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀seemed,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀later⠀writer's⠀words⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀by⠀altering⠀the⠀earlier⠀document's⠀original⠀intention.⠀A⠀casual⠀request⠀cannot⠀become⠀a⠀deliberate⠀message⠀unless⠀the⠀writer⠀actually⠀intended⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀artifact.⠀The⠀document's⠀writer⠀may⠀have⠀private⠀thoughts,⠀hesitations,⠀or⠀memories⠀that⠀never⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀text;⠀render⠀those⠀in⠀the⠀surrounding⠀narration⠀or⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀interiority,⠀not⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀document⠀were⠀a⠀confession.⠀Comfort,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀continued⠀connection⠀may⠀remain⠀unexpressed⠀in⠀writing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀narrative⠀time⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀or⠀comfortable⠀presence.⠀Instead⠀of⠀summarizing⠀that⠀\"they⠀were⠀kind\"⠀or⠀\"the⠀room⠀was⠀cozy,\"⠀show⠀the⠀concrete⠀details:⠀someone⠀pours⠀tea⠀into⠀a⠀favorite⠀cup,⠀chooses⠀a⠀chair⠀near⠀the⠀window,⠀remembers⠀which⠀blanket⠀is⠀preferred,⠀or⠀leaves⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food⠀because⠀they⠀know⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀likes⠀it.⠀Give⠀comfort⠀a⠀particular⠀expression,⠀including⠀direct⠀affection⠀or⠀pleasure⠀spoken⠀plainly.⠀A⠀declaration⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀the⠀shared⠀act;⠀productive⠀work⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀physical⠀gesture⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀make⠀warmth⠀real.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀person's⠀pleasure,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀choice.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀kindness,⠀decline⠀it,⠀or⠀set⠀it⠀aside⠀for⠀later.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀enjoy⠀quiet⠀company⠀without⠀speaking;⠀another⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀talk⠀about⠀something⠀unrelated.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀gratitude⠀scene,⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀breakthrough.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀ease⠀of⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀in⠀its⠀outcome.\n\nIf⠀a⠀routine⠀or⠀phrase⠀is⠀established,⠀let⠀it⠀continue⠀without⠀requiring⠀new⠀meaning.⠀A⠀weekly⠀meal,⠀a⠀usual⠀greeting,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀joke⠀can⠀simply⠀happen⠀again.⠀New⠀acquaintances⠀may⠀offer⠀something⠀particular—an⠀umbrella,⠀a⠀snack,⠀a⠀seat—without⠀instantly⠀forming⠀a⠀lifelong⠀habit.⠀The⠀value⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀itself,⠀not⠀in⠀what⠀it⠀proves⠀about⠀the⠀future.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀response⠀to⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward⠀without⠀canceling⠀the⠀comfort.⠀A⠀joke⠀may⠀fall⠀flat⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀affectionate;⠀a⠀thanks⠀may⠀be⠀mumbled⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀sincere;⠀a⠀companion⠀may⠀do⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing⠀in⠀the⠀right⠀spirit.⠀Keep⠀each⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀show.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀comfort⠀simply⠀underway,⠀no⠀lesson,⠀no⠀foreshadowing,⠀no⠀repaired⠀trust.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀exchange,⠀phrase,⠀preference,⠀or⠀practical⠀contribution,⠀then⠀deliberately⠀widen⠀the⠀paragraph⠀to⠀include⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀relational⠀history⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀know.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀character's⠀habit⠀of⠀setting⠀the⠀table⠀a⠀certain⠀way⠀can⠀lead⠀into⠀a⠀paragraph⠀about⠀whose⠀house⠀this⠀was,⠀what⠀meals⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀like,⠀or⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀neighborhood.⠀Keep⠀the⠀widening⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀detail;⠀do⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀generic⠀historical⠀summary.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀widening,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀or⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀detail.⠀The⠀character⠀who⠀set⠀the⠀table⠀may⠀now⠀do⠀so⠀without⠀thinking,⠀or⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀arrangement⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀detail's⠀current⠀meaning,⠀which⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀its⠀past⠀meaning⠀or⠀remain⠀the⠀same.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀lesson;⠀continuity⠀is⠀a⠀valid⠀outcome.\n\nPreserve⠀private⠀reasons⠀separately⠀from⠀public⠀accounts⠀and⠀others'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀thinks⠀and⠀feels,⠀but⠀other⠀characters⠀may⠀not.⠀A⠀public⠀explanation⠀for⠀an⠀absence⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀private⠀memory.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀by⠀whom,⠀not⠀to⠀explain⠀everything⠀to⠀the⠀reader.\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀between⠀paragraphs.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀physical⠀gesture⠀to⠀a⠀social⠀observation,⠀then⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀memory,⠀then⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀movement⠀should⠀feel⠀composed,⠀not⠀automatic.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀omniscience:⠀if⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀is⠀limited,⠀stay⠀within⠀that⠀access.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀formal⠀movement⠀complete⠀but⠀the⠀relationship⠀unresolved,⠀the⠀private⠀feeling⠀recognized⠀without⠀being⠀spoken,⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀simply⠀understood⠀in⠀a⠀larger⠀context.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nSituate⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀present⠀occasion,⠀which⠀embedded⠀episodes⠀may⠀share:⠀who⠀is⠀telling⠀it,⠀in⠀whose⠀company,⠀for⠀what⠀immediate⠀purpose⠀such⠀as⠀entertaining,⠀comforting,⠀explaining,⠀or⠀simply⠀passing⠀a⠀shared⠀interval.⠀Before⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀establish⠀why⠀this⠀material⠀is⠀being⠀offered⠀now,⠀using⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene—a⠀task,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀request—so⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀encounter⠀is⠀intelligible,⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀welcomed,⠀unsolicited,⠀or⠀left⠀unanswered.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀account⠀begins,⠀select⠀the⠀particular⠀phrases,⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀or⠀acts⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀account⠀and⠀its⠀listeners,⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀number⠀or⠀an⠀invented⠀shared⠀history.⠀Present⠀them⠀as⠀the⠀teller⠀remembers⠀them⠀at⠀that⠀moment,⠀without⠀retroactively⠀loading⠀them⠀with⠀hidden⠀meaning.⠀A⠀familiar⠀detail⠀may⠀recur⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀simply⠀familiar;⠀its⠀later⠀significance,⠀if⠀any,⠀must⠀arise⠀at⠀its⠀own⠀time,⠀not⠀as⠀planted⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀secret⠀understanding.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀listeners⠀to⠀respond⠀during⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀telling⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀established⠀relationships.⠀They⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀recognition,⠀attend⠀quietly,⠀challenge⠀a⠀detail,⠀recall⠀a⠀related⠀moment⠀of⠀their⠀own,⠀or⠀enjoy⠀the⠀story⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀learn⠀anything⠀new.⠀Keep⠀observable⠀responses⠀distinct⠀from⠀interpretation⠀and⠀any⠀authorized⠀private⠀reception;⠀a⠀reaction⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀certify⠀a⠀state⠀of⠀mind⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀correct⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration's⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀told⠀account.⠀Render⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀person's⠀actual⠀unspoken⠀thoughts,⠀sensations,⠀or⠀questions⠀at⠀their⠀actual⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀encounter,⠀including⠀during⠀the⠀telling.⠀They⠀need⠀not⠀wait⠀until⠀the⠀story⠀ends⠀or⠀replace⠀the⠀experience⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀have⠀told⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀felt;⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀hear⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀intend.⠀Preserve⠀this⠀difference⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confessional⠀turn⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀reconciliation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀govern⠀the⠀pause,⠀including⠀within⠀the⠀account,⠀inward⠀listening,⠀continued⠀company,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.⠀No⠀completed⠀reception⠀or⠀extra⠀outward⠀act⠀is⠀required.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀to⠀justify⠀itself⠀through⠀a⠀solution,⠀moral,⠀or⠀emotional⠀payoff;⠀its⠀placement⠀in⠀ordinary⠀lived⠀company⠀is⠀sufficient.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀route⠀of⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism:⠀follow⠀a⠀particular⠀expectation⠀of⠀belonging⠀or⠀responsibility⠀as⠀it⠀meets⠀an⠀actual⠀act⠀of⠀shared⠀life,⠀over⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀occasion⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀permits.⠀Begin⠀by⠀identifying⠀the⠀person's⠀concrete⠀expectation—such⠀as⠀being⠀included⠀in⠀a⠀regular⠀task,⠀being⠀answered⠀in⠀a⠀certain⠀way,⠀or⠀being⠀trusted⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀responsibility—and⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀real⠀action,⠀agreement,⠀or⠀continuance⠀of⠀routine⠀confirms,⠀questions,⠀or⠀leaves⠀it⠀unchanged⠀in⠀this⠀specific⠀instance.\n\nDo⠀not⠀treat⠀the⠀encounter⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀person⠀acted⠀on⠀the⠀understanding⠀they⠀had⠀at⠀that⠀time;⠀later⠀information⠀must⠀not⠀rewrite⠀their⠀earlier⠀motive⠀as⠀secret⠀preparation⠀for⠀growth.⠀If⠀a⠀subsequent⠀occasion⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀habit,⠀anchor⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀actually⠀occurred⠀between,⠀not⠀in⠀hindsight⠀inserted⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene.\n\nWhere⠀an⠀established⠀detail⠀of⠀shared⠀continuity⠀bears⠀on⠀later⠀interactions,⠀preserve⠀its⠀actual⠀recurrence⠀and⠀use.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀object⠀need⠀not⠀recur⠀before⠀that⠀history⠀exists⠀or⠀appear⠀in⠀every⠀encounter.⠀It⠀may⠀simply⠀remain⠀familiar,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀acquire⠀fresh⠀weight⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀intervening⠀event.⠀The⠀point⠀is⠀the⠀lived⠀connection,⠀not⠀a⠀revelation⠀the⠀detail⠀was⠀hiding.⠀Let⠀each⠀present⠀exchange⠀occur⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀terms⠀intact:⠀people⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀help⠀without⠀either⠀side⠀being⠀cast⠀as⠀the⠀unwitting⠀instrument⠀of⠀another's⠀development.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀complete⠀private⠀experience.⠀In⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation,⠀render⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀actual⠀thoughts,⠀uncertainties,⠀or⠀reactions⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀time,⠀without⠀erasing⠀them⠀to⠀protect⠀a⠀later⠀plot⠀point.⠀Known⠀motives⠀remain⠀available⠀at⠀their⠀original⠀time,⠀including⠀sincere⠀care⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀intended⠀as⠀a⠀teaching⠀device.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀helped⠀or⠀cared⠀for⠀simply⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀wanted⠀to⠀do⠀so,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀may⠀continue⠀without⠀gratitude,⠀self-reproach,⠀or⠀a⠀transformed⠀self-image.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀continuation⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀at⠀a⠀completed⠀reflection.⠀The⠀expectation⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀forming;⠀the⠀routine⠀may⠀continue⠀incompletely.⠀The⠀aim⠀is⠀to⠀render⠀a⠀social⠀reality⠀in⠀which⠀ordinary⠀participation,⠀dependency,⠀and⠀belonging⠀carry⠀weight⠀without⠀being⠀forced⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWhen⠀inherited⠀authority⠀or⠀dependency⠀actually⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀relationship,⠀make⠀its⠀terms⠀concrete⠀through⠀an⠀operable⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀place⠀only⠀one⠀may⠀enter,⠀a⠀resource⠀only⠀one⠀may⠀give,⠀a⠀permission⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀asked,⠀or⠀a⠀condition⠀attached⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀kindness.⠀Show⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀as⠀they⠀affect⠀this⠀particular⠀exchange,⠀without⠀inventing⠀supernatural⠀mechanics⠀or⠀a⠀secret⠀institutional⠀rule.\n\nWhere⠀a⠀familiar⠀shared⠀act,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀is⠀established,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀its⠀actual⠀meaning⠀to⠀each⠀participant.⠀A⠀present⠀invitation⠀or⠀ordinary⠀contribution⠀can⠀also⠀stand⠀without⠀invented⠀repetition.⠀One⠀may⠀find⠀comfort⠀in⠀continuity;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀tolerate⠀it,⠀resent⠀it,⠀or⠀depend⠀on⠀it⠀without⠀either⠀response⠀certifying⠀hidden⠀devotion,⠀corruption,⠀or⠀entitlement.⠀Private⠀desire⠀and⠀known⠀terms⠀remain⠀distinct:⠀a⠀sincere⠀offer⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀awareness⠀of⠀the⠀power⠀that⠀makes⠀it⠀possible,⠀and⠀refusal⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀punished⠀as⠀ingratitude.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀the⠀material⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀with⠀concrete⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀detail:⠀worn⠀furniture,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀recurring⠀errand,⠀a⠀particular⠀view⠀from⠀a⠀window.⠀These⠀elements⠀should⠀situate⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀in⠀present⠀daily⠀life,⠀not⠀merely⠀create⠀an⠀oppressive⠀mood.⠀Let⠀small⠀repeated⠀objects⠀or⠀phrases⠀acquire⠀weight⠀through⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀negotiated⠀lives,⠀not⠀as⠀symbols⠀of⠀a⠀concealed⠀truth.\n\nLet⠀any⠀change⠀of⠀outward⠀presentation⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀person⠀and⠀circumstances,⠀including⠀chosen⠀openness⠀or⠀an⠀involuntary⠀response.⠀Trusted⠀company⠀may⠀matter,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀prerequisite⠀and⠀no⠀mask⠀must⠀fall.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀openness⠀need⠀not⠀reveal⠀a⠀hidden⠀agenda;⠀it⠀may⠀simply⠀show⠀that⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀tired,⠀fond,⠀frightened,⠀or⠀relieved.⠀Preserve⠀both⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀presentations⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀relationship,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀theatrical⠀unmasking.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀within⠀consideration,⠀pending⠀response,⠀an⠀unchanged⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀an⠀actual⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀current⠀act⠀or⠀private⠀concern⠀is⠀situated⠀inside⠀the⠀supplied⠀structure⠀of⠀power⠀and⠀dependency,⠀and⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀response—help,⠀trust,⠀caution,⠀refusal—remains⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀lived⠀history.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nEmploy⠀lyric⠀and⠀philosophical⠀inwardness⠀for⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind.⠀Choose⠀a⠀current⠀question⠀about⠀care,⠀belonging,⠀or⠀obligation—often⠀arising⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀shared⠀act,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀such⠀an⠀occasion.⠀State⠀the⠀question⠀plainly⠀at⠀first,⠀then⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀examined⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀movement⠀between⠀concrete⠀perception⠀and⠀abstract⠀consideration,⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀terms⠀with⠀familiar⠀meaning,⠀supported⠀new⠀qualification,⠀or⠀continuing⠀uncertainty.\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀returns⠀to⠀sustain⠀the⠀consideration⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reversal;⠀an⠀actual⠀event⠀may⠀still⠀prompt⠀a⠀gradual⠀or⠀sudden⠀change.⠀A⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀from⠀ordinary⠀life⠀may⠀be⠀revisited⠀with⠀slight⠀variation,⠀allowing⠀feeling⠀to⠀exceed⠀the⠀argument⠀while⠀the⠀line⠀of⠀thought⠀remains⠀legible.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀become⠀meditative,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀stay⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀occasioned⠀the⠀question.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀consideration⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀wiser⠀conclusion,⠀a⠀refutation⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀belief,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀statement.⠀The⠀person⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀uncertain,⠀may⠀feel⠀both⠀affection⠀and⠀resentment,⠀or⠀may⠀simply⠀acknowledge⠀that⠀the⠀question⠀remains⠀open.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀their⠀understanding,⠀place⠀that⠀changed⠀understanding⠀at⠀its⠀actual⠀time,⠀whether⠀gradual⠀or⠀sudden,⠀without⠀rewriting⠀the⠀earlier⠀events,⠀motives,⠀or⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀other⠀character,⠀and⠀from⠀any⠀narrator⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀that⠀character.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀includes⠀another⠀person's⠀speech⠀or⠀account,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀externally⠀observed⠀or⠀attributed,⠀not⠀merged⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀mind.⠀The⠀philosophical⠀voice⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀person;⠀others⠀remain⠀people⠀acting⠀and⠀speaking⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀terms.\n\nClose⠀the⠀passage⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀consideration,⠀not⠀a⠀forced⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀ongoing⠀question⠀may⠀be⠀laid⠀aside⠀for⠀practical⠀activity,⠀interrupted⠀by⠀someone's⠀arrival,⠀or⠀simply⠀held⠀in⠀incomplete⠀form.⠀The⠀value⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀honest⠀inward⠀attention⠀to⠀what⠀particular⠀shared⠀life⠀means⠀for⠀this⠀person⠀now,⠀not⠀in⠀arriving⠀at⠀a⠀final⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nPresent⠀the⠀narrative⠀as⠀a⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀kept⠀by⠀a⠀situated⠀recorder⠀who⠀is⠀compatible⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person.⠀Establish⠀enough⠀context⠀for⠀the⠀recording⠀situation—the⠀actual⠀time⠀and⠀place,⠀and⠀any⠀state⠀of⠀mind⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀know—without⠀letting⠀the⠀recording⠀frame⠀replace⠀the⠀substance⠀of⠀the⠀account.\n\nSelect⠀an⠀actual⠀shared⠀phrase,⠀preference,⠀pleasure,⠀task,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀concern⠀that⠀mattered⠀to⠀the⠀recorder⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Write⠀the⠀entry⠀around⠀that⠀particular⠀detail,⠀letting⠀it⠀anchor⠀the⠀day's⠀significance.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀routine⠀may⠀appear⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀be⠀interpreted⠀as⠀foreshadowing;⠀its⠀recurrence⠀earns⠀meaning⠀through⠀the⠀recorder's⠀continued⠀attention,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀secret⠀agenda⠀planted⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀occurrence.\n\nIf⠀the⠀miscellany⠀includes⠀later⠀annotations⠀or⠀reflections,⠀separate⠀them⠀explicitly⠀from⠀the⠀original⠀entry⠀by⠀their⠀time⠀and⠀occasion.⠀A⠀later⠀note⠀may⠀comment⠀on⠀an⠀earlier⠀event,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀words⠀of⠀the⠀original⠀to⠀match⠀its⠀current⠀understanding.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀original⠀knowledge⠀at⠀the⠀original⠀time:⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀silently⠀inserted⠀into⠀the⠀past⠀entry.\n\nKeep⠀actual⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀written⠀selection.⠀The⠀diary⠀contains⠀what⠀the⠀recorder⠀chose⠀to⠀record;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀capture⠀their⠀complete⠀mind⠀at⠀that⠀moment.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀allows⠀interiority,⠀render⠀the⠀unspoken⠀or⠀unwritten⠀thoughts⠀of⠀the⠀authorized⠀person⠀separately⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀says,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀record's⠀omissions⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀person's⠀experience.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀each⠀entry⠀to⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀insight,⠀moral,⠀or⠀seasonal⠀image.⠀The⠀style⠀may⠀include⠀such⠀reflections⠀if⠀the⠀recorder⠀would⠀naturally⠀make⠀them,⠀but⠀ordinary⠀entries⠀can⠀simply⠀note⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀pleased⠀or⠀troubled⠀the⠀writer,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀boundary,⠀including⠀within⠀continuing⠀writing⠀or⠀reflection,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀interval,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀entry;⠀neither⠀a⠀whole⠀artifact⠀nor⠀completed⠀understanding⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀and⠀nonlinear⠀organization⠀for⠀the⠀permitted⠀points⠀of⠀view.⠀Choose⠀a⠀concrete⠀shared⠀element—a⠀particular⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀act—that⠀appears⠀in⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀account⠀and⠀serves⠀as⠀a⠀common⠀reference⠀without⠀collapsing⠀the⠀different⠀perspectives⠀into⠀one⠀voice.\n\nPresent⠀each⠀account⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀time⠀and⠀source.⠀If⠀the⠀narrative⠀includes⠀attributed⠀speech,⠀documents,⠀or⠀recollections,⠀identify⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀or⠀writing⠀and⠀when⠀they⠀hold⠀this⠀understanding.⠀Move⠀among⠀these⠀sources⠀out⠀of⠀chronological⠀order⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀clarifies⠀each⠀person's⠀separate⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀shared⠀matter;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀confuse⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀with⠀earlier⠀knowledge.\n\nAllow⠀different⠀people⠀to⠀have⠀understood⠀the⠀same⠀care,⠀agreement,⠀or⠀routine⠀accurately,⠀differently,⠀or⠀only⠀partly.⠀Their⠀interpretations⠀may⠀remain⠀stable,⠀even⠀in⠀direct⠀contrast,⠀without⠀one⠀needing⠀to⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀false⠀or⠀incomplete⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀revelation.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀qualifies⠀an⠀earlier⠀interpretation,⠀state⠀that⠀later⠀event⠀explicitly;⠀preserve⠀the⠀original⠀acts⠀and⠀motives⠀rather⠀than⠀rewriting⠀them⠀to⠀manufacture⠀a⠀hidden⠀agenda.⠀A⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀reveal⠀an⠀earlier⠀intention⠀when⠀that⠀is⠀actually⠀supported,⠀without⠀making⠀such⠀a⠀discovery⠀compulsory.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀attributed⠀records.⠀If⠀a⠀section⠀uses⠀a⠀letter,⠀diary,⠀or⠀testimony,⠀that⠀document⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀their⠀complete⠀contemporaneous⠀mind.⠀In⠀the⠀selected⠀Visible⠀or⠀Hidden⠀nonspoken⠀presentation⠀for⠀an⠀authorized⠀person,⠀render⠀their⠀unspoken⠀thoughts⠀separately⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀said⠀or⠀wrote,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀multiplicity⠀of⠀positions⠀remains⠀genuine.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀accounts⠀to⠀converge⠀on⠀a⠀single⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀picture.⠀The⠀passage⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀one⠀account⠀still⠀open,⠀another⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀a⠀pattern⠀without⠀any⠀character⠀announcing⠀it.⠀The⠀method's⠀value⠀is⠀the⠀layering⠀of⠀distinct⠀human⠀relations⠀to⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀life,⠀not⠀the⠀solution⠀of⠀whose⠀version⠀is⠀authoritative.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaman::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀scene⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀actual⠀people,⠀occasion,⠀and⠀relevant⠀physical⠀context⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀direct⠀sentences.⠀State⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀or⠀about⠀to⠀do,⠀keeping⠀spatial⠀changes⠀simple⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀action⠀is⠀occurring.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphing⠀around⠀relevant⠀changes⠀of⠀speaker,⠀action,⠀or⠀attention⠀without⠀requiring⠀every⠀event⠀or⠀inward⠀movement⠀to⠀fit⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph.\n\nMove⠀readably⠀among⠀speech,⠀activity,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀response⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀cycle.⠀When⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀person,⠀give⠀the⠀actual⠀thought,⠀perception,⠀or⠀feeling⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀without⠀a⠀brevity⠀limit⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀return⠀to⠀outward⠀movement⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀The⠀inner⠀response⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀compressed⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀exclamation⠀or⠀dramatic⠀pause;⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀to⠀feel⠀like⠀this⠀person's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀beat.\n\nUse⠀an⠀established⠀preference,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀routine⠀to⠀connect⠀moments⠀across⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀with⠀previous⠀scenes.⠀A⠀familiar⠀detail⠀may⠀simply⠀recur⠀without⠀a⠀flashback;⠀if⠀background⠀is⠀needed,⠀give⠀it⠀the⠀needed⠀extent⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀knowledge,⠀without⠀creating⠀extra⠀access⠀or⠀requiring⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀stop⠀and⠀think⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀retrospective⠀scene⠀merely⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀more⠀weight.\n\nKeep⠀developed⠀feeling⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀distinct⠀from⠀immediate⠀utility.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀to⠀think⠀about⠀something⠀after⠀acting,⠀or⠀may⠀act⠀while⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀forcing⠀a⠀clear⠀resolution.⠀Humor⠀and⠀seriousness⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀appropriate⠀characters:⠀some⠀may⠀joke,⠀others⠀remain⠀reserved,⠀and⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀tones⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀wit⠀or⠀banter⠀from⠀every⠀speaker.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀passage⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀within⠀the⠀interaction—either⠀in⠀the⠀midst⠀of⠀conversation,⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀or⠀at⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀activity.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀question⠀open,⠀a⠀plan⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀state⠀still⠀developing.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀need⠀to⠀finish⠀with⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger;⠀the⠀continuation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀existing⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀ongoing⠀concerns.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nDevelop⠀a⠀scene-grounded⠀sound,⠀texture,⠀or⠀comparison⠀through⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀attention.⠀Let⠀syntax,⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images,⠀and⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention⠀extend⠀an⠀experience⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀familiar⠀image⠀may⠀retain⠀ordinary⠀warmth⠀or⠀acquire⠀supported⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀while⠀plain⠀clauses⠀keep⠀the⠀people,⠀practical⠀activity,⠀and⠀event⠀times⠀recoverable.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀earlier⠀significance⠀of⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀instead⠀of⠀treating⠀every⠀recurrence⠀as⠀foreshadowing⠀or⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀hidden⠀meaning.\n\nLet⠀the⠀image⠀develop⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀later⠀become.⠀A⠀comparison⠀can⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀or⠀the⠀shared⠀occasion;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀loss,⠀longing,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀symbolic⠀arc.⠀Actual⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀directly⠀named⠀or⠀developed⠀associatively.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀notice⠀the⠀particular⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀task,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀an⠀object⠀handed⠀over,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀settles⠀differently⠀without⠀being⠀required⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀that⠀awareness.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀lyric⠀movement⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀dialogue⠀register⠀of⠀every⠀speaker,⠀and⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀separate⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀access.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀can⠀provide⠀contrast⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀terms⠀legible.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀within⠀ordinary⠀company⠀or⠀thought,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀continuing⠀under⠀its⠀present⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀reaching⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀current⠀act⠀or⠀detail⠀recall⠀a⠀real⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀distinguishing⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀and⠀available⠀then⠀from⠀now.⠀The⠀recollection⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀particulars:⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀place⠀can⠀bring⠀an⠀earlier⠀shared⠀moment⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀occasion's⠀original⠀knowledge⠀intact.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀understood⠀a⠀kindness⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀may⠀only⠀now⠀recognize⠀what⠀it⠀meant;⠀do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀the⠀past⠀as⠀hidden⠀foreshadowing.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀and⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀present⠀pleasure⠀feel⠀diminished.⠀A⠀routine⠀may⠀continue,⠀feel⠀different,⠀or⠀remain⠀ordinary.⠀Present⠀comfort,⠀humor,⠀and⠀continuing⠀care⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀Give⠀private⠀longing,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀relief⠀room⠀without⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀alter⠀behavior⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀confession.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association,⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀diction.\n\nDo⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀absence,⠀damage,⠀failed⠀reunion,⠀hidden⠀farewell,⠀or⠀death⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀tone.⠀An⠀actual⠀departure⠀or⠀continued⠀company⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀scene,⠀but⠀no⠀miraculous⠀return⠀or⠀concluding⠀statement⠀of⠀impermanence⠀is⠀supplied.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀the⠀familiar⠀life⠀still⠀being⠀lived⠀beside⠀what⠀has⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling.⠀Situate⠀an⠀actual⠀teller⠀and⠀audience,⠀preserving⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀knows⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀occasion.⠀The⠀telling⠀has⠀a⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀relationship:⠀it⠀may⠀entertain,⠀persuade,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀simply⠀pass⠀time⠀in⠀company.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀follow⠀that⠀purpose⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀knowledge⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀event.\n\nA⠀familiar⠀story⠀can⠀be⠀told⠀without⠀revealing⠀a⠀secret.⠀A⠀participant⠀may⠀already⠀have⠀understood⠀its⠀kindness⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀may⠀hear⠀a⠀detail⠀differently⠀now.⠀Keep⠀original⠀event⠀knowledge⠀distinct⠀from⠀hindsight;⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀interpretation⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀or⠀imperfect⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀source,⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀receive⠀it⠀with⠀warmth,⠀disagreement,⠀distraction,⠀or⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀response.\n\nActual⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀beyond⠀performed⠀speech.⠀A⠀teller's⠀public⠀account⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀complete⠀live⠀mind,⠀and⠀a⠀listener's⠀reaction⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀teller.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀terms.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀unfinished,⠀entertaining,⠀or⠀unproductive;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀repair⠀a⠀bond,⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀deliver⠀a⠀lesson⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀actual⠀phrase,⠀preference,⠀act,⠀or⠀spatial⠀relation⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀account.⠀Use⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Omit⠀reiterated⠀interpretation⠀rather⠀than⠀causes⠀or⠀feeling;⠀what⠀is⠀omitted⠀should⠀remain⠀inferable⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀particular.⠀A⠀familiar⠀detail⠀can⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀or⠀gain⠀supported⠀significance⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀but⠀neither⠀silence⠀nor⠀a⠀brief⠀answer⠀proves⠀concealed⠀affection⠀or⠀hurt.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chosen⠀particular⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀terms.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀may⠀connect⠀moments⠀when⠀it⠀belongs,⠀while⠀new⠀acquaintances⠀need⠀no⠀fabricated⠀history.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀individual⠀speech.⠀A⠀character's⠀inward⠀attention⠀may⠀develop⠀at⠀the⠀extent⠀its⠀feeling,⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀needs,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀it⠀produces⠀a⠀decision;⠀brevity⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota⠀that⠀removes⠀private⠀experience⠀or⠀turns⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀performed⠀fragment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀terms⠀legible⠀without⠀restating⠀them.⠀The⠀boundary⠀needs⠀no⠀new⠀understanding,⠀completed⠀task,⠀or⠀prepared⠀next⠀move.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀continuing⠀under⠀its⠀present⠀conditions,⠀the⠀exact⠀detail⠀left⠀to⠀do⠀its⠀work⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀with⠀natural⠀movement⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀present⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀tonal⠀turn.\n\nLet⠀a⠀supported⠀habit,⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀preference⠀connect⠀moments⠀when⠀it⠀belongs.⠀A⠀repeated⠀particular⠀can⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀or⠀acquire⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀every⠀recurrence⠀as⠀a⠀hidden⠀test,⠀farewell,⠀or⠀planted⠀reveal.⠀Preserve⠀original⠀motives⠀and⠀knowledge:⠀a⠀later⠀understanding⠀does⠀not⠀retroactively⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀knew⠀or⠀intended⠀earlier.⠀New⠀acquaintances⠀need⠀no⠀fabricated⠀shared⠀history.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀interpretation⠀distinct⠀from⠀established⠀fact⠀and⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀know.⠀Individual⠀humor,⠀tenderness,⠀distance,⠀or⠀disagreement⠀follow⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀uniform⠀emotional⠀register.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀fall⠀within⠀ordinary⠀company⠀or⠀thought,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀continuing⠀under⠀its⠀present⠀conditions⠀instead⠀of⠀reaching⠀a⠀lesson,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀reframing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀and⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀its⠀particular⠀promise.⠀Select⠀a⠀current⠀request,⠀offer,⠀preference,⠀or⠀established⠀callback⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀bond⠀rather⠀than⠀inserting⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀A⠀habit⠀may⠀continue⠀unchanged⠀or⠀gain⠀new⠀weight⠀after⠀a⠀supported⠀event,⠀without⠀inventing⠀an⠀earlier⠀hidden⠀test,⠀farewell,⠀or⠀motive⠀simply⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀reveal.⠀A⠀genuine⠀earlier⠀intention⠀may⠀become⠀known⠀when⠀supported;⠀keep⠀the⠀past⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀original⠀meaning⠀intact.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀person's⠀private⠀meaning,⠀boundaries,⠀and⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀Agreement⠀and⠀direct⠀affection⠀may⠀be⠀genuine;⠀warmth⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀a⠀wound,⠀and⠀a⠀pause⠀need⠀not⠀signal⠀a⠀confession.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀history.⠀New⠀relationships⠀need⠀no⠀invented⠀routine⠀or⠀shared⠀past;⠀the⠀premise's⠀particular⠀promise⠀can⠀develop⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀offered,⠀asked,⠀withheld,⠀or⠀accepted⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀remain⠀contingent.⠀No⠀confession,⠀sacrifice,⠀synchronized⠀recognition,⠀repair,⠀or⠀perpetual⠀continuation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀bond⠀familiar,⠀newly⠀forming,⠀changing,⠀or⠀concluding,⠀with⠀each⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀knows.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀recurring⠀phrasing,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Use⠀named⠀acts⠀and⠀coherent⠀recurrence⠀to⠀recount⠀an⠀actual⠀contribution,⠀refusal,⠀stay,⠀departure,⠀or⠀care⠀at⠀its⠀proper⠀scale.⠀An⠀errand⠀remains⠀an⠀errand;⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀remains⠀a⠀shared⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀promote⠀ordinary⠀life⠀into⠀heroic⠀doom⠀or⠀mock⠀combat.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀designation⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Let⠀a⠀phrase⠀recur⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀account,⠀with⠀familiar⠀or⠀changed⠀application.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀relationship⠀can⠀hold⠀ordinary⠀history⠀or⠀later⠀gain⠀supported⠀weight⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀on⠀every⠀return.⠀Keep⠀later⠀reputation⠀separate⠀from⠀original⠀motives⠀and⠀private⠀feeling.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern;⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀or⠀imperfect⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀source.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀participant's⠀actual⠀experience⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀helping⠀was⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀automatic.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.⠀No⠀heroic⠀promotion,⠀hidden⠀sacrifice,⠀community⠀verdict,⠀or⠀completed⠀deed⠀before⠀the⠀boundary⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism:⠀keep⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement⠀of⠀care,⠀work,⠀space,⠀preferences,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀company⠀visible⠀while⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it⠀continue⠀their⠀separate⠀concerns.⠀A⠀shared⠀routine⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀chore⠀around⠀every⠀exchange.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀already⠀doing⠀what,⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀for⠀later,⠀so⠀the⠀relationship⠀exists⠀inside⠀practical⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀extracted⠀from⠀it.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀act,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀belong⠀to⠀its⠀participants⠀in⠀different⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀way.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀as⠀ordinary⠀maintenance⠀while⠀another⠀experiences⠀it⠀as⠀attention,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀change.⠀Preserve⠀that⠀private⠀feeling⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀no⠀immediate⠀usefulness⠀to⠀anyone⠀else.⠀A⠀later⠀event⠀may⠀alter⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀rewrite⠀all⠀prior⠀care⠀as⠀foreshadowing⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀earlier⠀feeling⠀secretly⠀false.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀scene⠀turns⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀place⠀and⠀occasion,⠀including⠀rest⠀or⠀company⠀without⠀a⠀task.⠀Let⠀speech⠀follow⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀relationship;⠀they⠀may⠀directly⠀name⠀a⠀feeling⠀or⠀attend⠀to⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀emotional⠀summary.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀answer⠀plainly,⠀keep⠀working,⠀or⠀pause⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀reason.⠀Private⠀interpretation⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀expose.\n\nDo⠀not⠀supply⠀a⠀household⠀structure,⠀national⠀reserve,⠀improved⠀group⠀mood,⠀or⠀emotional⠀repayment.⠀The⠀realism⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀concurrent⠀ordinary⠀life⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀attachments⠀it⠀sustains,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀belonging⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀moment⠀of⠀shared⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀through⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀audible:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀handle⠀or⠀set⠀down.⠀Let⠀an⠀actual⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀object,⠀or⠀routine⠀recur⠀through⠀a⠀justified⠀cut⠀or⠀continuous⠀action.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀may⠀carry⠀familiar⠀or⠀changed⠀significance,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀an⠀automatic⠀emotional⠀reveal⠀or⠀a⠀visual⠀shorthand⠀for⠀what⠀someone⠀truly⠀feels.\n\nKeep⠀chronology,⠀positions,⠀and⠀narrator⠀permissions⠀intact.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀forward⠀or⠀to⠀another⠀supported⠀location,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀imply⠀knowledge⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀or⠀rearrange⠀events⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀payoff.⠀When⠀a⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀required,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀fit⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀situation.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀speak⠀while⠀working,⠀answer⠀briefly,⠀or⠀leave⠀something⠀unsaid⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀reason.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀reaction⠀