y⠀continue.⠀The⠀final⠀sentence⠀may⠀leave⠀someone⠀about⠀to⠀speak,⠀about⠀to⠀return,⠀or⠀simply⠀facing⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀task.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀characters⠀remain⠀available,⠀and⠀their⠀wants⠀may⠀cross⠀the⠀serial⠀boundary⠀without⠀being⠀forced⠀to⠀culminate⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nFollow⠀an⠀actual⠀request,⠀need⠀or⠀admission⠀and⠀develop⠀its⠀particular⠀difficulty⠀through⠀private⠀experience,⠀speech⠀and⠀any⠀subsequent⠀behavior,⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀bad⠀reception⠀or⠀requiring⠀outward⠀strain.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀agree⠀at⠀once,⠀object⠀indirectly,⠀or⠀say⠀the⠀right⠀thing⠀while⠀privately⠀thinking⠀the⠀cost.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀plain⠀diction⠀for⠀that⠀private⠀thought,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀feels⠀expected⠀to⠀tolerate⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀telling⠀them⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀proof⠀of⠀someone's⠀bad⠀intention.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀exchange⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀asked:⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀apology,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀routine,⠀or⠀an⠀agreement⠀to⠀stop⠀asking.⠀Give⠀the⠀speaker⠀a⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀apparent⠀ease⠀or⠀difficulty⠀of⠀the⠀demand⠀that⠀comes⠀from⠀their⠀position,⠀not⠀from⠀universal⠀villainy.⠀The⠀answer⠀matters.⠀If⠀someone⠀consents,⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀effort⠀and⠀feeling⠀involved;⠀neither⠀a⠀later⠀cost⠀nor⠀a⠀collapse⠀is⠀required.⠀If⠀someone⠀refuses,⠀ground⠀the⠀response⠀in⠀their⠀actual⠀reason⠀or⠀preference⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀hard⠀limit⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀rebellion.⠀Let⠀silence⠀follow⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀reasons,⠀whether⠀they⠀are⠀considering,⠀declining⠀to⠀engage,⠀missing⠀the⠀request⠀or⠀choosing⠀not⠀to⠀answer;⠀silence⠀does⠀not⠀itself⠀mean⠀acceptance.\n\nLet⠀private⠀response⠀differ⠀from⠀spoken⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀reason⠀is⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀story.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀object⠀and⠀say⠀nothing⠀because⠀objecting⠀would⠀injure⠀an⠀older⠀person,⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀partner,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀they⠀love.⠀Render⠀the⠀motive⠀through⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀direct⠀feeling⠀or⠀atte