ear⠀or⠀know.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀that⠀a⠀phrase⠀was⠀meant⠀kindly⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀the⠀old⠀claim⠀inside⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀that⠀feeling⠀as⠀irony.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀closing⠀critique⠀or⠀new⠀conflict.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀interval⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀shared⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀message⠀sent,⠀or⠀one⠀person⠀choosing⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀understood.⠀Let⠀that⠀pause⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀involved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Give⠀the⠀episode⠀an⠀actual⠀social⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀place⠀and⠀time,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀institution⠀or⠀local⠀color⠀to⠀carry⠀it.⠀Open⠀with⠀an⠀accepted⠀explanation⠀as⠀someone⠀would⠀offer⠀it:⠀a⠀household⠀rule,⠀a⠀work⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀be⠀natural,⠀or⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀how⠀two⠀people⠀already⠀treat⠀each⠀other.⠀Keep⠀that⠀statement⠀in⠀its⠀speaker's⠀voice,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀absorb⠀it⠀into⠀universal⠀truth.\n\nThen⠀place⠀the⠀explanation⠀beside⠀the⠀actual⠀request,⠀favor,⠀or⠀responsibility⠀that⠀enacts⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀move⠀from⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀the⠀arrangement⠀is⠀to⠀what⠀someone⠀must⠀do⠀under⠀it:⠀whose⠀time⠀it⠀consumes,⠀whose⠀claim⠀receives⠀priority,⠀who⠀may⠀decline,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀notices⠀as⠀normal.⠀Make⠀any⠀actual⠀agreement⠀or⠀discrepancy⠀concrete⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀gap.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀carry⠀out⠀the⠀custom⠀graciously⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀silently⠀sees⠀the⠀cost.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀benefit⠀without⠀understanding⠀the⠀benefit⠀as⠀exploitation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀and⠀say⠀nothing⠀because⠀naming⠀it⠀would⠀cost⠀too⠀much.⠀None⠀of⠀these⠀possibilities⠀is⠀compulsory;⠀agreement⠀is⠀also⠀possible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀satire⠀restrained.⠀The⠀passage⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀a⠀hypocrite⠀or⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀unmasking.⠀A⠀small⠀incongruity⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀work:⠀a⠀polite⠀phrase⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀measured⠀silence,⠀a⠀gift⠀offered⠀with⠀the⠀giver's⠀need⠀embedded⠀in⠀its⠀occasion,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀whose⠀repetition⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀treats⠀as⠀proof,⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀certifying⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀was⠀repeated.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀compare⠀explanation⠀and⠀operation⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀assigning⠀a⠀collective⠀verdict.⠀Keep⠀private⠀experience⠀situated⠀in⠀the⠀authorized⠀person;⠀a⠀sweeping⠀judgment⠀they⠀actually⠀make⠀remains⠀their⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀automatic⠀general⠀verdict⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀style.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀exact⠀physical⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀an⠀ordinary⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀routine⠀task⠀carry⠀weight.⠀Name⠀the⠀actual⠀contact:⠀a⠀package⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀heavily,⠀a⠀shoulder⠀pressed⠀through⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀package⠀moving⠀between⠀wet⠀hands,⠀or⠀a⠀child's⠀cup⠀held⠀in⠀one⠀hand⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀wipes⠀a⠀counter.⠀Let⠀effort,⠀wear,⠀and⠀bodily⠀discomfort⠀arise⠀where⠀the⠀task⠀would⠀produce⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀them⠀as⠀a⠀decorative⠀shorthand⠀for⠀social⠀damage.\n\nCompress⠀transitions⠀that⠀merely⠀repeat⠀the⠀visible⠀situation.⠀Move⠀between⠀words,⠀action⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀actual⠀causality⠀supports,⠀including⠀reasoning⠀before⠀an⠀answer⠀or⠀experience⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀lead⠀to⠀outward⠀action.⠀Vary⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀thinking⠀needs⠀room.⠀A⠀long⠀sentence⠀can⠀develop⠀specific⠀recall,⠀feeling⠀or⠀calculation⠀without⠀its⠀prose⠀length⠀imposing⠀a⠀delay⠀in⠀the⠀scene;⠀a⠀sharp⠀exchange⠀can⠀move⠀in⠀short⠀clauses⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀grunts.\n\nKeep⠀rough⠀speech⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀and⠀its⠀situation.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀curt⠀because⠀the⠀task⠀is⠀urgent,⠀another⠀because⠀courtesy⠀has⠀never⠀been⠀available⠀to⠀them.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀line⠀abrasive.⠀Assistance⠀can⠀pass⠀from⠀one⠀hand⠀to⠀another⠀cleanly;⠀a⠀relationship⠀can⠀remain⠀warm⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀softening.⠀Render⠀that⠀warmth⠀through⠀actual⠀practical⠀action,⠀direct⠀words⠀or⠀private⠀feeling⠀rather⠀than⠀substituting⠀a⠀generic⠀declaration⠀for⠀the⠀person's⠀experience.\n\nPreserve⠀humor⠀and⠀affection⠀where⠀they⠀belong.⠀A⠀ti