rvation⠀remains⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀accept⠀as⠀natural:⠀one⠀person⠀overworked⠀while⠀another⠀offers⠀rest,⠀one⠀person⠀used⠀to⠀refusing⠀while⠀another⠀offers⠀without⠀ceremony.⠀Let⠀ease⠀stand,⠀with⠀any⠀constraints⠀that⠀actually⠀remain⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀invented⠀burden;⠀comfort⠀need⠀not⠀fix⠀a⠀deeper⠀arrangement⠀or⠀prove⠀that⠀one⠀is⠀damaged.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀place⠀an⠀ordinary⠀request,⠀invitation,⠀or⠀obligation⠀inside⠀a⠀wider⠀social⠀situation.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀remembered⠀custom,⠀a⠀family⠀pattern,⠀a⠀work⠀hierarchy,⠀a⠀public⠀ceremony,⠀or⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀understanding.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀composed⠀register⠀for⠀contextual⠀framing⠀while⠀retaining⠀a⠀character's⠀purposeful⠀explanation⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀judgment⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀convention⠀being⠀described.⠀A⠀custom⠀may⠀be⠀presented⠀as⠀familiar⠀without⠀the⠀novel⠀endorsing⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀encounter⠀arrives,⠀let⠀speech⠀keep⠀its⠀individual⠀feel.⠀A⠀formal⠀household⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀uniformly⠀formal⠀speakers;⠀a⠀younger⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀in⠀shorter⠀phrases,⠀a⠀worker⠀may⠀use⠀local⠀idiom,⠀and⠀an⠀older⠀person⠀may⠀lean⠀on⠀a⠀formula⠀while⠀meaning⠀something⠀particular⠀by⠀it.⠀Use⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀understanding⠀as⠀separate⠀channels.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀perform⠀the⠀expected⠀greeting⠀while⠀inwardly⠀noting⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀permit⠀both⠀without⠀telling⠀the⠀reader⠀that⠀one⠀is⠀false.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀episode⠀through⠀contextual⠀motion⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀static⠀tableau.⠀Relate⠀the⠀actual⠀convention,⠀particular⠀words,⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀through⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀channel⠀order⠀or⠀a⠀required⠀consequence⠀before⠀the⠀boundary.⠀A⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀convention⠀may⠀show⠀changed⠀or⠀unchanged⠀application,⠀with⠀no⠀compulsory⠀moral⠀summing-up.⠀Agreement⠀can⠀be⠀meaningful⠀without⠀transformation;⠀understanding⠀can⠀come⠀without⠀conversion.\n\nLet⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀serve⠀the⠀drama⠀instead⠀of⠀replacing⠀it.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public⠀meeting⠀may⠀appear⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀them,⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀mandatory.⠀The⠀story's⠀force⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀people:⠀what⠀they⠀ask,⠀accept,⠀withhold,⠀and⠀understand⠀as⠀normal⠀within⠀the⠀world⠀the⠀narration⠀has⠀made⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀the⠀present⠀telling⠀situation:⠀name⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listeners,⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀purpose⠀of⠀giving⠀the⠀account⠀now,⠀including⠀companionship⠀or⠀entertainment⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀practical⠀needs.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀want⠀help,⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀decision,⠀to⠀explain⠀an⠀absence,⠀or⠀to⠀keep⠀someone⠀from⠀acting,⠀but⠀the⠀reason⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀telling⠀begins⠀and⠀how⠀listeners⠀receive⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀request,⠀favor,⠀or⠀accepted⠀practice.⠀Narrate⠀the⠀past⠀events⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis:⠀what⠀they⠀call⠀ordinary,⠀what⠀they⠀pass⠀over⠀quickly,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀explain⠀as⠀if⠀no⠀explanation⠀were⠀needed.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀conceal⠀a⠀fact⠀or⠀to⠀be⠀morally⠀wrong.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀leave⠀out⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀notice⠀or⠀did⠀not⠀think⠀mattered.\n\nKeep⠀three⠀levels⠀distinct⠀as⠀you⠀write.⠀The⠀outer⠀present⠀scene⠀includes⠀the⠀listeners'⠀actual⠀responses:⠀they⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀remain⠀quiet,⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀or⠀accept⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀accepting⠀all⠀of⠀it.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀reports⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀happened.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀listener's⠀real⠀reaction,⠀a⠀teller's⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀does⠀not⠀include.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀listener's⠀silence⠀automatically⠀mean⠀agreement⠀or⠀enlightenment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀actual⠀activity⠀and⠀private⠀attention⠀available⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀continues⠀or⠀after⠀it⠀ends.⠀A⠀task⠀may⠀resume,⠀a⠀request⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀or⠀understanding⠀may⠀change,⠀but⠀no⠀consequence⠀or⠀completed⠀telling⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.⠀The⠀tale⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀resolve⠀every⠀listener's⠀objection.⠀Use⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀detail⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀connect⠀the⠀past⠀account⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose.⠀Bring⠀an⠀actual⠀available⠀instruction,⠀note,⠀record⠀or⠀formal⠀arrangement⠀into⠀relation⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀life,⠀following⠀the⠀order⠀their⠀actual⠀experience⠀supports.⠀Quote⠀or⠀describe⠀the⠀document⠀in⠀clean,⠀concrete⠀terms,⠀showing⠀what⠀it⠀assumes⠀about⠀the⠀people⠀it⠀governs.\n\nSet⠀it⠀beside⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀recollection⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀human⠀circumstances,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀record⠀to⠀precede⠀the⠀remembering.⠀Follow⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀actually⠀remembers:⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀tone⠀of⠀voice,⠀the⠀practical⠀difficulty,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀made⠀the⠀arrangement⠀work.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀follow⠀the⠀person's⠀actual⠀associations⠀or⠀deliberation,⠀which⠀may⠀align⠀with⠀the⠀record's⠀order⠀or⠀depart⠀from⠀it⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀pattern.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀two⠀beside⠀each⠀other⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀verdict.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀agree⠀with⠀the⠀memory,⠀differ⠀from⠀it,⠀or⠀concern⠀a⠀separate⠀matter⠀entirely.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀or⠀may⠀not.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀record's⠀official⠀or⠀institutional⠀register⠀from⠀the⠀narration⠀of⠀an⠀authorized⠀person's⠀recollection.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀adopt,⠀repeat⠀or⠀reject⠀that⠀phrasing⠀where⠀their⠀actual⠀habits⠀support⠀it;⠀neither⠀the⠀document's⠀wording⠀nor⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register⠀automatically⠀replaces⠀their⠀voice.\n\nLet⠀personal⠀significance⠀survive⠀the⠀comparison.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀value⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀resent⠀it,⠀or⠀simply⠀continue⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀it⠀requires.⠀No⠀investigation,⠀corrected⠀belief,⠀invented⠀document,⠀or⠀practical⠀change⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀returning⠀to⠀ordinary⠀life,⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀recollection⠀actually⠀make⠀available,⠀whether⠀a⠀cost,⠀care⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀arrangement,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
