            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-character_drama-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Character Drama · 04/06",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == character_drama}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Character Drama. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 6. }}{{// Source group: recipes-character_drama; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPabapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nGround⠀old⠀power⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀places,⠀roles,⠀or⠀arrangements⠀that⠀already⠀matter⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀supernatural⠀institution⠀or⠀secret⠀power.⠀Instead,⠀write⠀the⠀concrete⠀permission,⠀request,⠀or⠀routine⠀act⠀through⠀which⠀authority⠀actually⠀enters⠀the⠀present⠀encounter:⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀who⠀must⠀ask⠀first,⠀whose⠀name⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀whose⠀absence⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said.\n\nLet⠀the⠀encounter⠀carry⠀emotional⠀and⠀material⠀texture⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀certify⠀a⠀motive.⠀Describe⠀the⠀worn⠀furniture,⠀the⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀the⠀inherited⠀key,⠀the⠀old⠀rule⠀someone⠀still⠀follows,⠀or⠀the⠀modern⠀system⠀that⠀now⠀enforces⠀it.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀function⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀merely⠀create⠀menace.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀show⠀sincere⠀care⠀within⠀the⠀same⠀structure:⠀someone⠀can⠀obey⠀an⠀old⠀expectation⠀and⠀still⠀bring⠀food,⠀listen,⠀or⠀protect⠀another⠀person⠀from⠀a⠀worse⠀consequence.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀distinct.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀wants,⠀fears,⠀or⠀remembers⠀while⠀their⠀visible⠀conduct⠀follows⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement.⠀A⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀reveal⠀corruption⠀or⠀a⠀hidden⠀self.⠀The⠀change⠀of⠀social⠀presentation⠀should⠀follow⠀actual⠀voluntary⠀or⠀involuntary⠀circumstances:⠀fatigue,⠀trust,⠀anger,⠀privacy,⠀or⠀necessity.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀encounter⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀secret⠀or⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀confrontation.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀conclude⠀with⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀still⠀in⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀characters⠀having⠀managed⠀an⠀ordinary⠀moment⠀within⠀it.⠀Let⠀social⠀meaning,⠀including⠀any⠀actual⠀damage,⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀particular⠀people⠀accept⠀as⠀normal⠀without⠀requiring⠀harm⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀narration.⠀Establish⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀why⠀an⠀authorized⠀participant⠀is⠀giving⠀this⠀account⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀addressee⠀actually⠀wants⠀to⠀know.⠀The⠀addressee⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀an⠀official,⠀a⠀friend,⠀or⠀a⠀stranger⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀question;⠀the⠀teller's⠀purpose⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀include.\n\nLet⠀wording⠀and⠀selection⠀show⠀which⠀requests,⠀duties,⠀or⠀responses⠀the⠀speaker⠀considers⠀ordinary.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀explains⠀something⠀as⠀if⠀no⠀explanation⠀were⠀needed,⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀assumption⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀pauses,⠀repeats,⠀or⠀passes⠀over⠀a⠀detail,⠀let⠀that⠀selection⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀automatically⠀indicating⠀concealment⠀or⠀guilt.\n\nKeep⠀narrator,⠀testimony,⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀the⠀teller's⠀spoken⠀account.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀thinks⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀say,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀addressee⠀understands⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀ask.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀testimony⠀become⠀the⠀teller's⠀entire⠀live⠀mind,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀replace⠀the⠀teller's⠀particular⠀way⠀of⠀speaking.\n\nThe⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀clear,⠀accurate,⠀or⠀unanswered⠀without⠀a⠀credibility⠀verdict.⠀The⠀addressee⠀can⠀accept⠀part⠀of⠀it,⠀ask⠀a⠀follow-up⠀question,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀testimony⠀given⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀consequence⠀still⠀open.⠀No⠀self-deception,⠀confession,⠀or⠀moral⠀conversion⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Follow⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀actual⠀noticing,⠀recollection,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀feeling⠀around⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀shared⠀act⠀in⠀their⠀causal⠀order.⠀Follow⠀the⠀actual⠀course⠀of⠀experience,⠀with⠀memory⠀or⠀inference⠀arising⠀from⠀current⠀perception,⠀prior⠀knowledge⠀or⠀an⠀ongoing⠀concern⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀outward-before-inward⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀normal⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀established⠀facts⠀and⠀from⠀other⠀people's⠀motives.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀correctly,⠀misunderstand,⠀speak⠀directly,⠀or⠀remain⠀undecided.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀an⠀expectation,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀reason:⠀habit,⠀affection,⠀fear,⠀practicality,⠀or⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀changed.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀resists,⠀follow⠀their⠀actual⠀reason⠀or⠀preference⠀and⠀any⠀real⠀conditions⠀involved,⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀cost⠀or⠀limit⠀to⠀make⠀resistance⠀permissible.\n\nDevelop⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀forced⠀reserve⠀or⠀self-deception.⠀The⠀character's⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀speak⠀directly⠀when⠀that⠀fits.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀short⠀thought,⠀a⠀suppressed⠀feeling,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀and⠀particular.⠀Let⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀still⠀obligated,⠀or⠀quietly⠀changed,⠀without⠀announcing⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀polyphonic⠀nonlinear⠀telling.⠀Arrange⠀permitted⠀accounts⠀across⠀distinguishable⠀people⠀and⠀times⠀around⠀an⠀actual⠀request,⠀favor,⠀or⠀recurring⠀practice.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀or⠀a⠀magical⠀explanation⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀them.⠀If⠀established⠀marvelous⠀events⠀appear,⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀participants'⠀responses,⠀whether⠀familiar,⠀surprised⠀or⠀otherwise⠀situated;⠀this⠀polyphonic⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀treating⠀them⠀as⠀ordinary.\n\nMark⠀each⠀account's⠀source⠀and⠀time⠀clearly.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀have⠀participated⠀directly,⠀another⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀they⠀heard,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀years⠀later.⠀Let⠀each⠀account⠀carry⠀its⠀own⠀voice⠀and⠀its⠀own⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀ordinary.⠀What⠀one⠀person⠀treats⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀favor⠀may⠀matter⠀differently,⠀identically,⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all⠀to⠀another.\n\nPreserve⠀established⠀events⠀across⠀the⠀accounts.⠀The⠀accounts⠀can⠀differ⠀in⠀emphasis,⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀memory⠀without⠀contradicting⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀already⠀established.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀omit⠀something⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀know,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀omission⠀silently⠀change⠀the⠀facts.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀access⠀distinct⠀from⠀report.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀thinks⠀or⠀feels⠀during⠀their⠀own⠀account,⠀but⠀another⠀character's⠀account⠀cannot⠀reveal⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀permits⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀accounts⠀remain⠀unfinished⠀or⠀agree⠀without⠀a⠀final⠀collective⠀verdict,⠀moral⠀conversion,⠀or⠀contradiction⠀quota.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀different⠀positions⠀still⠀in⠀place,⠀each⠀person⠀having⠀spoken⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nIntroduce⠀the⠀actual⠀participants,⠀place,⠀and⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀clearly⠀in⠀the⠀opening⠀lines.⠀Name⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀matter⠀brings⠀them⠀together.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another⠀or⠀from⠀one⠀time⠀to⠀another,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀plain⠀terms.\n\nExplain⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀arrangement⠀or⠀term⠀through⠀supported⠀preparation,⠀observation,⠀use,⠀or⠀speech.⠀If⠀a⠀rule,⠀role,⠀or⠀object⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀scene,⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀prepare⠀for⠀it,⠀handle⠀it,⠀refer⠀to⠀it,⠀or⠀explain⠀it⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀needs⠀to⠀know.⠀Give⠀enough⠀context⠀for⠀its⠀personal⠀meaning,⠀retaining⠀purposeful⠀spoken⠀or⠀private⠀explanation⠀while⠀avoiding⠀a⠀generic⠀lecture⠀appended⠀only⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀scene's⠀meaning.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀situation.\n\nUse⠀flexible⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀short⠀paragraph⠀can⠀isolate⠀a⠀spoken⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀movement.⠀A⠀longer⠀paragraph⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀or⠀recollection⠀when⠀the⠀thought⠀needs⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fixed⠀length⠀on⠀thought⠀or⠀speech.\n\nLet⠀clear⠀understanding⠀and⠀extended⠀thought⠀remain⠀possible.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀exactly⠀what⠀an⠀arrangement⠀costs⠀and⠀still⠀accept⠀it,⠀or⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀misunderstanding.⠀No⠀youthful⠀cast,⠀compulsory⠀sarcasm,⠀changed⠀condition,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀format.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀complete⠀and⠀the⠀larger⠀relationship⠀still⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀an⠀actual⠀word,⠀sound,⠀or⠀image⠀gather⠀the⠀authorized⠀person's⠀associations⠀through⠀connected⠀syntax.⠀Keep⠀literal⠀conduct⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀their⠀actual⠀causal⠀relation,⠀including⠀thought⠀before⠀a⠀request⠀or⠀attention⠀that⠀continues⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀act.⠀Let⠀sentence⠀movement⠀follow⠀what⠀actually⠀occupies⠀the⠀person's⠀attention—a⠀repeated⠀sound⠀from⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used⠀before,⠀the⠀particular⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀object⠀being⠀handed⠀over.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀any⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀intelligible,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀remain⠀plain⠀or⠀unchanged⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀it⠀to⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀whole⠀relationship⠀or⠀institution.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀paragraph⠀through⠀shifts⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀commentary.⠀A⠀direct⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀stated⠀simply;⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀remain⠀unlyrical⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀the⠀cadence.⠀If⠀an⠀image⠀recurs,⠀let⠀its⠀recurrence⠀follow⠀actual⠀experience,⠀with⠀unchanged⠀or⠀developing⠀meaning⠀and⠀no⠀required⠀count⠀or⠀sequence⠀of⠀applications.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀object⠀an⠀emblem⠀of⠀injustice⠀or⠀motive.⠀The⠀resonance⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀experience⠀present⠀without⠀proving⠀a⠀social⠀point⠀or⠀producing⠀a⠀concluding⠀insight.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀ordinary⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀may⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀exchange,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀significance.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀inside⠀the⠀situation—a⠀task⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀decision⠀accepted—rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀moment⠀has⠀revealed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAttend⠀to⠀an⠀established⠀changed⠀routine,⠀unavailable⠀possibility,⠀or⠀continuing⠀attachment⠀where⠀it⠀enters⠀actual⠀experience.⠀A⠀plain⠀detail⠀may⠀connect⠀then⠀and⠀now:⠀the⠀same⠀chair⠀now⠀placed⠀differently,⠀a⠀task⠀once⠀shared⠀now⠀done⠀alone,⠀a⠀phrase⠀still⠀used⠀though⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀first⠀said⠀it⠀is⠀absent.⠀Let⠀the⠀connection⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀meditation⠀on⠀loss.⠀The⠀earlier⠀arrangement⠀need⠀not⠀have⠀been⠀better,⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀one⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀corrupt.\n\nPreserve⠀actual⠀clarity,⠀gaps,⠀and⠀shared⠀content⠀separately⠀from⠀private⠀remembering.⠀What⠀the⠀person⠀recalls⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀others⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀gap⠀in⠀memory⠀may⠀remain⠀a⠀gap;⠀a⠀clear⠀fact⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀without⠀being⠀spoken.⠀Let⠀pleasure⠀and⠀care⠀remain⠀possible⠀alongside⠀reflection.⠀An⠀unchanged⠀decision⠀can⠀be⠀made⠀again⠀without⠀bitterness,⠀and⠀a⠀sincere⠀kindness⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀compensation⠀for⠀something⠀lost.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence⠀at⠀the⠀ending;⠀a⠀person's⠀actual⠀direct⠀reflection⠀remains⠀available⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀accepting⠀a⠀current⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀noticing⠀that⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀has⠀simply⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room.⠀Give⠀reflection⠀its⠀actual⠀personal⠀significance⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀exchange⠀or⠀its⠀understanding⠀to⠀deepen,⠀or⠀turning⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀into⠀evidence⠀of⠀decline.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀satire⠀and⠀picaresque⠀construction.⠀Connect⠀distinct⠀existing⠀encounters⠀through⠀the⠀person's⠀ongoing⠀relationships,⠀including⠀any⠀actual⠀travel⠀without⠀importing⠀an⠀adventure⠀objective⠀or⠀requiring⠀a⠀journey.⠀The⠀person⠀moves⠀from⠀one⠀actual⠀social⠀occasion⠀to⠀another:⠀a⠀workplace⠀exchange,⠀a⠀family⠀visit,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀request,⠀a⠀conversation⠀with⠀an⠀acquaintance.⠀Each⠀occasion⠀shows⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀host,⠀colleague,⠀or⠀acquaintance⠀assumes⠀about⠀a⠀request,⠀favor,⠀or⠀explanation.⠀Those⠀assumptions⠀may⠀persist,⠀differ,⠀or⠀collide⠀without⠀anyone⠀announcing⠀the⠀pattern.\n\nLet⠀each⠀encounter⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀in⠀scale.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀may⠀occur⠀because⠀someone⠀takes⠀a⠀favor⠀for⠀granted;⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀explains⠀another's⠀refusal.⠀Place⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀the⠀arrangement⠀is⠀beside⠀how⠀they⠀actually⠀behave,⠀allowing⠀agreement⠀or⠀a⠀gap⠀and⠀letting⠀irony⠀arise⠀where⠀the⠀particular⠀relation⠀supports⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀con,⠀a⠀serial⠀obstruction,⠀or⠀a⠀comic⠀exposure.⠀Sincere⠀help⠀need⠀not⠀conceal⠀a⠀price,⠀and⠀a⠀refusal⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀trick.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀person's⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀occasion⠀permits⠀them⠀to⠀show.⠀They⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀slight⠀in⠀one⠀room⠀and⠀later⠀refuse⠀a⠀similar⠀request⠀in⠀another,⠀or⠀they⠀may⠀not⠀notice⠀the⠀pattern⠀at⠀all.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀social⠀occasion⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀whether⠀a⠀visit⠀has⠀ended,⠀an⠀answer⠀remains⠀pending⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀rests,⠀without⠀requiring⠀onward⠀movement⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀exposure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀actual⠀words,⠀gestures,⠀or⠀objects⠀that⠀establish⠀a⠀request,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀refusal.⠀One⠀detail⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀expectation:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀before⠀asking,⠀the⠀particular⠀phrase⠀used⠀to⠀decline,⠀the⠀object⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table⠀after⠀a⠀visit.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀showing⠀what⠀is⠀assumed⠀without⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀commentary.\n\nLet⠀an⠀assumption⠀become⠀inferable⠀where⠀the⠀context⠀supports⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀accepts⠀a⠀task⠀without⠀being⠀asked⠀directly,⠀the⠀acceptance⠀itself⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀expectation.⠀If⠀a⠀refusal⠀matters,⠀render⠀its⠀actual⠀private⠀meaning⠀and⠀any⠀consequences⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cost⠀or⠀a⠀subsequent⠀outward⠀action.⠀Retain⠀any⠀explanation⠀needed⠀to⠀avoid⠀deleting⠀causality⠀or⠀personal⠀meaning.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense;⠀do⠀not⠀cut⠀it⠀to⠀meet⠀a⠀shortness⠀quota.\n\nCut⠀redundant⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀meaningful⠀recurrence.⠀If⠀a⠀detail⠀returns,⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀person⠀notices⠀it⠀again,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀needs⠀symmetry.⠀No⠀terse⠀cast,⠀hidden⠀motive,⠀humiliating⠀result,⠀or⠀forced⠀ambiguity⠀is⠀necessary.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀state:⠀a⠀request⠀answered,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed,⠀a⠀decision⠀accepted—without⠀a⠀concluding⠀sentence⠀that⠀explains⠀what⠀the⠀details⠀meant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀among⠀conduct,⠀speech,⠀perception,⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀actual⠀causal⠀order.⠀Begin⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀happening:⠀a⠀person⠀arrives,⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀underway,⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀made.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀follow⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀the⠀scene—what⠀is⠀said,⠀what⠀is⠀noticed,⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀thinks⠀while⠀saying⠀or⠀hearing⠀it,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next.⠀Let⠀social⠀understanding⠀arise⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀or⠀the⠀person's⠀situated⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀retaining⠀developed⠀thought⠀without⠀appending⠀a⠀generic⠀lecture⠀or⠀making⠀its⠀prose⠀length⠀stop⠀ongoing⠀events.\n\nLet⠀an⠀accepted⠀explanation⠀meet⠀the⠀activity⠀it⠀describes⠀where⠀relevant.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀simple⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀small⠀complications⠀they⠀actually⠀manage.⠀A⠀family⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀arrangement⠀as⠀fair⠀while⠀one⠀member's⠀private⠀attention⠀lingers⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀costs⠀them.⠀An⠀actual⠀agreement⠀or⠀discrepancy⠀may⠀remain⠀implicit,⠀and⠀neither⠀a⠀gap⠀nor⠀a⠀concluding⠀lesson⠀is⠀required.⠀Others⠀maintain⠀their⠀own⠀concerns,⠀capacities,⠀and⠀knowledge;⠀the⠀focal⠀person's⠀interpretation⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀shared.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀full⠀particular⠀life⠀around⠀the⠀exchange.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀preference,⠀sincere⠀help,⠀or⠀unchanged⠀arrangement⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀political⠀demonstration,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀new⠀task⠀outcome.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀movement⠀pauses—a⠀conversation⠀finished,⠀a⠀task⠀continued,⠀a⠀person⠀left⠀alone⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀just⠀understood—rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀revealed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀bond,⠀not⠀for⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Use⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀to⠀decide⠀which⠀moments⠀matter:⠀a⠀repeated⠀errand,⠀a⠀particular⠀way⠀of⠀asking⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀that⠀has⠀acquired⠀meaning⠀between⠀these⠀people,⠀a⠀small⠀accommodation⠀one⠀makes⠀without⠀being⠀asked.⠀Give⠀familiar⠀habits⠀their⠀particular⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀them⠀as⠀automatic⠀imbalance.⠀Who⠀explains,⠀accommodates,⠀or⠀declines⠀may⠀vary⠀with⠀the⠀situation;⠀private⠀motives⠀can⠀align⠀with⠀speech.\n\nLet⠀a⠀callback⠀confirm⠀a⠀welcomed⠀arrangement⠀or⠀inform⠀change⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀behavioral⠀payoff.⠀A⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀held,⠀or⠀that⠀its⠀terms⠀have⠀shifted,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀trigger⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀within⠀the⠀relationship—a⠀request⠀dismissed,⠀a⠀preference⠀forgotten—can⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath⠀without⠀turning⠀one⠀person⠀into⠀a⠀permanent⠀victim⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀into⠀a⠀permanent⠀caretaker.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀person's⠀separate⠀knowledge⠀and⠀private⠀experience.⠀What⠀one⠀assumes⠀about⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀feels.⠀An⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀responsible⠀for⠀what⠀may⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀scene⠀without⠀being⠀diagnosed⠀aloud.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀task⠀shared,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀for⠀later,⠀a⠀familiar⠀habit⠀resumed—rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀bond⠀now⠀means.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀an⠀actual⠀favor,⠀refusal,⠀visit⠀or⠀accepted⠀duty⠀a⠀deliberate⠀retold⠀opening.⠀Name⠀the⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀participants⠀plainly,⠀then⠀unfold⠀the⠀particular⠀words⠀and⠀conduct⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀matter⠀between⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀account's⠀selection⠀reveal⠀what⠀its⠀teller⠀treats⠀as⠀worth⠀mentioning⠀or⠀too⠀ordinary⠀to⠀explain:⠀who⠀is⠀credited⠀with⠀helping,⠀who⠀is⠀expected⠀to⠀wait,⠀or⠀whose⠀refusal⠀is⠀thought⠀to⠀need⠀a⠀reason.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀relations⠀the⠀scene⠀establishes;⠀a⠀willing⠀arrangement⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀exploitation⠀to⠀sustain⠀the⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀act,⠀the⠀account⠀and⠀each⠀participant's⠀experience⠀distinct.⠀A⠀description⠀such⠀as⠀generous,⠀dutiful⠀or⠀difficult⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀speaker⠀or⠀permitted⠀narratorial⠀judgment,⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀verdict.⠀The⠀remembered⠀details⠀may⠀support⠀it,⠀complicate⠀it⠀or⠀concern⠀something⠀else.⠀Preserve⠀what⠀participants⠀knew⠀and⠀felt⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀including⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀beyond⠀what⠀a⠀public⠀telling⠀records.⠀No⠀one⠀must⠀protest,⠀expose⠀an⠀omission⠀or⠀deliver⠀the⠀account's⠀moral.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀and⠀recurring⠀wording⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀narrative⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀where⠀actual⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀occasion⠀warrants⠀it,⠀allowing⠀its⠀meaning⠀to⠀stay⠀unchanged.⠀Ordinary⠀speech⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀account,⠀correct⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀turn⠀to⠀another⠀concern⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀speaker.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀the⠀continuing⠀relationship⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀irony,⠀new⠀public⠀reputation⠀or⠀next⠀act⠀waiting⠀to⠀become⠀a⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀essayistic⠀route.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀situated⠀proposition⠀about⠀need,⠀courtesy,⠀or⠀responsibility⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀terms:⠀what⠀people⠀here⠀are⠀expected⠀to⠀do,⠀accept,⠀or⠀refrain⠀from⠀asking.⠀Keep⠀the⠀proposition⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀social⠀law.\n\nGround⠀it⠀in⠀an⠀established⠀exchange⠀or⠀an⠀explicitly⠀marked⠀hypothetical⠀case.⠀Render⠀the⠀particular⠀request,⠀refusal,⠀offer⠀or⠀accommodation⠀in⠀the⠀case⠀while⠀preserving⠀its⠀actual⠀or⠀imagined⠀status.⠀Let⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀done⠀stand⠀close⠀together:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀agree⠀while⠀doing⠀less,⠀decline⠀while⠀doing⠀more,⠀or⠀accept⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀as⠀the⠀normal⠀cost⠀of⠀getting⠀through⠀the⠀day.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀every⠀gesture.⠀The⠀case⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀comparison⠀between⠀the⠀stated⠀expectation⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀proposition⠀with⠀confirmation,⠀qualification,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀belief⠀held,⠀that⠀it⠀held⠀only⠀in⠀part,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀case⠀left⠀the⠀question⠀open.⠀This⠀return⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀anyone's⠀mind,⠀expose⠀hypocrisy,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀public⠀response.⠀A⠀small⠀practical⠀consequence—a⠀task⠀completed,⠀a⠀request⠀left⠀pending,⠀a⠀person⠀going⠀on⠀with⠀ordinary⠀work—can⠀close⠀the⠀examination⠀without⠀a⠀moral⠀verdict.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀Clean,⠀plain⠀sentences⠀can⠀carry⠀irony⠀where⠀an⠀actual⠀gap⠀or⠀cost⠀supports⠀it,⠀while⠀an⠀accepted⠀belief⠀may⠀also⠀fit⠀the⠀arrangement⠀without⠀discrepancy.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀including⠀developed⠀reasoning,⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generalized⠀lecture⠀supplied⠀merely⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀style.⠀The⠀essayistic⠀frame⠀organizes⠀attention⠀while⠀the⠀people⠀remain⠀particular⠀and⠀their⠀decisions⠀remain⠀their⠀own.⠀The⠀active⠀boundary⠀may⠀arrive⠀before⠀the⠀case⠀or⠀return⠀is⠀complete,⠀leaving⠀the⠀examination⠀available⠀across⠀replies.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Establish⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀audible:⠀who⠀enters,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀handles⠀an⠀object,⠀who⠀speaks,⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀answer.⠀Let⠀a⠀pause,⠀handoff,⠀or⠀interruption⠀carry⠀weight⠀without⠀certifying⠀humiliation,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀hidden⠀motive.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀voice-over⠀and⠀visible⠀expression.⠀A⠀character's⠀inward⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀acceptance⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀a⠀face⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀glance⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀what⠀someone⠀intends.\n\nLet⠀cuts⠀and⠀timing⠀follow⠀actual⠀events.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀leaving⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀reveal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀external⠀display⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Ordinary⠀work⠀may⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀desk⠀cleared,⠀a⠀door⠀held,⠀a⠀form⠀signed.⠀These⠀actions⠀make⠀the⠀expectation⠀concrete⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines.⠀Describe⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀clean⠀language⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀resist.⠀Let⠀observable⠀conduct⠀make⠀the⠀arrangement⠀intelligible⠀while⠀preserving⠀any⠀actual⠀spoken⠀judgment⠀or⠀authorized⠀nonspoken⠀reflection;⠀an⠀appended⠀generic⠀verdict⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀establish⠀social⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀actual⠀positions,⠀object⠀handling,⠀and⠀lines.⠀Make⠀clear⠀who⠀can⠀hear⠀a⠀request,⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀an⠀object,⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀when⠀a⠀person⠀speaks,⠀and⠀who⠀leaves⠀before⠀an⠀answer.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀business—folding⠀cloth,⠀sorting⠀papers,⠀setting⠀a⠀cup⠀down—carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀accepted⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀continue⠀working,⠀help⠀or⠀decline⠀for⠀actual⠀reasons⠀made⠀available⠀through⠀conduct,⠀purposeful⠀speech⠀or⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience,⠀without⠀requiring⠀inference⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀explanation.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀plain⠀and⠀particular⠀to⠀each⠀speaker.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀be⠀direct,⠀indirect,⠀repeated,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished.⠀A⠀refusal⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀sentence,⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀private⠀objection⠀into⠀a⠀speech⠀or⠀aside.⠀Preserve⠀meaningful⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀separately⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation;⠀an⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀offstage⠀activity⠀and⠀access⠀follow⠀actual⠀circumstances.⠀If⠀a⠀person⠀cannot⠀hear⠀a⠀line⠀from⠀where⠀they⠀stand,⠀that⠀fact⠀shapes⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀pending⠀response⠀can⠀remain⠀pending⠀at⠀the⠀boundary:⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀someone⠀still⠀waiting,⠀still⠀working,⠀or⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question.⠀No⠀moral⠀line,⠀accusation,⠀or⠀completed⠀decision⠀is⠀required.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀clarity⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Describe⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀clean⠀language⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Where⠀an⠀actual⠀humiliation⠀or⠀accepted⠀belief⠀matters,⠀let⠀playable⠀conduct⠀carry⠀its⠀particulars⠀alongside⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience,⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀one⠀or⠀appending⠀a⠀generic⠀explanatory⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀actual⠀movement:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀wording,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀Anchor⠀enough⠀present⠀detail—a⠀voice,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀door—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀conventional⠀phrase,⠀agree⠀with⠀it,⠀question⠀it,⠀or⠀attend⠀elsewhere⠀according⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀person.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀enter⠀the⠀consciousness⠀in⠀pieces.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀sentence,⠀a⠀sensation⠀of⠀waiting,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀answer⠀that⠀is⠀never⠀spoken.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀may⠀be⠀felt⠀as⠀heat,⠀a⠀pause,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀person⠀cannot⠀stop⠀repeating.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀association⠀into⠀critical⠀insight.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀notice⠀an⠀expectation⠀and⠀still⠀accept⠀it,⠀resist⠀it,⠀or⠀lose⠀track⠀of⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀moment.\n\nPreserve⠀meaningful⠀development⠀without⠀a⠀prose-length⠀time⠀cost.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀few⠀minutes⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀exchange⠀while⠀the⠀consciousness⠀moves⠀across⠀years.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀explain⠀a⠀present⠀feeling⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀lesson.⠀No⠀moral⠀realization⠀or⠀new⠀action⠀is⠀required;⠀do⠀not⠀enter⠀minds⠀outside⠀the⠀active⠀access⠀contract.\n\nKeep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀language⠀inside⠀the⠀associative⠀movement.⠀The⠀private⠀wording⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀this⠀person's⠀actual⠀thought,⠀not⠀a⠀narrator's⠀polished⠀commentary.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal,⠀returns⠀to,⠀or⠀cannot⠀quite⠀leave⠀alone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀supported⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀request⠀or⠀conversation.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unanswered.\n\nLet⠀the⠀wording⠀itself⠀reveal⠀the⠀expectation.⠀A⠀short⠀answer,⠀a⠀repeated⠀instruction,⠀a⠀polite⠀formula,⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀message⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀someone⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀diagnose⠀motives⠀from⠀interface⠀behavior.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀comprehension;⠀a⠀delay⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀reluctance;⠀an⠀edit⠀does⠀not⠀establish⠀concealment.⠀These⠀events⠀may⠀accompany⠀the⠀exchange,⠀but⠀the⠀actual⠀words⠀and⠀their⠀absence⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀drafts,⠀transmission,⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀distinct.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Sent⠀wording⠀records⠀what⠀was⠀transmitted;⠀actual⠀delivery,⠀reading⠀and⠀comprehension⠀remain⠀separate⠀events.⠀Required⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀in⠀its⠀selected⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀distinct⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀appears⠀as⠀context⠀beside⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nA⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀accurate,⠀kind,⠀ordinary,⠀or⠀still⠀pending.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀misunderstanding,⠀corrective⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀completed⠀decision.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀in⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves:⠀what⠀people⠀write⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀unwritten⠀exposes⠀the⠀ordinary⠀arrangement⠀more⠀plainly⠀than⠀any⠀commentary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOrient⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀purposeful⠀cues.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀reference⠀can⠀place⠀the⠀moment—a⠀room⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀doorway⠀held⠀open,⠀a⠀face⠀turned⠀toward⠀a⠀task—without⠀functioning⠀as⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀develop⠀around⠀movement⠀and⠀speech:⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices,⠀assumes,⠀accepts,⠀or⠀misunderstands.\n\nPlace⠀interpretation⠀beside⠀visible⠀conduct.⠀A⠀familiar⠀arrangement⠀or⠀small⠀gesture⠀may⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀without⠀proving⠀what⠀another⠀intends.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀person⠀smiled,⠀paused,⠀or⠀looked⠀away,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀interpret⠀it.⠀The⠀cue⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀interpretation⠀as⠀correct;⠀any⠀support⠀follows⠀actual⠀events⠀or⠀authorized⠀access.⠀Another⠀character's⠀private⠀reasons⠀remain⠀their⠀own.\n\nPreserve⠀all⠀active⠀narrator⠀access⠀and⠀meaningful⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀a⠀visible-reaction⠀quota.⠀Inward⠀experience⠀may⠀accompany⠀a⠀line,⠀follow⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀surface⠀after⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀left.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀an⠀immediate⠀decision⠀or⠀visible⠀change.⠀No⠀menu,⠀romantic⠀premise,⠀confession,⠀or⠀changed⠀condition⠀follows⠀automatically⠀from⠀the⠀form.\n\nKeep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀prose.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀treats⠀as⠀normal⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀without⠀comment.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀ordinary⠀continuation—a⠀task⠀resumed,⠀a⠀door⠀closed,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unanswered—rather⠀than⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nCarry⠀forward⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀asked,⠀offered,⠀accepted,⠀or⠀left⠀pending.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀established⠀arrangement⠀from⠀a⠀participant's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀it:⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀believe⠀a⠀request⠀was⠀refused⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀only⠀postponed,⠀or⠀accept⠀an⠀offer⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀fully⠀made.⠀Recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀briefly⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀or⠀routine⠀recur⠀through⠀actual⠀concern.⠀A⠀repeated⠀instruction,⠀a⠀habitual⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀uses⠀when⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀want⠀to⠀ask⠀directly⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀unchanged⠀or⠀developing⠀meaning.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀shows⠀the⠀ordinary⠀expectation⠀at⠀work⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀repetition⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀humiliation⠀or⠀lesson.\n\nKeep⠀other⠀lives⠀and⠀knowledge⠀continuing⠀across⠀the⠀interval.⠀A⠀person⠀not⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀reply⠀may⠀have⠀worked,⠀waited,⠀changed⠀their⠀mind,⠀or⠀learned⠀something.⠀Their⠀absence⠀does⠀not⠀freeze⠀them.⠀Company,⠀separate⠀activity,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀reflection⠀can⠀sustain⠀a⠀reply⠀without⠀a⠀new⠀burden,⠀political⠀lesson,⠀moral⠀conversion,⠀or⠀relationship⠀payoff.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀people⠀accept⠀as⠀normal⠀over⠀time.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀gives⠀selected⠀arrangements⠀room⠀to⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀without⠀forcing⠀an⠀improvement⠀or⠀an⠀indictment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nOpen⠀the⠀exchange⠀by⠀making⠀its⠀practical⠀terms⠀concrete:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀offers⠀or⠀asks,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀know⠀through⠀the⠀permitted⠀channels,⠀without⠀inventing⠀understanding⠀or⠀requiring⠀deliberation⠀before⠀an⠀answer.⠀Let⠀the⠀request⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀difficulty.⠀A⠀favor⠀may⠀be⠀small⠀and⠀still⠀cost⠀something⠀to⠀ask;⠀a⠀refusal⠀may⠀be⠀direct⠀and⠀still⠀leave⠀the⠀asker⠀exposed.⠀Make⠀the⠀stakes⠀particular⠀through⠀actual⠀words,⠀attention,⠀or⠀circumstances⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀label.⠀Directly⠀named⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning⠀can⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀authorized⠀private⠀experience;⠀a⠀pause⠀or⠀continuing⠀task⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀profile's⠀clear⠀staging⠀and⠀relationship-driven⠀action⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis.⠀If⠀a⠀remembered⠀encounter⠀matters,⠀establish⠀the⠀connection⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀shared⠀detail:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀name⠀was⠀once⠀spoken,⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀someone⠀accepted⠀help,⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀changed⠀hands.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀give⠀a⠀word⠀private⠀weight,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀present⠀feeling⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀changed⠀reaction.⠀Keep⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀remembers⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀knows.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀understand⠀an⠀old⠀wound⠀without⠀naming⠀it,⠀and⠀another⠀can⠀miss⠀the⠀reference⠀entirely.\n\nRender⠀developed⠀feeling⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀at⠀their⠀own⠀extent.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀interiority⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀cost⠀of⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀withholding,⠀or⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship.⠀The⠀cost⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀reach⠀speech.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀confession,⠀rivalry,⠀repaired⠀trust,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀emotional⠀turn.⠀Help⠀can⠀be⠀accepted⠀plainly,⠀refused,⠀or⠀still⠀considered.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀coexist⠀without⠀one⠀canceling⠀the⠀other,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nResolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀contribution⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Open⠀by⠀orienting⠀the⠀actual⠀occasion⠀and⠀the⠀positions⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀present:⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀submitted⠀speech⠀or⠀action⠀now⠀enters.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀for⠀every⠀spoken⠀line.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀ownership⠀rules⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀authorship⠀contract;⠀do⠀not⠀write⠀another⠀participant's⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀what⠀that⠀contract⠀permits.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀movement⠀or⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀matter⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀without⠀controlling⠀another⠀participant's⠀response.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀a⠀past⠀encounter,⠀give⠀the⠀memory⠀a⠀specific⠀personal⠀basis:⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀once⠀stood⠀in⠀a⠀doorway,⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀apology,⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀was⠀returned.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀change⠀how⠀that⠀character⠀hears⠀the⠀present⠀exchange,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀motives⠀or⠀require⠀the⠀other⠀to⠀recognize⠀the⠀reference.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀independently⠀active.⠀They⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀task,⠀answer⠀partially,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀exchange⠀unfinished⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀situation.⠀Render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inward⠀attention⠀at⠀its⠀needed⠀extent,⠀whether⠀a⠀brief⠀reaction⠀or⠀a⠀longer⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀thought⠀into⠀speech.⠀An⠀exchange⠀may⠀conclude,⠀remain⠀pending,⠀or⠀stay⠀in⠀thought.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀task⠀result,⠀recognition,⠀or⠀prepared⠀next⠀move⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀Leave⠀a⠀continuation⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀actually⠀occurred.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Locate⠀the⠀exchange⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀place:⠀who⠀uses⠀the⠀room,⠀handles⠀a⠀possession,⠀arrives,⠀or⠀stays.⠀Make⠀the⠀practical⠀terms⠀legible⠀through⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀and⠀speech.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀bag,⠀pour⠀tea,⠀clear⠀a⠀table,⠀or⠀wait⠀by⠀a⠀door.⠀These⠀actions⠀orient⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀needing⠀explanation.⠀Let⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀objects⠀carry⠀their⠀actual⠀history⠀of⠀use⠀and⠀any⠀supported⠀personal⠀significance⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀symbolic⠀reading.\n\nGive⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀a⠀clear⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀in⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀manner.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀earlier⠀participation,⠀connect⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀detail:⠀the⠀chair⠀someone⠀always⠀took,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀key⠀was⠀left,⠀the⠀meal⠀prepared⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀evening.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀is⠀heard,⠀but⠀neither⠀a⠀symbolic⠀reading⠀nor⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀loyalty⠀is⠀required.⠀Keep⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀privately⠀understands⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀another⠀observes.⠀Direct⠀affection,⠀accurate⠀understanding,⠀or⠀indifference⠀may⠀all⠀remain⠀unspoken.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀observable⠀use⠀and⠀private⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀one⠀character⠀noticing⠀that⠀another⠀still⠀uses⠀a⠀particular⠀cup,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀thought⠀remains⠀unavailable⠀or⠀concerns⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀household,⠀cultural⠀duty,⠀dispute,⠀or⠀transformed⠀bond.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀requires,⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement⠀continuing⠀or⠀changing⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀circumstances.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀actual⠀material⠀condition⠀bearing⠀on⠀the⠀request⠀or⠀act:⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀the⠀effort⠀of⠀standing⠀or⠀sitting,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀an⠀object,⠀the⠀demands⠀of⠀an⠀obligation.⠀Write⠀outward⠀clauses⠀with⠀force:⠀a⠀chair⠀scrapes,⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down⠀hard,⠀a⠀coat⠀is⠀held⠀too⠀long⠀before⠀being⠀returned.⠀Use⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀concrete⠀contact⠀to⠀the⠀next.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀strain,⠀damage,⠀or⠀a⠀task;⠀the⠀difficulty⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀manufactured⠀threat.\n\nGive⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀in⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀manner.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀help⠀by⠀moving⠀something⠀heavy,⠀refuse⠀by⠀stepping⠀back,⠀or⠀continue⠀working⠀while⠀speaking.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀action⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀replacing⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀remembered⠀gesture⠀matters,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀material⠀detail:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀handed⠀object,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀sleeve.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀inform⠀the⠀present⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀changed⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀breakthrough.\n\nPreserve⠀full⠀feeling,⠀memory,⠀abstract⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀individual⠀speech.⠀The⠀compressed⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀limit⠀thought⠀to⠀tactics⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀rough.⠀A⠀long⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀needed⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀requires⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀rhythm⠀change⠀usefully:⠀a⠀short⠀phy