d,⠀and⠀known⠀then.⠀A⠀gesture⠀or⠀request⠀should⠀carry⠀its⠀original⠀personal⠀basis,⠀not⠀a⠀meaning⠀supplied⠀later⠀by⠀the⠀memoirist.\n\nLet⠀later⠀commentary⠀enter⠀as⠀a⠀distinct⠀layer.⠀It⠀may⠀confirm⠀an⠀earlier⠀interpretation,⠀revise⠀it,⠀or⠀record⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀does⠀not⠀understand⠀something.⠀Do⠀not⠀backdate⠀a⠀motive,⠀supply⠀a⠀new⠀ability,⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀older⠀self⠀wiser⠀by⠀default.⠀The⠀later⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀matter-of-fact.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀the⠀composed⠀memoir:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀thought⠀then⠀remains⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀record⠀now,⠀and⠀the⠀memoir⠀itself⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀their⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relationship⠀act⠀concrete⠀and⠀particular.⠀A⠀remembered⠀kindness,⠀refusal,⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀task⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀account⠀without⠀heroic⠀elevation⠀or⠀public⠀consequence.⠀Allow⠀uncertainty,⠀genuine⠀resolution,⠀or⠀unchanged⠀understanding.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀memoirist⠀still⠀living⠀with⠀the⠀event,⠀returning⠀to⠀present⠀business,⠀or⠀leaving⠀the⠀earlier⠀question⠀open.⠀No⠀confession,⠀absolution,⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀the⠀exact⠀particulars⠀needed⠀to⠀understand⠀what⠀is⠀asked,⠀offered,⠀accepted,⠀or⠀still⠀considered.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀concrete⠀details:⠀where⠀the⠀people⠀stand,⠀what⠀passes⠀between⠀them,⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀not⠀answered.⠀Omit⠀reiterated⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀causes⠀or⠀actual⠀feeling.⠀A⠀refusal⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀the⠀object⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀of⠀speech;⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀then⠀explain⠀that⠀the⠀refusal⠀mattered.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀carry⠀known⠀history⠀without⠀recap⠀in⠀every⠀channel.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀cup⠀or⠀uses⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀its⠀meaning⠀may⠀remain⠀inferable⠀from⠀earlier⠀established⠀context.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀prove⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Keep⠀the⠀characters'⠀inward⠀range⠀intact:⠀developed⠀memory,⠀uncertainty,⠀reasoning,⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀can⠀occupy⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀account⠀needs⠀it.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota,⠀and⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀thought⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀scene⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.\n\nPreserve⠀individual⠀voices.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀another⠀indirectly,⠀another⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀Let⠀omission⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀delete⠀causality.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀exchange⠀incomplete,⠀a⠀decision⠀deferred,⠀or⠀an⠀act⠀finished⠀without⠀commentary.⠀No⠀newly⠀legible⠀bond,⠀prepared⠀next⠀move,⠀or⠀decision⠀utility⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀exchange,⠀ordinary⠀activity,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inward⠀attention.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀clearly⠀situated:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀practical⠀task⠀or⠀shared⠀interval⠀is⠀underway,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀says⠀or⠀does.⠀Retain⠀relevant⠀physical⠀continuity⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀work⠀objective.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀continue⠀across⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀walk,⠀or⠀the⠀completion⠀of⠀a⠀chore.\n\nLet⠀an⠀established⠀memory⠀enter⠀when⠀it⠀explains⠀why⠀an⠀act⠀matters⠀or⠀simply⠀remains⠀meaningful⠀privately.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀control⠀another⠀person's⠀response.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise⠀while⠀accepting⠀help⠀now,⠀or⠀recall⠀a⠀past⠀refusal⠀while⠀still⠀choosing⠀to⠀ask.⠀Keep⠀original⠀knowledge⠀and⠀individual⠀voices⠀intact.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it,⠀and⠀private⠀interpretation⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀established⠀fact⠀without⠀being⠀corrected.\n\nAllow⠀care,⠀refusal,⠀agreement,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀to⠀stand⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀outcome.⠀The⠀prose⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound,⠀changed⠀bond,⠀or⠀complete⠀emotional⠀arc⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀exchange⠀concluded,⠀resumed,⠀or⠀still⠀under⠀consideration,⠀following⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀prepared⠀next⠀move.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀a⠀current⠀request,⠀offer,⠀distance,⠀or⠀shared⠀pleasure⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀clear⠀personal⠀setting.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀now,⠀rather⠀than⠀relying⠀solely⠀on⠀a⠀historical⠀summary;⠀relevant⠀recollection⠀or⠀explanation⠀can⠀still⠀give⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀its⠀actual⠀context.⠀An⠀established⠀callback⠀may⠀enrich⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀it⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀past:⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀a⠀repeated⠀small⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀known⠀preference.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀past⠀for⠀new⠀acquaintances⠀or⠀make⠀recognition⠀mutual⠀when⠀only⠀one⠀person⠀would⠀have⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀words,⠀private⠀reasons,⠀and⠀choices.⠀Agreed⠀intentions⠀and⠀direct⠀affection⠀are⠀as⠀possible⠀as⠀conflict.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀callback⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀misses⠀it;⠀one⠀may⠀speak⠀warmly⠀while⠀privately⠀uncertain;⠀one⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀explain⠀why⠀it⠀matters.⠀Rendering⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀give⠀another⠀character⠀knowledge;⠀preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀channels⠀and⠀active⠀ownership⠀permissions.⠀The⠀bond's⠀particular⠀promise⠀should⠀be⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀scene⠀selection⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀by⠀forcing⠀every⠀moment⠀toward⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀test.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀continue,⠀change⠀substantially,⠀or⠀conclude⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀premise⠀and⠀present⠀choices.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀characters⠀closer,⠀farther⠀apart,⠀or⠀simply⠀still⠀in⠀each⠀other's⠀company.⠀No⠀compulsory⠀rivalry,⠀sacrifice,⠀or⠀repaired⠀attachment⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀active⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling⠀through⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀coherent⠀recurrence.⠀Name⠀the⠀act⠀plainly:⠀the⠀time⠀someone⠀stayed,⠀the⠀refusal⠀made⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀care⠀given⠀without⠀being⠀asked.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀concrete⠀circumstance⠀and⠀personal⠀basis⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.⠀A⠀declaration⠀may⠀open⠀the⠀passage,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀particulars⠀give⠀its⠀scope⠀a⠀concrete⠀basis,⠀confirming,⠀qualifying,⠀or⠀challenging⠀a⠀reputation⠀as⠀actual⠀facts⠀permit⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀incomplete.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀hold⠀familiar⠀significance⠀or⠀gain⠀supported⠀weight⠀through⠀actual⠀later⠀occurrence.⠀A⠀phrase⠀used⠀at⠀one⠀departure⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀someone⠀else⠀leaves,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀first⠀speaker⠀changes⠀their⠀mind.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀helping⠀was⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀automatic.⠀The⠀public⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀or⠀imperfect⠀as⠀sourced;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀determine⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known.\n\nRecount⠀giving,⠀refusal,⠀staying,⠀leaving,⠀or⠀care⠀at⠀its⠀proper⠀scale.⠀Household⠀work⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat,⠀and⠀familiar⠀inconvenience⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Preserve⠀original⠀knowledge⠀and⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀or⠀completing⠀a⠀legacy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nGive⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀a⠀recognizable⠀folktale⠀pattern⠀through⠀the⠀role⠀a⠀person⠀is⠀actually⠀taking:⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀stays,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀asks⠀again,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀brings⠀word,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀leaves.⠀Name⠀or⠀imply⠀the⠀role⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀moral⠀label.⠀Let⠀the⠀concrete⠀enactment⠀fit,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀leave⠀the⠀pattern⠀unsettled⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀people⠀and⠀circumstances.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀stay⠀without⠀being⠀welcomed,⠀ask⠀again⠀without⠀demanding,⠀bring⠀word⠀without⠀being⠀believed,⠀or⠀leave⠀without⠀abandoning⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀role-pattern⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀narrator.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magic,⠀a⠀fixed⠀trial⠀count,⠀a⠀reward,⠀a⠀punishment,⠀or⠀a⠀preassigned⠀moral.⠀The⠀pattern⠀organizes⠀what⠀is⠀noticed⠀and⠀repeated,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀decide⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀feel⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀will⠀do⠀next.\n\nMake⠀the⠀emotional⠀significance⠀of⠀the⠀exchange⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people.⠀A⠀familiar⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀request⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀practical⠀meaning⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀between⠀them,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀a⠀reversal.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀interpretation⠀distinct⠀from⠀another⠀person's⠀actual⠀intention,⠀whether⠀they⠀align⠀or⠀differ.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀knowledge⠀channels⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀private⠀narration⠀as⠀automatic⠀transmission.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀staging⠀for⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀practical⠀action:⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀is⠀doing,⠀what⠀passes⠀between⠀them.⠀An⠀advance⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀invented⠀solely⠀to⠀satisfy⠀a⠀tale-pattern.⠀Supported⠀symbolic⠀meaning⠀can⠀accompany⠀the⠀actual⠀act.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀role-pattern⠀still⠀unresolved,⠀a⠀partial⠀accommodation,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀continuation⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀relevant⠀positions,⠀objects,⠀movements,⠀and⠀speakers.⠀Add⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀actually⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀each⠀block⠀observable⠀or⠀audible:⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀does,⠀where⠀they⠀move,⠀what⠀they⠀hold,⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands⠀or⠀emotional⠀descriptions⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard.\n\nLet⠀a⠀familiar⠀visual⠀or⠀spoken⠀detail⠀connect⠀the⠀present⠀act⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀encounter⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀the⠀connection.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀take⠀the⠀same⠀position⠀as⠀before.⠀Show⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀clearly;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀flashback,⠀bodily⠀reaction,⠀or⠀breakthrough.⠀The⠀connection⠀can⠀remain⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀the⠀character⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀causal⠀time.⠀If⠀a⠀cut⠀or⠀scene⠀change⠀is⠀used,⠀make⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀moments⠀legible:⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀between⠀them,⠀what⠀remains⠀from⠀before,⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀hide⠀a⠀change⠀that⠀would⠀alter⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀action.\n\nRender⠀full⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀separately⠀from⠀voice-over.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀an⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose;⠀it⠀cannot⠀replace⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀Presenting⠀private⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀transmit⠀it⠀to⠀another⠀character.⠀Preserve⠀actual⠀prior⠀knowledge,⠀communication,⠀world⠀channels,⠀and⠀any⠀mental⠀access⠀permitted⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀A⠀visible⠀expression⠀or⠀action⠀can⠀suggest⠀feeling,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀a⠀motive⠀or⠀a⠀conclusion.\n\nLet⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀fall⠀within⠀consideration,⠀ordinary⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀practical⠀result,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀revelation⠀or⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPabaqax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Character⠀Drama⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nLocate⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀reach,⠀and⠀relevant⠀objects⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports.⠀Use⠀blocking⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀concrete:⠀who⠀moves⠀toward⠀whom,⠀who⠀stays⠀seated,⠀who⠀picks⠀something⠀up,⠀who⠀wait